window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3001,"title":"Chapter 3001 - 2999: Chatting About Three Bucks","paragraphs":["Chapter 3001: Chapter 2999: Chatting About Three Bucks","“Perhaps, I understand why Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven has insisted on cultivating a Heavenly Dao,” said the Great Northern Emperor, looking at Tyrannical Song, who was under the ‘Dao Rune’ at the time. He had suddenly resolved an inner perplexity.","After cultivating a ‘Heavenly Dao,’ in the Immortal Realm, one could be like the current Tyrannical Song!","In fact, not just Tyrannical Song, but also him, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, Cheng Lin, Song Shuhang, master of the Buddha Temple, and the Eight-Armed Ancient Heavenly Demon—fellow friends who, if needed, could now contact Daozi and obtain a portion of the simplified ‘Sub-Immortal Information’ from him.","This is the benefit of having a Heavenly Dao as your backing.","At this moment, under the protection of the Heavenly Dao ‘Daozi,’ Tyrannical Song could behave as recklessly as he desired. The things he once did only cautiously, he could now do boldly and without worry!","“Agree, and then begin the one-on-one process,” the Great Northern Emperor said with a smile that seemed to melt icebergs.","The surrounding immortals nodded and selected the ‘agree’ option.","The entire ‘time-distorted secret realm’ quieted down.","The immortals and the Tyrannical Songs all closed their eyes without speaking a word.","If it were not for the intermittent puffing of white smoke over Song Shuhang’s head, this scene would appear as though time had stopped.","Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair was enveloped by white smoke, discontentedly shaking it off.","After a moment.","The bored Pavilion Master Chu used her dumb hair to encircle the white smoke, forming it into a smoke ball that she carefully stacked on top of the ‘Hamster Ball’ above Song Shuhang’s head, making it the upper half of a gourd.","“Perfect,” remarked Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair with satisfaction.","Just as she spoke, the Heavenly Dao protective runes above dispensed golden light, promptly cooling and reinforcing Tyrannical Song’s head.","The smoke ball that formed the upper half of the gourd also dispersed.","Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair: “!!!”","The smoke ball that I had so painstakingly formed, ah.","Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair lost its momentum and lazily lay on top of Song Shuhang’s head, motionless.","...","...","Elsewhere.","Evil Corpse Tyrannical Song arrived in the Sinful Black Lotus World, the iron fortress of Senior White Two.","“Senior White, has the egg of King Kun been born? My main body sent me here to borrow the egg of King Kun and see if I could extract some clues from it,” said the Evil Corpse with the same familiarity as visiting his own home, entering Senior White’s fortress.","“Still experimenting, wait on the side for a bit. Once I finish this experiment here, I’ll let you take the egg of King Kun away,” said one of Senior White Two’s research clones.","It’s unclear what contents Senior White Two’s clones are researching.","Could it be the ‘Egg of King Kun Cookbook’?","Unable to borrow the egg of King Kun for the time being, Evil Tyrant temporarily rested in the Sinful Black Lotus World.","As the experiment by Senior White Two took slightly longer... the idly bored Evil Tyrant began strolling around the vicinity of the Sinful Black Lotus World.","Walking around, he unconsciously left the Sinful Black Lotus World and went over to Dark Song’s place to visit the sealed fat ball leader.","At this time, Dark Song retained only a thread of Tyrannical Song’s consciousness, maintaining basic operations while stationed in the Demon Sea World.","The fat ball leader was pressed near the Demon Sea World by the Heavenly Dao Seal, guarded by Dark Song.","When Evil Tyrant arrived, he discovered that fat ball leader was in the middle of covertly analyzing the seal of Daozi.","The sealing technique of Daozi wasn’t too clever; it was a seal that purely overpowered finesse with force... suppressing directly with Heavenly Dao authority and rules.","“Long time no see, fat ball leader,” said Evil Tyrant as he sat down cross-legged near the seal.","The fat ball leader silently glanced at Song Shuhang’s Evil Corpse and chose not to speak.","Evil Tyrant didn’t mind.","After he had taken his seat, he spoke as if talking to himself, “Fat Ball, are you bored? Want to chat for five bucks?”","Fat Ball: “...”","Ba Er began talking on his own, “Before proving their Dao under the Will of the Heavens, the rulers of the Netherworld Realm were part of the Will of the Heavens itself, becoming masters of the Netherworld. So, that means the rulers of the Netherworld also possess a perfected path to immortality, right?”","Fat Ball: “...”","“So, what exactly is your path to immortality, Fat Ball?” Ba Er asked.","Fat Ball: “[Sneer] You think I’d tell you that?”","“Actually, whether you tell me or not doesn’t really matter. Once our preparations here are complete and my Dark Song merges with you, Fat Ball, I think I’ll eventually find out all these things,” Ba Er said cheerfully.","Being an Evil Corpse, and given that Tyrannical Song had so many heart-wrenching pendants nearby, Ba Er could learn quite a lot just by listening.","All Fat Ball wanted to do was swear inside, but because it had to remain civil, it couldn’t say those words out loud.","“By the way, Fat Ball... what’s your origin?” Ba Er asked again.","In the tale of grievances between the Sage of Confucianism and the eighth Heavenly Dao, whenever the origin of the Heavenly Dao liquefied metal ball is brought up, it’s described as ‘mysterious’.","No one knows the roots of the Heavenly Dao ball; it isn’t human, demon, monster, Buddha, or ghost...","And before its final battle with the Sage of Confucianism, no one knew its origin.","It seemed to have popped out of thin air.","Ba Er really wanted to try the “secret appraisal technique” on Fat Ball—now that the main body had reached the Immortal Realm, the cost of appraising a ruler of the Netherworld should be greatly reduced.","But considering that the main body was currently in a ‘multi-threaded simultaneous cultivation discussion’ state, using external stimulation suddenly could cause a collapse of his main body’s condition.","Ba Er had no choice but to suppress the urge.","When Fat Ball heard this question, it suddenly fell silent.","Had Ba Er’s words struck a weak spot in its heart?","After a long pause.","“I don’t know,” Fat Ball said.","Ba Er: “!!!”","“My memories split from those of the Heavenly Dao ball after the fight with the Sage of Confucianism ended. But if I trace back further, my memories... only involve cultivation, meditation, learning, cultivation...” Fat Ball explained slowly.","Apart from a vast amount of knowledge and cultivation techniques, it had no memories of its own origins.","“Did the Heavenly Dao ball tamper with you?” Ba Er guessed instinctively.","It seemed that every generation’s Heavenly Dao had a habit of tampering with its corresponding ruler of the Netherworld.","The three-eyed young senior seemed very dissatisfied with his own Heavenly Dao and had mentioned topics like ‘treat one’s own ruler of the Netherworld well’ during his exchanges with Song Shuhang.","Father Goudan had it relatively good; although researched by the Heavenly Dao, the Heavenly Dao truly cherished Father Goudan.","The ruler of the Dark Sun of the Netherworld Realm had their main consciousness synchronized and was directly seized by the Heavenly Dao’s countermeasure.","Senior White Two had his thigh cut off.","Now, it seemed like Fat Ball’s memories might have been tampered with by the Heavenly Dao ball.","“That big idiot!” Fat Ball, reminded by Ba Er, also thought of this possibility and was furiously enraged.","[Or perhaps, there’s something inherently problematic with Fat Ball’s origin?] Ba Er had another possibility in mind, which he didn’t voice.","Both guesses were plausible.","And deep down, Ba Er leaned more towards the second guess.","[First, I’ll report back to the main body and see if I can borrow Daozi’s ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ later to perform some calculations and deduce information about Fat Ball,] Ba Er fed back this thought."]},{"number":3002,"title":"Chapter 3002 - 3000: Lady Kunna: Fat Ball, Delicious","paragraphs":["Chapter 3002: Chapter 3000: Lady Kunna: Fat Ball, Delicious","Ba Er packaged his two speculations about the fat ball and fed them back to his main body.","However, since his main body was currently in a multithreading spiritual debate state, Ba Er anticipated a delay in the feedback. He would have to wait until his main body finished the one-on-one debate with the first wave of Immortals before it could be received.","Ba Er was in no rush since time flowed differently there compared to the main world. He reckoned it wouldn’t be long in the main world before it all ended there.","“So, farewell, fat ball,” Ba Er said as he stretched lazily and stood up.","The eye that the fat ball had manifested glanced at him and then returned to silence—as if the irate fat ball from before was not the same entity.","Ba Er got up, leaving a dashing backdrop for the fat ball, and gradually walked away.","He knew the fat ball had not given up on self-rescue.","Once he left, the fat ball would surely continue to grind at the ‘Heavenly Dao Seal.’","Truthfully, Ba Er thought the fat ball’s will to survive was much stronger than that of his main body, Song Shuhang.","Up until now, the fat ball had been struggling to ‘survive,’ even challenging Senior White—a task it took on incidentally.","Now, even though it was suppressed and sealed by Daozi Senior, the fat ball still hadn’t given up hope—this character of the fat ball was such that as long as it persevered, given time and opportunity, it would certainly achieve great things.","Unfortunately... the fat ball’s luck had always been poor, time had always been biased against it, and it never seemed to have enough of it.","[Without the fat ball around, Senior White might feel a bit lonely, right?]","[However, after merging with Dark Song, it can also be seen as an alternative way of preserving a trace of the fat ball’s existence in this world. Moreover, Dark Song will only merge with most of the fat ball, not all. Perhaps it could leave some residue behind?]","Ba Er thought this as he stylishly walked away.","As he was pondering the term ‘fat ball,’ he accidentally triggered a hidden program within the Cultivator Chat System.","[Ding~ Message from the Cultivator Chat System backend: ????]","Ba Er: “???”","What on earth is the Cultivator Chat System backend message?","Oh... wait, could it be Lady Kunna?","Lady Kunna was currently busy upgrading functions for the Cultivator Chat System, so swamped that she couldn’t even find time to chat casually in chat groups. Now, she was sending messages directly from the backend without even switching from the upgrade interface.","“What happened, Lady Kunna?” Ba Er asked.","Lady Kunna: “Please call me Lady Fat Ball.”","Ba Er: “...”","Lady Kunna: “You keep thinking of me, are you thinking about me?”","Ba Er: “No, I was talking about the fat ball.”","Lady Kunna: “I am the Fat Ball.”","Ba Er: “...”","Heaven knows why Lady Kunna suddenly fancied the name ‘Fat Ball’?","Could it be influenced by that time the main body brought the seed influenced by pregnancy and the Embryonic Gaze into the Black Dragon World?","After sighing, Ba Er explained, “I just met the ruler of the Netherworld, the fat ball, the ball of liquid metal in the current world. Then, I was contemplating the origins of the fat ball, discussing this issue with him. Perhaps while pondering over it, I thought of the term ‘fat ball’ several times in my mind.”","Lady Kunna: “Oh, that one.”","After that ‘oh’, Lady Kunna did not reply further.","Ba Er: “...”","He was still expecting further conversation from Lady Kunna, but suddenly, the conversation just ended.","“Understandable, have to be understanding,” Ba Er said.","After all, Lady Kunna was very busy.","She probably couldn’t even spare the time to say ‘goodbye.’","The main reason is... the main body upgraded too fast, and the “Cultivator Chat System” also had to work overtime tirelessly to upgrade.","Lady Kunna had to compress tasks of at least a few thousand years or even tens of thousands of years into half a year. So, as you can imagine, her workload was terrifying!","That’s why Ba Er could understand Lady Kunna.","“By the way, speaking of Lady Fat Ball’s origins... I suddenly remembered why I like this name,” Lady Kunna suddenly replied.","Ba Er: “???”","Lady Kunna: “Fat Ball, it’s tasty.","Ba Er: “...”","Although Lady Fat Ball looks like a dango, it’s clearly metallic and doesn’t seem like it could be used as food.","And Lady Kunna, when did you eat Lady Fat Ball?","Could it be that Lady Kunna secretly made delicious food behind the main body’s back and quietly ate it alone?","Lady Kunna: “The memories are too distant. Moreover, my state has been affected by the collapse of the world, and many things have been sealed in the depths of the vast Memory Bank.”","“Too distant?” Ba Er was stunned, and suddenly he guessed a possibility, “Lady Kunna, did you eat Lady Fat Ball a long, long time ago, in the Black Dragon World?”","The origins of Lady Fat Ball are unknown to everyone and are not part of the current myriad practitioners in the universe... Could it be that it is a product of the Black Dragon World?","In the Black Dragon World, those who reach the Ninth Stage are blessed by the Black Dragon World and sent out of it. Could Lady Fat Ball be one of them?","Furthermore, Lady Kunna likes to call itself ‘Fat Ball’, there must be some karmic relationship here.","If one dares to think even bolder.","Could Fat Ball have once been a part of ‘Lady Kunna’?","But when Demon Emperor Hezhi was tampering with ‘Dragon Network’s Will of Black Dragon World’, did this part escape from the Black Dragon World, come to the main world, and eventually become Lady Fat Ball?","Every being at the Immortal level is a fantasist—they think too fast, imagining a lot of plots in the blink of an eye.","“Not in the Black Dragon World, but even longer ago,” Lady Kunna suddenly switched to ‘backstage mode’, entered the ‘Cultivate Chat System’ chat interface, and chatted with Ba Er.","Ba Er: “Longer ago?”","“The eighth session, it should be the eighth session... was the ball. And I should be the ninth session, I’m not wrong about that,” replied Lady Kunna.","Ba Er: “!!!”","What’s this ‘eighth session’?","Heavenly Dao?","And could it be a coincidence that Lady Fat Ball corresponds to the ‘Heavenly Dao ball’ of the eighth session?","“Request: please return to the Netherworld’s Fat Ball location, share your vision, I wish to take a look at the Netherworld’s Fat Ball,” said Lady Kunna again.","“No problem, I’m heading back to visit Lady Fat Ball right now,” Ba Er hurriedly said.","It feels like Lady Kunna is about to bring him some explosive news!","Ba Er turned swiftly, running back to the location where Lady Fat Ball was being suppressed.","Lady Fat Ball: “...”","Watching Ba Er return, it silently put away its means of breaking the seal.","“Hold on, Lady Fat Ball, I’m starting a video, haha,” Ba Er kindly said.","Lady Fat Ball, in a burst of rage, extended a pair of metallic arms and hammered at the seal: “I’ll kill you!”","Do they think it’s a monkey in a zoo?",".",".","Three thousand chapters check-in~~ Finally, the story of “Cultivator Chat” is also about to end~~"]},{"number":3003,"title":"Chapter 3003 - 3001: It’s Self-Protection for Children to Resemble Their Parents!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3003: Chapter 3001: It’s Self-Protection for Children to Resemble Their Parents!","They’re actually video recording this—it’s as if they’re treating it like an animal penned up in a zoo.","And to top it off, they don’t even pay for photos!","Lady Fat Ball’s temper flared up uncontrollably.","Had it not been for the seal suppressing her right now, she would have flattened Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s three corpses avatar under her massive form in a minute, rolling back and forth over him until he turned into a paper-thin figure!","In this world right now, she detests Netherly White the most, followed closely by Tyrannical Song—these two individuals always manage to rile her up with ease.","Despite Lady Fat Ball’s status and self-control acquired from her cultivation, she would usually not lose her temper so easily. But Song and White always seemed to carry a ‘provoking-the-ball aura,’ effortlessly triggering Lady Fat Ball’s fury inadvertently.","“Stay calm, Lady Fat Ball, you need to cool down for a moment. Anyway, no matter how angry you get now, you can’t hit me,” Ba Er said with a voice.","At the same time, his eyes lit up as he began to share his sight with Lady Kunna—the details of how the ‘sight-sharing spell’ worked were a mystery to him; he just needed to cooperate and open permissions, and Lady Kunna would handle the rest of the ‘sight-sharing’ operations.","Lady Fat Ball: “!!!”","Don’t think that just because you can’t be hit, you can do whatever you want.","Here, this is the Netherworld Realm.","And even though I’m sealed, I’m still the ruler of the Netherworld!","Lady Fat Ball calmed down and said with an icy, unemotional mechanical voice, “As the ruler of the Netherworld, I curse you... You will die without a whole corpse, your head blown to bits.”","“Uh, that’s basic for the main body, right?” Ba Er winked at Lady Fat Ball, “Ever since my main body started cultivating, I’ve lost count of the number of times it has exploded into a bloody mist. And there have been plenty of times my head has popped too.”","Lady Fat Ball: “...”","She turned her spherical body around, her materialized single eye now focusing on a figure above the ‘Demon Sea World.’","Her curse had just been neutralized.","By Dark Song...","The other party also has the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld.","This infuriating act of mutual negation reminded her of her past experiences of clashing and killing with Netherly White over tens of thousands of years. Such reflections only fueled her anger further.","Even though I am the ruler of this session’s Netherworld Realm, with Netherly White occupying the spot and Dark Song hastening to take a higher position, I still haven’t fully faded away!","Frustrated to the point of almost developing cirrhosis, Lady Fat Ball ultimately decided to close her single eye and even shut off her senses to the outside world.","Out of sight, out of mind.","She began focusing solely on countering the seal, wholeheartedly calculating methods to break the sealing technique.","As for the Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s three corpses avatar nearby—let’s just treat him as a monkey jumping up and down!","...","...","“She isolated herself?” Ba Er sat down cross-legged, eyes fixed on Lady Fat Ball, transmitting the video feed to Lady Kunna.","“Yes, exactly as expected,” Lady Kunna said.","A thought struck Ba Er; he sat upright, preparing himself for Lady Kunna’s lesson.","“Although its color has changed, and its appearance somewhat altered, it still looks rather appetizing,” Lady Kunna said.","Ba Er: “...”","Truth be told, he just couldn’t associate Lady Fat Ball in front of him with ‘appetizing.’","“Back in the Black Dragon World, when I came into contact with the ‘seed’ that Tyrannical Song had brought over, I may have already subconsciously sensed and grown fond of the name Fat Ball,” Lady Kunna continued.","Ba Er: “So, Lady Kunna, could you explain the matter from beginning to end?”","“I don’t have time for that, I need to go back and upgrade the communication program,” replied Lady Kunna.","Ba Er: “!!!”","Suddenly, Ba Er felt moved by Lady Kunna’s dedication... She’s so diligent.","“Do you also want to eat the ‘fat ball’?” Lady Kunna suddenly asked.","Ba Er: “It’s not about eating, should it be about Fusion?”","“Isn’t that just another form of eating?” said Lady Kunna.","Ba Er: “Well... from a certain perspective, it’s indeed not much different. Lady Kunna, have you ever ‘eaten’ a being similar to the fat ball Senior? One that was also the ruler of the Netherworld?”","“Our counterpart was the Ancient Nether Chaos Will,” explained Lady Kunna.","Ba Er nodded: “Anyway, they are similar existences.”","After thinking for a moment, he cleverly said: “Lady Fat Ball, could you say a few more words?”","It seems that Lady Kunna quite likes the nickname ‘Lady Fat Ball’?","“Then, I will talk a bit more during my lunch break,” said Lady Kunna, her mood seemingly blossoming: “I, or to be more precise, the ‘me’ from before, or you could say my main body, was the last immortal body of a destroyed World, the ninth one.”","This information, Ba Er already knew.","Mainly because when looking at the Black Dragon World equivalent of the ‘Ancient Ghost’ big shots’ inserted pillars, Heavenly Dao Father Goudan’s father had left spoilers on those pillars.","So, Song Shuhang knew that the Black Dragon World is the relic of the ‘previous destroyed World’... The immortal Black Dragon was willing to let a batch of living beings survive, but at a certain cost.","And Lady Kunna is the will manifestation of the Black Dragon, the will of the Black Dragon World’s ‘Dragon Network’.","“Before me was the eighth one, which was also a ball... a plump one. According to the memory data in my Memory Bank, I had once entered the Ancient Nether alone, inserted the ‘Dao Mark Pillar’, and encountered the ball there. Then... I ate part of it,” Lady Kunna replied.","Ba Er: “Lady Fat Ball, you really have an appetite. What about the leftovers?”","“There were no leftovers. After eating a part of it, the rest just dissipated. Until later on, my counterpart ‘Ancient Ghost Will Body’ appeared... But because it looked so much like me, I couldn’t bring myself to do it,” Lady Kunna continued, pulling data from her ‘Memory Bank’ as she spoke.","Ba Er: “...”","So it seems, children resembling their parents indeed makes sense, for the more similar they are, the more protection they receive.","If the Ancient Nether Chaos Will hadn’t resembled its main body so closely, it might have ended up as Lady Kunna’s meal... and it might have been one of those things that she could harvest over and over again, regrowing to be eaten repeatedly.","“Eating the ball before becoming immortal would provide a lot of useful information... However, my Memory Bank data is a bit incomplete, so when exactly will you eat the ball?” Lady Kunna inquired.","Or should they consider consuming it piece by piece?","“Lady Kunna, did you eat the ball from the Ancient Nether before proving your Dao?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","So, in the Black Dragon World era, after the eighth ball ceased to be, the ‘ball’ from the Ancient Nether was still alive, sort of like Senior White two?","What has happened in the past, will happen again... Is that what it means?","Moreover, Ba Er was more concerned about another point.","“Lady Fat Ball, is there any connection between the current fat ball Senior and the Ancient Ghost Ball you ate back then?” Ba Er asked.","Could it be that the successor of the previous eighth session, through Lady Kunna, secretly made its way to the main world to prove its Dao again?","But if it was the plan of the previous ball, after transforming into Lady Fat Ball, why doesn’t it remember its past?","Is it the price of going through destruction?","“Definitely,” replied Lady Kunna.","There’s definitely a connection between the two from the eighth session."]},{"number":3004,"title":"Chapter 3004 - 3002: The Plan to Bind the Sage’s Eye Requires External Assistance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3004: Chapter 3002: The Plan to Bind the Sage’s Eye Requires External Assistance","“p>”So, you mean... it turns out that the fat ball’s real body indeed smuggled itself from the Black Dragon World to the main world where we are now, and then proved its Dao during the Eighth Session?” Tyrant Evil speculated aloud.","“There might be that possibility. Besides having devoured the Ancient Ghost Ball in the past, I do not have too much understanding of the Eighth Session. Maybe it really had the means to smuggle itself successfully,” Lady Kunna thought for a moment and then added, “But I have another guess.”","Tyrant Evil thought briefly and said aloud, “Is it related to the ‘Eighth Session’ too?”","“Exactly,” Lady Kunna responded by nodding, “Two balls, both appearing in the position of the Eighth Session. It’s too much of a coincidence. Therefore, I am wondering if it could be that whenever the Eighth Session arrives... a ball might be born to mark the occasion?”","Because if the ‘fat ball’ in front of them was truly the one from her Black Dragon World that had smuggled over, then why would it choose to prove its Dao only during the Eighth Session?","Timewise, if it was truly a smuggled ball, then it should have been able to prove its Dao during the second, third, or fourth sessions.","So... could it be that every time the Eighth Session of the Will of the Heavens arrives, a ‘ball’ like this is born between Heaven and Earth?","Tyrant Evil had come to the same conclusion.","“Indeed, if it were a smuggled ball, surely it would avoid the first session of the Will of the Heavens. The first session is too special; as a smuggler, it definitely could not touch it. Thus, theoretically speaking, it should have chosen one session among the second, third, or fourth... holy shit...” As he said this, Tyrant Evil couldn’t help but tear apart the ‘seal of civility’ over his mouth.","The Will of the Heavens from the second and third sessions were the three-eyed young senior and Father Goudan, definitely unrelated to the smuggled ball.","During the fourth and fifth sessions, one of them was the main body of the ‘Dark Sun’...","When Tyrant Evil thought of this, he suddenly felt a tingling sensation on his scalp.","He immediately sent his speculations to his main body, as well as Daoist Senior.","“Don’t worry, this possibility is slim.” After a moment, the voice of Daozi rang in Tyrant Evil’s ear, “When I made contact with the Dark Sun, I discovered that it didn’t recognize the liquid metal ball at all. It even mistook me for the ball Will of the Heavens, and even thought of tempting me, trying to recruit me. So, there should be no connection between the two.”","Upon receiving Daoist Senior’s response, Tyrant Evil breathed a sigh of relief.","“However, I never thought the ball Will of the Heavens would be so special. If it really is born corresponding to the Eighth Session... what would its purpose be? Does the world need a ball to be born during the Eighth Session to complete something?” Daozi frowned.","Lady Kunna, “To be eaten?”","Tyrant Evil, “...”","“Maybe, it really is meant to be eaten.” After being silent for a moment, Daozi surprisingly agreed with Lady Kunna’s suggestion.","Saying this with his status as the current Will of the Heavens would not be without cause.","“We have been thinking about letting Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s Dark Song swallow the Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball, it might be a coincidence, but we are on the right path,” Daozi’s intent grazed the self-closed fat ball, feeling pleasure +1.","At the same time, Daozi happily reinforced the seal on the self-closed fat ball.","To enable Dark Song to fuse with the fat ball sooner... it would be necessary to accelerate the ‘inheritance of the Sage’s talent’ plan.","Daozi felt somewhat impatient.","“By the way, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song... regarding the topic of ‘how to fuse your teacher’s eyes,’ we have a lead here, but it would require the help of a fellow friend,” Daozi’s voice sounded.","Tyrant Evil asked in confusion, “Who?”","So many powerhouses like Daoist Senior, Senior White, and Father Goudan had joined hands; did they still need to call for external assistance?","How remarkable could this reinforcement be?","“The Nine Nether Body of the Second Wielder of the Will, Senior Three-Eyed,” Daozi explained, “This suggestion came from Senior Dragon. In the myriad practitioners in the universe, no one surpasses the research pertaining to ‘eyeballs’ of the Second Will. Thus, the most reliable plan to solve the issue of ‘fusing the Sage’s eye and making a one-time-use item into something recyclable’ swiftly would be to have the Second Will’s Nine Nether Body help us.”","“I see, then I’ll inform Tyrant Kindness. He’s just gone with Self-Corpse Overlord to visit the three-eyed young senior to pick up Demon Emperor Og, so he can ask whether the three-eyed young senior would be willing to come out of retirement,” Tyrant Evil nodded.","...","...","In the small world behind the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","The trial area of the ‘Celestial Killing Light’ belonging to the three-eyed young senior.","The Demon Emperor Og had a face full of despair.","At this point, his situation could be described as utterly miserable.","With the seal of the Scholarly Sage, the backlash from the power of the Demon Sea World, the aftereffects of the burst techniques used in desperation, and the injuries inflicted by Tyrannical Song, he, who was already at death’s door, now had to withstand the relentless bombardment of the ‘Celestial Killing Light.’","It was too painful.","In the past few days, he had been constantly reflecting on his life.","Before he ascended to ‘Immortal,’ his life was like pushing through obstacles on easy mode, crushing all impediments with his overwhelming strength.","But ever since he encountered the Scholarly Sage and Tyrannical Song, his life plummeted like a stock market crash.","[After you guys finished your bet, why didn’t you remember to take me, the bet, out of there?]","[I’m going to die, I’m really going to die.]","[I, the mighty Immortality Demon Emperor, am going to die within the Immortal Slaying Thunder Pond? And my cause of death is because two gamblers fighting their corner forgot about their bet, me?]","At this time, whoever comes to rescue me, I will definitely fulfill one of their wishes!","Just when the Demon Emperor Og was in the depths of despair, two figures appeared in front of him.","One was Tyrant Kindness, and the other was Tyrannical Song with no presence, who would be forgotten in the blink of an eye.","“The Ancient Three Corpses Cutting Technique?” The Demon Emperor Og was startled.","He didn’t expect that Tyrannical Song would also play with the ‘cut three corpses’ method.","“Do you want to get out of this thunder pond?” Tyrant Kindness joined his hands together, looking at Demon Emperor Og with a compassionate face.","Demon Emperor Og: “...”","“The main body wants to hear about the ‘Mysterious Principles of Immortality’ from you. If you are willing, I can take you out,” said Tyrant Kindness.","“Do I even have a choice?” the Demon Emperor Og said with all the strength he could muster.","“Hmm, maybe you do have another choice,” said the Self-Corpse Overlord?. “Tyrant Kindness, I just received a message from Tyrant Evil. We need to meet with the three-eyed young senior again... And then, have one final gamble with him.”","If we win, we can ask the three-eyed young senior to help us with the project of ‘researching how to fuse the Scholarly Sage’s Eye with the undying fat whale golden core.’","It was the last gamble of the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","Tyrant? said to Demon Emperor Og: “You can become our bet once again.”","Demon Emperor Og: “???”","F*ck, you guys are doing this again?","There’s no end to this, is there?","“Got it.” Tyrant Kindness picked up Demon Emperor Og and, together with Tyrant?, left the thunder pond.","In the small world of the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","The three-eyed young senior lay on the beach wearing swimming trunks.","“Senior... let’s have the last bet. Can we stand in for the main body and do it?” Tyrant Kindness called from afar."]},{"number":3005,"title":"Chapter 3005 - 3003: From Today Onwards, Tyrannical Song is My Bro!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3005: Chapter 3003: From Today Onwards, Tyrannical Song is My Bro!","“What are you planning to pluck from me this time?” the three-eyed young senior asked without turning around, responding languidly.","Tyrant Kindness: “???”","So devoid of spirit, this isn’t the three-eyed young senior I know!","In Tyrannical Song’s view, the three-eyed young senior was always more determined after setbacks, and no matter how many times he lost, he would come back with renewed confidence next time.","But the three-eyed young senior in front of him seemed like someone had replaced him... absolutely devoid of any spirit.","“Senior Three-Eyed, what’s wrong with you?” Tyrant Kindness asked cautiously.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, don’t worry, the master is just having his period~” the eyeball butler came out carrying the tea, serving the immortal tea to both Tyrant Kindness and Tyrant ? at the same time.","The three-eyed young senior: “...”","“His period?” Tyrant Kindness was taken aback.","The ruler of the Netherworld has such a setting?","“Don’t be shy, say it boldly, what do you want to pluck from me this time?” the three-eyed young senior rolled over on the beach and looked at Tyrant Kindness.","“Senior, why don’t you have any fighting spirit?” Tyrant ? asked.","The three-eyed young senior looked up at the sky: “Even the most spirited person can’t withstand you shearing my wool once a month!”","“In the past, even if I lost, I had decades, even hundreds or thousands of years to adjust my mentality. With such a long time, no matter how badly I lost last time, I could recover.”","“But you? You show up punctually every month. Moreover, this time you didn’t even give me a month!”","“How do you expect me to have any spirit?”","An awkward expression appeared on Tyrant Kindness’s face—this was something he hadn’t considered.","Even the strongest person needs time to lick their wounds.","The main body has been shearing wool a bit too diligently.","“However, if you think about it, Senior, this is our last gamble with you. After this one, you can say goodbye to us. Thinking of it this way, doesn’t it make you a bit happier?” Tyrant Kindness said empathetically, trying to comfort from another perspective.","“Eh? Now that you mention it, it does make some sense.” the three-eyed young senior sat up from the beach.","He had almost forgotten, this was his last wager with Tyrannical Song!","After the ceremony, Tyrannical Song wouldn’t have the chance to sheer his wool anymore.","“Moreover, the main body isn’t here this time; we are clones, which should be a bit different from the main body,” Tyrant Kindness added.","The three-eyed young senior dusted the sand off his pants and stood up.","In the sky, the sunlight began to brighten.","The eyeball butler looked up at the dazzling sunlight—not very friendly for it. As an eyeball monster, it needed a lot of water, and too brilliant sunlight would evaporate the water content from its body.","Indeed, it’s the bloated mentality of the old master that should be fractured!","“Master, this is also your last chance to win against Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song... If you lose, your wagers with Tyrannical Song will be completely defeated without a single victory. Moreover, in the future, you will never have the chance to change this record again.” the eyeball butler kindly reminded.","The three-eyed young senior: “!!!”","The previously bright sunshine seemed to dim a little.","“Cough, what do you guys, the main body, want this time?” the three-eyed young senior coughed lightly and asked.","Given Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s character, he definitely wanted to get something from him, only then would he bother coming over.","Practically treating him as a treasure extraction vault.","“The main body has recently been studying a project, ‘Fusing a pair of Scholarly Sage’s Eyes into the undying fat whale golden core’, merging them into one entity.” Tyrant Kindness spoke up.","Self-Corpse Overlord continued, “In the process of research, we encountered some technical difficulties. We need someone to provide technical support for ‘eyeballs’... and Senior Three-Eyed, you are the senior with the deepest research on eyeballs in the myriad practitioners in the universe. Thus, we would like to ask you to assist in researching this project.”","Tyrant Kindness summarized, “This is the target of our bet, I wonder if you agree, Senior?”","“A pair of Scholarly Sage’s Eyes?” Upon hearing this, the three-eyed young senior felt a stir of excitement.","Was he being invited to research the ‘Sage’s Eye’?","This was problematic, the proposal had hit a soft spot in his heart.","The Scholarly Sage’s Eyes, Tyrannical Song surely wouldn’t use them as a betting stake and they were destined not to be added to his collection.","So it seemed the only way he could thoroughly study these divine eyes was by ‘assisting in the research.’","Such magnificent Sage’s Eyes, since they couldn’t be collected, touching and studying them also seemed wonderful.","So... should I intentionally lose this round to Tyrannical Song’s Three Corpses Avatar?","The three-eyed young senior began to struggle internally.","[And why does this have to be the goal of a bet? With our friendship, for such a minor matter, couldn’t he just invite me directly? Why go through the trouble?]","Seeing ‘a pair of Scholarly Sage’s Eyes’ as the prize, the three-eyed young senior secretly boosted his friendship value with Tyrannical Song by a lot- about five or six times the original, filling up his favorability to the brim.","“Ahem, alright, I agree to this bet,” replied the three-eyed young senior. “And what’s your wager?”","“As a wager, would a living Demon Emperor suffice?” Self-Corpse Overlord pointed to Demon Emperor Og.","The three-eyed young senior: “...”","That felt rather dismissive.","But, considering ‘a pair of Scholarly Sage’s Eyes.’","“Agreed,” nodded the three-eyed young senior.","Demon Emperor Og: “...”","For a moment, he felt as if he had caught a whiff of disdain from the Heavenly Dao of the Three-Eyed Sovereign.","He, the mighty Immortality Demon Emperor, the big boss of demons, wasn’t even qualified to be a bet?","That felt awful.","“Then, Senior, how shall we proceed with this bet?” asked Tyrant Kindness.","“What are you good at?” The three-eyed young senior asked directly—having decided to lose on purpose, he thought to just go through the motions.","“What am I good at? Hmm, I am the Good Corpse of my main body, possessing countless good deeds and have inherited a part of the main body’s ‘Kindness.’ So, I am quite good at accumulating light of virtue, holy light, being a good person, and doing good deeds,” Tyrant Kindness honestly replied.","The three-eyed young senior once again showed an expression of disdain.","He originally thought of competing in what Tyrant Kindness was good at, but upon hearing these items, the three-eyed senior immediately dismissed the idea.","He, the sovereign ruler of the Netherworld, was supposed to compete in gathering holy light or virtue power?","Pah!","“What else are you good at?” The three-eyed young senior looked towards Tyrannical Song’s self-corpse.","Self-Corpse Overlord: “I excel at making people unable to remember me.”","“What’s your name?” asked the three-eyed young senior.","Self-Corpse: “Selfcentric Corpse Overlord Body.”","“That sounds pretty easy to remember,” the three-eyed young senior said. “Ba Ben.”","Self-Corpse: “...”","He was now the person who could most understand Drunk Fish Hermit from the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group.","“Decided, this time, let’s compete in ‘memory,’” proposed the three-eyed young senior."]},{"number":3006,"title":"Chapter 3006 - 3004: The Restless Butler","paragraphs":["Chapter 3006: Chapter 3004: The Restless Butler","“”””Tyrant Kindness asked in confusion, “A contest of memory? How do we compare that?”","Under normal circumstances, cultivators have incredibly strong memories.","Having a photographic memory is something cultivators at the Second and Third Stage can achieve.","And when one reaches the Immortal Realm, the brain’s processing speed becomes indescribably fast.","Take Song Shuhang’s main body’s current state, for example, after sweeping through with his Immortal-level Primordial Spirit Power, he could encompass everything happening on modern world – Earth within his mental scan and perceive all things.","And everything that occurs within the range of the Primordial Spirit’s scan can be firmly remembered by the main body, down to the ruffling of leaves in the wind, without missing a single detail.","At the Immortal Realm, one could already do many things that are considered ‘divine’ in human myths, and even surpass most deities depicted in those myths, outperforming them beautifully.","If an Immortal so desires, they could ensure good weather, a life free from disasters and difficulties, and instantly receive and respond to the prayers of millions, all within their capabilities.","Hence, at a certain level, ordinary ‘memory contest projects’ would definitely be pointless.","Projects like random number memory, abstract images, or remembering people’s names and faces – for an existence at the Immortal Realm, one glance is enough to permanently remember everything, without missing anything.","Unless the competition is about who can first remember Fishing Hermit’s dao name?","However, if that’s the case, it might end in a draw.","...","...","“Mm, if we’re going to compete, we definitely can’t use ordinary tasks, let me think...” the three-eyed young senior stretched out his hands, and the eyeball butler came forward to drape a cloak over him.","The three-eyed young senior came to the side of Tyrant Kindness and Ba Ben, pulled out his own chair and lay down.","The eyeball butler then served the master immortal tea.","—Although it was always a pain in the master’s heart, contemplating switching jobs, duty calls where one serves, and professional responsibilities must be met. The butler could beautifully complete all the tasks required of him.","Tyrant Kindness watched the three-eyed young senior without blinking.","“I was thinking of using the Sealing Realm to add some fun to the contest. But now that you’re already at the Immortal Realm, sealing would be very troublesome... and it would also waste my precious materials,” the three-eyed young senior continued until he suddenly felt that the tea in his hand lost its flavor.","The last time he contended with Song Shuhang, this guy was still at the Eighth Stage Profound Sage.","This time, he has jumped to the Immortal Realm.","What about the normal Tribulation Transcender Realm?","Was the Tribulation Transcender Realm eaten?","Just thinking about this made the three-eyed young senior’s heart ache.","“Master, given Song Shuhang’s current realm, if we want to compete in memory, we must reach a limit with the ‘memory project’, surpassing what Immortal can accommodate,” the eyeball butler reminded from the side.","The three-eyed young senior rubbed his chin: “Hmm, like Song Shuhang’s last speech to the myriad practitioners in the universe, instantly replying to all cultivators’ questions and providing answers – then we see who can remember more of the questions and answers?”","The last time Song Shuhang suddenly connected to his database, the massive influx of information caused even his head to hurt.","The universe is vast, and the simultaneous questions from all cultivators in the universe almost caused the three-eyed young senior to crash.","“But now Song Shuhang has lost the qualifications to give a speech. He is no longer able to show his divinity in front of the masses and offer cultivators the chance to ask and receive answers,” the eyeball butler said, brewing some emotion and proposing: “So I think, why not extract all the memories of the master from the ancient era to the present and turn them into a competition project. The master’s memories from Eternity to now are so vast that even Immortals cannot instantly absorb and accommodate the amount of memory!”","First, the butler compliments the master, laying the groundwork.","“We can test whether Song Shuhang can memorize all of the ‘memories’ within a specified time. Then, based on the master’s memory, ask some random questions to see if Song Shuhang can answer them correctly.”","The butler spoke more and more enthusiastically.","“If the master really did this, then all of his memories would be laid out right before Tyrant Kindness, leaving no privacy between them,”","Just thinking about it felt very interesting.","The eyeball butler had even thought of a rough draft for the questions he would use to examine Tyrant Kindness.","For instance: how many eyeballs had the master, who had this peculiar love for eyes, collected in his lifetime?","Or: since the master started setting up gambling events, how many times had he lost? One could even delve into detail, asking who the master lost to in a given year and month?","And who was the master’s first love? What did his second love look like? What race was his third love, and how many pairs of eyes did they have?","At this point, the eyeball butler was becoming somewhat impatient.","“I think it could work,” Tyrant Kindness nodded – he was very interested in the three-eyed young senior’s memories as well.","Perhaps he could even catch a glimpse of the three-eyed young senior’s ‘Mysterious Principles of Immortality’?","“Keep dreaming,” the three-eyed young senior rolled his eyes three times.","He did not intend to make his memories public to anyone.","However, the proposal from the butler was not bad.","The three-eyed young senior’s gaze landed on ‘Gambling Demon Emperor,’ “How long have you lived?”","Demon Emperor Og: “...”","Is this targeting me?","I refuse to answer this question!","To become a bet was already inhumane enough, and now you even want to use my ‘memories’ as betting items, what more do you want to do to me before you’re satisfied?","You two demons!","No... both of the ones before me are rulers of the Netherworld.","To call them demons is practically a compliment to their kindness.","You two heartless rulers of the Netherworld!","“The ‘Gambling Demon Emperor’ and the Confucian Sage are from the same era, but he is much younger than the Sage...” Ba Ben chimed in from the side.","He remembered that the Gambling Demon Emperor, after proving his Dao and achieving immortality, couldn’t wait to challenge the Confucian Sage, but because he was too arrogant, he angered the Sage, was rubbed against the ground, and was even fitted with a permanent seal.","“So, he’s from the end of the ancient era? Too short, that duration of memories isn’t enough to be a wager for a bet,” the three-eyed young senior said dismissively.","Demon Emperor Og: “...”","Did I just get looked down upon again?","Why is there a feeling of loss deep inside although I don’t have to become part of the betting items anymore?","“Shall we use my main body’s memories as the wager? There are some things in the main body’s memories that are quite hard to remember,” Tyrant Kindness suggested aloud.","“No thanks, I have no interest in experiencing your memories,” the three-eyed young senior waved his hand dismissively.","He remembered that Tyrant Song’s mere one year of ‘Cultivation memories’ contained a lot of ‘Death Experiences, painful experiences.’ To touch these memories and try to remember them would be akin to self-torture.","The wise ruler of the Netherworld, having once been tricked by Tyrant Song’s ‘painful tolerance,’ would not fall into the same trap again.","“So, we might as well use the master’s memories. Master, you can edit your memories a bit,” the eyeball butler began to egg on."]},{"number":3007,"title":"Chapter 3007 - 3005: The Original Ruler of the Netherworld’s Companion Item","paragraphs":["Chapter 3007: Chapter 3005: The Original Ruler of the Netherworld’s Companion Item","A mature steward would never speak easily of giving up.","“Master, you can edit out some inconvenient private memories from your own memory, or even mix truth with falsehood by altering some scenes in your memories. After all, we just need a huge ‘memory’ as a wager,” the eyeball butler added.","It had already faintly sensed that its master was considering the suggestion.","With a little more covert encouragement, the deal would be sealed!","The three-eyed young senior crossed his arms and propped his chin, falling into deep thought.","Tyrant Kindness, Tyrannical Song’s Self Corpse, the eyeball butler, and the Gambling Demon Emperor all watched the three-eyed youth expectantly, waiting for his decision.","“Perhaps, I have something here that can serve as the object of this wager,” the three-eyed young senior said after a moment of thought, presenting an answer that surprised everyone.","After all this time, the three-eyed sovereign wasn’t planning to use his own Memory Bank?","The situation left the eyeball butler feeling somewhat downhearted.","“I have a Companion Magic Device that should be able to play a role at this time,” said the three-eyed young senior.","The eyeball butler was startled: “Master, you have a Companion Magic Device?”","Why didn’t I know anything about this at all?","How could the master’s little secret be hidden so well?","“I am the first ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ of the myriad practitioners in the universe; this is something I believe you should already know,” the three-eyed young senior stated as he gently tapped the vacuum, opening a small space treasure trove.","Tyrant Kindness looked up curiously into this little treasure trove... and the next moment, he was nearly blinded by its brilliance.","Song Shuhang had long known that the three-eyed young senior was extremely extravagant.","After all, only a person with mines at home could afford to wager so many precious materials and treasures and still host a Wealth Throne Ritual to distribute treasures to outsiders.","The treasures of grades 1 through 9 given away in previous Wealth Throne Rituals were no more than ‘garbage’ that the three-eyed young senior needed to clear out regularly!","Only the treasures he truly valued and collected were the real precious items.","Tyrant Kindness hardly recognized any of the precious treasures inside the treasure trove, each emitting an aura of inestimable value—and also, in one corner of the small treasure trove, there seemed to be many eyeballs, each carefully enclosed in exquisite treasure chests.","The three-eyed young senior retrieved a bottle shrouded in mist from the small space of his treasure trove.","Black, foulest mist continuously spilled from the bottle, then was reabsorbed—this cycle repeated endlessly.","“What is this?” asked the Self-Corpse Overlord Body, puzzled.","At the same time, he and Tyrant Kindness instinctively stepped back, their instincts warning them not to get too close to the bottle.","“This is the Companion Magic Device of my title as the first ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ in the myriad realms. To be precise, the fact that the corresponding Will of the Heavens created the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ is also related to the prototype of this object,” the three-eyed young senior remarked with some emotion.","The first Wielder of the Will was very mysterious, erasing all information about itself... And furthermore, the first Wielder of the Will did not have a corresponding ‘ruler of the Netherworld.’","Before the appearance of the three-eyed sovereign, the Netherworld Realm was still the Primordial Demon Sea, utterly chaotic, without any rules.","It was only long after the Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes rose to a higher position that it conceived of the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ during an experiment.","After the Three-Eyed Youth created the ruler of the Netherworld, this existence was recognized within the laws of the Heavenly Dao, embedded into them, and passed down through the ages.","Essentially, every incarnation of the Heavenly Dao is a player who creates complications.","The Three-Eyed Youth actually shares some similarities with the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon, both being outstanding inventive types of Heavenly Dao.","Heavenly Dao Eye Drops, the primordial treasure ‘Long-Eyed Orb Planet’, ruler of the Netherworld Realm... These are all works of the Three-Eyed Youth.","“What is its original form?” the Self-Corpse Overlord Body asked again.","The three-eyed young senior reached out and caressed the small bottle, then a single eye made of special material popped out from it.","The foul solitary eye landed in the palm of the three-eyed young senior and after a slight rotation, it locked onto the position of his third eye.","That was where it was meant to reside, in its socket.","“You are not unfamiliar with the origin of its original form,” the three-eyed young senior said, “It is that world which Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song referred to as the ‘special world’ of the Black Dragon World.”","Each iteration of the Heavenly Dao, or members who possess the qualifications to compete for the final battle for the Heavenly Dao, seemed to enter the Black Dragon World for some reason before proving their Dao and plant a pillar there.","The First Heavenly Dao, three-eyes, Striped Dragon Two, Demon Emperor Hezhi, Confucianism Sage... all have once left their marks there.","However, Demon Emperor Hezhi was a bit different; he entered the Black Dragon World after failing to compete for the Heavenly Dao.","“The Black Dragon World has a complete main world system, and there is a corresponding Ancient Nether World. In the Ancient Nether World, there exists a ‘Ancient Nether Will Collection.’ That may very well be the opportunity for my corresponding Heavenly Dao to tinker with the ‘ruler of the Netherworld Realm’ experiment,” the three-eyed young man explained.","However, the Ancient Nether Will Collection might have some defect due to ‘Heaven and Earth Defect’ or other reasons. From what we see now, it is not as complete as the ‘ruler of the Netherworld Realm’.","The ruler of the Netherworld appears to be an upgraded version of the ‘Ancient Nether Will Collection’.","“And this original form of my Companion Magic Device should be a treasure that my Heavenly Dao brought out from the ‘Ancient Nether’ of the Black Dragon World. After many experiments with that treasure, I was ultimately born in the Netherworld Realm,” the three-eyed young senior explained.","Unlike the later ruler of the Netherworld, when the three-eyed young senior was born, his corresponding ‘Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes’ had already proved his Dao.","Therefore, the memories he inherited were different from those of the later ruler of the Netherworld, not split at the moment the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes’ proved his Dao.","The Memory Bank of the three-eyed young senior retained some information about the actions after ‘Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes’ proved his Dao.","However, later, as the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao followed the example of the First Heavenly Dao, erasing its own information data, the information about the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes’ in the Memory Bank of the three-eyed young senior was also disturbed.","Even his past ‘memories’ were actually affected.","During that time, to erase his information data like the First Heavenly Dao, the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao conducted some excessive experiments on Eye Goo-goo in secret—just like what Wielder of the Will White did to Senior White two secretly.","These experiments, Eye Goo-goo had no recollection of, as they were done by the Heavenly Dao in secrecy.","But his Companion Magic Device recorded them all.","“In my Companion Magic Device, many memories are recorded... most of them related to me. They serve as perfect subjects for this betting contest,” the three-eyed young senior said.","“Isn’t that the same as your own Memory Bank, master?” the eyeball butler asked, confused.","“No, there are differences,” the three-eyed young senior waved his hand.","Then, he looked at Tyrant Kindness, “What do you think?”","“I will follow Senior’s arrangement,” Tyrant Kindness nodded in agreement."]},{"number":3008,"title":"Chapter 3008 - 3006: Instincts About to Be Etched into Genetic Genes","paragraphs":["Chapter 3008: Chapter 3006: Instincts About to Be Etched into Genetic Genes","“Alright, then you must do as I say. I’ll pick an auspicious day and find you a good household to marry into, so just wait peacefully to be married off,” the three-eyed young senior chuckled heartily.","Tyrant Kindness: “...”","“Master, that joke was so cold I’m starting to freeze up,” the eyeball butler muttered quietly.","As soon as it finished speaking, it was impaled to the ground by a casual spear thrown by the three-eyed young senior, and blood spilled all over the place.","The master’s temper has been growing worse and worse lately, he’d go straight to physically stabbing it in the heart over trivial things, which is too irritable... This isn’t good.","As an excellent butler, it felt it should find a way to adjust the master’s state and improve his irritable mood.","[Maybe dietary therapy would help.] The eyeball butler thought to itself, it needed to check what the ruler of the Netherworld could take to make it easier for him to fall asleep.","When a person becomes extremely drowsy, they begin to become lethargic, and even an irritable disposition can improve.","The three-eyed young senior cleared his throat and said, “Since you agree—”","“No, I won’t marry.” Tyrant Kindness hastily said.","Three-eyed young senior: “...”","I was joking before, but now I’m seriously discussing the issue!","“Shut up and listen to the rules of this trial,” the three-eyed young senior said.","Self-Corpse Overlord quickly covered Tyrant Kindness’s mouth—Senior Three-Eyes seemed in a really bad mood today, he might really be having his ‘time of the month’.","“The memory fragments stored in my Companion Magic Device are similarly vast, barely lesser than mine... And since it is not a biological being, its way of reading memories is different from ours, so the way it processes memories is also unlike us,” the three-eyed young senior began explaining.","His Companion Magic Device doesn’t remember things chronologically, it often starts with the beginning A, skips the middle sections C and D, and jumps directly to section E, but sometimes it unpredictably leaps back to section B from J.","To sum it up, it’s a total mess.","However, it obviously has a special program to read its memories, no matter how chaotic the memories are, it can neatly piece them together on its own.","Apart from itself, it’s extremely difficult for outsiders to read its memories, requiring not only the ability to read but also to piece memories together... Top-notch reading comprehension is a must.","Sometimes, you have to fill out the story with your imagination; sometimes you have to sort out the jumbled memory sequences; other times, you still have to delve deep into the Companion Magic Device’s psyche, to deduce the underlying meanings of its memories.","This undoubtedly added difficulty to Song Shuhang’s challenge.","Tyrant Kindness listened while nodding silently—this wasn’t too challenging for him.","His main body, Song Shuhang, enjoyed reading, particularly squatting in a rental bookshop to read.","Sometimes the books in the rental shop would be missing several volumes from a set, leaving gaps when he was reading.","Over time, his main body developed the ability to read books non-sequentially. Even if the order was flipped, starting with 1, 2, 5, then going back to fill in 3 and 4, it did not impede the reading experience.","And as the Three Corpses Avatar of the main body, he naturally inherited this foundational ability.","“Here are the rules of the competition: I give you half an hour to thoroughly absorb the memory content stored in the Companion Magic Device. After half an hour, I will extract 50 questions from the vast memory bank for you to answer,” the three-eyed young senior announced.","“How many correct answers count as passing?” Tyrant Kindness asked.","“Two points per question, get thirty correct for a passing score of sixty. If you answer all correctly, not only will I cooperate with you to study the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eye’, but I will also give you an additional precious treasure,” the three-eyed young senior stated, tapping the armrest of his chair.","“What treasure?” Tyrant Kindness’s eyes gleamed.","“The details of an ‘immortality path’ that no one has practiced yet and where a seat of longevity still remains vacant,” said the three-eyed young senior. “Although you’ve already stepped onto the path of immortality, surely there must be others around you who would need such a complete ‘Will of the Heavens’ detail.”","Tyrant Kindness immediately thought of Senior White.","Only with the Scholarly Sage’s Eye complemented by an immortality path can one inherit the innate skills of the Sage.","Senior White would need to consume a path to immortality at that time.","“Full marks, it’s mine!” Tyrant Kindness declared with boundless bravado.","“Very good... that’s the spirit I want,” the three-eyed young senior chuckled.","What if Tyrannical Song doesn’t perform well and ends up losing to him?","Therefore, it is imperative to support Tyrannical Song, to ensure he wins this round and takes him to study the Sage’s eyeballs!","“Since you agree with the rules and the competition items, let’s sign the ritual now,” the three-eyed young senior urged while the iron was hot.","He couldn’t wait to study the Saint’s eyeballs.","“The ritual can be established at any time, my betting stake is a living immortal, gambling chips Demon Emperor Og!” Tyrant Kindness announced.","Demon Emperor Og: “...”","What the hell is a ‘gambling chips Demon Emperor’ title?","Is this really Tyrannical Song’s ‘Good Corpse’ manifestation?","Where’s the kindness?","Where’s the conscience?","When you pronounced the title ‘gambling chips Demon Emperor,’ did your kindness and conscience not hurt?","“Our betting stake is [assisting Tyrannical Song in researching the Scholarly Sage’s Eye] and the full-mark reward [complete information on the way to immortality] one piece,” the three-eyed young senior declared.","The glow of the ritual appeared at the feet of Tyrannical Song’s Tyrant Kindness clone and the three-eyed young senior; the contract was established.","As for the Self-Corpse Overlord beside them, it was accidentally omitted.","——Originally, the three-eyed young senior planned to have both Song Shuhang’s Good Corpse and Self-Corpse enter the gambling, with both manifestations synchronizing the reading of memories for added security.","But in the moment the gambling ritual started, for some reason, he just forgot about the Self-Corpse.","The uninformed Self-Corpse Overlord still thought that the ritual could only be conducted one-on-one and didn’t think much of it.","“So, Senior, how do I read the memories of your Companion Magic Device?” Tyrant Kindness rubbed his hands together and asked.","He was somewhat eager to see the memories related to the three-eyed young senior.","“Just stretch out your hand and place it upon it,” the three-eyed young senior said, handing over his ‘eyeball Companion Magic Device’.","“Then, Senior, start counting,” Tyrant Kindness approached the Companion Magic Device, hand ready.","“Begin!” The eyeball butler coughed up blood and pressed the timer.","Tyrant Kindness extended his hand and placed it on the eyeball Companion Magic Device.","In the next moment, his consciousness was drawn in, pulled into a vast and boundless space—this immense cosmic space was the memory of the Companion Magic Device!","Tyrant Kindness’s consciousness was drawn, his body seemingly going asleep, leaving behind only some inherent reactions.","Some instincts would not stop because one was sleeping, such as a normal person’s breathing.","For instance, the ‘Hand Slip’ that was about to become a familial trait passed down through the generations and etched into the genes of the Tyrannical Song family.","The palm of Tyrant Kindness’s hand that was touching the Companion Magic Device quietly slipped.","A flash of bright light glimmered quietly..."]},{"number":3009,"title":"Chapter 3009 - 3007 “How the Ruler of the Netherworld Was Made","paragraphs":["Chapter 3009: Chapter 3007 “How the Ruler of the Netherworld Was Made","Innate instincts are something that cannot be forbidden, just like how ordinary people need to breathe.","Even in an unconscious state, one cannot stop the instinct of Tyrant Kindness.","As one of Song Shuhang’s Three Corpses Avatars, Tyrant Kindness, aside from the “Main Cultivation Technique” and “Body Attributes,” shares several basic techniques, basic skills, and innate talents in synchronization with the main body.","It’s worth mentioning that most of Tyrant Song’s abilities are also foundation establishment techniques. Therefore, his skills can largely be inherited by the Three Corpses Avatar.","The “Saber-Nurturing Technique,” which has been etched into Tyrant Song’s soul and might even be passed down to posterity through “Inheritance Ability” in the distant future, naturally wasn’t an exception.","With a stealthy slide of Tyrant Kindness’s right hand, a trace of the “Saber-Nurturing Technique” was silently cast.","Tyrant Kindness’s right hand slid again, and another trace of the “Saber-Nurturing Technique” slipped out without gods or ghosts noticing.","The Three-Eyed Companion Magic Device, which was synchronizing with Tyrant Kindness and had opened its “Memory Bank” to him, remained outwardly motionless, as calm as usual.","But in truth, it had already begun to derive pleasure!","It felt that this avatar named ‘Tyrant Kindness,’ had an indescribable charm in its palm.","Just a gentle touch from Tyrant Kindness’s hand on it had stirred its usually untroubled heart. Following that, it felt as if it had engaged in long-missed exercise and grappled with a formidable enemy, leaving it indescribably comfortable throughout.","Moreover, when the other’s fingers touched it, it sensed the continuous transmission of ‘kindness,’ as if the other was trying to curry favor.","Theoretically, as the Companion Magic Device of the ruler of the Netherworld and a symbol of the foulest evil, it should be highly resistant to ‘kindness.’","However, the kindness emanating from ‘Tyrant Kindness’ was something the Magic Device couldn’t refuse.","Just as godly weapons cannot refuse maintenance.","Godly weapons don’t need maintenance and can still cut through iron like mud... but after being maintained, they shine even more wonderfully.","Between the Three-Eyed Companion Magic Tool and Tyrant Kindness, a progress bar labeled ‘Friendship Value’ began to form.","And this progress bar started to steadily rise.","This might just be the legendary rapport, where despite it being the first meeting, it all felt so familiar.","On the side.","Self-Corpse Overlord* watched Tyrant Kindness’s continuously sliding palm, the corner of his mouth twitching.","But since the three corpses share one body, no matter what, he couldn’t possibly expose Tyrant Kindness!","“Eh, I suddenly feel much better,” mused the three-eyed young senior, pinching his chin and looking up into the sky.","In the sky of the Throne of Wealth Distribution’s small world, the sun suddenly shone bright and cheerful.","This brightness was different from splendor.","A splendid sun, like the scorching midsummer sun, makes one overheat, but this bright sunshine, like the winter sun, felt warm.","[Could it be the influence of the Companion Magic Device?] the three-eyed young senior looked at his Companion Magic Device, then at Tyrant Kindness’s hand that moved like it had ADHD, sometimes sliding and the fleeting brilliance that followed.","A moment later, the three-eyed young senior fell into meditation.","But even in a meditative state, his mood couldn’t stop brightening, as if he was bullying some little dragon years ago.","After a while, he suddenly realized that this avatar of Tyrant Song’s Three Corpses looked unexpectedly pleasant to the eye.","The more he looked, the more pleasant he found it.","It has been a long time since he saw such a pleasing junior... maybe, should he give him a complete ‘Immortality Method Information’ as a meeting gift?","In the hands of the three-eyed young senior, there was more than one set of ‘complete Immortality Method Information.’","He had entered the Throne of Wealth Distribution’s small world since the ancient era and survived to the present. Aside from the joy that the Throne of Wealth Distribution could bring him, he spent most of his time fiddling with various things.","From the ancient era to the present, he had developed not just one ‘path to immortality’ theory, and while some had become useless because the geniuses of the main world had proved them, others had never been proved by anyone.","Giving away a set of ‘Immortality Method Information’ was still within his means.","Eyeball Butler: “!!!”","That’s it!","Coach, I want to learn this!","The method that inexplicably improved the old master’s mood!","This is far more reliable than dietary therapy~","...","...","Inside the memory space of the Companion Magic Device.","Because the memories stored in the starry sky were vastly numerous and arranged chaotically, Tyrant Kindness had no choice but to scan desperately.","His mental energy swept through the vast vacuum, and with each sweep, he forced his way through a tremendous portion of memories.","Under the operation of his Immortal-level brain’s computing ability, these ‘memories’ were continuously sorted, combined, and labeled.","“Half an hour, that might be a bit too tight.”","The main issue was the enormity of the memories stored within the Companion Magic Device...","Moreover, in this starry expanse of the memory storage world, many locations were blank memory areas. Tyrant Kindness’ mental energy swept over them only to come up empty-handed, thus wasting a lot of precious time.","“It won’t be easy for me to score full marks this way,” Tyrant Kindness frowned.","He had originally thought this was a good opportunity to prepare a path to immortality for Senior White, but now it seemed like quite the challenge.","“But the greater the challenge, the more motivated I am. I am an avatar of Thrice Tyrannical Song; even my main body isn’t afraid of death, much less can mere difficulties stop me,” Tyrant Kindness quickly adjusted his attitude.","He fully activated his mental energy, went berserk to expand his range of mental energy, and wildly scanned the vast sea of memories.","As if sensing Tyrant Kindness’ fighting spirit, the Companion Magic Device, whose favorability was continuously rising, also felt moved.","Moments later, touched by his efforts, the Companion Magic Device decided to unlock and share a segment of its most treasured memory for the agreeable ‘Tyrant Kindness’ to inspect.","This sealed memory had been with it since it became a Companion Magic Device and was quite classic.","——Moreover, this memory was not within the ‘assessment scope,’ a special memory area that Tyrant Kindness originally had no chance of accessing.","Now, it offered Tyrant Kindness an additional opportunity.","This is the great use of raising favorability!","After the Companion Magic Device made up its mind, it actively drew in Tyrant Kindness’ consciousness from the memory bank and brought him into the treasured memory area.","Just as Tyrant Kindness was going berserk and frantically scanning the memory area, something stirred within him.","Then, amidst his mental energy’s sweep, he discovered a ‘Golden Gate’ slowly opening.","Inside the gate was a vortex that quickly sucked in the consciousness of Tyrant Kindness.","Tyrant Kindness: “!!!”","Wait, does this memory space actually have traps too?","I only have half an hour to scan memories... If I get trapped inside, won’t I lose?","However, it seems that the content of this ceremony didn’t mention anything about not using traps?","Have I fallen into a contractual trap set by Senior Three-Eyed?","Senior Three-Eyed is truly worthy of being the ruler of the Netherworld, so cunning!","While Tyrant Kindness’ mind was racing with thoughts, within the vortex, an additional piece of memory unfolded before him.","This memory even came with a title.","“How the Ruler of the Netherworld was Forged”","Primordial characters, but since it was in the form of memories and the Companion Magic Device acted as an intermediary, Tyrant Kindness could understand it.","“It’s not a trap?” Tyrant Kindness said, puzzled."]},{"number":3010,"title":"Chapter 3010 - 3008: Senior Three-Eyed: I Did My Best!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3010: Chapter 3008: Senior Three-Eyed: I Did My Best!","He had thought it was a despicable trap set by the ruler of the Netherworld, designed to detain him for half an hour and thus thwart his efforts.","But unexpectedly, hidden behind this golden gate was top-secret knowledge and memory information.","This particular memory, “How the Ruler of the Netherworld Was Formed,” was dated even before the arrival of the three-eyed young senior!","It was a treasure and mental energy brought back from the Ancient Nether World by the former ‘Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes’ experiment. It started the detailed process of creating the ‘Ruler of the Netherworld’ and various complex theories.","After successfully fabricating the experimental subject, Eyes Repose, this precious memory was stored in the Companion Magic Device of Eyes Repose and was sealed for protection—it was unknown whether the three-eyed young senior had ever viewed this segment of memory information.","Although Tyrant Kindness did not understand why he had been involved in what could be called the ‘Memory Forbidden Land’, once his consciousness touched the knowledge within, he could no longer divert his eyes.","“How the Ruler of the Netherworld Was Formed” content gradually unfolded.","Profound and obscure.","This knowledge surpassed that of cultivators in the main world, containing plenty of information tinged with Heaven’s Will.","Fortunately, Tyrannical Song had just accessed Heaven’s Will through the dreamland skill, synchronized vision with ‘Daozi’, and had been in close contact with the core rules of ‘Heaven’s Will’... Therefore, although “How the Ruler of the Netherworld Was Formed” was obscure, a thorough read-through might still make some sense.","Tyrant Kindness absorbed the contents of the ‘Memory Forbidden Area’ with a thirst for knowledge.","“To construct a Ruler of the Netherworld, first, an eternal Attribute is needed, supplemented by Heavenly Dao Authority... I wonder if my main body’s ‘undying fat whale golden core’ could meet the condition of ‘eternal attribute’? If the Heavenly Dao Authority is only supplementary, could it work even if it’s not one’s own? Perhaps, Daozi could assist from the side, adding a push to the process?”","“Then, one needs material involving the ‘Ancient Nether Will Collective’ rule from the Ancient Nether... Perhaps Lady Kunna could help acquire this, hopefully, it’s not something too critical.”","“Next, it’s necessary to sort out the ancient rules of the Demon Sea World within the Demon Sea World and merge them together... Ah, don’t I just happen to have a Demon Sea World in my hands?”","“Moreover, this step might be skippable. Since ‘Ruler of the Netherworld’ itself was once a collective of Demon Sea World rules... So, I should be able to use ‘Fat Ball’ to replace this step, right? Whether it works or not, I’ll note this down first.”","When Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes experimented with “How the Ruler of the Netherworld Was Formed,” it was from nothing to something, creating the Ruler of the Netherworld in the former ‘Demon Sea World’.","But now, the Demon Sea World has evolved into the Netherworld, and there is an existing Demon Sea World.","So many of the procedures can be simplified or even skipped.","It’s like configuring a computer on modern-day Earth; with many technologies, components, and software available, one does not need to invent a massive machine like the people who created the first computer did.","This is the advantage of standing on the shoulders of giants.","“Someone planted trees, others enjoy the shade... Thus, knowledge makes me happy, learning brings me joy.” Tyrant Kindness immersed himself happily in the ocean of knowledge.","A book filled with great knowledge, being able to understand its words, being able to understand its content, that is happiness.","Time, silently passed.","The conscious world here is not a ‘Time Secret Realm Space’ opened up by Daozi; here, the passage of time synchronized with the outside world.","Immersion in the knowledge of “How the Ruler of the Netherworld Was Formed” made Tyrant Kindness, like a happy fish, swim freely without constraints.","When engrossed in studying, one always tends to lose track of time.","Half an hour, long to say, short to say.","Tyrant Kindness had just entered the state when suddenly, a piercing ringtone sounded in the ‘ear’ of his consciousness.","This ringtone was like the cellphone’s alarm that called Tyrannical Song to awaken every morning in the first half of last year.","Upon hearing this sound, Tyrant Kindness suddenly became alert.","His consciousness was abruptly pulled out from the ocean of knowledge... and pulled back into the Three Corpses Avatar.","“Time’s up!” The eyeball butler, still maintaining a posture nailed to the ground, pressed the button on the pocket watch.","On the opposite side, the three-eyed young senior added, “The viewing of the memory segment is over.”","Tyrant Kindness recovered, looking bewildered.","A moment later.","“I... Harmony Star number!” Tyrant Kindness pressed his hand against his temple, a look of doom on his face.","In the half-hour... except for about a minute at the start where he frantically swept through a portion of the ‘Companion Magic Device’s’ memory content, he was irretrievably lost in the ocean of knowledge the rest of the time.","Of the vast memories stored in the Companion Magic Device, he had only managed to sweep a tip of the iceberg.","“I’ve been tricked, I still fell for your cunning plan, Senior Three-Eyed!” Tyrant Kindness cried in pain, “When I thought it was that trap and went in, it turned out not to be a trap. But when I thought it wasn’t a trap, it turned out to be an outright trap... Is this the horror of the ruler of the Netherworld?”","Ah, I’m going to lose!","Tyrant Kindness had a distressed look on his face.","Beside him, Tyrant* had a look of frustration at their poor performance — had he known earlier, he should have taken over; Tyrant Kindness was too unreliable. Fat Ball was right after all, both Tyrant Ba Er and Tyrant Kindness seemed not too bright!","Opposite side.","The three-eyed young senior looked puzzled: “???”","What did I do?","When did I set up a trap?","I didn’t engage in any schemes or cunning this time, right?","Could it be there was some error in the script halfway through?","This is bad...","I meant to lose this time.","But seeing how cowardly this avatar of Tyrannical Song Three Corpses looks, he probably didn’t remember much of the ‘memory content’ at all.","Am I going to win this game?","But winning this round is utterly meaningless... Gambling chips from the Demon Emperor no longer attract him.","After all, the Demon Emperor had already been lying in the ‘Immortal Slaying Thunder Pool’ for so many days.","In the time the Demon Emperor had been lying there, he had already gotten the knowledge he wanted from him — the knowledge to structure the Demon Sea World, intelligence on the Demon Sea World.","As one of the oldest rulers of the Netherworld, he had abundant means of collecting knowledge, even capable of gathering information imperceptibly.","What use could he have after winning this now valueless Demon Emperor as gambling chips?","He couldn’t store it in the treasure trove, and he would even need to spend treasures to maintain it...","On the other hand, losing and then studying the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eye’ seems far more enticing.","[There’s no way out... I can only try to go easy.] The three-eyed young senior sighed inwardly.","“Let’s begin the random question draw segment, fifty questions. You only need to answer thirty correctly to win,” the three-eyed young senior said in a deep voice.","Having said that, he subtly began to manipulate the process.","Originally, questions were supposed to be randomly drawn from the entire ‘Vast Memory,’ but the three-eyed young senior tried his best to limit them to the memory area that ‘sent Tyrant Kindness consciousness into.’","By narrowing the scope of the exam, the three-eyed senior had done his best.","Constrained by the terms of the gambling ritual, he had reached his own limits!",".",".","I recommend a good friend of mine who has pledged himself to me, starting a new book at the beginning, “A Walk in the Mountains: The Reimagined Legend of the Gods”. This book is unrelated to the traditional tales and is a completely reimagined story of deification! As it nears completion, I always feel I need to promote it a bit more to not incur a loss~"]},{"number":3011,"title":"Chapter 3011 - 3009: I Can Surf the Internet!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3011: Chapter 3009: I Can Surf the Internet!","The gambling ritual at the Throne of Wealth Distribution possessed a binding nature.","This nature, typically, was to increase the challenge for the three-eyed young senior in the game, aiming to ensure the fairness of the gambling ritual... even if it was only superficial fairness!","But now, under the constraints of the gambling ritual, even if the three-eyed young senior wanted to lose the game through cheating, he wouldn’t have much leeway to operate.","Minimizing the scope of the questions as much as possible was the limit of what he could do within the rules.","If under such circumstances... Tyrant Song still lost, then he truly had no other options left.","Looking at Tyrant Kindness, who had the face of a scaredy-cat, the three-eyed young senior felt very tired in his heart.","Do you think it’s easy for me wanting to truly lose a match for once?","Now is not the time to be timid, Tyrant Song!","Just like when you gambled with me before, don’t back down. Fight back!","You must win!","Eyeball Butler: “...”","The butler had vaguely sensed that his master was on the verge of exploding today.","The master might be planning to throw the game.","The attraction of the Scholarly Sage’s Eye for the master was bigger than it had anticipated.","Indeed, the eyes of the Sage from Confucianism could be considered among the top ‘Demon Eyes’ in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Moreover, unlike those naturally occurring ‘Demon Eyes’, the Sage’s eyes were adjusted and evolved bit by bit by the Sage himself.","This meant that what was hidden within was a kind of ‘technique’, a perfect technique for enhancing the power of eyeballs.","For the master, this indeed was a huge temptation.","The three-eyed young senior also had quite a few techniques for enhancing the quality of the Demon Eye, but for someone like him who was obsessed with eyeballs, the more similar techniques, the better.","Moreover, his own research in this area had reached a bottleneck. He needed to study the twin eyes of the Scholarly Sage to see if the Sage’s techniques could spark his inspiration and help him break through the bottleneck by taking advantage of the explosive power of another’s wisdom.","...","...","“Fifty questions have already been generated. Next, I will start asking... Tyrant Kindness, please listen to the question!” The three-eyed young senior stared intently at Tyrant Kindness.","I have already reduced the difficulty of the questions to the lowest point. If you still fail, don’t bother coming back. I will tie you up and seal you in a drum with specially made Ninth Stage Cement and sink you into the foulest sea of the Netherworld Realm!","Being stared at by the sharp gaze of the three-eyed young senior, Tyrant Kindness felt even more nervous.","It’s over, this game is really over.","“Master, you are the ruler of the Netherworld. Please do not use the word ‘please’ as it diminishes your dignity.” Nearby, the Eyeball Butler spoke up timely, attempting to draw the master’s wrath away to lessen the pressure on Tyrant Kindness.","The three-eyed young senior flicked his finger, sending the eyeball butler flying into the sky...","“First question: What was the first thing the most ancient ruler of the Netherworld did at the moment of its birth, after opening its eyes? Answer within thirty seconds,” the three-eyed young senior said gravely.","This question was supposed to be an easy score.","“I know this one, Senior Three-Eyed! After you were born, the first thing you did was to step out from the origin of the Netherworld Realm, straighten out the rules of the entire world, and leave your mark of ownership upon the Netherworld!” Tyrant Kindness responded jubilantly.","He had just read about this.","Three-eyed young Senior: “...”","He looked at the standard answer to the question: The first thing the ruler of the Netherworld did after its birth was to take out its companion magic device from the origin of the Netherworld.","An easy score question, yet he got it wrong.","Tyrant Kindness had spent half an hour in the memory space of the companion magic device, how much had he actually retained? Don’t tell me this guy just slept for half an hour and then came out?","“The second question, what was the first ‘Netherworld Demon’ remodeled by the ruler of the Netherworld?” the three-eyed young senior asked in an unfeeling voice.","“Senior, was my first answer correct?” Tyrant Kindness asked doubtfully.","The three-eyed young senior responded, “You still have twenty-six seconds to answer.”","“It’s the Eye Demon! It’s the Big-eyed Demon formed by countless Eye Demons!” Tyrant Kindness hurriedly answered... He was also unsure of this answer.","Because the memory fragments in the Companion Magic Device were all chaotically arranged.","He had scanned many images about the ‘Senior Three-Eyed’ remodeling Netherworld creatures, but he really didn’t know which one was the first!","The three-eyed young senior said, “...”","He silently began preparing his specially made Ninth Stage Cement.","“The third question, the first palace established by the ruler of the Netherworld in the Netherworld Realm is located in which part of the Netherworld?” the voice of the three-eyed young senior now utterly devoid of emotion.","This time, Tyrant Kindness sensed something was off.","He probably got the answers to his first two questions wrong.","A perfect score was already out of the question...","Winning back the ‘way to immortality’ for Senior White seemed almost impossible now.","Even continuing like this, completing all thirty questions was doubtful.","This was not good...","Proceeding in this way, he couldn’t even complete his task of inviting the three-eyed senior to the main world to assist in studying the Sage’s eye. He needed to find a way to break out...","Wait! Why must I rely solely on my own power to answer the question?","In a critical moment, Tyrant Kindness remembered the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ a powerful tool.","Some things, he could ask the seniors for help.","The first person he sought help from was naturally Father Goudan, who had the closest connection to the Senior Three-Eyed.","Tyrant Kindness first sent the questions of the three-eyed young senior to Father Goudan through a private chat.","Then, using his server privileges, he directly entered the back end of the Cultivator Chat System.","After a moment...","All members who had downloaded the ‘Cultivator Chat System client,’ if they were in idle status, received a system prompt.","— This function, similar to the ‘Profound Sage Speech,’ filters out members who are in seclusion or critical moments.","[System Announcement: Enter the new year’s second event, a prize quiz segment. Question: In the Netherworld Realm, where did the first ruler of the Netherworld establish his palace? The fellow friend with the fastest correct answer will earn event points. After the event ends, you may redeem various rewards with the points in the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ including but not limited to profound sage teachings, information related to eternity, and valuable intelligence...]","I’m proud to have Internet access.","The internet can tightly link people from the ends of this world together.","“Netherworld Ancient Sea?Immortal Destruction Island.” Father Goudan sends his reply.","Simultaneously, intuitively guessing that Song Shuhang might be gambling with Eye Monsters, Father Goudan quietly sends Song Shuhang’s ‘Cultivator Chat System’ client QR code to a few of his old subordinates in the Netherworld Realm.","And through these old subordinates, forwards it to the subordinates of the ‘Eye Monsters,’ further spreading it within the Netherworld Realm, aiming to have a large number of ancient Netherworld demons join.","Having gotten the answer, Tyrant Kindness’s eyes lit up: “Senior Three-Eyed, is it the Netherworld Ancient Sea?Immortal Destruction Island, am I right?”","“Your answer is correct!” the voice of the three-eyed young senior, previously void of emotion, suddenly warmed up: “Next question, listen carefully!”","One question after another pulled from memory was voiced by the three-eyed young senior.","And Tyrant Kindness, as if he had an epiphany, correctly answered one question after another!"]},{"number":3012,"title":"Chapter 3012 - 3010: Suffering for the Sake of Keeping up Appearances","paragraphs":["Chapter 3012: Chapter 3010: Suffering for the Sake of Keeping up Appearances","“`","That melon brat finally got a clue!","The three-eyed young senior felt very satisfied...","Watching Tyrant Song’s Three Corpses Avatar answer one question after another correctly, the three-eyed young senior nodded silently and secretly put back his special cement with added ingredients, as well as a Sealing Barrel.","Meanwhile, his voice as he posed questions also became more emotional, no longer the emotionless, icy tone.","With Tyrant Kindness smoothly answering questions and the three-eyed young senior rattling them off, the scene was so harmonious and natural.","The eyeball butler flying in the sky showed a satisfied smile—even in the sky, it was still closely watching the progress of the gambling battle.","With Tyrant Kindness openly cheating and the three-eyed young senior discreetly going easy, the two hit it off perfectly.","Tacit understanding!","The two exchanged glances and instantly understood each other’s thoughts!","Then, time flew by...","And just like that, Tyrant Kindness smoothly lost the gambling battle.","The eyeball butler floating in the sky looked up at the weather that was starting to turn dark and closed its eyes, pretending to be a clueless hydrogen balloon.","The three-eyed young senior slowly took out a smoking pipe from his storage space, struck a match—puff—and took a deep drag, exhaling a thick cloud of white smoke that enveloped both Tyrant Kindness and himself.","It had been a very, very long time since he last smoked the tobacco from this pipe...","The Senior Three-Eyed had quit smoking for tens of thousands of years.","But now, if he didn’t take a puff, he felt he might not be able to repress his crumbling inner state.","Was my letting you win not obvious enough?","Was your cheating not powerful enough?","Were the questions still too difficult?","Why, even now... did you still lose?","Do you think you treated me right?","The three-eyed young senior looked down at Tyrant Kindness.","Opposite him, Tyrant Kindness was doing the robot dance... but slowed down by several hundred times.","He was like a robot whose battery was almost drained, his movements slow and stiff.","At this moment, Tyrant Kindness seemed to want to reach out his hand.","But just the ‘act of reaching out’ was so exhausting to watch; it was as if he had been afflicted with the ‘Thousand-Time Slowdown Technique’. He trembled for half a day, finally raising his hand slightly, as if in slow motion.","He opened his mouth, apparently wanting to speak... but after half a day, no sound came out.","The three-eyed young senior took another fierce drag of his tobacco, suppressing the urge to explode in his chest.","The Tyrant Kindness before him was weakened to the extreme, not just in movement and voice, but even in thought process!","This weakening effect even affected the immortal’s Three Corpses Avatar!","From Tyrant Kindness’s perspective, perhaps the entire world was accelerating!","And this condition emerged precisely when he and the three-eyed young senior were in tacit understanding, answering nearly twenty questions in one breath...","Just a few more minutes and the three-eyed young senior and Tyrant Kindness would’ve completed the gambling ritual without saying a word, with Tyrant Kindness winning the final battle for the Throne of Wealth Distribution, leading to a situation where everyone would be happy.","But at this critical moment, there was a problem with the flow of time around Tyrant Kindness.","At first, the three-eyed young senior didn’t notice.","So he asked a question... but after thirty seconds had passed, Tyrant Kindness had not answered.","And once more than thirty seconds passed without an answer, it was considered a forfeit.","“`","Under the constraints of the gambling ritual, the three-eyed young senior had to continue presenting the next question.","At the same time, the three-eyed young senior also realized that something was amiss.","But the rules of the gambling ritual were set in stone.","And so, the three-eyed young senior presented the question... waited thirty seconds... Tyrant Kindness was slowly opening his mouth, uttering an ‘aah’ sound, and then no response... Once the thirty seconds passed, the three-eyed young senior had no choice but to present the next question...","Unknowingly, fifty questions were presented this way.","And throughout it all, Tyrannical Song managed to answer only 19 questions.","Challenge failed.","The final battle in the wager between three-eyed young senior and Tyrannical Song ended with a grand victory for the three-eyed young senior.","Their showdown had finally yielded a victory instead of a series of defeats.","This was a cause for celebration.","But the three-eyed young senior couldn’t feel happy at all right now.","He turned his head again, looking toward the presence of Ba Ren, which was so faint that he had almost overlooked him several times.","Originally, if something were wrong with Tyrant Kindness, the Self-Corpse Overlord Ba Ren could have taken his place.","But it wasn’t just Tyrant Kindness, Ba Ren’s condition was also slow, as if it had been slowed by thousands of times.","Anxiety emerged in Ba Ren’s eyes, he even prepared a secret sound transmission to the three-eyed young senior... but his time was stuck at the stage of starting the Sound Transmission Skill...","“Three~~” After a long while, Tyrant Kindness’s mouth again stretched out a word’s sound slowly.","“Butler, come down,” the three-eyed young senior called out: “Bring out my sealing barrel, today, I will bury both of Tyrannical Song’s Three Corpses Avatars in it, fill it with cement, and sink them into the Ocean of Nine Remoteness.”","The eyeball butler floated down from the air: “Congratulations to the master on the final victory over Tyrannical Song!”","“Congratulations my ass,” the three-eyed young senior exhaled a puff of white smoke.","The eyeball butler briskly pulled out his spear and asked, “Master, what’s going on with Tyrannical Song? Why has he suddenly been affected by the power of Time Rules?”","“No need to say, it must be that his main body stirred up something in the ‘Heavenly Dao Time Secret Realm,’ perhaps another explosion on his part or something similar that affected his Three Corpses Avatars,” the three-eyed young senior said.","Now Tyrannical Song was, after all, an existence of the Immortal Realm, aside from the ‘Time-Distorted Secret Realm’ set up by the Heavenly Dao, ordinary ‘Time Rules’ usually can only affect his fleshly body but can’t restrain his thought processes.","Moreover, generally only when something goes wrong with the main body do the Three Corpses Avatars get affected.","“To think that he’s been let down by his main body, such an event is truly unexpected,” sighed the eyeball butler.","At the same time, he looked down at ‘Demon Emperor Og’ on the ground with a look of disdain: “Then master, how should we deal with this gambling chip, Demon Emperor?”","It was a spoils of war won from Tyrannical Song, after all.","“Keep it to wager against the next inheritor of the ‘Throne of Wealth Distribution,’ and then find a way to offload him,” the three-eyed young senior suggested, waving his long pipe.","Demon Emperor Og: “...”","Am I, a grand Immortal and Demon Emperor, really that unremarkable?","“Right away, master,” the eyeball butler began to busily move about.","“Speaking of which,” the three-eyed young senior put away his pipe and said, “Butler, how can I maintain my dignity yet take the initiative to help Tyrannical Song study the Sage’s eyeballs?”","He was, after all, the First Netherworld Ruler, and face mattered.","Since he had won, it wouldn’t be proper to proactively offer help to Tyrannical Song.","So, how could he maintain his dignity and yet smoothly participate in the project of studying the Sage’s eyes?","“Master, it’s no good to keep suffering while you are alive; besides, you don’t fit the arrogant persona,” the eyeball butler said.","Three-eyed young senior: “...”"]},{"number":3013,"title":"Chapter 3013 - 3011: The fat ball that was forcibly popped out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3013: Chapter 3011: The fat ball that was forcibly popped out","Seeing that the master’s expression had changed for the worse, the eyeball butler knew this round had really hit hard.","But... it had been about enough, to keep pressing on, and the master might just set it to roast over a fire... If it burned too violently, it would be very troublesome to replenish the water later.","Thinking this, the eyeball butler’s style shifted as he said, “Master, actually, I have a suggestion.”","“Speak,” the three-eyed young senior’s voice came through cold and hard, icy with a hint of frost.","The eyeball butler leaned in close to the master’s ear, after isolating Tyrant Kindness and Tyrant Wood, and whispered, “Master, take a closer look at your Companion Magic Device, a very close look.”","The three-eyed young senior looked down... then saw his Companion Magic Device clinging like a sticky dog to Tyrant Kindness’s right hand, unwilling to let go.","If he wasn’t careful, Tyrant Kindness might just walk off with his Companion Magic Device when he left!","Tyrant Kindness, what have you done to my Companion Doggy?","The three-eyed young senior felt unhappy in his heart and prepared to pull his Companion Doggy back.","But suddenly, he had a thought.","Then the three-eyed young senior turned his head to look at the eyeball butler.","“Yes, master, that’s exactly what I mean,” the eyeball butler nodded, his understanding in tune with the master’s.","Since the Companion Magic Device was so attached to Tyrant Kindness, they could just let him go back to check in later without mentioning this Companion Magic Device.","Once Tyrant Song got home, they would remotely contact Tyrant Kindness to accuse him of taking their doggy away.","And while Tyrant Kindness was confused, they could cleverly suggest ‘I’m coming over to pick up the doggy myself’.","Once he visited, he could ‘accidentally’ get involved with Tyrant Song’s [Eye Demons Research Project of the Confucian Sage].","Then, it would be time to display his true skills and acting prowess.","With his Netherworld Ruler Level expertise in the foulest of acting, joining the [Eye Demons Research Project of the Confucian Sage] would be a breeze!","“Dealt, let’s do that,” the three-eyed young senior nodded.","Now, they just had to wait for Tyrant Kindness and the other two Three Corpses Avatars to recover before sending them away.","“So, master, do we still need the Sealing Barrel? Do we continue filling these two avatars of Tyrant Song with concrete?” the eyeball butler reminded him.","“Not filling them seems like losing face. But if we do, it’ll affect their return check-in time. Forget it, we’ll apply the barrel and concrete later, we’ll just go and fill Tyrant Song’s main body with it instead,” the three-eyed young senior waved it off.","“Right away, master,” the eyeball butler nodded.","If they were to fill Tyrant Song’s real body... he would need to carefully plan, to see if he could mix in some natural treasures with the concrete, so that when they filled Tyrant Song’s body, it could have the effect of a ‘medicinal bath’.","By then, he could even suggest that Tyrant Song, his disciples, the Three Corpses Avatar, and Dark Song all take turns being filled with concrete.","This way, the master would be satisfied, and Tyrant Song and the others would gain benefits, killing several birds with one stone.","I really am as clever as always, the eyeball butler was extremely pleased with himself.","In the vacuum of the Throne of Wealth Distribution, the sunlight was soft.","The three-eyed young senior lay in a rocking chair, waiting silently.","After quite a while.","Tyrant Kindness finally regained his sense of time.","As soon as he recovered, out of habit, he confidently declared, “Senior~, the answer to the twenty-first question is eighty-one treasure spots, absolutely no mistake, Father Goudan has dug them all up. Wait, why didn’t I manage to hold back the last part of that sentence... Damn.”","Tyrant Kindness desperately covered his mouth with his hand.","The three-eyed young senior: “...”","Although he had long known that the treasures he had quietly left in the Netherworld Realm would end up benefiting that Coffin-Pulling Death Dragon, the suffocating feeling when he personally confirmed that all of his eighty-one treasure spots had been dug up was indescribable with words.","That was the collection of a lifetime!","Moreover, only the finest treasures could catch his eye; he disdained to collect anything of lesser quality for his treasure trove.","After he became the ruler of the Netherworld, he never imagined that one day, the Will of the Heavens corresponding to him would vanish.","He was too young at the time and thought he would serve as the ruler of the Netherworld for life, until the end of the world.","So, he began to indulge his hobbies, spending a lifetime smoothing and straightening the rules of the Netherworld Realm, fostering powerful Eye Demons, and collecting treasures to place throughout the realm.","To his surprise, the Heavens collapsed just like that... After the collapse, when he woke up, he found himself no longer in the Netherworld and unable to return.","That pesky dragon later on so capriciously researched all sorts of projects, burning through money as if it cost nothing... it turned out it was burning through his money!","One day, I will kill that dragon and scatter its ashes!","The three-eyed young senior thought bitterly in his heart.","That time is not far off.","Now, after recently gathering the power of the white horse, White t w o, and the fat ball, he could already briefly wander the main world.","Once the world he was tinkering with was fully perfected, he would be able to hop around freely in the main world and even visit his old home in the Netherworld with his real body.","Then, watch him hammer that Death Dragon to his heart’s content!","“The gambling ritual has now ended, Fellow Daoist Tyrant Kindness,” said the eyeball butler.","Tyrant Kindness: “!!!”","“Sadly, you have lost. Next, please help my master find a suitable ‘Successor’ to inherit the Throne of Wealth Distribution’s mark... Although the time I’ve spent with Fellow Daoist was short, it was very pleasant. If fate permits, we’ll meet again,” said the eyeball butler, leaving a heartfelt message.","Tyrannical Song was leveling up too quickly, not giving him enough time to find a ‘Housekeeper Successor.’","Now, all there was left to do was to silently wish Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song well.","Having said that, the eyeball butler lightly waved his hand, opening the small cottage of the Throne of Wealth and ejected Tyrant Kindness and Tyrant l out.","Still bewildered, Tyrant Kindness hadn’t noticed that the three-eyed senior’s Companion Magic Device was still silently sticking to his palm and hadn’t come off.","“Lost?” Outside the Throne of Wealth Distribution, Tyrant Kindness still hadn’t come to his senses.","“Lost... It’s probably because there was a problem with the main body earlier, leading to an error in our time status. Now that it’s restored, it must be that the main body has finished adjusting,” sighed the self-corpse. “Anyway, let’s go back first and report this to the main body, to see if there are other plans on the main body’s side that can be used to invite the three-eyed young senior over.”","“For instance, we might immediately transfer the Throne of Wealth Distribution’s mark to the members of the group, and then ask the group members to gamble with the three-eyed young senior once more, maintaining the same wager.” Tyrant Kindness cleverly suggested.","“That plan might work... let’s see if we can transfer the mark to Senior White’s clone. Theoretically speaking, Senior White’s clone should still be able to gamble once as well, right?” said the self-corpse, nodding in agreement.","The two Three Corpses Avatars opened a space gate and escaped first back to the Netherworld Realm, preparing to travel to the time-distorted secret realm through the nodes of the Netherworld Realm.","In the Netherworld Realm.","The fat ball, which was previously in a state of self-seclusion, sensed something and opened itself up from its closed state.","It looked up... and then saw Tyrant Kindness, whom it found most distasteful.","“Strange, why would I pop out of my seclusion just from sensing its arrival?” the fat ball wondered in confusion."]},{"number":3014,"title":"Chapter 3014 - 3012: I’m Not Listening, I’m Not Listening","paragraphs":["Chapter 3014: Chapter 3012: I’m Not Listening, I’m Not Listening","Could it finally be about to make a move on me?","So, is that why my sense of crisis is quietly alerting me and causing me to become vigilant?","The fat ball stared at the approaching Tyrant Kindness.","Once upon a time, this little bug that it could crush hundreds of times at will had now grown into a significant existence that controlled its fate.","If there were such a thing as a regret medicine, if time could flow backward... it would definitely keep away from this little bug, not entangling with it at all. Or perhaps, it should have focused on crushing this annoying bug from the start, crushing it until it could not resurrect.","Either kill it or stay completely away.","Unfortunately, there is no such thing as regret medicine in this world. Unless one has reached a state transcended from the Heaven’s Will, or at least half a step transcended.","Tyrant Kindness also noticed the fat ball that had awakened.","“Huh? The self-isolating fat ball has awakened?” Tyrant Kindness was slightly startled.","So... should I go up and chat with it?","He indeed had some matters he wanted to ask the fat ball, such as the news about the immortals of the eighth Black Dragon World obtained from Lady Kunna, and possibly the origin of the fat ball, and so on.","Perhaps talking to the fat ball might reveal more valuable information.","Such extremely top-secret information, whether usable or not, should be collected first; who knows, it might come in handy in the future. Information is also a very rich wealth.","“Fat ball, you’re awake,” Tyrant Kindness came to the edge of the seal and said, “I just wanted to talk to you...”","“I’m not listening, I’m not listening!” the fat ball answered with a cold metallic voice.","Tyrant *: “...”","Tyrant Kindness: “Come on, just listen to me, I want to...”","“I’m not listening, I’m not listening.” The fat ball interrupted again.","“It’s about you,” Tyrant Kindness said loudly.","“I don’t want to hear your explanation, not listening, not listening.” Having said that, the fat ball once again activated its self-isolation mode.","Tyrant Kindness: “...”","Are you some romantic drama heroine from which era?","After re-entering the ‘self-isolation mode,’ the fat ball continued to work hard on deciphering the Heavenly Dao Seal.","Sealing techniques were something the fat ball was very good at.","In theory, its sealing techniques could keep Senior White Two sealed for thousands of years.","Once it broke the Heavenly Dao Seal, it could escape into its hidden research room using the ruler of the Netherworld authority... and when the time came, even if it had to discard most of its body, just preserving a part of its liquid metal form would suffice.","As a ball of liquid metal, this was its unique way of survival.","As long as it could survive, even if just barely clinging to life, the fat ball would not mind.","Its desire for ‘life’ was stronger than anyone else’s.","Right when the fat ball was about to delve deeper into studying the Heavenly Dao Seal... suddenly, it was forcefully ejected from the ‘self-isolation mode’ state again.","Fat ball: “???”","Curse Netherly White a thousand times, what’s going on?","Why was it ejected again?","When the fat ball opened its eyes, it saw Tyrant Kindness’s face again—the face of the ball disgustful—this was Tyrannical Song’s Kindness clone, which naturally carried the light of virtue, having twice the disgust factor of the main body.","However, this time, the fat ball could sense that what kept ejecting it from the ‘self-isolation mode’ was not Tyrannical Song’s Kindness clone, but... something in the hands of the clone!","“What is that?” A eye formed on the fat ball’s surface, fixed on Tyrant Kindness’s palm, with obvious emotional fluctuations in its voice.","“What?” Tyrant Kindness also looked puzzled, following the fat ball’s gaze to his own palm.","Then, he saw a round little thing attached to his palm.","As he looked at the little thing, it turned around, revealing a cute eyeball, and blinked at Tyrant Kindness.","His eyes were super cute.","“My goodness!!” Tyrant Kindness let out a long cry.","The Tyrant* beside him rubbed his temples... This time, he truly felt that the embodiments of Tyrant Kindness and Tyrant Evil from his main body seemed somewhat unintelligent.","Even though they were all Three Corpse Avatars, why did this guy seem a bit silly and adorable?","“Why did you, mighty magical treasure, come out with me!” Tyrant Kindness asked, raising his palm.","Moreover, this Three-Eyed Young Senior’s Companion Magic Device was incredibly mighty. It was in his palm, yet he had not noticed anything unusual!","The Three-Eyed Companion Magic Tool continued to blink at Tyrant Kindness, acting cute but didn’t respond verbally.","“Big shot, speak up. If you only blink, I won’t understand what you mean. I’m not the main body, I don’t have the innate skill to decipher non-human languages,” Tyrant Kindness sighed.","He was certain that the Three-Eyed Young Senior’s Companion Magic Device definitely had a consciousness, and definitely a sentient treasure.","This was a magical treasure that had survived from the era of the Second Wielder of the Will until now. Even friction could have produced a sentient treasure by now.","A clear smile emerged in the eyes of the Companion Magic Device ‘Big Shot’.","Then, it uttered a few syllables—sure enough, there was a sentient treasure.","But after hearing these syllables, Tyrant Kindness completely despaired.","It was in an ancient language, but it was some local dialect from an ancient era.","In this era, who could understand that!","The sentient treasure big shot continued to blink its eyes, full of smiling intent.","“Sigh.” Tyrant Kindness sighed, “I’ll contact Senior Three-Eyed later and then send you back.”","After speaking, he looked up again at the Fat Ball senior sealed within.","At this moment, the eyes that Fat Ball senior had formed were tightly staring at the Companion Magic Device ‘Big Shot’ in Song Shuhang’s hand.","When Tyrant Kindness turned to the left, the eyes of Fat Ball followed to the left. When Tyrant Kindness turned to the right, the eyes of Fat Ball also followed to the right.","“Tyrannical Song, what is this in your hand?” Fat Ball senior asked again.","Tyrant Kindness thought for a moment, then suddenly covered his ears: “I’m not listening, I’m not listening~”","The Tyrant* beside him: “...”","MDZZZ!","So embarrassing!","Being one of the Three Corpses, he felt so ashamed.","Therefore, Tyrant* silently activated his power, running his techniques to their limit, quietly erased his presence, and became invisible, disappearing from everyone’s sight.","Only at this moment did Tyrant* truly appreciate the marvels of the “Forgotten Divine Technique.”","“Let’s have a good chat, Tyrannical Song.” Fat Ball senior’s heart was weary.","“Not listening, not listening,” Tyrant Kindness shook his head hard.","[Love to listen or not, get lost!] Fat Ball senior roared internally.","But in reality, it still had to maintain a smiley fa?ade, “Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, you have questions for me, and I have questions for you, we really can have a good talk.”","Tyrant Kindness’s mouth turned upward: “You ask me one question, and after I answer, it’ll be my turn to ask you one question, and so it goes.”","“Deal,” said Fat Ball with a weary heart.","“First off, I’ll answer you, this is the first ruler of the Netherworld, the Three-Eyed Young Senior’s Companion Magical Treasure,” Tyrant Kindness answered, holding up the Companion Magical Device ‘Big Shot’.","Fat Ball frowned.","The first ruler of the Netherworld’s Companion Magical Treasure?","Then why does it feel like there’s a blood connection between it and this magical treasure?"]},{"number":3015,"title":"Chapter 3015 - 3013: Simply Heartbreaking!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3015: Chapter 3013: Simply Heartbreaking!","Between the first ruler of the Netherworld and itself, there shouldn’t be too direct a connection, right?","And moreover...","Why is it that when other rulers of the Netherworld were born, they had something like a ‘Companion Magic Device,’ but it didn’t!","When it was born, aside from this ball of itself, it had nothing.","[Maybe even that Netherly White guy has a Companion Magic Device or some other treasure.]","[Sure enough, was my Companion Magic Device messed up by the Heavenly Dao?]","[Stupid Heavenly Dao liquefied metal ball.]","The resentment in fat ball’s heart toward the Heavenly Dao liquefied metal ball grew even more intense.","If this goes on, its grudge against the liquefied metal ball will sooner or later surpass that towards Song Shuhang, Netherly White, and the Sage of Confucianism.","“I feel a very intimate connection with this magical treasure... Tyrannical Song, do you know something?” the fat ball hurriedly continued to ask.","“Your turn for questions is over, now it’s my turn to ask you,” Tyrant Kindness said as he waved his hand.","The fat ball sighed inwardly, its grudge value against Tyrannical Song +1.","“Go ahead and ask,” said the fat ball.","Tyrant Kindness asked, “Fat ball, do you have any recollection of the Black Dragon World?”","“No, now it’s your turn to answer me,” the fat ball said urgently.","Tyrant Kindness said, “If your answer is ‘no’, then there might not be any connection between you and Senior Companion Magic Device.”","Fat ball: “???”","“Let me explain properly,” Tyrant Kindness said as he sat cross-legged beside the seal—he was ultimately a kindhearted manifestation, always willing to resolve others’ doubts.","“The primary material for Senior Companion Magic Device came from the Heavenly Dao corresponding to the first ruler of the Netherworld, brought back from the ‘Ancient Nether primordial chaos will’ of the Black Dragon World. After researching the material brought from the Ancient Nether, the Heavenly Dao eventually concocted the ‘ruler of the Netherworld,’ perfected the setting, and incorporated it into the laws of the Heavenly Dao,” Tyrant Kindness explained slowly. “I was originally speculating whether you, fat ball, had any connection with the ‘Ancient Nether primordial chaos will material,’ but it turns out you have no memory of it whatsoever.”","Leaping up, the fat ball exclaimed, “Why would you think that? Why would I have any connection to the Ancient Nether primordial chaos will material? Do you really know something?”","If not for the Heavenly Dao Seal, it would have certainly unleashed a thousand-ton fall to suppress Tyrannical Song’s manifestation and extract everything it wanted to know—As for reading memories directly, it would never use that method again.","Within Tyrannical Song’s memories were pits everywhere, mines everywhere; one careless move could lead to reading forbidden content and suffer a retaliatory injury.","“Don’t rush, Senior Fat Ball... now it’s my turn,” Tyrant Kindness motioned with his hand, then pulled out a little notebook and asked, “Question: Fat ball, how should your body be cut so that it won’t fuse back together in a short time?”","Fat ball: “...”","Is this a question that a person should ask?","Why don’t you go and ask a pig how it should be slaughtered so that it tastes better?","Seeing that fat ball did not respond for a long time, Tyrant Kindness looked up at the big boss, “Should we end the Q&A session?”","“You can change the question,” said the fat ball.","Tyrant Kindness flipped through the notebook and asked another question: “Then, fat ball, how should your body be cut so that the connection between the cut part and your main body is severed?”","As a reliable manifestation, he needed to conduct some investigations in advance for the major project of ‘fusing with Dark Song.’","Fat ball: “...”","“Actually, the following questions are all somewhat similar,” Tyrant Kindness closed his little notebook and said to the fat ball, “Shall we continue?”","In fact, the plan to fuse with fat ball was an opportunity for the fat ball itself.","You see, there was a deep-seated hatred between Daozi of the Heavenly Dao and the fat ball.","The resentment accumulated by Confucianism for tens of thousands of years couldn’t be explained in a few words.","If it weren’t for the fat ball’s value in use... Daozi would have long since killed and scattered the fat ball’s ashes.","However, the ‘Dark Song modification project’ actually provided an opportunity for the fat ball to be preserved.","To modify Dark Song, there was no need to fuse with the entire ball, just a large part of it, just enough to perfect the ‘Netherworld Body’ Attributes.","With the liquid metal body attribute of the fat ball, as long as a part of it still existed, it wouldn’t perish but at most shrink in size.","This point was even clear in the fat ball’s own heart.","It began to contemplate.","At this time.","While Tyrant Kindness and the fat ball were in communication, Daoist Senior’s intent swept across them.","This was Daoist intent coming to check in.","Daozi had long noticed the fat ball attempting to break the seal and, to prevent the fat ball from truly breaking free, Daozi’s intent would sweep over periodically to... reinforce the seal and obstruct any chance the fat ball had of escaping.","This time, Daozi’s intent had just happened to see Tyrannical Song and the fat ball confronting each other.","By accessing the ‘recording’ feature of the seal, Daozi quickly came to understand the cause and effect of the situation.","After pondering for a moment, Daozi made a decision in his heart.","—In the plan to transform Dark Song, if the fat ball was willing to cooperate actively, it would save a lot of trouble.","Thus, the voice of Daozi’s intent rang out to the fat ball, “If you’re willing to actively cooperate with us during the ‘Tyrannical Song Netherworld ruler plan’, when the plan ends, I can let go of the part of your body that remains!”","“Senior Brother Daozi, greetings.” Tyrant Kindness stood up from the ground.","“I was just passing by to check in and happened to hear your conversation with the ruler of the fat ball,” said Daozi’s intent. While speaking, two more layers of reinforcement were added to the fat ball’s seal.","Fat ball: “...”","Curse you, Netherly White, the seal is strengthened again.","“What’s your answer, ruler of the fat ball?” Daozi’s intent spoke again.","After all, once he collapsed from the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’, the fat ball ruler, as the corresponding ‘Netherworld Body,’ would also collapse.","So before that, if it could maximize its benefits, that would be best.","“You really know how to calculate, Confucian Daozi,” said the fat ball with a cold voice.","Actually asking itself to actively cooperate and sacrifice its body to complete Dark Song.","This proposal was simply a bane to its heart.","But...","“But you can survive, you can continue to exist,” Daozi’s intent said emotionlessly.","Fat ball: “...”","To survive.","Such humble and bitter three words.","“I want to survive,” said the fat ball.","No matter what state... it would choose to survive.","This had become its obsession.","“Deal,” voiced Daozi’s intent.","Once a covenant with Daozi was established, it was witnessed by the Heavens, leaving no chance for regret.","The contract was formed.","Daozi then glanced at the fat ball within the seal.","Seeing the fat ball’s frustrated appearance at this time, Daozi’s thoughts became unobstructed; the thoughts turned into eight lanes, with no more congestion!","‘Sometimes, living can be more painful than dying.’","By settling the grudge between the fat ball and Confucianism in this manner, surely the disciples who sacrificed themselves over tens of thousands of years would be satisfied, right?"]},{"number":3016,"title":"Chapter 3016 - 3014: Forced to Drop","paragraphs":["Chapter 3016: Chapter 3014: Forced to Drop","After conquering Confucianism’s formidable opponent, Daozi felt delighted.","To return enmity directly and repay kindness with virtue, how delightful it made one feel—indeed, happiness was built upon the suffering of one’s enemies.","The pain and frustration of fat ball greatly whet Daozi’s appetite.","“Tyrant Kindness, continue chatting with this ball, and I’ll see you later,” the will of Daozi waved his hand cheerfully and left the Netherworld Realm, ending his inspection.","The sealed fat ball took a deep sigh, seemingly drained of all strength, the complexity of its feelings indescribable even over several hours.","This was one of the most humiliating days of its life...","Tyrant Kindness sat down cross-legged by the seal again and asked, “Fat ball, shall we continue our chat?”","“Leave me alone,” fat ball said weakly.","“I understand you, feeling down and not wanting to talk is normal at this time,” Tyrant Kindness slightly smiled and said, “But I just want to chat with the current you.”","The less you want to talk, the more I want to talk to you.","Fat ball glanced at Tyrant Kindness, “...”","This was indeed good material for a ruler of the Netherworld.","“I have some information that might concern fat ball. You must know of the Black Dragon World,” Tyrant Kindness said. “In the Black Dragon World, there is an ‘Eighth Session Immortal,’ coincidentally, that immortal is also a ball... and seems to be made of liquid metal too.”","Fat ball: “!!!”","The listless state was forcibly dispelled by Tyrant Kindness’s topic!","Even the fact that Tyrant Kindness called it ‘fat ball’ was something it didn’t bother to mind.","“Where did you get this information?” fat ball asked.","Tyrant Kindness replied, “From the ruler of the Black Dragon World, Lady Kunna.”","Fat ball fell into meditation.","A moment later.","“So, I might be related to that ‘Eighth Session Heavenly Dao of the Black Dragon World’?” Fat ball said while looking at the ‘Three-eyed Ruler Companion Magical Treasure’ in Song Shuhang’s hand.","The raw material of this companion magic device came from the ‘Ancient Nether’ corresponding to the Second Wielder of the Will from the Black Dragon World.","And the Eighth Session Heavenly Dao of the Black Dragon World was similar to it.","It also felt an intimate resonance with this ‘companion magic device’.","All these connections together led to the conclusion above.","Is my blank memory because I am an aftereffect of immortal reincarnation?","“This is one of two speculations between my main body and Lady Kunna,” Tyrant Kindness spoke up.","Fat ball’s body gently bounced on the ground, displaying its inner turmoil, “And the other speculation?”","“The other speculation... is that it’s very likely that each ‘Eighth Session’ will produce a ball,” Tyrant Kindness answered.","“Impossible,” fat ball flatly denied.","Even the omnipotent Heavenly Dao couldn’t suddenly create a powerful being out of nowhere—there are rules and processes that it must follow in certain aspects.","“But two ‘Eighth Session Immortals’ seems too coincidental,” Tyrant Kindness pointed out.","Fat ball closed its eyes and speculated, “Two Eighth Sessions... Indeed, it seems coincidental. But it can be explained if someone intentionally guided it.”","At this moment, fat ball was standing from the perspective of a third party, speculating on the answer, without aligning itself with the ‘Heavenly Dao ball’ camp.","—— “If someone has been secretly controlling the foolish Heavenly Dao ball all the way to the eighth session, and then let the Heavenly Dao ball prove its Dao, it theoretically makes sense,”","It might not even be necessary to deliberately guide it, just nurture the foolish Heavenly Dao ball, and when its strength is sufficient, everything can happen naturally.","“But, in the era of fat ball and the Confucian Sage, no one could achieve this, right?” Tyrannical Kindness said.","In the myriad practitioners in the universe at that time, who had the ability to secretly arrange for the previous Heavenly Dao ball to appear during the eighth session of the Heavenly Dao and compete with the Confucian Sage for the Heavenly Dao seat?","By then, the Confucian Sage was already immensely powerful, truly the foremost person below the Heavenly Dao. Even the Heavenly Dao would find it difficult to directly influence an existence like the Sage.","“Heavenly Dao... the Heavenly Dao corresponding to Netherly White!” fat ball suddenly spoke out with certainty, without any thought.","If there is any matter in the world where the true culprit can’t be found, it must be Netherly White’s fault.","If the strength of Netherly White is not enough to take the blame—then it must definitely be the Heavenly Dao corresponding to Netherly White’s fault!","Song Shuhang: “...”","“When I was in the Netherworld Realm, I also researched some information about the Heavenly Dao of various generations, trying to find a way that, after the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, the Ruler of the Netherworld could still survive in the world, similar to Netherly White. During that period, I discovered that the Heavenly Dao of Netherly White, although brief in its tenure... was very special,” fat ball’s thought process had become obsessed.","Tyrannical Kindness shook his head.","Although dealing with Wielder of the Will White was very troublesome, the appearance of fat ball was likely unrelated to Wielder of the Will White—if it were the work of Wielder of the Will White, then fat ball should have appeared as ‘Young Sis White’.","Seeing Tyrannical Kindness shaking his head, fat ball also shook slowly in rhythm.","A moment later...","It cooled down a bit.","“Heavenly Dao.” fat ball gazed at the ‘Companion Magic Device’ in Tyrannical Kindness’s hand.","It felt that the two possibilities raised by Tyrannical Song’s manifestation, if combined—someone might have brought out the original form of the ‘Heavenly Dao ball’ from the Black Dragon World and nurtured it.","Perhaps the opponent did not intend to have the Heavenly Dao ball ultimately prove its Dao to eternity, maybe it was merely an experiment?","fat ball felt this guess was the most practical.","Moreover, it had a suspect.","Following fat ball’s gaze, Tyrannical Kindness looked down at the adorable Companion Magic Device.","The Second Wielder of the Will.","Like the First Wielder of the Will, it had erased all its marks.","It had also delved deep into the Black Dragon World to research Ancient Nether primordial chaos will.","If it’s said that the Heavenly Dao corresponding to fat ball was indeed brought about by someone, the Second Wielder of the Will indeed had a high level of suspicion.","“It would be great if we could enter a dream once... Or else, try a secret appraisal technique and see if we can identify anything?” Tyrannical Kindness wondered inwardly.","Entering the dreamland skill was the best option, basically without any side effects, but it was not possible to control at will. When to enter a dream and who the dream subject is, was uncontrollable.","And for the secret appraisal technique, if it needs to appraise information involving the mysteries of Eternity or even the Black Dragon World, it’s unknown what kind of price must be paid. Even his Immortal Realm main body might not be able to withstand it.","“When the Heavenly Dao ball corresponding to me was collapsing, did it leave any clues? You could ask the scholar system’s Daozi to search for traces,” fat ball suggested at this time.","“I’ll report back to Daoist Senior,” said a voice from the vacuum, where an invisible reliable three corpses spoke.","Meanwhile, Tyrannical Kindness also said, “By the way, if your guess is correct, fat ball... it feels like your imposingness has dropped a lot.”","fat ball: “???”","“Every Heavenly Dao of various generations is almost always scheming something. Only the Heavenly Dao corresponding to you was being schemed against. Additionally, perhaps your main body was an experimental subject,” Tyrannical Kindness said.","The Heavenly Dao of fat ball does not fit in with the other Heavenly Dao at all."]},{"number":3017,"title":"Chapter 3017 - 3015: How Can I Not Disgrace the Immortal’s Reputation?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3017: Chapter 3015: How Can I Not Disgrace the Immortal’s Reputation?","At last, Fat Ball had discovered that besides piercing people’s hearts, Tyrant Kindness had a fatally tempting flaw—his train of thought made alarmingly huge leaps!","In the midst of a conversation, his thoughts would suddenly jump into an unknown ravine. Even when discussing critically important matters, his mind remained hyperactive, never focusing on one thing.","Such a person would definitely be unable to concentrate properly on their studies, eventually becoming one of the academic failures.","Moreover, this type of person would definitely be unable to seal themselves up for cultivation properly.","Not being able to seal up for cultivation meant they couldn’t cultivate properly, ultimately becoming a bottom-tier member of the cultivators...","Bullshit!","This guy had already, through sheer stubbornness, advanced to an Immortal!","Fat Ball sighed in distress.","This isn’t cultivation.","“Ba Xiu, has Senior Daozi sent back any message?” Tyrant Kindness suddenly turned and shouted into the vacuum—after his thoughts made a full loop, he surprisingly jumped back to the main topic!","“Senior Daozi is checking the records during his spare time, it will take some time,” Ba Star responded.","“Oh, then let’s contact the three-eyed young senior, and tell him the ‘companion magical treasure master’ has come out with us,” Tyrant Kindness lifted his hand to hold the companion magical treasure in his palm. With a few flickers in his right palm, he casually cast two Saber Nurturing Techniques.","Ba Star had a complicated expression: “...”","However, his consciousness, through the main body’s Throne of Wealth’s mark, began contacting the three-eyed young senior—handling the communication himself felt more reliable. Leaving it to Tyrant Kindness could lead to God knows what antics.","[Beep—Beep—Beep—The user you are calling is currently asleep and cannot be reached. Please try again after he wakes up.]","The gentle voice of the eyeball butler came from the Throne of Wealth’s mark.","Ba Star was stunned.","Wasn’t he just fine when we came out? Why did he suddenly go to sleep?","Do rulers of the Netherworld all have such good sleep quality, able to sleep whenever they want?","That’s a bit enviable—after reaching the Immortal Realm, the sensation of sleepiness basically disappears, and the function of sleeping degrades.","“What happened?” Tyrant Kindness asked.","“The three-eyed young senior is sleeping... Speaking of which, do all rulers of the Netherworld require a lot of sleep?” Ba Star said.","Tyrant Kindness answered, “They probably do. Senior White t-w-o often sleeps a lot too, the deep kind that you can’t wake him from even if you shout, making one unable to resist wanting to go up and...”","Boom—","Before he could finish speaking, a bolt of Netherworld Evil Thunder struck from the vacuum, exploding upon Tyrant Kindness’s body.","This was the Netherworld Realm.","Speaking ill of the ruler of the Netherworld behind his back in the Netherworld Realm would have consequences.","[Well done!]Qiu Youyou, upon seeing this scene, felt rather pleased—additionally, do all rulers of the Netherworld really need sleep? Could it be because I don’t sleep often that I don’t fit in with the other rulers of the Netherworld?","“I couldn’t resist... wanting to go up... and cover him with a blanket,” Tyrant Kindness cleverly changed his words after being struck by the lightning.","In the vacuum, the second bolt of Netherworld Evil Thunder that was gathering quietly dissipated.","Ba Star massaged his temples, “So, what were you about to say originally?”","“Don’t frame me,” Tyrant Kindness’s eyes continuously glanced towards the sky, signaling covertly.","“Let’s go, it’s time to report back to the main body,” Ba Star sighed, and then added, “Besides, bringing out the companion magical treasure might be a good thing.”","“Why would you say that?” Tyrant Kindness waved to Qiu Youyou, and then opened the gate to a ‘time-distorted secret realm.’","“If the companion magical treasure is in our hands, we can try to make the three-eyed young senior come out to retrieve this magical treasure... If the three-eyed young senior agrees, then we can set up a plan, hoping that when the three-eyed young senior comes to retrieve the companion magical treasure, he can come in contact with the ‘Sage’s Eyeball Research Project.’ If the senior shows interest in researching the Sage’s eyeballs, then our plan will succeed,” Ba Star spoke out.","Tyrant Kindness heard the words and praised, “Truly befitting of a self-corpse, the strategy is as excellent as the main body itself, with a black belly button and a dirty heart.”","...","...","World of the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","A sinister smile appeared on the face of the three-eyed young senior.","The ruler of the Netherworld, even a smile that came from the heart would turn sinister and terrifying under the influence of the aura of the Netherworld Realm... unless one’s appearance was incredibly outstanding, surpassing the influence of the Netherworld ruler’s aura.","“What was that self-corpse of Tyrannical Song called again? It has potential,” the three-eyed young senior said.","It perfectly coincided with his plans!","Much more promising than the other three corpses ‘Tyrant Kindness’.","Just a moment ago, when whatever-his-name-called-again phoned, the three-eyed young senior had intentionally ignored the call... His plan was to wait until Tyrannical Song’s three corpses approached the location of the ‘Confucian Sage Research Project’ and then return the call, finding an excuse to get involved with the Sage’s Eye research experiment.","Unexpectedly, the one on the other end had the same idea.","“This self-corpse of Tyrannical Song is fated with me! Later on, I’ll send him a way to immortality as a gift,” the three-eyed young senior happily said.","The eyeball butler beside him showed a content smile—although Tyrannical Song’s Three Corpses avatar lost the competition, it still received a reward as good as a ‘perfect score’.","A way to immortality, as well as the opportunity for the master to participate in the research of the Sage’s Eye.","Sometimes, it’s really not necessary to fuss over temporary gains and losses in winning or losing.","“Master, the special cement and Sealing Barrel are all prepared,” the eyeball butler said.","The three-eyed young senior cheerfully said, “Good, prepare a few more barrels... We’ll go find Tyrannical Song later. Oh, this time we might run into Father Goudan. Prepare a disgusting gift for him, as a meeting present.”","“How disgusting?” asked the eyeball butler.","“As disgusting as possible, and preferably not too valuable. If it’s too expensive, it’s like killing a thousand enemies while self-harming eight hundred—it wouldn’t be beautiful,” the three-eyed young senior said.","“Alright, master, I’ll definitely handle this properly for you,” the eyeball butler replied—he had an idea, planning to get a saber that would explode with the power of holy light, and a Seventh or Eighth Stage rank would suffice.","This way, after fully disgusting the Striped Dragon Ruler with the gift, it was likely that the Striped Dragon Ruler would carelessly toss it to Tyrannical Song.","Then, Tyrannical Song could pass this gift to his disciple who cultivated holy light.","This is called waste utilization.","...","...","Meanwhile, in the main world.","Tyrannical Song’s steel manifestation was worried.","It was the new year, and he also planned to give a few little guys some New Year’s gifts.","Last year, the main body Tyrannical Song had prepared some stuff—storage bottles obtained from celestials, as well as high-quality cosmos bags, Branded Wooden Sabers, and other trinkets.","When Tyrannical Song began preparing these gifts, he was still in the Fifth and Sixth Stage Realm.","Back then, giving these gifts to the younger ones was perfectly appropriate for him.","But now... he had become an Immortal big shot.","Would it be somewhat disgraceful for an Immortal big shot to give storage bottles, such low-tier items, to the younger ones during the New Year?"]},{"number":3018,"title":"Chapter 3018 - 3016: Little Guoguo, Your Path Has Narrowed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3018: Chapter 3016: Little Guoguo, Your Path Has Narrowed","I’m having such a hard time, my main body is advancing too quickly, but my ability to amass wealth can’t keep up.","Sometimes, I finally obtain a batch of precious treasures from big shots like King Kun, but before I can even warm them up, they’re either spent in a Pay-To-Win Strike or used for upgrading my magical treasures... I can’t save anything.","My main body is such a spendthrift!","Although some treasures are left, like the Immortal parts and the like... I can’t give those to these little rascals.","Too powerful treasures, just their inherent Tribulation Transcender aura or Immortal Great Way aura, could harm these little guys.","Sigh~","“Senior Brother Song, is something the matter?” little Guoguo asked, puzzled.","Just now, Senior Brother Song Shuhang suddenly called all of us little guys together, seeming like he had something to tell us. But after he gathered us, Senior Brother Song started to space out, looking like he had something on his mind.","“Yes, I’ve prepared some New Year’s gifts for you guys.” The steel manifestation showed a gentle smile, took out several celestial race tiny bottles + Branded Wooden Saber, and handed them to the little ones.","Even little Li Yinzhu and the half-egg, half-human mechanical girl, who were playing with the little ones, got a set of New Year’s gifts.","——The disciples’ New Year’s gifts would have to wait a little longer, the main body had long made extensive preparations for the disciples’ gifts.","“Thank you, Senior Brother!” Loli Shi took the gifts happily and thanked him—she really liked these tiny bottles; these were magical treasures with an ‘inch-reducing purse’ function. Disciples from big sects like hers usually had to wait until they officially left the mountain to have a chance to get such storage-type treasures.","“You’re the best, Senior Brother.” Loli Zhu jumped happily and gave the steel manifestation a hug.","“These two gifts, I prepared for you half a year ago... Besides these, do you have any special New Year’s wishes?” the steel manifestation asked with a smile.","——This was the best solution he could think of!","As an Immortal-ranked steel manifestation, he had the power to promise these little ones a ‘New Year’s wish.’","Whether it’s soaring through the skies or diving deep into the oceans for shrimp, it’s not a problem.","As long as it’s not an absurd wish, it wouldn’t be too difficult for the steel manifestation to fulfill.","I, the steel manifestation, am indeed the most intelligent of them all—among all the clones, only I am special; I’ve studied abroad!","The other manifestations just stayed by the main body’s side after being created and didn’t continue their studies.","Only I spent a long time studying abroad with the Heavenly Emperor’s Da Da Zi last year. During that time, I was also in a ‘no contact’ state with the main body, an experience that other greenhouse manifestations can’t boast of!","“A New Year’s wish? We can also make a New Year’s wish?” little Guoguo’s eyes lit up.","Perhaps it was because boys liked robots, but at this moment, little Guoguo felt that this steel-looking Senior Brother Song was simply too cool, even cooler than Senior Brother Song’s main body!","“Ah Song, any wish?” Yinzhu vigorously rubbed her eyes to wake herself up.","The steel manifestation indulgently stroked Yinzhu’s head and said, “You can tell me whatever wish you have, but I’m not Senior White, so there are some limitations.”","Senior White’s clone, who was eating dessert after a meal, blinked in surprise—why do I get dragged into this?","“Then, can I go first, Senior Brother Song?” little Guoguo cheerfully raised his hand; it seemed he had a wish ready.","The steel manifestation smiled and said, “Sure, little Guoguo, what’s your New Year’s wish? But remember, I will only fulfill one New Year’s wish for each of you, so think carefully and don’t waste the opportunity.”","Little Guoguo seemed to have grown up quite a bit over the past six months.","“I’ve always had a wish—when I become strong and a Seventh Stage Venerable, I want to spank Abbot Profound Principle in return, and make him unable to leave his bed for three days!” Little Guoguo said happily.","Steel manifestation: “...”","Silly child, I asked you to make a New Year’s wish, not to reveal your wildest ambitions!","“So, Senior Brother Song, my wish is, can I have the fighting power of a Seventh Stage Venerable for a short time?” Little Guoguo continued.","And then go and beat up Great Master Profound Principle? Little Guoguo’s New Year’s wish was actually well thought out!","“Silly Guoguo, you’re treading a narrow path,” sighed the steel manifestation—bragging so loudly, are you not afraid Great Master Profound Principle will hear you?","However, Little Guoguo hadn’t finished stating his wish, he continued to describe it: “Then, if I had the realm of a Seventh Stage Venerable, even for a short while, I could break the oath Abbot once made. He would be able to give up silent meditation and speak normally.”","Steel manifestation: “???”","This train of thought is truly worthy of a prospective member of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group.’","Furthermore, was Abbot Profound Principle’s diligent pursuit of silent meditation really related to an oath he made?","Curious, it turned its head to look at Senior White’s clone.","After a moment of recollection, Senior White’s clone said, “That was a long time ago... Great Master Profound Principle once accepted a disciple with good innate skill. Later, maybe because Great Master Profound Principle gave the wrong guidance in cultivation, or maybe the disciple was impatient and overeager, eventually there was an issue with the disciple’s cultivation. Since then, Great Master Profound Principle suddenly began to practice silent meditation.”","“And breaking the silent meditation is to mentor a disciple who reaches the Seventh Stage Venerables’ realm?” asked the steel manifestation in confusion.","Senior White’s clone shook his head: “I haven’t heard of that condition.”","“I’ve heard my senior brother mention, as long as one mentors a disciple who is stronger than oneself, Abbot could then speak normally,” Little Guoguo said earnestly. “So, if I have the power of a Seventh Stage for a short while, Abbot could speak human language, and we wouldn’t have to guess hard what he’s trying to say. Also, by the way, I could also... ahhh~ ah~”","Two powerful Vajra Fists pressed against Little Guoguo’s temples, lifting him by the force of the fists, as they vigorously gyrated.","Little Guoguo let out a series of screams.","“This scream, it somewhat resembles the ability of my main body,” the steel manifestation nodded in appraisal.","Senior White’s clone: “...”","Abbot Profound Principle’s iron fists bored in for a full half minute before putting Little Guoguo down, and then he rewarded him with a doting chop to the head.","Little Guoguo touched his head and looked dissatisfiedly at Abbot Profound Principle.","“The realm of power is something more reliable when self-cultivated... Although I have a way to let you experience the concept of the ‘Seventh Stage Venerable’ for a short period, you’d be wasted afterward,” the steel manifestation said with a smile, pressing down the lump on Little Guoguo’s head.","With the realm of an Immortal, it’s possible to directly inject energy into someone through certain sacrificial rituals, allowing them to experience the realm for a while. But once it is over, the recipient is basically ruined.","Little Guoguo’s face turned bitter upon hearing this.","“However, since your wish has been spoken, I should at least make a gesture,” said the steel manifestation, stretching out its palm, where formation runes began to flicker.","A moment later, a ball of lightning took shape in its palm, emerging..."]},{"number":3019,"title":"Chapter 3019 - 3017: Eh, who are you guys, why are you appearing in my mind?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3019: Chapter 3017: Eh, who are you guys, why are you appearing in my mind?","This move is none other than Tyrannical Song’s strongest Lightning-based technique, the ‘Giant Heavenly Tribulation Lightning Palm,’ which even immortals from myriad practitioners in the universe dare not underestimate.","Based on the ‘Simplified Lightning Palm’ originally created by Senior White, Tyrannical Song incorporated his own understanding and enlightenment of ‘heavenly tribulation,’ ultimately concocting a Lightning Palm with the killing power of a heavenly tribulation.","Though the steel manifestation holds a Lightning Palm only the size of an apple in its hand, this is because the Lightning Palm hasn’t been released—once it is unleashed, it will be a Suppression-level Lightning Palm, with power at the Seventh Stage Realm.","The steel manifestation continues to maintain the ‘Suppression-level Lightning Palm’ in one hand while taking out some wood from the main world with the other.","Most of these were left over from the original ‘drowsy-eyed wooden body’ and are excellent materials for refining and manufacturing talismans.","The steel manifestation took out a strip of wood and whittled it into more than ten small wooden blocks the size of mahjong tiles.","Then, using the crude ‘Basic Sealing Skill,’ he forcefully sealed the Lightning Palm into the small wooden pieces by leveraging the pressure of his main body’s Immortal-level realm!","In the hands of an immortal, even the Basic Sealing Skill could perform wonders—the immortals are just that miraculous.","After properly sealing them, the steel manifestation nodded in satisfaction.","He then repeated the operation, sealing twelve ‘Suppression-level Lightning Palm’ mahjong-shaped formation tiles in one breath.","“Take these, these formation tiles can be released to allow you to withstand a head-on clash with a Seventh Stage Realm cultivator... However, the range of this technique is quite large, so be careful about the allies around you when releasing it. I’ve added a kind of smart technology that distinguishes enemies, but it relies on you to lock onto the targets.” The steel manifestation, who had studied abroad, mastered some very advanced techniques.","He had also shared these little techniques with his main body... but he didn’t know if his main body had mastered them.","“So many?” Little Guoguo carefully stored ten of the tiles into a ‘small bottle,’ and gave the remaining two to his friends, Loli Shi and Loli Zhu.","The older brother had taught him that good things should be shared with pretty little companions.","He considered giving one each to Xiao Lingxiao and little Li Yinzhu as well, but given that they were ‘daughters’ of Senior Brother Song, little Guoguo thought about it and felt it was unnecessary.","The little fellow has potential.","“Abbott~ from today onwards, I won’t let you slap my butt that easily anymore... I have grown up!” Little Guoguo shook the small bottle in his hand.","—A man grows up when he gains strength. Now that he has Senior Brother Song’s Lightning Talisman, does it mean he has acquired power? Could he also be considered as having grown up?","No sooner had he spoken than Great Master Profound Principle’s iron fist once again pressed against the little monk’s head and began to spin rapidly—this time, the spinning was so fast that the steel manifestation saw wisps of white smoke rising from the little monk’s head.","This time, the little monk didn’t even have a chance to scream...","The steel manifestation turned away, not looking at the small monk, and looked toward Shi and Zhu: “Then, do you two have any New Year’s wishes?”","Loli Shi, like a little adult, said seriously, “Senior Brother Song, I want to improve my mind and willpower.”","“Mind and willpower? Is your mind and willpower not stable?” wondered the steel manifestation, who thought that because of Shi’s composed nature, her mind and willpower were the most stable among the three little ones.","Loli Shi shook her head and said, “My mind and willpower currently match my realm... but I hope to possess an even stronger mind and willpower. I came into contact with Senior Brother Song very early. In addition to advancing quickly, brother also has a mind and willpower as stable as a rock, which always keeps up with his realm’s advancement. Therefore, I want to know the method by which Senior Brother Song keeps his mind and willpower so stable.”","Advancing quickly is indeed attractive, but without a matching mind and willpower, quick advancement becomes a hidden danger.","Loli Shi, seeming much like a little adult, thought things through very clearly.","Fairy Lychee, not far away, showed a satisfied smile. Loli Shi’s request for a New Year’s gift was very appropriate!","The steel manifestation slightly smiled: “If you asked about other cultivation matters... perhaps I really wouldn’t be able to give you a definitive answer. But if you’re asking about matters of the mind and willpower, you’ve indeed come to the right person.”","In addition to an exceptionally resilient constitution that allows him to withstand monsters, the main body, Tyrannical Song, also possesses an indomitably firm intent as well as a mind and willpower that even Inner Demons would steer clear of—these are also his main strengths!","Moreover, he does have a method suitable for low-grade cultivators to improve their ‘mind and willpower.’","The path of cultivation, the first step in tempering mind and willpower, is to endure solitude.","Within frustrating solitude, one forges the most basic, most robust mind and willpower—this is also why small cultivators like little Guoguo, despite their low realms, are assigned to sit in meditation for long stretches of time, even to the point of developing hemorrhoids.","“Senior Brother, Senior Brother Song, I want to make the same choice as Shi!” Loli Zhu called out, hanging from the neck of the steel manifestation, loudly.","Loli Zhu was the youngest and not as sensible, not thinking as much. But she knew, as long as it was Shi’s choice, following along would be good for her.","Because Shi was smarter than her.","“Alright, since you’ve made the same choice, I will give your New Year’s gift to you both,” the steel manifestation said with the kind smile that once belonged to Tyrannical Song.","The next moment, he reached out to touch his glabella, sending a report to his main body: requesting the use of the third eye.","In the blink of an eye.","The third eye condensed directly in the steel manifestation’s glabella.","“Prepare yourselves, the experience to come... will be unimaginably boring,” the steel manifestation said solemnly.","Shi nodded her head.","Seeing Shi nod, Zhu also nodded.","“Then... welcome to the beginning of three hundred years as an onion,” the steel manifestation spoke softly.","An “illusory reality” made up entirely of 0s and 1s unfolded around the steel manifestation, enveloping Shi and Zhu.","At the same time, from within the third eye, a light carrying a segment of Tyrannical Song’s memories shone upon Shi and Zhu.","It was the very scene of Tyrannical Song’s first experience tempering his mind and willpower—his experience entering the dreamland as Lady Onion!","The steel manifestation used the “illusory reality” and the “third eye’s forced information transmission” feature to emulate Tyrannical Song’s past experience entering the dreamland as Lady Onion.","Although Shi and Zhu were pulled into this ‘onion life experience’ project together, they were separately pulled into two different illusory worlds.","How could they have the opportunity to stay together if they are to truly experience loneliness?","Loneliness is to be savored alone, carefully.","In the world of illusionary dreams.","Shi and Zhu felt their bodies being held by a warm, large hand.","That hand held them as it climbed step by step to the mountain summit.","“Where is this place?” Shi asked, puzzled.","“Shi, Shi, where are you?” Zhu cried out in alarm from the neighboring illusory world.","“Success,” the steel manifestation thought to himself.","He had successfully recreated and replicated the detailed process of his main body’s original experience entering the dreamland as Lady Onion!","Now, Shi and Zhu had both become an onion lady without consciousness.","Both were planted by Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven on the top of the mountain.","Next... enjoy the life of being an onion for hundreds of years!","The steel manifestation smiled kindly.","In the illusory world.","Shi and Zhu, just like Song Shuhang before them, endured the wind, the sun, and the rain on the mountain summit.","“Eh? Who are you guys? Why are you appearing in my mind?” suddenly, a crisp voice rang out separately in Shi’s and Zhu’s ears!"]},{"number":3020,"title":"Chapter 3020 - 3018: End Credits Easter Egg","paragraphs":["Chapter 3020: Chapter 3018: End Credits Easter Egg","Loli Shi and Loli Zhu, each in their own illusions, were both taken aback simultaneously.","Hadn’t Senior Brother Song said they should be prepared to experience profound loneliness? So why was there a pleasant voice sounding by their ears?","Could it still be called loneliness if someone was there to talk to?","And furthermore...","Shi felt that the voice sounded somewhat familiar.","But after carefully comparing it to the voices of fairies from her memory, she couldn’t find any that matched.","Could it be the voice of a fairy from her memories that had undergone some change?","However, if it was Senior Brother Song who had sent them into this world, then perhaps the appearing voice was also a part of the process to “stabilize Dao heart?”","At the very least, it shouldn’t harm her or Zhu.","With this in mind, Shi calmed down and replied, “My name is Shi... If you, Fairy, can sense another person, that should be my junior sister Zhu.”","But her voice did not reach the fairy.","“Not replying? Or can’t talk?” the crisp voice wondered aloud.","After a moment...","“Eh, is this entering a dream? Is it Boss Song’s dreamland skill?” the voice seemed to recall something.","[Boss Song?] Shi was stunned.","In her memory, the one who would call Senior Song that... wasn’t it Lady Onion, who often gets her head pinched?","On closer inspection, this crisp voice did indeed bear some resemblance to Lady Onion’s voice. But this crisp voice was more mature, like the difference between a young girl’s voice and a mature woman’s voice.","What had happened to Lady Onion? Her voice had changed so much, becoming so mature and tempting.","“Since when could your dreamland skill carry others along, Boss Song? You are too biased, aren’t you? You’ve never taken me along... Be careful, or I might double the staff’s salary this month?” the mature voice of Lady Onion continued, seemingly conversing with Mister Song.","Shi puzzledly sensed her surroundings, but she didn’t hear Senior Brother Song’s voice.","Could it be that Senior Brother Song was conversing with Lady Onion outside?","“But, since it’s because of Boss Song, then I won’t sever this karmic connection. You two little ones continue... I’ll give you a little Easter egg at the end.” The voice of Lady Onion grew fainter and ultimately disappeared.","[Such a strange feeling.] Shi thought, puzzled.","It felt as though Lady Onion’s voice was transmitting from a distant other world, as if crossing through time and space.","Furthermore... what about an Easter egg?","After the mature and tempting voice of Lady Onion vanished, the whole ‘onion life plot’ slowly unfolded.","This time, both Shi and Zhu clearly sensed that they had become onions planted in the soil.","[Is this the onion life Lady Onion mentioned?] Shi mused.","They could feel themselves turning into plants, roots planted deep in the soil, immobile, only able to sway with the wind.","At first, Loli Zhu found it refreshing and amusing—the experience of being an onion was completely different from that of a human, and she was having a blast.","But as day turned into night, and one day passed...","Even the most fun experience becomes tedious and boring without change.","Loli Zhu quickly grew weary of this onion life experience.","But... this was just the beginning.","The onions that they had become, swaying atop a mountain peak, were isolated; no one to talk to, no one else to interact with.","Daybreak, sunset.","Day after day.","Loli Zhu was starting to crack... it was too boring, especially for someone as lively and active as her, this mundane onion life was a terrible torture!","She was now beginning to regret following Shi’s choice to make the same decision; Shi’s personality might adapt to onion life, but it wasn’t for her!","Actually... even Loli Shi couldn’t bear it any longer.","No matter how mature, she was still just a child. At first, she could silently calculate the time in her heart and see how many days she had passed.","But after a few months, she was completely unable to calculate time anymore.","Her spirit had been tormented to the edge.","[After all, those motivational quotes are deceptive, being a carefree blade of grass on the vast prairie, swaying with the wind... Why don’t you try being a blade of grass?]","Besides, had Senior Brother Song ever experienced such an ordeal?","No wonder Senior Brother Song’s mind and willpower were so stable.","Such an inhumane life experience, so vividly felt, if one could endure to the end, how could their mind and willpower not be stable?","During this period, Shi and Zhu both thought about breaking Lady Onion to escape this extremely boring and tasteless world.","But... it couldn’t be done.","Song Shuhang had also thought about breaking his own onion waist to commit suicide and get out. However, the dreamland skill didn’t have this function.","One year passed, two years passed, ten years passed, thirty years passed...","Shi didn’t know how much longer she had to stay in this world. But there are some things. After enduring the most difficult times, one could actually start to slowly adapt.","As a disciple from a major sect, Shi had an excellent foundation in cultivation. Compared to Song Shuhang back then, she adapted a bit faster.","Moreover, deep in her heart, there was a thought—Senior Brother Song had persisted to the end, and she must persist to the end as well!","After calming herself down, Shi’s mind and willpower began to Reinforce slowly with the passing years of Onion life.","On Zhu’s end, she was almost forgetting she was once human, after all, her brief human life wasn’t as long as that of an onion... Being an onion, one must be determined to be an onion, absorbing nutrients from the soil, sprouting upwards, and through photosynthesis, serving all of humanity.","Shi, I don’t want to be human anymore!","Compared to the stable Shi, Zhu’s mentality was somewhat similar to Song Shuhang’s last year.","Then, a hundred years, two hundred years, three hundred years...","The mind and willpower of Shi and Zhu had been polished smooth.","While they were still waiting for a far longer Onion life, Lady Onion suddenly sprang out of the ground.","She sprang out?!","At this moment, Shi and Zhu were moved to tears.","Originally, they thought their current mind and willpower could remain unshaken even if the sky fell, but when Lady Onion finally sprang out of the ground, they couldn’t help but shed tears of liberation.","The world is still so beautiful!","The illusion plot came to an abrupt halt the moment Lady Onion sprang out.","The plot set by the steel manifestation was to let the two youngsters experience three hundred years of Onion life. The upcoming plot was not suitable for children.","Shi and Zhu are still children.","Even after three hundred years of Onion life...","“Is it over?” Shi sighed heavily.","She felt that her mentality was no longer young.","On Loli Zhu’s end, it was the same; she felt she could no longer be as naive as she was three hundred years ago.","Shi, I don’t want to be an onion anymore!","[Senior Brother Song had experienced such three hundred years, but he could still jump around lively without much change in his personality, and his mentality was still as young as before... Is this an innate skill, or is there some secret to it?] Shi wondered in her heart.","The ‘Dream Entry Plot’ had gone to a black screen.","We can finally go out, right?","Just as Shi and Zhu were thinking this, the world that had already gone to a black screen started to brighten up again.","It’s... still happening?"]},{"number":3021,"title":"Chapter 3021 - 3019: When in Doubt, Confront the Tycoon + Pain + Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 3021: Chapter 3019: When in Doubt, Confront the Tycoon + Pain + Death","“The Dao heart that has been reinforced by three hundred years of green onion life is soulless!”","“Do you want to know the real reason why Boss Song’s Dao heart is so strong?”","“Let me open the gates to the world of the Dao heart for you!”","At this moment, Lady Onion’s mature and enticing voice echoed.","“No, I don’t need it. A soulless Dao heart is enough for me!” Loli Shi immediately refused.","To her, a Dao heart just needed to be strong enough to serve its purpose, so what did it matter if it lacked a soul?","But, just like before... her voice couldn’t be heard by Lady Onion.","After all, their experiences and Tyrannical Song’s true ‘dreamland skill’ were different.","Then, the mature and enticing voice of Lady Onion spoke again, “Soft Feather, dear, lend me your strength.”","“Soft Feather sister?” Shi was startled.","“Is Soft Feather sister going to help Lady Onion torment us too?” Zhu felt a pang of panic—Soft Feather’s personality was rare among fairies who could join in their play, making her an extremely dear playmate for Zhu.","If someone like Soft Feather sister were to assist Lady Onion, it would be terrifying.","The next moment, the darkened world flipped again and brightened up.","They were once again in possession of ‘Lady Onion’s’ body, but this time it was not the green onion itself, but Lady Onion with hands and long legs.","For some reason, even though the perspective should be first-person, both Shi and Zhu could ‘sense’ what Lady Onion looked like at the moment.","Her originally long green hair had been cut to a neat shoulder-length that made Lady Onion appear more mature, and she even had the air of a strong woman about her.","Her figure hadn’t changed much... because Lady Onion’s figure had always been quite Tyrannical.","But she seemed a bit taller?","And her attire had changed too, no longer the skirt of before but now a set of form-fitting trousers and high heels—truly the get-up of an elder sister figure.","“When did Lady Onion sister grow up to look like this?” Shi was surprised.","She had interacted with Lady Onion many times before.","And they had even played together.","Lady Onion’s character was such that she got along well with children.","However, this strong woman version of Lady Onion was completely unfamiliar to both Shi and Zhu.","“Here it comes!” the Lady Onion in the dream suddenly spoke in a deep voice.","It was the mature Lady Onion’s voice that Shi and Zhu heard.","In the next moment, an attack so terrifying that it defied description descended from the opposite vacuum.","When faced with such an attack, Shi and Zhu felt an indescribable terror welling up deep within them—an innate fear brought on by the overwhelming might of the attack, beyond their realm, suppressing them with dread.","There seemed to be several figures standing next to Lady Onion.","But since Lady Onion’s gaze wasn’t fixed on them, Shi and Zhu couldn’t see them clearly.","Boom~","The attack from the other side came crashing down like a flood.","It was darkness as tangible as solid substance, seeming like black light, yet also resembling some sort of virus-like thing.","Lady Onion stretched out her arms, and wings that resembled those of a phoenix spread from her back to shield herself and also to cover her companions beside her.","Then... Lady Onion perished.","She died a truly miserable death.","Just like a candle melting away.","First, her skin and flesh dissolved, followed by her bones and marrow...","In the blink of an eye, Lady Onion turned to ashes.","How tragic!","The dreamland skill active on Lady Onion, Shi and Zhu, was felt as though it were their own experience.","Such a deathly ordeal made their scalp tingle.","The kind of pain that shook the soul, along with the sense of powerlessness when facing the enemy’s attack, was like a red-hot branding iron, leaving a mark deep in their memories.","Unlike Song Shuhang, Shi and Zhu lacked the innate skill of ‘pain tolerance’.","The intense pain and the death experience knocked them out immediately.","Time passed, but they weren’t sure how long...","They opened their eyes.","Not dead yet?","“Pain... After resurrection, the pain still persists. Only Boss Song in the myriad practitioners in the universe could consider such pain as a part of his daily life,” the voice of the elder sister, Lady Onion, continued.","From the plot point of view, it seemed that Lady Onion and the others were resisting some powerful enemy?","Moreover, an enemy so powerful that they were unable to resist.","An enemy that could kill Lady Onion in one move.","Shi and Zhu clenched their teeth.","The memory of the pain they had faced before death still lingered in their minds.","The instant before they nearly died, every moment and every flash of the death process, and the endless darkness and despair after death, were deeply etched in their hearts.","Remembering the moment that had just passed, their souls were still trembling.","But in the end... they had made it through.","With the help of something like the ‘dreamland skill’ and the external interference from elder sister Lady Onion, they had pulled through.","It was the same principle as borrowing a CPU.","As long as they made it through, even if by relying on external support, the benefit to their mind and willpower was immense.","How did Tyrannical Song come to possess such a strong mind and willpower?","Especially in the later stages, when his realm was skyrocketing, why was his mind and willpower as stable as Mount Tai Seal?","Through pain, through death, by confronting powerful seniors!","He had tasted the pain that no one in the myriad practitioners in the universe could bear, and he had savored it.","Within one year, the number of times he died could rank in the top three in the myriad practitioners in the universe!","And that was quite a modest claim.","It was mainly because Cloud Gauze Three View Moon had a horrifying number of parts in the mountain of body parts, making it difficult to scrutinize her past highest number of deaths in a year...","Then there was confronting powerful seniors, opposing enemies that brought despair, which is also an extreme method to strengthen one’s inner self. Either under the pressure of a despairing enemy, one’s mind and willpower collapse, or one dares to directly face their strong enemies, enhancing the strength of their mind and willpower!","And Lady Onion left them an easter egg—confronting powerful seniors + pain + death, a one-stop service.","“Although I want to continue, unfortunately, if we keep going, you won’t be able to bear it. The foundation that three hundred years of living as a green onion provided is only enough for you to carefully go through this once.” The easter egg plot ended, and the voice of sister Lady Onion sounded.","The reason why an easter egg is called so, is because it’s just a brief few scenes, and not lengthy.","“My part is over, my dear friends, don’t forget to leave us a good review. Soft Feather dear, I’m leaving now,” Lady Onion continued.","“Mm,” the next moment, Soft Feather’s voice rang in Shi and Zhu’s ears.","Just as pleasant, but a voice that was different from sister Soft Feather today.","Shi had already vaguely guessed a possibility.","But she felt that this possibility was too shocking, theoretically impossible to achieve—the sister Lady Onion and sister Soft Feather in their ears didn’t seem to be from the time node they were in.","“Though it’s a pity... I cannot directly communicate with you, the fact that you, Shi and Zhu, are still safe and sound at this point in time proves that things are developing in a good direction,” Soft Feather’s voice slowly said.","Soft Feather had recognized their identity.","“Please tell Senior Song that our experiment here was a success. When consuming the ‘way to immortality,’ we can utilize the ‘small black room’ of the Will of the Heavens, a special space. In that forgotten world, where the source is erased. We can retain fragments of the way to immortality. Senior Song’s second way to immortality, by splitting and combining...” Soft Feather’s voice trailed off.","Shi and Zhu’s consciousness returned to the main world."]},{"number":3022,"title":"Chapter 3022 - 3020: The Targeted Fat Ball","paragraphs":["Chapter 3022: Chapter 3020: The Targeted Fat Ball","After Shi and Zhu emerged from the illusionary experience of the Easter egg, they relayed Soft Feather’s message to the steel manifestation immediately.","“To use the small black room to solve the problem with the depletion of the ‘way to immortality’?” the steel manifestation pinched his chin, puzzled, “Did Soft Feather tell you this?”","“Yes, it was Soft Feather’s voice, it sounded so pleasant,” Loli Zhu said with the look of a ‘300-year-old grown-up’, speaking in a particularly mature loli tone.","Loli Zhu, feeling as though she had lived for over three hundred years, quietly demoted ‘Sister Soft Feather’ to ‘Little Soft Feather’—she felt that the former Sister Soft Feather was now her little sister.","But the problem was... Soft Feather’s family name wasn’t ‘Soft’, and her given name wasn’t ‘Feather’.","The combination of Soft + Feather was just a traditional daoist method for creating dao names.","“Huh? Senior Song, did I say something?” Soft Feather, hearing someone call her dao name, happily joined in, and casually hugged little Zhu.","The small Loli Zhu was forced into Soft Feather’s immense bosom, nearly suffocating.","It was a disparity in realms so great that it was insurmountable!","Sister Soft Feather remained Sister Soft Feather... a gap that not even three hundred years of onion life could bridge.","The inflated Zhu instantly came to terms with her reality.","At the side, Shi added, “We also encountered Lady Onion.”","“I know, I am the one who led you into that illusion; it was the three hundred years of the stupid onion’s life,” the steel manifestation said with a smile.","Who knows where that stupid onion is now, how she is doing, if she has money for online shopping?","“Lady Onion is not the stupid onion,” Loli Zhu retorted for Lady Onion.","In the final scene of the dreamland Easter egg, the short-haired big sister Lady Onion had left a deep impression on her—she wanted to grow up to be like Sister Lady Onion, with a prominent front, a slim waist, and long legs.","The most important thing was—even in death, she had to die in an extremely cool manner.","The steel manifestation was slightly startled, “Didn’t you just experience three hundred years of the onion’s life?”","“Yes,” Shi nodded, then recounted her experience to the steel manifestation in detail.","After hearing the story, the steel manifestation was taken aback.","Was this ‘Lady Onion’ really from his Tyrannical Song Group, the worker boss Lady Onion?","Our group’s worker boss Lady Onion couldn’t possibly be this cool!","After a moment of stupor, the steel manifestation began calculating again—he, who had studied abroad, had learned a lot.","But after calculating for a while, the steel manifestation didn’t arrive at a conclusive result.","“Is it the future? Did the missing Lady Onion go to the future... or is it, the Lady Onion from the future?” the steel manifestation thought to himself.","“Senior Song, Senior Song, what are you thinking about?” Soft Feather asked in confusion, hugging the Zhu overwhelmed by the disparity in realms.","“I am pondering Lady Onion’s mysterious disappearance, and also... thank you for your hard work, Soft Feather,” the steel manifestation said.","He was expressing gratitude to both the present and the future Soft Feather.","“Hehehe, although I don’t know what you’re thanking me for, Senior Song, I still feel a bit embarrassed,” Soft Feather chuckled.","“By the way, do you have any New Year’s wishes?” the steel manifestation asked.","Soft Feather was the only official member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group who addressed him as “senior”, so he counted her as part of the ‘give a New Year’s gift’ friends group.","“Wishes? Senior Song, I have so many wishes!” Soft Feather exclaimed happily.","She had many things she wanted to do, many places she wanted to explore, and now she had plenty of time!","The steel manifestation quickly waved his hands, “One, only one. We’ll save the other wishes for the next holiday.”","“Just one? That’s a bit too few,” Soft Feather said as she leaned her chin on little Zhu’s head, pondering.","Moments later.","“Senior Song, I heard you’ve collected a pair of ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eyes’, so I want to experience the ‘impregnating gaze’ effect of possessing a pair of Scholarly Sage’s Eyes!” Soft Feather said earnestly.","The steel manifestation: “!!!”","Loli Zhu: “Wow~”","As expected of Fairy Soft Feather, her ideas are always so unique.","The steel manifestation waved his hands again and said, “This isn’t good... How about making another wish?”","Fairy Soft Feather with a very serious + earnest expression: “No, I want this...”","“No, you don’t!” Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, appearing behind Soft Feather without anyone knowing when, reached out and covered his daughter’s mouth.","At the same time, Senior Spirit Butterfly fixed the steel manifestation with a gaze as sharp as a sword.","“If you dare use the ‘Impregnating Gaze’ on my daughter, I’ll...” He paused mid-speech.","Then he looked up at the sky.","He was no longer a match for Tyrannical Song.","It was something that hit him really hard.","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, I also think it’s better for Soft Feather to change her wish. That’s what I’ve been advising her too.” The steel manifestation hurriedly spoke up.","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly released his hand and simply sat down beside his own daughter.","“Daddy.” Soft Feather called sweetly.","“Acting cute is useless,” Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly said.","“Then I’ll change my wish,” Soft Feather blinked her eyes—after all, there were so many holidays each year, there would be plenty of opportunities later.","She and Senior Song’s future was still long.","The steel manifestation also breathed a sigh of relief.","“If Tyrannical Song’s two demonic techniques are off-limits, then may I learn the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’?” Soft Feather asked again.","Upon hearing this, the steel manifestation finally exhaled in relief.","When Soft Feather mentioned the ‘two demonic techniques’, he feared that she would ask him to cast the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ on her.","Luckily, Soft Feather only wanted to learn the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’.","“No problem, I can carefully teach you the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ as I have adjusted it,” Song Shuhang nodded in agreement.","Techniques like the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ and the ‘Sword-Nurturing Technique’ were actually not any profound lost martial techniques in the cultivation world.","However, Song Shuhang’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ was a mutated version.","“Ah Song, my wish is also to learn the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’,” Li Yinzhu, rubbing her eyes, sat in the arms of the steel manifestation and said.","Originally, she wanted to learn Song Shuhang’s top-notch evasion technique, the ‘True Heavenly Peng’s Flying Technique.’","But after hearing about the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’, she changed her mind.","“Huh? Yinzhu, why would you suddenly want to learn the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’?” The steel manifestation skillfully took out a small comb and began combing Li Yinzhu’s long and beautiful silver hair.","“Um, I have a ‘nurturing’ target,” Li Yinzhu replied.","As she spoke, her beautiful silver eyes glanced at the mechanical girl Xiao Lingxiao beside her.","Mechanical Girl Xiao Lingxiao: Σ(°△°|||)_","Is Sister Yinzhu planning to use the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ on her?","But why?","Is she not a cute little sister?","“Haha, no problem,” the steel manifestation put away the comb, then lifted the mechanical daughter Xiao Lingxiao onto his shoulder, “Xiao Lingxiao, what’s your wish?”","[Should I also choose the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’?] Xiao Lingxiao’s mind was blank.","But suddenly, an image flashed through her mind—that was of her father Song Shuhang’s main body with the Fat Ball Cloak fluttering behind him.","“Daddy Song, I want a Fat Ball Cloak too!” Xiao Lingxiao blurted out."]},{"number":3023,"title":"Chapter 3023 - 3021: I don’t dare to ask more, nor do I dare to make a sound!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3023: Chapter 3021: I don’t dare to ask more, nor do I dare to make a sound!","“Are you sure? Xiao Lingxiao, you know your origins... Although the liquefied metal ball’s contingency centered around you has been completely obliterated by the main body, if you continue to entangle with Lady Fat Ball, I don’t know what kind of changes might happen,” the steel manifestation replied.","Xiao Lingxiao thought seriously and then responded, “I feel it should be okay. If any changes occur, I can seek refuge in Daddy Song’s main world the first time it happens. If I’m in the main world, any accident can be stopped.”","“Since you’re mentally prepared, I’ll figure out a way to get you a ‘Fat Ball Cloak’ sooner or later,” the steel manifestation nodded indulgently.","After all, when the ‘Dark Song Completion Plan’ is finished, there will definitely be some remnants of Lady Fat Ball left. And to prevent Lady Fat Ball from causing trouble in the future, the smaller the remaining remnants, the better.","To take a portion to make a cloak for Xiao Lingxiao is also a good excuse to weaken Lady Fat Ball.","“Thank you, Daddy Song,” Xiao Lingxiao joyfully bounced around.","Soft Feather took out her notebook and noted down “Fat Ball Cloak”—for the next holiday, she wanted to make a wish for such a gift too.","As for holidays, Huaxia had so many each year... the world of cultivation also had its own specific holidays, so she wasn’t in a hurry.","If worse came to worst, she could just make one up!","She could fabricate something like “Nine Provinces Number One Group’s Establishment Day” and find an opportunity to celebrate.","“But, the matter of the Fat Ball Cloak will have to wait a bit. Next up, little Li Yinzhu, Soft Feather, sit tight. I’m about to transfer all my understanding, insights, and casting experiences of the Saber-Nurturing Technique to you both,” said the steel manifestation, opening its third eye once more.","It’s not easy for cultivators to transfer techniques, but with the third eye, many memories can be transformed into data packages and sent out, like ‘copy and paste,’ which is especially convenient.","Senior Spirit Butterfly let out a soft sigh nearby.","After a long struggle to keep his daughter from the impregnating gaze, he never expected that after all the twists and turns, she would still end up targeted by Tyrannical Song’s third eye.","It felt as if it were the Will of the Heavens at work.","...","...","Meanwhile, in the time-distorted secret realm created by Daozi.","More than thirty days have already passed inside the realm!","Song Shuhang’s main body has been engaging in intellectual discourse with all the Immortal big shots non-stop, for a whole month now!","Most of the time, Song Shuhang has been listening. He had no choice; his cultivation-related theoretical knowledge wasn’t sufficient... After all, knowledge requires time to accumulate.","However, during the discourse, Song Shuhang was still able to occasionally raise critical questions, sometimes making insightful points that enlightened the Immortals he was talking with, causing them to have epiphanies.","—Tyrannical Song’s theoretical knowledge might be lacking, but his realm is high. Plus, he is currently able to make use of Daozi’s ‘Heavenly Dao Calculator,’ which is like using the realm of the Heaven’s Will to listen to the Immortals speak.","It’s a suppression by realm!","The discourse has been hugely beneficial for both parties.","Song Shuhang has gained a wealth of knowledge about the Mysterious Principles of Immortality from many Immortal big shots. With these other mountains’ stones, he could perfect his own Second Immortality.","In return, after receiving Tyrannical Song’s ‘pointers,’ the Immortals felt as if their horizons had widened significantly.","Apart from a few familiar members like the Great Northern Emperor and Zither Master Phoenix Bearing, the rest of the Immortals recruited by Song Fat Ball were now thoroughly convinced of Tyrannical Song’s capacities.","As expected of Tyrannical Song, what profound insights and extensive knowledge!","Despite all being of the Immortal Realm, Tyrannical Song seemed as if he stood on a higher level, almost as if he was instructing them in their discussion.","This was genuinely a ‘fortunate opportunity’!","Although they had to share the core knowledge of their path to immortality with Tyrannical Song, the gains were even greater.","Had they known this would be the result, they wouldn’t have needed Tyrannical Song’s fat ball manifestation to force them; they would have come willingly.","After this wave of debate and speech... Tyrannical Song’s prestige in the myriad practitioners in the universe will ascend another step!","Hidden in the shadows, Daozi’s senior brother revealed a satisfied smile.","He was secretly aiding Tyrannical Song’s next step in proving his pseudo-immortal body, gently pushing the waves.","Moreover, his method was like the spring rain, nourishing things quietly.","After confirming there were no issues in the exchange between Tyrannical Song and the Immortals, the intent of Daozi quietly receded.","“However, to put the task of saving this myriad practitioners in the universe on Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s shoulders, I truly feel a bit guilty.” After retreating to the edge of the secret realm, Daozi let out a soft sigh.","If possible, he truly wished he could take on all the responsibility, completely obliterate the ‘Dark Sun’ and eliminate the potential destruction of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Not leave such a great pressure for the juniors.","“Daoist Senior need not feel guilty... the main body is also willing. In fact, if the main body really didn’t want to pursue proving his Dao, then no one in the myriad practitioners in the universe could force him to do so. With the main world, if he wants to slack off, no one can stop him,” Tyrant Kindness, who had returned with Ba Star, came to Daozi’s side and spoke.","In this myriad practitioners in the universe, there are many people that Song Shuhang cares about.","With these people here, Song Shuhang would definitely not let the myriad practitioners in the universe be destroyed.","Moreover, just as Daozi is proving his Dao as 8.5 Heavenly Daos with an obsession to be fulfilled, Song Shuhang’s main body also wants to flawlessly prove his Dao and has karmic ties he wishes to cut.","Even if slacking off, he still has things he wants to do.","“If that’s the case... then nothing could be better,” Daozi’s senior brother said softly.","“Right, senior brother Daozi. Where is the Scholarly Sage’s eyeballs experiment located? We’ll go right now and lure the three-eyed young senior over,” Tyrant Kindness waved the ‘Companion Magic Device’ in her hand.","“Are you confident?” Daozi’s senior brother asked.","The Self Corpse Ba Xing nodded: “Over sixty percent confident.”","“Okay, I’ll take you there,” Daozi extended his hand, and the space shifted, directly transferring the two ‘three corpses’ to the location of the research room.","“Moreover, regarding the experiment on ‘using up the Mysterious Principles of Longevity’, we have new intelligence. When the time comes, we might make use of the ‘small black room of the Heavenly Dao’, and will need senior brother Daozi’s cooperation,” Self Corpse Ba Yue reminded.","Daozi nodded: “That’s settled, but we need to speed up the process. I really don’t know how much longer I can hold on.”","In the research room.","At this moment, several big shots were surrounding a pair of ‘Scholarly Sage’s eyes,’ constantly calculating something.","A projection of Senior White two, the illusory shadow of Father Goudan, Lady Long Luo Pang of the Dragon Network made manifest through the ‘Inner World Assistant’, and the ‘Heavenly Dao Calculator’ assisted by Daozi.","Glazed Cheng Lin, Heavenly Emperor’s daughter, Fairy Creation, and Fairy Skylark, who had been invited due to her close connection to the Scholarly Sage, were all on hand to assist.","In the big shots’ hands, there were small piles of eyeballs.","Most of them are glazed eyeballs... clearly pried out from the sockets of Tyrannical Song.","The giant turtle of disaster was crouching beside the big shots, shivering pathetically.","She had sensed the aura of Tyrannical Song’s parts upon the activation of the time-distorted secret realm to welcome the arrival of the Immortal big shot, and thus she came to reclaim them...","But upon arriving, she was intimidated by the luxurious assembly of big shots into submission.","The immense aura of Immortals, clones of the ruler of the Netherworld, and manifestations of the Heavenly Dao almost made her shed her new turtle shell in fear.","Seeing the big shots seemed to be researching, holding discussions, and being very busy,","She dared not make a sound, and could only crouch in the corner, behaving like a well-behaved decorative turtle.","With so many big shots together, were they researching how to destroy the world?"]},{"number":3024,"title":"Chapter 3024 - 3022: Relationships Between People Are Often So Immature","paragraphs":["Chapter 3024: Chapter 3022: Relationships Between People Are Often So Immature","Especially since there were several auras of rulers of the Netherworld Realm among them... As everyone knows, the rulers of the Netherworld Realm are the foulest entities in the world!","There were enough of them gathered to play mahjong.","Is this the end for the myriad practitioners in the universe?","The female giant turtle of disaster felt a huge pressure on her heart.","Moreover, that big ham hock Tyrannical Song, didn’t he promise that even in death, he would die cleanly, without giving the giant turtle clan additional work to handle?","But look, in just a few days, he churned out so many eyeballs!","Did he really think that just because she was specifically in charge of collecting his corpses, he could push her to work herself to the bone?","Men’s words are truly all lies!","The female giant turtle of disaster silently felt aggrieved while inwardly resenting Tyrannical Song.","“Don’t let me see Tyrannical Song, otherwise, I swear I’ll swallow him whole the moment I lay eyes on him!” the female giant turtle of disaster vowed secretly in her heart.","No matter how Tyrannical Song tried to explain, she would bite off his fur.","Just as the giant turtle finished making her vow... two figures were transferred over by Daozi’s intent.","It was two Tyrannical Songs!","One had an air of kindness, and the other was so forgettable that one could not remember him after looking away and then back again.","The female giant turtle of disaster opened her mouth... but dared not move.","This wasn’t the right place.","The vow she had just made was silently swallowed back down.","She could only stare at Tyrant Kindness with eyes full of silent reproach.","“Eh? Senior Turtle, what are you doing here?” Tyrant Kindness saw the decoratively placed female giant turtle of disaster and asked in confusion.","Given the large size of the female giant turtle of disaster, it was hard not to notice her.","“What do you think?” The female giant turtle of disaster dared not speak out loud but instead used secret sound transmission.","“How could I guess that?” Tyrant Kindness couldn’t help but laugh and cry.","The female giant turtle of disaster said with a resentful tone: “Why do you think I’m here, don’t you have any idea at all?”","Tyrant Kindness looked dumbfounded.","Then, he followed the giant turtle’s gaze to the research table.","A floor scattered with glazed eyeballs.","Most of them carried the aura of Tyrannical Song’s main body.","Tyrant Kindness rubbed his temples: “...”","By a stroke of coincidence, Fairy Creation’s figure passed through the space gate, disappearing then returning. When she reappeared, there were another pair of eyeballs in the palm of her hand.","Without saying a word, everyone knew where these eyeballs came from.","The fingers of Tyrant Kindness rubbing his temples pressed down harder.","His main body was not having it easy either, life was just too difficult.","“Kindy-Kindy~” Fairy Creation called Tyrant Kindness over with a wave of her hand, gesturing for him to come.","“Look, Senior Turtle... you can’t blame me for this. I’m also hurt,” Tyrant Kindness said to the female giant turtle of disaster.","Senior Turtle looked up to the sky, remaining silent for a long time.","Tyrant Kindness waved his hand at Senior Turtle and then moved towards the seniors in the research room.","“Where’s the fetish for eyes?” Father Goudan asked.","“I lost to the three-eyed young senior... I couldn’t win him over,” Tyrant Kindness replied.","“You lost? How did that happen? How could you lose like this?” Father Goudan was extremely disappointed—meanwhile, it took off a glove from its single claw with its dragon mustaches and carefully put it away.","“It was not a sin of war... there was an unexpected mishap with the main body, it’s a long story,” Tyrant Kindness said, heart heavy.","“However, we have a way to bring the three-eyed young senior over.” The Self Corpse Ba Ren drew strength into his dantian and said aloud, “We brought his Companion Magic Device with us.”","“Companion Magic Device? Even the foulest envy has a Companion Magic Device? Why does it get one and not me, when we’re both rulers of the Netherworld?” Father Goudan immediately felt unbalanced.","“Huh? Striped Dragon Ruler, you don’t have a Companion Magic Device? I have one, though.” Senior White Two suddenly spoke up.","Father Goudan was stunned.","Both the foulest envy and the good-looking White had Companion Magic Devices, but he didn’t!","Damn it, did Heavenly Dao Father Goudan trick me out of my Companion Magic Device?","“Anyway, with the Companion Magic Device, we can bring over the three-eyed young senior.” Self Corpse Ba Ti Shan cleared his throat and then boomed out loud.","He needed to speak up due to his low presence, always raising his voice to increase the volume.","“Right, right, let’s first bring over the foulest envy, let’s make contact with this guy.” The Striped Dragon Two carefully put the glove back on again.","Tyrant Kindness stared at the glove, feeling like there was some conspiracy to it.","[Is it holy light?] Tyrant Kindness carefully sensed, but there was no taste of holy light in it.","Next to him, Self-Corpse Overlord used the mark of the Throne of Wealth Distribution from his main body to start contacting the three-eyed young senior.","“Can you turn up the volume, is there a speakerphone function?” Father Goudan asked.","“There should be, let me try.” Self-Corpse Overlord fiddled around and actually turned on the speakerphone function.","Amid the sound of pleasant music, the three-eyed young senior, who was originally ‘asleep,’ finally picked up the call.","——In fact, through the Companion Magic Device, the three-eyed young senior could vaguely sense Tyrant Kindness’ nearby location.","Since Tyrant Kindness had arrived at the destination research room, there was no need for him to hang onto Tyrant Kindness’ call anymore.","Once the call connected, the three-eyed young senior slowly said, “Is that Tyrannical Song?”","Tyrant Kindness replied, “Yes, Senior Three-Eyes, I have something to tell you, about your...”","“Foulest envy, your Companion Magic Device is now in my hands. You have thirty seconds to come over. Otherwise, I’m going to rip it up!” Father Goudan cut to the chase and bluntly threatened.","Tyrant Kindness, who was in the middle of speaking, got interrupted.","That’s not what I meant, I didn’t want to rip anything, that wasn’t what I said!","“Father Goudan, come at me if you’ve got the guts!” the three-eyed young senior slowly said: “You’re meddling with my Companion Magic Device because you’re jealous that I have one, aren’t you?”","Father Goudan loudly provoked, “Come on, do it, I’m not afraid of you!”","The scene was extremely childish for a moment.","It totally didn’t sound like a conversation between two ‘rulers of the Netherworld.’","There was no dignity befitting rulers of the Netherworld.","It was just like two elementary school students... or even kindergartners from a senior class provoking each other.","“If that’s how it is, just wait, I’ll be right there, and don’t you chicken out!” The three-eyed young senior sneered.","“Whoever chickens out is Tyrannical Song!” Father Goudan retorted.","The three-eyed young senior didn’t show any sign of weakness, “I’m telling you, I’ll be right there! Whoever chickens out is Tyrannical Song!”","Tyrant Kindness pointed at himself, confused: “???”","Who am I? Where am I? Why am I being targeted?","“Father Goudan, when you provoke each other like that, it’s like two dogs tied up and barking at each other.” Fairy Cheng Lin didn’t spare Tyrannical Goudan any face and spoke bluntly.","“Goudan, remember I am your father. Since I’m Father Goudan, what’s wrong with a little barking?” the mighty Striped Dragon Two replied unfazed.","Fairy Cheng Lin clapped her hands against her chest vigorously, choking back a breath, unable to catch her breath.","Whoosh.","A space gate opened — this was Daozi opening the gate to the secret realm.","Then, with his hands behind his back and pulling a small gift box, the three-eyed young senior entered ostentatiously.","The three-eyed eyed the striped dragon.","They locked eyes, their glares as sharp as sabers clashing.","But after a moment, both simultaneously revealed kind smiles."]},{"number":3025,"title":"Chapter 3025 - 3023: It’s Onion, I Added Onion!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3025: Chapter 3023: It’s Onion, I Added Onion!","The three-eyed young senior arrived quickly. In fact, as soon as he connected to Tyrant Kindness’s communication link, Daozi had already quietly opened the gateway to the “time-distorted secret realm” for him.","This was also why, under the different flow of time, the three-eyed young senior could still have a normal conversation with Father Goudan.","Otherwise, the time it takes for the three-eyed young senior to move over here might have been half a day longer for the people inside the secret realm.","After exchanging a smile, the three-eyed young senior was the first to speak, “Long time no see, Father Goudan. Knowing you were here too, I thought about it and specially prepared a gift for you.”","“You’re too polite, Loves Eyes.” Father Goudan laughed and came forward, extending his claw to shake with the three-eyed young man.","The three-eyed young man looked at Father Goudan’s clawed glove, and Father Goudan looked at the three-eyed young man’s small gift box.","Both sides fell silent.","Fairy Cheng Lin quietly rolled her beautiful eyes: “...”","These two guys were being so childish that even she couldn’t stand it anymore.","She could be childish at times, but her childishness had its limits.","The childishness between Father Goudan and the three-eyed, on the other hand, knew no bounds.","Moreover—she had deliberately not given Tyrannical Goudan face just now, hoping he would disdain the nickname ‘Goudan’ and try to salvage her now tarnished dao name.","But Father Goudan was completely ruined; he not only did not find the nickname ‘Father Goudan’ shameful but actually took pride in it.","Cheng Goudan felt that changing back to Cheng Lin was a distant dream.","“Do you think I’m blind? That glove on your claw is clearly a trick,” the three-eyed young senior grumbled.","If you’re going to con me, at least do it with some dignity, will you?","Such a big glove over a claw. Do you think I’m a fool?","“Aren’t you just the same?” Father Goudan picked his nose with his dragon mustache: “Bringing a gift for me, do you think I don’t know what our relationship is like? I could figure out with my toes what your gift is, and it’s definitely disgusting.”","“At least I covered it with a gift box,” pointed out the three-eyed young senior, pointing at the glove. “What about you? What’s inside that big claw glove of yours?”","“You guess?” Father Goudan said, “Or, shall we shake hands?”","“Guess my ass.” The three-eyed young senior threw the gift box at Father Goudan: “Forget the handshake, the gift is yours!”","As he hurled the gift box, the three-eyed young senior also secretly opened it—gifts are such that just because you don’t accept them doesn’t mean I can’t give them!","I’m just going to smash the gift on your face. Whether you accept it or not, what does it have to do with me?","All that matters is that I’ve given out the gift.","Swiftly turning around, Father Goudan dragged an innocent bystander A, Tyrant Song, into the mix.","“Tyrant Song, since Loves Eyes gave me this gift, I’ll pass it on to you—catch it.”","Out of the blue, Tyrant Song looked utterly perplexed: “!!!”","Whoosh—","The box opened, emitting dazzling holy light.","Pure and rich holy light spread out.","Even though Tyrant Song was in the way, Father Goudan still got bathed in the holy light.","Tyrant Song reached out, catching both the box and the saber.","“Is this a giant sword?” Tyrant Song inspected the ‘saber’ closely after catching it.","It wasn’t the kind of giant sword imported from the West, but similar to those three-meter-long ‘giant swords’ seen in many fantasy magic games today.","The saber’s rank seemed to be at the peak of the Seventh Stage.","With just a bit of nurturing, and some added refining materials, promoting it to an Eighth Stage magical treasure was definitely not a problem.","“Thanks, Father Goudan. Thank you, Senior Three-Eyed.” Tyrant Song happily stored the ‘giant sword’ away.","The steel manifestation was also thinking of distributing a batch of ‘New Year gifts’ to the disciples.","The gift for the disciples was a life-bound magical treasure plus a bottle, matching the “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique,” which Tyrant Song had prepared earlier.","The refining materials were also saved, or could be obtained at any time—such as the gorilla general’s hair from Senior White Two’s residence.","But he still had no idea what to get Joseph as a New Year’s gift now that he had decided to formally take him as a disciple.","Now, the gift had arrived!","A Seventh Grade Holy Light Giant Sword, which, by adding five or six layers of seals, could be used by Joseph—just like the “Combined Magical Treasure” back then, sealed to the First or Second Stage. If Joseph truly became stronger in the future, these seals could be removed at any time.","After putting away the Seventh Grade Holy Light Giant Sword, Tyrant Kindness turned his attention to Father Goudan’s glove: “Father Goudan, how about you also give me that glove of yours? You couldn’t trick the three-eyed young senior anyway... And since the three-eyed young senior’s gifts have already been reassigned to me, your glove will end up with me sooner or later, so why not give it to me now?”","Although he did not know what the glove was, since it was used by Father Goudan to trick the three-eyed senior, it must also be something valuable—worth taking for free.","Father Goudan: “!!!”","What kind of bandit logic is this!","If I can’t trick the three-eyed one, why should I give the glove to you? Are you my son?","Oops, no, Song Dog Egg, in a way, inherited Cheng Lin’s dao name.","Does that mean Song Dog Egg actually has a right to inherit it?","“Dream on.” Father Goudan finally carefully took off the glove and hid it, “Next time I’ll package it nicely, maybe I’ll still manage to trick the three-eyed one.”","Three-eyed young senior: “...”","Do you think I’m a fool?","“By the way, Senior Three-Eyed, here is your Companion Magic Device back,” said Tyrant Kindness, lifting the imposing Companion Magic Device, walking towards the three-eyed senior—his hand accidentally slipped, and a “Saber-Nurturing Technique” slid out.","The three-eyed young senior’s favorability towards Tyrant Kindness increased by 0.5,","primarily because this favorability came through the Companion Magic Device which passed from an intermediary, so it was diminished by one layer.","The three-eyed young senior slightly smiled, stretching his hand to receive the “Companion Magic Device” from Tyrant Kindness’ hand.","However, at this moment, Father Goudan suddenly stumbled and fell.","His fall was not graceful, and his posture was unpracticed.","Moreover, as he fell, he managed to slide all the way to Tyrant Kindness’ side.","The three-eyed young senior sharply jumped backward to avoid it!","Thinking of ambushing him? No chance!","“Ah, my hand slipped~” Father Goudan performed with his three-dollar acting skills—on his claw, the glove he had just removed somehow ended up being worn again.","Then, its dragon claw ‘slapped~’ onto the Companion Magic Device held by Tyrant Kindness.","The outer layer of the glove exploded violently, revealing a ‘Bone Dragon Claw’.","The flexible Bone Dragon Claw grabbed onto the Companion Magic Device.","The already eerie three-eyed senior’s Companion Magic Device, with the addition of this Bone Dragon Claw, suddenly became even more sinister!","Tyrant Kindness, confused, had no idea what Father Goudan was up to.","As he wondered, this Bone Dragon Claw released an extremely ‘eye-stinging’ aura.","Literally, ‘eye-stinging’.","Tyrant Kindness immediately burst into tears.","“What is this?” tears constantly streamed down Tyrant Kindness’ face.","Fairy Creation flashed over, took out a crystal bottle, and collected the rolling teardrops.","“It’s onions, I added the scent of onions,” Father Goudan explained: “It’s from a top-quality onion demon I cultivated, and using its juice along with the Bone Dragon Claw, I refined this magical treasure. The effect is particularly eye-stinging, extremely so, so much that even the ruler of the Netherworld cannot be immune to it.”","“I’ve experienced it,” Tyrant Kindness sobbed, “Now I just want to know, how can I stop crying?”","Aren’t you supposed to be tricking the three-eyed senior?","Why did you end up tricking me?","“Another effect is, once the Bone Dragon Claw is attached, it can’t be removed for a short time,” Father Goudan said, looking at the three-eyed young senior: “Which means, if you don’t want your eyes to sting, for the time being, you can’t take your Companion Magic Device away!”","And whatever magical item stays with Tyrant Kindness for a longer period of time... well, take a look at the ‘Scarlet Heaven Sword’ hanging at Tyrant Kindness’ side."]},{"number":3026,"title":"Chapter 3026 - 3024: Judgment Basis: Only the Parts That Can Resurrect Are Its Own Components","paragraphs":["Chapter 3026: Chapter 3024: Judgment Basis: Only the Parts That Can Resurrect Are Its Own Components","This was a playful contraption devised by Father Goudan after spending loads of time pondering how to annoy the three-eyed treasure.","The three-eyed guy not only had three eyes himself... his collection, butler, other servants, and pets were all eyeballs.","As a fanatic of eyeballs, his world was filled with eyeballs.","If this “Enhanced Spicy Eye Onion Juice” were brought back, the whole world of the three-eyed would be filled with tears.","Just think about it, it feels satisfying.","Besides, this “Enhanced Onion Juice” not only irritated the eyes but Father Goudan had also added several scents that the three-eyed found extremely repulsive.","For the three-eyed, this companion magic device at this moment was more disgusting than falling into a cesspool.","“Do you have to be so childish?” the three-eyed young senior said while stealthily distancing himself from Tyrant Kindness, daring not to come near.","Father Goudan used water-type magical techniques to cleanse his lone claw, happily responding, “I’m childish, but I’m happy!”","The three-eyed young senior: “...”","“So, Father Goudan, I know the effects and benefits now. But when should I put this down?” Tyrant Kindness shook the companion magic device in his hand.","Perhaps coincidentally, as Father Goudan was fastening the ‘Bone Dragon Claw,’ he accidentally fused the companion magic device with Tyrant Kindness’s palm in one breath.","Tyrant Kindness was now utterly unable to remove it.","“You won’t be able to take it off anytime soon, just give up,” Father Goudan cheerfully said.","Tyrant Kindness: “!!!”","“Young friend Tyrant Song, there’s no rush.” The three-eyed young senior, standing at least a hundred meters away from Tyrant Kindness, transmitted his voice from afar, “My companion magic device is not in a hurry to be recovered, you can travel the world with it. After some time, I’ll take it back home.”","Upon hearing this, Tyrant Kindness’s eyes teared up, and at the same time, his hand slipped, accidentally unleashing another Saber-Nurturing Technique.","“Besides, Tyrant Kindness, you’ve had a rough time... why don’t you head back and rest early? Isn’t there another of Tyrant Song’s avatars, Ba Ji, here? You can leave the matters here to him and find a secluded corner to cry your heart out,” the three-eyed young senior suggested.","As Tyrant Kindness listened, the tears continued to fall.","Fairy Creation collected a crystal bottle full of tears, nodded in satisfaction, and took this bottle of ‘Tyrant Kindness’s Tears’ to the research table, placing it among the experimental materials.","Any material related to “eyeballs” might possibly be used in this experiment.","Also on the research table was a treasure like “Heavenly Dao Eye Drops.”","A few minutes later...","Tyrant Kindness was invited to the main world’s ‘Palace of Virtue.’ Carrying the companion magic device with him, he got the place to himself to calm down.","The Creation Hall was the territory of the virtuous lamia.","Although Fairy Creation had never returned there even once, she actually could remotely control the palace. For example, secretly collecting the ‘tears’ that dripped within the palace was no problem at all.","...","...","In the research room.","The three-eyed young senior didn’t bother looking for any “excuse” and directly forced his way into the experiment team.","After such a ruckus with Father Goudan, he wasn’t even in the mood to make excuses.","Aside from Father Goudan, the other members tacitly understood what was happening — everyone was waiting for the three-eyed young man, naturally, they wouldn’t embarrass him at this moment.","As for the extremely active Father Goudan, he was directly ignored by the three-eyed young senior.","“What’s the progress on the study of the Scholarly Sage’s dual eyes?” The three-eyed young senior could be called the number one ‘ophthalmologist’ across all ages and all realms.","When it came to the study of eyeballs, no one across the myriad practitioners in the universe could match his expertise.","“Currently, we have two ideas and research directions,” Senior White two’s projection manifested and spoke, “One is to try to fuse the Scholarly Sage’s eye with Song Shuhang’s ‘undying fat whale golden core’. The other plan is to consider whether we can fuse the Sage’s eye with Song Shuhang’s main body, which could also achieve the effect of bringing you back to life.”","After pondering for a bit, the three-eyed young senior replied, “Let’s proceed with the first option. The second path might affect the future ‘proving his Dao and immortality’. Although the Scholarly Sage’s eye is extremely powerful, it is at the end of the day an extrinsic object. If it replaces Tyrant Song’s eyes, when the time comes to prove the Dao and achieve immortality... will these eyes be considered Song Shuhang’s or the Scholarly Sage’s? If handled poorly, it could lead to imperfect immortality for Song Shuhang.”","“Then are my colorful waist and my main body also considered extrinsic objects?” Self-Corpse Overlord shouted, his energy surging through his dantian.","“Whether it’s an extrinsic object, there’s only one way to know,” Father Goudan spoke up, “Each time you come back to life, whatever can recover with the ‘resurrection’ is considered a part of yourself. Everything else is extrinsic. This ugly third eye in your brow is an extrinsic object!”","Three-eyed young senior: “...” Once the experiment was over, he was going to give this black and white striped silk stocking dragon a good beating!","“So, every time I resurrect, my colorful waist is carried away by the Sage’s blood, is it an extrinsic object?” Ba Yao frowned and asked.","Would that mean he had to become a one-kidney man in his future immortal path?","“About that, you can be reassured,” Senior White two consoled him, “Last time you resurrected, I saw the whole process. Every time your main body resurrects, it still has two kidneys. The ‘colorful waist’ taken away by the Sage’s blood is more like a ‘kidney attire’. Once you resurrect, this kidney attire comes back, you put it on again, and one of your kidneys turns into a colorful one.”","Stunned, Self-Corpse Overlord was shocked by the slick move of his own main body.","Kidney attire, bright and colorful light... This was exactly like the ‘ultra-cool fashion’ in online games.","“Then let’s follow the first research direction,” Fairy Skylark’s slender fingers moved through the air, manipulating the Scholarly Sage’s dual eyes with mental power.","“Fairy Creation, go bring Song Shuhang’s fat whale golden core over,” Senior White two turned his head and called out to a corner of the research room.","In the corner, the virtuous lamia, who was playing dead curled up in a ball, raised her upper body and gave Senior White a thumbs up.","—All the rulers of the Netherworld Realm were present, and she, being a body of virtue alone, felt tremendous pressure; she joined Senior Turtle in the corner acting as a decoration.","After receiving the task, Fairy Creation’s figure flickered and disappeared.","A moment later,","The virtuous lamia reappeared, holding Song Shuhang’s ‘undying fat whale golden core’ in her hands and returned.","After a few days of not seeing it, the fat whale golden core seemed to have grown fatter, resembling a pufferfish more than ever, truly earning the title of a golden core.","“Binding the Sage’s eye and the fat whale golden core. The fat whale golden core’s ‘undying’ attribute; the Sage, none. The forced fusion of undying and non-undying, a ten-star difficulty,” Lady Kunna’s manifestation stated.","“So, shall we first try to impart a layer of ‘undying’ attribute to Scholarly Sage’s eyes?” Senior White two said.","“It’s not that easy to manipulate the undying attribute; if it were, then the myriad practitioners in the universe wouldn’t only have Fairy Skylark and Tyrant Song,” Father Goudan said.","“Hold on a second.” The three-eyed young senior suddenly pulled out a monocle and wore it, keenly studying this pair of Scholarly Sage’s eyes.","Because he discovered that deep within the Sage’s eyes, there seemed to be a strand of ‘undying’ level information."]},{"number":3027,"title":"Chapter 3027 - 3025: Why suddenly turn into dominating blow!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3027: Chapter 3025: Why suddenly turn into dominating blow!","As an expert on eyeballs, the three-eyed young senior’s understanding of eyeballs surpassed everyone present.","That’s why he immediately recognized the unique nature of these Scholarly Sage’s Eyes.","The three-eyed young senior’s monocle adhered to the forehead’s third eye, scrutinizing it meticulously from the outside in, observing the Scholarly Sage’s Eye.","After a moment, he finally confirmed his suspicion.","“It really is immortal information... so well concealed that if I weren’t so attentive, I might have actually overlooked it,” the three-eyed young senior mused with emotion.","The three-eyed young senior was a ruler of the Netherworld carefully devised by the ‘Heavenly Dao of the Three-Eyed Sovereign’ after proving his Dao. Thus, he could confirm that the information hidden within the Sage’s eyes was indeed the Heavenly Dao Immortal Information.","He didn’t possess the power of ‘eternity’, hadn’t consumed any such essence, but he had seen the Heavenly Dao on the run.","After putting away his monocle, the three-eyed young senior contemplated seriously, asking, “Speaking of which, did the Confucian Sage truly die?”","“...” Daozi’s will incarnation fell silent for a moment, then nodded, “My teacher indeed died. When I took over the Heavenly Dao Authority, I confirmed this matter immediately.”","“To be honest, it’s hard to believe that someone as exalted as him could die. Inside his eyeballs is hidden the ‘Heavenly Dao immortal’ information! If he figured this out before his death... then he managed to procure a smidgen of immortal information even before proving his Dao as an eternal being. This is truly the genuine ‘Heavenly Dao template’,” the three-eyed young senior said.","“Dumb Dumb Song ~ Smidgen ~ Boom~” Fairy Creation gestured with her hands, mimicking an ‘explosion’.","“Yes, yes, yes,” the three-eyed young senior sighed, responding, “But Tyrannical Song is an exception... To be honest, the fact that he actually created an ‘undying fat whale golden core’ is still unbelievable to me. There’s a sense of disbelief, like [how could he, of all people, come up with immortal information before proving his Dao]. But when I think about how I still can’t create ‘objects that carry the aura of eternity’ on my own, I feel thoroughly outdone by Tyrannical Song. Just the thought makes me feel tight in the chest.”","“Why can you understand what my junior sister is saying, Senior Three-Eyed Sovereign?” Daozi’s will incarnation was bewildered, then turned to look at the three-eyed young senior’s ‘third divine eye’.","It dawned on him — Tyrannical Song also understood the junior sister’s words. Tyrannical Song also had a third eye, which he obtained from Senior Three-Eyed!","Could this be the secret?","For a moment, even Daozi, as the Heavenly Dao, felt an unrighteous ‘greed’ welling up within.","He nearly reached out to gouge out the eyes of the Senior Three-Eye Sovereign.","The three-eyed young senior suddenly also paused, and after a moment, he speculated thoughtfully, “Could it be an after-effect of the ‘data linkage’ with Tyrannical Song last time? I don’t recall having this functionality before.”","“I’ve linked data with Tyrannical Song as well,” Daozi murmured.","But why haven’t I awakened this ability?","Is Tyrannical Song holding out on me?","Or did my data connection with Tyrannical Song not reach the level that Senior Three-Eyed Sovereign did?","“I wonder if the ‘immortal information’ in the Confucian Sage’s eyes could be related to Fairy Skylark?” Meanwhile, the Heavenly Emperor’s child speculated, who had always been a bystander.","She was monitoring the movements of glass gemstone Cheng Lin and somehow got pulled into joining the ‘Sage’s Eye Binding Project’.","“But he shouldn’t have seen my bone of eternity...” Fairy Skylark reminisced.","When she lured the Confucian Sage into Daoist cultivation, she was very restrained. That was an unusual period for her, when she didn’t actively seek death.","After all, the Sage was still young back then, and she didn’t want to die in some spectacular fashion, leaving a dark shadow in the young Sage’s heart.","“Senior Skylark, perhaps you never revealed your ‘bone of eternity’ in front of the Sage, but the Sage definitely knew about the existence of your ‘bone of eternity’ during his lifetime. Moreover, he might have personally contacted and researched the bone of eternity,” Self Corpse Ba Ming said aloud. “Think about it, back then... last year, when the fat ball kidnapped you, some of the Sage’s contingency plans kicked in, directly saving and hiding the ‘bone of eternity.’ If he hadn’t known about your ‘bone of eternity,’ how could he have made such arrangements?”","“That makes sense,” Skylark propped her chin on the table, looking at the Scholarly Sage’s Eye, and said, “So, you mean to say, later on, after he became the renowned ‘Sage of Confucianism’ throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe, he secretly studied me without my knowledge?”","“How come it feels like how the Heavenly Dao secretly studied the ruler of the Netherworld?” Senior White two couldn’t help but speak out.","The expressions of Father Goudan and the three-eyed young senior became unnatural... they were both subjects of research.","Daozi also felt awkward.","After all, they were discussing his teacher’s past, and it might even include some embarrassing history.","“However, I did die many times back in the day. If he had been secretly protecting me, it wouldn’t be strange for him to have seen the ‘bone of eternity,’” Skylark’s eyes slightly darkened, her long blue eyelashes fluttering lightly.","Due to her undying constitution, after experiencing death too many times, she had developed a detached view of ‘life and death.’","Yet even so, when some important people in her life had completely died, she couldn’t hide the feeling of emotional loss deep in her heart.","“Moreover, perhaps this ‘immortal’ information wasn’t consolidated by the Sage during his lifetime... Don’t forget, the Sage had once ‘swallowed’ a part of the fat ball’s existence. Perhaps it was during the fat ball’s process of proving his Dao and becoming ‘undying’ that the Sage’s corpse was also infected with a portion of ‘immortal’ information?” Self Corpse Ba Xing added.","“Regardless of the reason, this topic can be put aside for now,” the three-eyed young senior waved his hand. “The key point is that in the Scholarly Sage’s Eye, there lies a thread of ‘immortal’ information Attribute. With this in mind, things will be much easier to deal with.”","If it was undying + undying, and neither of them were complete ‘eternity,’ then there was hope for them to be existentially bound.","If both were fully ‘Great Way eternal’, they would entirely lose the possibility of binding.","“Should we scoop out the eyeballs of the fat whale golden core to replace them with the Sage’s eye?” Cheng Lin spoke up.","The fat whale golden core: “!!! ”","Its spherical body began to pulse vigorously—it certainly didn’t share the main body’s affinity for scooping out eyeballs!","“It’s a golden core, its eyeballs are more like ‘engraved’ or ‘painted’ on, can’t scoop them out,” Senior White two explained.","Fairy Creation, who had reached out eagerly, withdrew her hands in disappointment.","“What does the Heavenly Dao of the Three-Eyed Sovereign think?” Senior White two asked again.","“Actually, this is easy to handle,” the three-eyed young senior slightly smiled and said. “I remember that Tyrannical Song has seven small dantians, right?”","Father Goudan interjected, “Yes, but why suddenly turn it into Tyrannical Bluster?”","The three-eyed young senior simply ignored Father Goudan and continued, “In Tyrannical Song’s seven small dantians, there used to be a ‘Core Item’ that transformed into his Golden Core, right?”","“That’s the case,” Senior White two replied.","“So, we can follow this idea,” the three-eyed young senior said. “We can open up a new small dantian or something similar for Tyrannical Song, then find a way to transform this pair of Sage’s eyes into Tyrannical Song’s core of the golden core. By following this approach, we can see if we can bind it with the fat whale golden core.”","“Hmm? That could actually work,” Senior White two nodded.","Back when Song Shuhang was at the Fifth Stage, fiddling with the ‘golden cores’ of various small dantians, he also used a variety of raw materials!"]},{"number":3028,"title":"Chapter 3028 - 3026: Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder Will Be Very Uncomfortable","paragraphs":["Chapter 3028: Chapter 3026: Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder Will Be Very Uncomfortable","“`","After all, Tyrannical Song already has seven small golden cores + one original dantian, so adding one more to make it the Ninth Supreme wouldn’t be unacceptable.","Moreover, his main body has now ascended to the Immortal Realm, so even if he tinkers with the ‘golden core’, it wouldn’t affect his future—the insignificance of the golden core can no longer influence the nearly maxed-out Tyrannical Song.","“But where to add another small golden core?” Self Corpse Ba Yang began using the ‘Buddhist Roaring Lion’s Technique’ to express himself this time.","He noticed something, while exchanging thoughts with the big shots and seniors, his presence kept diminishing.","From initially being able to speak and be heard by the seniors, to later having to shout using his luck-imbued dantian, to now having to use the ‘Buddhist Roaring Lion’s Technique’ to make himself heard...","Even though he was trying his best to suppress his invisible condition, and even making efforts to shift the ‘invisible’ status over to the main body’s ghost spirit fairy maiden, this method was becoming less and less effective, unable to stop the intensification of his invisibility.","[Could it be the main body that keeps becoming stronger?] Ba Wo pondered a possibility.","This strengthening might not necessarily be a rise in rank but could also be an enhancement in the understanding of ‘rules and principles’.","The main body is currently engaging in discourse with the Seniors of Immortality, exchanging insights into the ‘Mysterious Principles of Immortality’... and this strengthening will continue.","Ba Sheng felt utterly weary.","Now, all he could hope was for the main body to quickly prove its Dao and become undying.","After the main body proves its Dao and becomes undying, these three corpses incarnations should be able to be imbued with the genuine principles of Heaven’s Will and thereby be sublimated.","“Hmm, it’s impossible to add more small golden cores in the apertures... We need to start from a different angle,” the three-eyed young senior said.","Tyrannical Song’s seven small golden cores were formed from the Second Stage Realm’s Dragon Tail, Dragon Claw, Dragon Body, Dragon Palm, Dragon Neck, Dragon Head, and Dragon Horn seven major aperture dantians, each condensing a golden core.","But these seven aperture dantians are an entirety, constructing a great dragon within the cultivator’s body, and this is the foundation of a cultivator, which shouldn’t be damaged.","After pondering for a moment, Father Goudan said, “How about simply carving out two more dantians in the left and right kidneys, transforming a pair of Sage’s eyes into two golden cores, and inserting them into the kidney dantians?”","Although nine is the extreme number, wouldn’t ten be more perfect?","“Holy Kidney Stones?” Cheng Goudan couldn’t help but say.","If the eyes of the Sage became golden cores and appeared in Tyrannical Song’s kidneys, wouldn’t that be Saintly ? Kidney Stones?","Daozi remained silent: “...”","As soon as he thought of the possibility that his teacher’s eyes might end up in Tyrannical Song’s kidneys, he felt a pain in his liver. He was plagued with a persistent thought that he was letting his teacher down, which kept assaulting his mind.","But he couldn’t think of a better idea...","And this issue was related to whether Tyrannical Song could merge his teacher’s eyes with the ‘fat whale golden core’, and even to whether he could save the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Should it really come to that, he believed his teacher, with his kindness and righteous heart, wouldn’t mind having his eyes in Tyrannical Song’s kidneys, right?","Holy Kidney Stones, that’s also quite grand.","Daozi was already mentally hypnotizing himself in advance, preparing himself psychologically.","“Using kidneys as dantians is a bit risky... Shuhang’s kidneys are easily targeted,” Senior White analyzed.","Although Song Shuhang’s kidneys are among the strongest defended places in his body.","But as they say, you can be a thief for a thousand days, but you can’t defend against one for a thousand days. No matter how strong the defense, it can’t shield against the coveting of so many enemies.","“There’s a rumor in the world of cultivators: it is said that Tyrannical Song’s kidneys can grant people the power of immortality,” the son of the Heavenly Emperor added silently, contributing a rumor he had heard.","“`","Self Corpse Ba Hu looked utterly confused, “???”","Since when did my kidneys have such an effect? How did I not know about this?","If it really had such an effect, why would my main body bother looking for life-extending spiritual medicines for my family? Wouldn’t it be better to just cut out my kidneys and roast them?","“What do you think about this matter, Tyrannical Song?” Father Goudan turned to Self Corpse Ba Xing and asked.","Self Corpse Ba Xing earnestly said, “Father Goudan, asking me about this is pointless... However, using the process of elimination, my kidneys and heart should both be unsuitable for establishing a new dantian.”","Senior White two said my kidneys won’t work.","As for the heart, it’s easily punctured. Many of the cultivators’ techniques aim at the head and the heart, with the heart being second only to the kidneys as a risky area. Moreover, Song Shuhang’s lustrous heart can even be played with and used for refining, possessing endless wonder. Turning it into a new dantian would be a loss instead.","“Suggestion: An external elixir field? How about that?” Lady Long Luo Pang spoke up at this moment.","Why limit the new dantian within Tyrannical Song’s ‘body’?","Why not broaden our horizon?","Since it is an additional dantian being created, why not make an external one?","Senior White two looked thoughtful and said, “Lady Kunna, could you please describe in detail this ‘external elixir field’ concept of yours?”","Lady Kunna nodded her head and began to explain her own existence.","Just like how she is the ‘Dragon Network’ of the Black Dragon World, her prototype is an energy system laid out in the body of an immortal black dragon.","Therefore, it is entirely possible to refer to her Dragon Network System and construct a similar ‘Dragon Network’ energy system on the surface of Tyrannical Song’s body, and then set up a central energy node.","This node could then develop into a brand new ‘external elixir field.’","“It’s worth a try,” Father Goudan nodded and said.","“I think it’s a good plan,” the three-eyed young senior also indicated its feasibility.","Self Corpse Ba Yang was moved and, exerting twice the power of the ‘Buddhist Roaring Lion’s Technique,’ declared: “Constructing a ‘Dragon Network’ system seems to vaguely resonate with my main body’s ‘Second Immortality’! That must be it, the very thing my main body needs!”","He only had to envision the ‘Dragon Network System’ surrounding his main body for a moment before he felt a familiar feeling with the ‘Second Immortality’!","A resonance indicated that this was the way forward.","“Then let’s do it this way. Overlord Body, link up with your main body so that a portion of its mind can descend here. We’ll assist in customizing a Dragon Network energy system for him,” Senior White two reminded.","Self Corpse felt touched—indeed, Senior White was the best!","“I am going to contact my main body right now.” Self Corpse closed his eyes and quickly reached out to his main body.","A new dantian, a new external energy system, once its framework was successfully constructed and its rank was further enhanced, his ‘energy reserve’ would become even more substantial in the future.","When casting some super techniques, he would have a stronger base and wouldn’t have to worry about being completely drained.","Besides...","If the new external dantian was to center around the ‘Sage’ eyes of Confucianism and condense a Golden Core, would he have to go through the process of a cultivator’s upgrade again?","Turning Golden Core into a Spirit Lake, a baby growing upon the lake, and then manifesting a Saint or something?","Otherwise, with all other dantians being suppressed by a Sage Seal, not having one on the new dantian would be quite bothersome for someone with OCD."]},{"number":3029,"title":"Chapter 3029 - 3027: Hello everyone, this is truly my last speech!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3029: Chapter 3027: Hello everyone, this is truly my last speech!","A family must be complete and united.","Each of my original dantian + seven small dantians + external elixir field has a ‘Sage Seal’ to suppress them, making them more pleasing to the eye.","With that thought, my self-corpse, Tyrannical Song, looked towards Daoist Senior.","The Heavenly Dao is one of us, showing our divinity, making a speech, and condensing a Sage Seal seems to be no problem?","Even if the external elixir field doesn’t have the function to ‘show my divinity in front of the masses’... would there be a problem if I asked Daoist Senior to open a back door for me?","No problem at all!","This is to condense a Sage Seal for the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eye’ golden core.","It’s a pity that the Sage Name ‘Tyrannical Scholar’ is already taken, otherwise, the Sage Seal for this elixir field would be even more perfect if it was branded with ‘Tyrannical Scholar Sage Seal.’","Wait, the position of the Sage Seal can be changed!","I can’t change it myself, but there’s no problem adjusting the ‘Dantian Sage Seal’ order through the Heavenly Dao!","Even if I can’t use the Sage Name ‘Tyrannical Scholar,’ there are other suitable Sage Names to choose from.","For example... Tyrannical Eye? Tyrant Saint? Tyrant?","Tyrant Saint sounds quite good.","“Deal!” The manifestation of Daoist Senior’s intent gave a thumbs-up to Tyrannical Song’s self-corpses.","My self-corpse might not have the same ‘100 percent face-reading’ Attribute as my main body, but Daoist Senior, being the Heavenly Dao, still has some privileges. As long as he feels like tuning in, he can pick up on some information.","Thus, the intentions of Tyrannical Song’s self-corpse got a ‘like’ from the Heavenly Dao and stamped approval in the Heavenly Dao backstage.","All that’s left is for the Tyrannical Song main body to complete the structure of the ‘External Golden Core Dragon Network System,’ and then convert the golden core into a lake, within which a lotus will grow. After that, the segment of ‘showing their divinity and delivering a Profound Sage Speech’ can proceed.","Some steps, if unnecessary, can be skipped... like overcoming tribulation, which has become meaningless nowadays. By then, Tyrannical Song just needs to casually endure a bolt of heavenly lightning to go through the motions and directly move on to showing divinity in front of the masses.","Even the speech draft—Daoist Senior has already split off a wisp of his Heavenly Will to quickly prepare it—after all, it’s an external golden core condensed from his own master’s eyes, and the event must be well-arranged, not to embarrass his master’s eye golden core.","By then, if Tyrannical Song wishes to give a speech, Daoist Senior will present him with this Heavenly Axiom-level speech draft.","What an array!","The so-called Will of the Heavens is to be several steps ahead of ordinary cultivators.","The self-corpse merely harbored this thought, and Daoist Senior had already arranged everything backstage in the Heavenly Dao, just waiting for the ‘show my divinity’ project to go live.","“What do you mean ‘deal’?” Goudan’s father asked in confusion. Why had the Heavenly Dao suddenly given a thumbs up and thought ‘deal’?","“I’ve arranged everything, just waiting for the other rulers and fellow friends to set up the ‘External Golden Core’ for Tyrannical Song’s main body,” explained Daoist Senior.","...","...","A week later, in the time of the Heavenly Dao secret realm.","With three-eyed young senior’s participation, the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eye Research Project’ made rapid progress.","This is the effect of having a real authority figure in a particular field.","How to extract and stabilize the ‘eternity’ Attribute from the Scholarly Sage’s eyes.","How to synchronize the Scholarly Sage’s eyes with the ‘External Golden Core System.’","How to begin the initial transformation of the Scholarly Sage’s eyes into golden cores, and so on...","One difficult problem after another was perfectly solved with the assistance of the ruler of the three-eyed sovereign.","Meanwhile, Lady Kunna generously sponsored along with rulers, Heavenly Emperor’s children, Cheng Lin, and others including Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and more, who followed Tyrannical Song’s main body consciousness transfer to visit the ‘Black Dragon World,’ personally experiencing the structure and secrets of the ‘Dragon Network.’","After returning, with the support of the “Heavenly Dao Computation Function,” it took only a week for Tyrannical Song’s main body to construct a prototype system of an “External Golden Core modeled after the Dragon Network”!","“Next comes the most crucial part.” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair spoke up.","Fairy Creation appeared, holding a pair of Scholarly Sage’s Eyes, and approached the fat whale golden core.","Before returning to its original position, Tyrannical Song’s “small golden core” had to undergo an inevitable process—that was to spend some time inside the body of the fat whale golden core.","Now, these Scholarly Sage’s Eyes were no exception and had to go through this procedure.","The fat whale golden core glanced at Fairy Creation and ultimately opened its mouth in despair.","The two Scholarly Sage’s Eyes were stuffed into its mouth in one breath.","The Sage’s Eyes began to take on even more of Tyrannical Song’s aura—after all, one of the eyes had already been nestling in the eye socket of Song Shuhang’s main body, forming deep karmic ties with Tyrannical Song.","After being digested by the fat whale golden core, the connection deepened even further.","However, the fat whale golden core itself was unable to fully integrate the Sage’s Eyes and could only serve to “approve” them, marking them as qualified to become “small golden cores” for Tyrannical Song.","“How long will the swallowing take?” the three-eyed young senior asked.","He had been in a great mood these past few days.","From this week’s research, he had gained a lot of useful information and technology from the Scholarly Sage’s Eyes. He would soon be able to greatly enhance the power of his collection of “Demon Eyes.”","Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair shook her head and said, “I’m not sure, in the past, the eyes would be yanked out by @#%× Fairy when the time seemed right.”","No sooner had she finished speaking than Fairy Creation eagerly reached out and grabbed the fat whale golden core—since there were many rulers of the Netherworld present, the virtuous lamia couldn’t get too close.","In the past, stroking the whale core was a task exclusively for the virtuous lamia, but this time, it was finally Fairy Creation’s turn.","From today on, whatever the virtuous lamia could do, she could do; and even the things the virtuous lamia couldn’t do, she could still manage.","She had won!","“Yaya duo~ Yi yi suo~” hummed Fairy Creation cheerfully, mimicking the motions of the virtuous lamia as she stroked the fat whale golden core.","biu~biu~","The fat whale golden core opened its mouth, and the two certified Sage’s Eyes were squeezed out.","“So, as you can see, Father Goudan—if the Heavenly Dao Father Goudan had set up such a function for me back then, Ghost God Cheng Lin could have spat you out just like this—biu~biu~, without having to get crushed into pieces,” Fairy Cheng Lin pointed at the fat whale golden core, speaking earnestly.","No sooner had she finished speaking than Father Goudan, smiling, produced an eggshell-shaped magical treasure.","In the next moment, she was captured within this ostrich-sized magical treasure and restrained.","With a compassionate smile, Father Goudan carefully stored the egg away.","Why is it that the people of the world never seem to grasp the simple truth that you won’t die if you don’t seek trouble?","The Self-Corpse subtly turned its head away, refusing to look at the sealed Cheng Goudan.","“Tyrannical Song, the golden core is returning to its place,” Lady Long Luo Pang prompted at this time.","The external faux-Dragon Network system of Tyrannical Song’s main body glowed faintly.","The two Scholarly Sage’s Eyes, as if attracted, took the initiative to fall into the nodes of the faux-Dragon Network system.","One positive, one negative.","The eyes settled on opposite sides of the node, taking their places.","After successfully settling in, the exterior of the Sage’s Eyes began to be coated with a layer of golden shell-like material.","It looked almost as if it had been coated in breadcrumbs and fried golden brown."]},{"number":3030,"title":"Chapter 3030 - 3028: Come and Be Killed Once!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3030: Chapter 3028: Come and Be Killed Once!","It looked like a golden pill, appearing very appetizing.","“It really changed?” The female giant turtle of disaster squatting together with the virtuous lamia in the corner exclaimed in shock.","The virtuous lamia looked at her with confusion.","“The Sage’s eyes have truly become a part of Tyrannical Song,” said the female giant turtle of disaster, her voice filled with a tone of despair.","After the Sage’s eyes turned into a golden core, they were thoroughly infused with Tyrannical Song’s aura — that is to say, the Sage’s eyes had also become a part of Tyrannical Song’s ‘components.’ If Tyrannical Song ever died and it was not a complete death, the Sage’s eyes would become a part that needed to be recovered.","This significantly increased her workload!","But that wasn’t the core reason for the giant turtle’s despair. What truly drove her to despair was the realization that ‘Tyrannical Song could turn external objects into parts of himself.’","—— If Tyrannical Song wished, and had the cooperation of a powerhouse, not only the Sage’s eyes but many other things could become parts of Tyrannical Song! Moreover, they would be cheat-like parts.","The more cheat-like components Tyrannical Song had, the higher the probability that parts would drop when he died.","At that time, wouldn’t they, the giant turtles of disaster, have to follow Tyrannical Song around every day?","She decided to request Daddy Turtle or Grandpa Turtle to dispatch more turtle hands, increasing the number of members in charge of recovering Tyrannical Song’s components. One turtle alone, her, couldn’t handle it all.","...","...","Clap clap clap~ At this moment, Fairy Creation’s fat whale golden core became excited, desperately flapping its tail as if it wanted to leap up and swallow that pair of Sage’s Eye Golden Cores.","Fairy Creation firmly grasped it — in the past, when it was inside Tyrannical Song’s dantian, she couldn’t touch the fat whale golden core. Now that the fat whale golden core came out on its own, Fairy Creation took the opportunity to stroke it as one would a cat.","“Does this count as one golden core? Or two?” Scarlet Heaven Sword looked at the Sage’s Eye Golden Cores in the heart of Tyrannical Song’s ‘External Dragon Network’ and asked.","Senior White Two said, “If they’re in the same dantian, should we consider them as ‘one’ golden core?”","“But they aren’t conjoined golden cores, they are more like twin golden cores... I feel it should count as two,” said the three-eyed young senior.","The son of Heavenly Emperor said with a serious face, “Speaking of which, if one Sage’s eye can launch an ‘impregnating gaze,’ does two amount to twins?”","Self-corpse: “Based on my sensing, this should be considered as ‘one’ in terms of golden cores.”","“Eh? Is someone talking near my ear?” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair suddenly said.","Scarlet Heaven Sword responded, “I don’t think so, and besides, Chu Pavilion Master, you only have one strand of hair here, where could you have ears?”","“I actually do have them... if needed, this strand of hair can have anything on it,” said Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair — her dumb hair could even grow little legs to move the ground before Song Shuhang exploded and run to a safe location.","“Let’s not stray off topic, it’s our turn to take action,” said the ninth dragon pattern seriously. “The golden core has successfully condensed; next, we enter the stage of binding the golden core. We need to be quick... otherwise, the golden core will turn into a Spirit Lake then condense into a Nascent Soul, which might lead to accidents.”","As it currently stands, after turning into a golden core, the Scholarly Sage’s eyes had been tainted with Tyrannical Song’s aura. However, considering this is an ‘External Elixir Field,’ the relationship between the Sage’s Eye Golden Core and Tyrannical Song’s fat whale golden core needs to be developed further to be secure.","Senior White Two nodded, “Confucian Daoist, we need your assistance next.”","“I am here, what do you need me to do?” asked the will of Heavenly Dao Authority embodied by Daozi.","The three-eyed young senior placed his monocle back over the third eye on his forehead, “Just follow my commands.”","“According to our previous research, induce the eternal attribute from the Scholarly Sage’s eyes and stabilize it.”","“Next, let the two golden cores start to resonate.”","“Very good, very smooth. Just as we speculated, once the Golden Core is transformed, the Sage’s Eye is by default considered a part of ‘Tyrannical Song’. The undying fat whale Golden Core won’t reject the Sage’s Eye Golden Core anymore.”","The two different Golden Cores resonated with each other very successfully.","Even the ‘eternal’ attribute from the Sage’s Eye Golden Core vaguely tended to complement the undying attribute in the fat whale Golden Core.","Song Shuhang’s ‘undying fat whale Golden Core’ was slightly inferior to Cloud Gauze Three View Moon’s ‘bone of eternity’—his resurrection had a cooldown period, unlike Cloud Gauze’s unrestricted and immediate return from death.","But now, the ‘eternal’ attribute that came with the Sage’s Eye was supplementing the undying fat whale Golden Core.","The cooldown period of the fat whale Golden Core’s resurrection ability began to continuously decrease.","Once the two were completely bound, Tyrannical Song’s immediate resurrection upon death would no longer be a dream.","In the distance, the despair points of the female giant turtle of disaster climbed by 1000.","Being a turtle is just too hard.","...","...","“The last step, guide the Sage’s Eye Golden Core to Song Shuhang’s original dantian, or guide the fat whale Golden Core to the ‘External Elixir Field that mimics the Dragon Network.’ Hurry up, Father Goudan, stop dazing out!” the three-eyed young senior constantly directed all members.","Especially Father Goudan, the striped dragon: he was the primary labor force whom Senior Three-Eyed was exploiting.","Even Daozi didn’t sweat as much as Father Goudan in this project.","Father Goudan knew this fetishist was messing with him... but considering Song Goudan’s project was of great importance, Father Goudan gritted his teeth and endured it.","“Choose the second option, Fairy Creation. Let the fat whale Golden Core go and allow it to enter the ‘External Dragon Network mimic Golden Core’ node,” Senior White Two chose.","The original dantian was not easy to meddle with. For experiments, naturally, the external elixir field was more convenient, and more direct.","Fairy Creation reluctantly released her grasp, letting the fat whale Golden Core go.","Daozi and Father Goudan acted at the same time while Senior White Two and the three-eyed young senior directed from the side, smoothly guiding the fat whale Golden Core into the node of the ‘External Dragon Network mimic Golden Core’.","With the support of the Heavenly Dao Authority, they were initiating the final ‘binding’ process for the two types of Golden Cores.","The final binding and synchronization process lasted a long, drawn-out ten hours.","The two Sage’s Eyes began to revolve around the ‘fat whale Golden Core’.","“[This scene... how nostalgic. It’s like a very, very long time ago, there were little suns and moons revolving around the Black Dragon World.] Memories of a very distant past flashed through Lady Fat Ball’s mind of the Dragon Network.","That should be the scene when the Black Dragon World had just stabilized.","The Black Dragon World was also round and large, with two celestial objects becoming stars and satellites, bringing the cycle of day and night to the Black Dragon World.","“The experiment should have been successful,” Senior Three-Eyes stated as he put away the lens over his forehead.","“Does that mean that now even if one ‘Sage’s Eye’ is consumed, it can be restored through the power of the ‘undying fat whale Golden Core’?” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair asked.","Senior Three-Eyed nodded, “In theory, that is correct. But of course, we will need to conduct an experiment to confirm.”","“How will we experiment?” Scarlet Heaven Sword inquired.","Senior Three-Eyed suggested devilishly, “Why not let Tyrannical Song die once?”"]},{"number":3031,"title":"Chapter 3031 - 3029: This time showing their divinity is a monster whale that can play ball!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3031: Chapter 3029: This time showing their divinity is a monster whale that can play ball!","Miss Giant Turtle of Disaster: “My... ah, after the dew at dawn, the green pines are bathed as if in balm!!”","She hadn’t even recovered from her despair when the big shots on the scene began to discuss bombing Tyrannical Song once more?","That’s just despicable!","The giant turtles of disaster were like pitiable cleaners, silently sweeping the floor while some disgustingly slick bastards kept making more trash, even going so far as to throw it right in front of them.","Had it not been for her inability to defeat these big shots, she would have turned the tables on them, believe it or not?","As she thought this, Miss Giant Turtle of Disaster curled up, tucking her delicate body inside her shell.","She felt certain she must have been infected by Tyrannical Song. She had never been this timid before! It must be because she had once eaten Tyrannical Song and caught his timidity virus.","On the other hand.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair gently swayed, giving the ruler of the Netherworld a glance.","It really was fitting of the ruler of the Netherworld. Ordinary people may just be slick, but the ruler of the Netherworld spewed oil wells with their slickness.","If the experiment was to test whether the Scholarly Sage’s Eye could resurrect after being consumed, all that was needed was to damage one of the Sage’s Eyes to a certain degree, and see if the fat whale golden core could restore it. Why would they ever need to have Song Shuhang die once?","Only the ruler of the Netherworld would propose such an idea.","“No need to experiment anymore, the golden cores touched by the teacher’s eyes have already thoroughly bound with Tyrannical Song’s main whale core, and I can determine this through my Heavenly Dao Authority,” Daozi’s will manifested spoke.","It’s quite convenient to have a ‘Heavenly Dao big shot’ around at times like these.","“Then Overlord Body, communicate with Shuhang’s consciousness and let him temporarily return his main consciousness, we’re about to try the ‘Inheriting the Sage’s Talent’ project,” Senior White two directed at Self-Corpse Overlord.","No sooner had Senior White two spoken than in the External Elixir Field, patterned after the Dragon Network, the fat whale golden core and the Sage’s Eye Golden Core underwent another change.","From within the Sage’s Eye Golden Core, it was as if ‘tears’ were flowing.","These tears, once fallen, transformed into springs within the Spirit Lake.","In a mere moment, a Spirit Lake overflowed, quickly filling the node of the External Elixir Field.","But similar to the Sixth Stage Realm mechanical core reactor and the fat whale golden core, the Sage’s Eye Golden Core did not dissolve; instead, it created the Spirit Lake through another method.","Not long after the birth of the Spirit Lake, it swiftly transitioned to the next stage.","From the depths of the Spirit Lake, a lotus bud began to grow.","Within the lotus, Song Shuhang’s ninth Nascent Soul began to take form.","Just wait for the lotus bud to bloom, and it would be time for the birth of the Nascent Soul.","“Father Goudan, want to make a bet? Guess how many Nascent Souls will be there?” The three-eyed young senior suddenly became interested.","With two Sage’s Eye Golden Cores, will there emerge twin Nascent Souls within the lotus?","The three-eyed young senior suddenly wanted to make a bet.","But no sooner had he spoken than the lotus opened.","Not even giving the ruler of the Netherworld a chance to bet.","The real answer is... an empty husk!","The lotus was hollow, the ninth Nascent Soul of Tyrannical Song that should have been born was nowhere to be seen.","“Huh? How did this happen?” The big shots present looked puzzled at the empty lotus.","Even if two Sage’s Eye Golden Cores did not produce twin Nascent Souls, at least one should have been born, right?","Why was it empty?","“Could it be an ‘invisible’ Nascent Soul, or perhaps one without any sense of presence?” Father Goudan speculated.","He remembered something about Tyrannical Song’s Self-Corpse Overlord... what was it?","“I feel that the Nascent Soul should have already been born,” Senior White two also said and at the same time, he looked towards Daozi’s will manifestation.","“It’s so strange, I sense that the ‘Nascent Soul’ should have been born as well. But in front of me, there is no trace of the Nascent Soul.” Even Daozi could not come up with an exact answer, “As an 8.5 Heavenly Dao, I really have many areas where I’m not as good as the real original Heavenly Dao.”","As they spoke, the aura of the Sage’s Eye Golden Core boosted further, advancing into the next stage of evolution.","Golden Core, Spirit Lake, Nascent Soul... Next up was the Eighth Stage’s Sage Seal stage.","The seven major sage seals of Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Demon, Tyrannical Dragon, Seal of Annihilation, Tyrannical Nether, and Tyrannical Saber stepped forth from Song Shuhang’s smaller dantians.","Simultaneously, the Overlord World’s Seal of the Sector Lord made its appearance from the main whale core.","The power of the Eight Great Seals combined, blessing the Sage’s Eye Golden Core.","“Time for tribulation?” Scarlet Heaven Sword inquired.","To be honest, with Tyrannical Song’s current power, undergoing tribulation was simply bullying the heavenly tribulation. Besides, this was a heavenly tribulation condensed by the Sage’s double eyes... This was not undergoing tribulation; it was the heavenly tribulation undergoing the Tyrannical Song Tribulation.","“The process is still necessary, just go through the motions,” Daozi said.","At the same time, Daozi’s will stretched out its hand, ready to send Tyrannical Song into the “Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm” to go through the motions.","The process of overcoming tribulation had lost its meaning; it was enough to let the heavenly tribulation strike a few peremptory bolts of thunder.","Just as Daozi reached out, the fat whale golden core and the Sage Eye Golden Core leaped in sync.","And then... the two of them joined forces and barged into the “Eighth Stage Profound Sage Heavenly Tribulation” space.","Daozi: “???”","“What’s this? The Golden Cores went to overcome tribulation on their own?” The Heavenly Emperor’s child was stunned.","In her long life, this was the first time she had seen such a scene.","During tribulation, the cultivator’s main body is busy, yet it’s just the golden cores that are thrown into the tribulation?","“Basic operation, basic operation, please sit down,” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair said.","Although it was her first time witnessing this, her immunity was strong! During the days she rooted herself on Tyrannical Song’s head, every now and then, she would encounter Tyrannical Song’s unusual antics.","After seeing so much, not to mention golden cores undergoing tribulation by themselves, even if Song Shuhang suddenly and accidentally obliterated the entire myriad practitioners in the universe, she wouldn’t be surprised.","There’s nothing in this world that can surprise me anymore.jpg","“Wait, if the Golden Cores are undergoing tribulation, what about the speech?” Daozi’s will hurriedly said.","The script for “showing one’s divinity in front of the masses” he had written for Tyrannical Song hadn’t even started before it was torn to shreds.","Does the Heavenly Dao have no pride?","Daozi’s will directly used the Heavenly Dao Authority to lock onto the “Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm” where the Sage Eye Golden Core and the fat whale golden core were undergoing tribulation.","But as soon as his will stepped out, the tribulation of the Sage Eye Golden Core had already ended.","—The Eighth Stage Profound Sage Heavenly Tribulation hadn’t even unleashed its power; the entire space’s force was devoured by the fat whale golden core + the Sage Eye Golden Core.","The body of the entire Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm felt as if it had been hollowed out.","Even the power that supported the platform for “showing one’s divinity in front of the masses” was gone.","If not for the strand of spiritual power spit back by the fat whale golden core in the end, even the “showing one’s divinity in front of the masses” would have been stuck.","Daozi’s will: “...”","What else can I say?","The Teacher’s eyeballs are awesome!","With the support of that wisp of spiritual power spit back by the fat whale golden core, the “showing one’s divinity in front of the masses” session finally began.","That day.","The cultivators in the myriad realms once again smelled a familiar scent.","They skillfully set aside their tasks at hand.","Even those cultivators engaged in a duel silently parted from each other, mutually establishing a safe distance, and tacitly looked up at the sky.","“I bet it’s Big Shot Tyrannical Song again!”","“But didn’t Tyrannical Song say that the last time was his final speech?”","“But after he said that the one before the last, he still did ‘one final speech’ last time.”","“Don’t panic, we will know whether it’s Big Shot Tyrannical Song in a bit.”","In the midst of conversation...","The “showing one’s divinity in front of the masses” session commenced.","First, a shiny little sphere appeared before everyone.","“What’s this?”","“Is it some magical treasure? Is this what the big shot is using this time?”","Then, another glittering little sphere showed its divinity.","“Are these the big shot’s two balls?”","“Eh, don’t you guys think these spheres look a bit like Golden Cores?”","Stop fooling around, this is an Eighth Stage Profound Sage showing their divinity, where would there be Golden Cores?”","Last, the fat whale golden core also appeared before everyone.","“Is the entity showing their divinity this time a monster whale?”","“A major figure among the whales who can play with balls, and play with two of them?”"]},{"number":3032,"title":"Chapter 3032 - 3030: Are All the Newcomers Showing Their Divinity This Year Monsters?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3032: Chapter 3030: Are All the Newcomers Showing Their Divinity This Year Monsters?","“Speaking of which, fellow friends, don’t you think this whale saint looks a bit like a Golden Core? The material’s luster and the patterns on the whale’s body, don’t they resemble golden dragon patterns? I even feel like I faintly saw an image resembling a ‘composition of my Golden Core’?” a cultivator said as he watched the ‘show of divinity in front of the masses’ and opened the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ expressing his inner doubts in his own friend group.","After Tyrannical Song promoted the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ practitioners from the myriad realms had adapted to its existence and found it increasingly indispensable.","Actually, in the myriad realms, there were similar chatting magical tools and technological products.","However, nothing like Tyrannical Song’s ‘Cultivator Chat System’ existed before, which broke through the restrictions of myriad realms and gathered all the practitioners of the universe together.","It was the difference between a local area network and a truly universal network of the myriad realms.","“How could it be a Golden Core, does your Golden Core look like a whale?” someone in the friend group immediately retorted.","How could there possibly be a cultivator’s Golden Core that looks like a whale?","“This must be a whale saint from the monster race... Has such a whale saint been undergoing tribulation lately?”","“Yes, reliable sources say that Sage Monarch Melon Eater is currently undergoing heavenly tribulation—but it’s undergoing the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, unrelated to the Eighth Stage.”","The practitioners from the myriad realms began guessing about the origin and identity of this ‘whale saint with two spherical magical treasures.’ Is it some big shot?","This whale saint looked completely golden, had it cultivated some sort of Golden Body Technique?","“At least it’s not the big shot Tyrannical Song undergoing tribulation.”","“But I feel so conflicted. Nowadays, every time someone shows their divinity, I worry it’s Tyrannical Song again, so I keep hoping to see a new Profound Sage emerge... But when a new Profound Sage actually shows divinity, I start to miss Tyrannical Song all over again.”","“I totally understand your feelings, because after getting used to the top-notch immortal dishes from immortal chefs, going back to eating regular food feels utterly tasteless. Our current state is similar to that.”","Accustomed to Tyrannical Song’s sensational actions and his Profound Sage Speeches that far surpassed the ordinary ‘Eighth Stage Profound Sage,’ listening to a regular ‘Profound Sage Speech’ feels somewhat inferior.","But if you think about it, the rank of Profound Sage Speeches is already very high. Normally, if you’re at your own sect, hoping to hear a Profound Sage Speech might happen once in a hundred years.","Even now with Tyrannical Song’s ‘Cultivator Chat System’ VIP membership, listening online to a Profound Sage Speech would still only happen once every year or two... and it costs spirit stones too!","“Stop chatting, we are about to enter the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ phase. Later, after the speech ends, remember to leave a positive review for the newly inaugurated Profound Sage, and definitely don’t disdain it just because the whale saint’s speech isn’t as good as Tyrannical Song!” many elders in the myriad realms began to admonish their juniors.","Tyrannical Song had invisibly raised the quality ceiling for ‘Profound Sage Speeches,’ but everyone should not disdain ordinary Profound Sages for not speaking well, and shouldn’t be misled by Tyrannical Song’s rhythm.","—After all, in the future everyone will also aim to prove their Dao as a Profound Sage, and it’s better to prepare the juniors mentally in advance to avoid pitfalls for themselves in the future.","...","...","While the normal cultivators were speculating wildly, some of the top experts and Immortal big shots in the myriad realms were also shocked and sat up, focusing intently on the screen showing the divinity.","“An aura of eternity?” The Primordial Demoness’s eyes widened; she had just received her ‘New Year’s task’ reward, so she was particularly sensitive to ‘eternity.’","This golden whale saint’s body faintly emitted the scent of eternity, and even those two small spheres nearby were the same.","Were all the divine manifestations this year monsters?","Not only the Primordial Demoness but other top-tier Immortals also became serious, all ears.","They had a premonition...","That the speech from this golden whale saint would probably not be weaker than Tyrannical Song’s sensational acts.","...","...","Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Yellow Mountain, feeling very tired and wanting to retire, logged online and silently typed a string of ellipses.","“This golden whale looks a bit familiar,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer slowly said, “And it looks quite delicious.”","Cats love to eat fish... whales aren’t fish, but it has ‘fish’ in its name, and Young Master Phoenix Slayer also loves to eat.","Fairy Dongfang Six replied, “How could it not look familiar? If you look closely, you’ll find that we’re all on the whale.”","On the body of the fat whale, a faint pattern was visible.","On the pattern, there was a star road.","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group were all drawn with names.","“It’s Senior Song’s golden core of the fat whale~da~” Soft Feather happily said, “There are two of me on the composition of my Golden Core.”","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman sighed, “Really, most men are like pigs; didn’t we agree that it won’t be the last time to show our divinity in front of the masses? Now it seems like men who keep their vows recorded in a notebook and practice them one by one, like me, are nearly extinct.”","Fish Bait Hermit couldn’t help speaking out: ”","“Already being immortals, are we still not giving up on showing our divinity in front of the masses? Song Shuhang really likes showing his divinity, doesn’t he?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was feeling stifled.","Fairy Dongfang Snow commented, “Exactly, already being immortals... and that’s the end of the topic...","The sky of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, at that moment, finally died from being discussed.","After a good while.","It was Soft Feather who restarted the topic: “Actually, I’m quite curious about how Senior Song’s Golden Core should be described.”","The Golden Core couldn’t speak, so how could it be described?","“I feel, those two small spheres, give me a heavy feeling. I subconsciously want to avoid them... Maybe in a while, little friend Song Shuhang’s ‘speech’ could rely on these two small spheres?” Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue said solemnly.","Fairy Lychee interjected, “Um, Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue. I just got news from my sister, those two small spheres... are a pair of the Scholarly Sage’s Eyes.”","Seven-Life Saint Lord exclaimed, “!!!”","“If they really are a pair of the Scholarly Sage’s Eyes, then there’s no need to describe them.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was quick to think of withdrawing from the ‘spectator’ state.","The Eyes of a Sage, and a pair at that!","This was about to be the moment where just a slight gaze at the practitioners in the universe, would make everyone willingly contribute a ‘good karma review.’","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator even imagined this scene in his mind.","...","...","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One group identified the identity of the fat whale golden core, but to the unrelated practitioners in the universe, who couldn’t see the ‘composition of the Golden Core’ on the fat whale, it was still regarded as a certain ‘Demon Whale’ proving its Dao as a Profound Sage.","The scene of showing their divinity around the whale core and the Sage Eye Golden Core eventually moved to the next segment.","Profound Sage Speech.","It was a time of benefits for the practitioners in the universe.","The fat whale swam leisurely, unable to give the speech itself.","Thus, it was preparing for its main body to come and save the situation.","Meanwhile, Daozi, who had been preparing in the dark, finally made a move... he presented his painstakingly written ‘Heavenly Dao Lecture Notes’!"]},{"number":3033,"title":"Chapter 3033 - 3031: Look, Whose Face is Smiling in the Clouds","paragraphs":["Chapter 3033: Chapter 3031: Look, Whose Face is Smiling in the Clouds","The fat whale golden core can’t speak?","The Sage Eye Golden Core can’t read a script?","Is that a problem?","Normally, during the Profound Sage Speech segment, this indeed would be a fatally tempting problem.","But with the Will of the Heavens personally assisting backstage, none of this is a problem!","With the Will of the Heavens, all these problems can be easily resolved.","Daozi directly used the authority of the Heavenly Dao to forcibly transfer Tyrannical Song’s ‘voice line’, temporarily moving Tyrannical Song’s ability to ‘speak’ to the fat whale golden core!","Afterward, he converted his self-written script into data information and fed it into both the fat whale golden core and the Sage Eye Golden Core.","Thus, the fat whale and Sage Eye golden core could become ‘Script Readers’, delivering lectures to the myriad practitioners in the universe.","While reading, the Script Readers might not be able to immerse themselves in comprehension and may not be able to deliver a lecture passionately.","But no worries, with the Heavenly Dao arranging everything behind the scenes, the atmosphere and everything could be stirred up!","Whatever Heaven and Earth Phenomena, wonders discussed in the lectures, and changes in spiritual power—whatever was needed would be available.","Even the dull, uninspired reading voice could be tuned to perfection through the power of ‘Million Sound Tunes’.","...","...","After making a round, the fat whale golden core suddenly stopped. It opened its mouth, and started to move up and down.","The two ‘Sage Eye Golden Core’ floated above the head of the fat whale golden core, forming a ‘mouth + eyes’ combination.","The next moment, Heaven and Earth Phenomena began to appear crazily.","Stuff like Earth-rising Golden Lotus, Heavenly Descending Auspicious Cloud, Eight Hundred Miles Purple Cloud, the illusion of the Dragon Flying Phoenix Dance, projections of a massive Enlightenment Ancient Tree...","All sorts of chaotic wonders bombarded the entire interface of the ‘Profound Sage Speech,’ dazzling to behold.","Practitioners in the universe widened their eyes.","Such a situation had never occurred from the beginning of the universe until now.","Even during Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s multiple lectures... the Heaven and Earth Phenomena had never been this mad.","Moreover, this Whale Saint hadn’t even made a sound while opening its mouth!","The lecture hadn’t even started yet, and the Heaven and Earth Phenomena were already appearing like money meant nothing—what kind of lecture would the Whale Saint deliver next?","What level of ‘law’ could match such a luxurious display of Heaven and Earth Phenomena?","After the myriad wonders flickered by like a horse parade, the Whale Saint’s lecture finally began.","The opening was the sound of the Great Way.","It seemed like the Whale Saint was reciting some vocabulary from its mouth.","But the sound felt incredibly distant, as if it had traveled billions of light-years from the deepest depths of space, finally reaching everyone’s ears.","The sound was somewhat nebulous... yet deafening.","Each word, each phrase seemed to contain supreme cosmic secrets within.","Although most cultivators couldn’t understand, it didn’t matter.","The mere ‘deafening’ sound resonating in their ears had an effect that could ‘pluck the heartstrings’!","The Inner Demons and stray thoughts in the cultivators’ hearts were suppressed under this ‘deafening’ sound, and some of the weaker Inner Demons were even shattered directly.","The so-called Inner Demons that couldn’t be completely eradicated by external interference, broke the legend this time, being directly smashed—an even Big Shot Tyrannical Song, who could harvest Inner Demons as if they were leeks, couldn’t dig out the very roots of them, leaving some roots intact still.","Not just Inner Demons, but also cultivation bottlenecks were constantly shaken and loosened by this ‘deafening’ sound.","Not understanding, not hearing clearly, didn’t affect the process.","As long as one listened, it was effective!","“An Immortal level speech? Starting off this intense?” Only some truly top-tier big shots among the myriad practitioners in the universe could vaguely understand the content of the lecture.","“Is this a Profound Sage? This isn’t a Profound Sage at all!” The Primordial Demoness focused on the Golden Whale Saint, a ‘blocked’ memory in her mind seemingly slowly unlocking.","“I must have seen this golden whale before, and it must have been very recently... very, very recently.” The Primordial Demoness frowned.","Immortality, gold, fat whale—these three were the key words.","Yet, for some reason, the memories related to this part in her mind seemed to become vague under some influence.","“Is it because this is information directly regarding ‘immortality’? So, even at the Immortal Realm, one can’t retain the related memory information for long?” The Primordial Demoness stretched out her hand, tracing in the vacuum as she calculated.","She wanted to deduce what connection she had with the golden whale that carried immortal information.","Just as she was persistently calculating, the content of the fat whale golden core’s lecture in ‘Profound Sage Speech’ suddenly broke through the Immortal level.","The lecture became more profound.","This time, even many relatively young Immortal big shots were completely confused.","Even the veteran Immortals partly grasped the content.","“This is no longer at the level of Immortals!”","“Is it immortal information? @ Primordial Demoness, does the reward for your new year’s task, the message of immortality, share anything in common with this lecture?” Sage of Beast Tamer @ Primordial Demoness in the bragging group.","Before the Primordial Demoness could reply, the group’s acknowledged ‘reliable big shot’ My Family Has a Twin Eggs solemnly said: “It’s immortality, or even... information from the Heavenly Dao! This is more terrifying than ordinary immortal information. Fortunately, the Golden Whale is conducting a lecture through the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ platform. Otherwise, just hearing the content of this lecture would be enough to put everyone to sleep.”","Group member Saint Scythe Heavenly King: “I can no longer hear the specific content of the lecture... I can only hear a series of thunder.”","“That’s the automatic censorship of the laws of the Heavenly Dao,” explained My Family Has a Twin Eggs. “But even if it’s just thunder, if we listen closely, it’s very beneficial to us. Stop talking, savor it, savor it carefully.”","The bragging group immediately became quiet.","Everyone listened to the sound that was already inaudible, which just sounded very impressive.","After merely ten plus minutes, the Whale Saint’s lecture entered the final stage, and then gradually concluded.","The length of the lecture wasn’t particularly long.","The speech by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was much shorter than the previous ones.","But this speech was sublime.","It even featured content at the level of Heavenly Axiom.","Practitioners in the universe listened without understanding from beginning to end, yet they knew that this speech was awesome.","No need to say anything, just send a thumbs-up!","In the Blowing Blow Group.","“Who exactly is this Golden Whale Saint?” Supremacy Golden Meow asked in the group.","Seizing the opportunity, the Primordial Demoness replied, “We might have come into contact with it before. When I searched my memory for the keywords ‘whale, golden, eternity,’ I vaguely felt an impression of it in my memories. However, it might be related to ‘immortal information,’ rendering the memories blurry.”","“We’ve come into contact before? Could it be someone we know?” The Clown Emperor wondered.","The members of the Blowing Blow Group started to list one after another famous figure from the myriad practitioners in the universe, speculating who it might be.","But these names brought up were all denied one by one.","These famous individuals, although powerful, had absolutely no connection to the whale and had nothing to do with eternity.","Finally, the group member Notionless King subconsciously said, “Then... could it be Tyrannical Song?”","After all... if there’s some unfathomable move in the Profound Sage Speech that ordinary people can’t understand and you don’t know who pulled it off, then it must’ve been Tyrannical Song!","The words of Notionless King were like a key, seemingly unlocking the blurred memories of the members in the Blowing Blow Group.","The members of the Blowing Blow Group fell into deep thought.","They pondered hard, striving to restore the blurred memories.","The Blowing Blow Group suddenly became quiet.","...","...","At the same time.","In the myriad practitioners in the universe.","The cultivators offered their praises, contributing their portion of virtue power to this big shot Whale Saint.","Countless virtue power from the universe converged and fell upon the ‘fat whale golden core’ during the speech phase.","“I didn’t expect that aside from big shot Tyrannical Song, there would be another Profound Sage big shot who could make the speech phase so interesting.”","“The Whale Saint’s speech is no weaker than big shot Tyrannical Song!”","“Not just no weaker, I even feel that the Whale Saint’s speech is even more powerful than big shot Tyrannical Song’s!”","“Big shot Tyrannical Song’s speech is strong, and he has many flashy moves, even surpassing the ordinary Immortal speeches. But this Whale Saint’s speech content feels like it’s on a higher level and a different story! This feeling is very intuitive and obvious... even though I don’t understand any of it.”","It’s only with something to compare that the term ‘stronger’ can exist.","It’s precisely because ‘big shot Tyrannical Song’ was a benchmark that the strength of this Whale Saint’s speech became even more prominent.","When everyone thought that big shot Tyrannical Song’s speech couldn’t be surpassed, someone turned the impossible into possible!","This record-breaking feeling was truly invigorating!","At this moment, the majority of the cultivators in the universe felt that the virtue power gathered by ‘Whale Saint’ should be comparable to big shot Tyrannical Song!","Even surpassing the virtue power of big shot Tyrannical Song wouldn’t be a surprise!","With this mindset, the virtue power transformed from the rave reviews of the practitioners in the universe grew even more formidable.","If the virtue power could be converted to spirit stones, the ‘fat whale golden core’ would have earned enough for Tyrannical Song to pay off his debts!","“Speaking of which... was there a segment of Whale Saint’s speech that was left out?” After the virtue praise phase ended, the cultivators began to sober up.","Finally, someone noticed something off, feeling that something was missing from the Whale Saint’s speech.","A moment later...","“Where’s the Sage Seal? Right, where is the Sage Seal?” cultivators in the corners of the universe found this issue one after another.","The Whale Saint had finished his speech, yet the Sage Seal hadn’t condensed!","No wonder they kept calling him ‘Whale Saint big shot’ without ever mentioning his Sage Name.","He hadn’t even begun condensing the Sage Seal!","“As expected of Whale Saint, even in the Profound Sage Speech phase, he has to be unique. These flashy moves are on par with big shot Tyrannical Song’s multiple times on the stage.”","“They’re all big shots who’ve rubbed the ‘rules of the Profound Sage Speech’ into the ground.”","“So, the Sage Seal should be condensing next, right? I wonder what kind of Sage Seal will the Whale Saint condense?”","As everyone speculated, sure enough, the Whale Saint began the phase of condensing the Sage Seal.","The virtue power and the power of the Sage Seal began synchronizing.","The top-tier big shots also concentrated their attention on this scene—intuition told them, the Sage Name would unravel the true identity of the Whale Saint!","A perfectly square embryonic form of the Sage Seal condensed successfully.","This Sage Seal, merging with the virtue power, virtue pouring into the Sage Seal, was both the Sage Seal and also the Great Seal of Virtue!","As the Sage Seal took shape, a huge face appeared as a projection in the vacuum, projected upon ‘Sage Seal.’","That was a young, kind face, seemingly capable of speaking.","This face, covering the clouds, reflected across the universe and was perceived by every viewer who looked up at the ‘speech.’","Conveniently, due to the angle, the two round golden cores were right at where the giant facial projection’s ‘eye sockets’ would be, shining brightly.","“Ah, ahh!” The throats of cultivators in the universe seemed to seize up.","It’s him!","Tyrannical... Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!","The man who had given his last speech!"]},{"number":3034,"title":"Chapter 3034 - 3032: Overbearing Dumb Dumb","paragraphs":["Chapter 3034: Chapter 3032: Overbearing Dumb Dumb","“`","The man who has both shocked and delighted the myriad practitioners in the universe is presently hanging above the clouds, and he’s laughing!","The cultivators from the myriad realms, despite having a myriad of thoughts, can’t find the right words to spout what they’re feeling!","They feel like they’re suffocating.","After a long while.","“Damn, it’s Tyrannical Song again.” Statements with similar sentiments arose in various corners of the myriad realms, each voiced in their own ‘languages’.","Even the most learned individuals could only resort to the simplest of swear words to express a feeling of ‘damn’ or ‘what the fuck’ at this moment.","Just a second ago, everyone was still wondering how impressive this ‘Whale Saint’ was, surpassing the record and level of Big Shot Tyrannical Song within his own domain of the ‘Profound Sage Speech’—for which practitioners in the universe had given their approval and light of virtue from the bottom of their hearts, cheering for the Whale Saint.","But the next second, this awesome Whale Saint... turned out to be Big Shot Tyrannical Song.","[As expected, it’s this man again, the one holding his last speech. He’s changing his way to spout his teachings, and he even swindled my likes and virtue reviews.]","On this day, living beings realized that no matter how wild they get, they could never outdo Big Shot Tyrannical Song.","They can’t breathe.","They feel a heaviness in their chests.","They’re rendered speechless.","Their feelings are mixed with a sense of grievance.","If one really needs to summarize this complex emotion, it would be... truly awesome!","The teachings of Big Shot Tyrannical Song remain as appealing as ever!","For the sake of Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s ‘True Fragrance Teachings’, the already squeezed-dry cultivators of the myriad realms once again squeezed out the last bit of their reviews and virtue in approval for the big shot.","...","...","[From now on, any Profound Sage Speech that I can’t understand, any new Profound Sage whose identity I can’t recognize, any abnormal Profound Sage Lecturing process, I’ll just treat it as Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s doing!]","The cultivators of the myriad realms, looking at the seemingly talkative face of Big Shot Tyrannical Song above the clouds, collectively came to this decision in their hearts.","“If you think about it... we really shouldn’t have guessed that it was some ‘Whale Saint Big Shot’. From the start of the whole series of flashy speech moves, we should’ve thought of Tyrannical Song.”","“In the segment of ‘Profound Sage Speech’, the only one who could surpass Tyrannical Song... is himself!”","Now, no one can stand shoulder to shoulder with Tyrannical Song in the segment of ‘Profound Sage Speech’.","There was none in the past, none now, and it’s very unlikely that there will be anyone in the distant future.","Soon, the shock of the practitioners of the myriad realms stabilizes.","Then they finally notice some details.","“Wait a second... what are those two spheres in the eye sockets of Tyrannical Song’s facial projection? What are these two golden spheres? My legs feel a bit weak.”","Right in the eye sockets of the chatty little face of Big Shot Tyrannical Song floating in the clouds were those golden spheres; before, they all thought these were the magical treasures of the Whale Saint... but now, it seems like they’re something else.","And it’s probably something they didn’t really want to see!","“Eyes, eyeballs?” someone said, trembling.","[Here it comes... you’ve finally noticed this detail.] The Daozi, the big shot behind the scenes orchestrating as Will of the Heavens, had been waiting for this moment.","He had already sent sufficient cheers for Tyrannical Song and had perfectly concluded the speech segment.","So, as this speech revealing divinity is about to end... it’s time for the teacher’s eyeballs to make an appearance.","After all, these eyeballs will eventually become Tyrannical Song’s Golden Core.","If they don’t gain some presence now, there will be no chance in the future.","The Scholarly Sage’s eyeballs have already become a Golden Core and can no longer be manipulated by Song Shuhang to switch to eyeball form without his control.","Daozi, as the Will of the Heavens, could forcefully control the Golden Core to switch to eyeball form... but doing so would be impolite.","Moreover, revealing the Scholarly Sage’s eyes directly is an inferior way to gain presence.","As the Will of the Heavens, Daozi naturally has a more ingenious plan.","At this moment, the virtue power gathered from the myriad realms all merged into the new ‘Sage Seal’.","Subsequently, a new Sage Name began to condense.","“`","This time, during the Golden Core tribulation, Tyrannical Song’s main consciousness hadn’t come over yet.","Therefore, he didn’t select his ‘New Sage Title’ immediately.","Consequently, this gave Daozi the opportunity to manipulate things from behind the scenes.","He rapidly cobbled together a series of ‘alternative Sage Titles’, appearing above the New Sage Seal.","Included were titles Song Shuhang had already used, like ‘Tyrannical Scholar’, titles that resonated with Song Shuhang’s thoughts like ‘Tyrant Saint’, and others that Daozi added like ‘Tyrant Man’, ‘Ba Shen’, ‘Ba Diao’ and the like.","One Sage Title after another emerged.","This was no longer a hint; it was an explicit indication.","— As the Will of the Heavens, the ‘Sage Titles’ that Daozi added were just to give Song Shuhang more options, some strange titles would be filtered out in the background, not affecting Song Shuhang.","With each Sage Title that emerged, practitioners in the universe felt a chill in their hearts.","Each of these titles seemed related to the ‘Scholarly Sage’ somehow.","And the closest relation to the ‘Scholarly Sage’ that Big Shot Tyrannical Song had... was naturally the Sage’s Eyes.","Could this pair of golden spherical magical treasures be the ‘Sage’s Eyes’?","Although Daozi, behind the scenes, was still expressionless, he was smiling internally.","He extended his hand and pointed again.","He added the sparkling ‘Tyrannical Eyes’ as another Sage Title.","“Aaargh... No, please...” At this moment, cultivators in the universe already wanted to kneel.","“It’s the Scholarly Sage’s Eyes! Definitely the Scholarly Sage’s Eyes!”","“Exit the speech viewing section, exit!”","“Close your eyes, quickly close your eyes, don’t look directly at Big Shot Tyrannical Song!”","Such comments filled the Myriad Realms.","But how could there be an option to exit the Profound Sage Speech section?","Moreover, how could the Will of the Heavens provide an option to exit the viewing when this was about giving his own teacher’s eyeballs ‘the last bit of presence’?","“Let’s add one more Sage Title at the end,” Daozi decided in his heart.","The ‘Sage Titles’ he added would be filtered out in the background and were merely for show to the audience of the Myriad Realms.","So, messing up the lineup of Tyrannical Song’s Sage Titles didn’t matter.","“How about something like ‘Tyrant Scholar’?” Daozi pondered.","No sooner had the words left his mouth than...","A new Sage Title quietly emerged.","Ba Mei!","Daozi was startled: “I didn’t do that... This wasn’t my doing, was it?”","How did this Sage Title appear?","Ba Mei, Ba Dull Dull?","Isn’t this the secret code style of the little junior sister?","Could this be a New Sage Title subconsciously conjured up by little friend Tyrannical Song, choosing it as his New Sage Title?","As Daozi was thinking this, the process of condensing the Sage Title was nearing its end.","Sure enough, in Tyrannical Song’s subconscious, he had already settled on this as the final Sage Title.","The Sage Seal shone with colors.","Tyrannical Song’s Ninth Seal— Ba Mei’s Sage Seal!","“Wait a minute, stop joking around. If you take this Sage Title, Shuhang might regret it later,” Daozi quickly pointed and forcibly summoned a wisp of Tyrannical Song’s main consciousness.","“While the Sage Seal isn’t completely finalized, you still have time to change your Sage Name,” Daozi urged, “I can modify it for you in the background, but you have to make it quick, no hesitations!”","Hesitation leads to defeat."]},{"number":3035,"title":"Chapter 3035 - 3033: Is It Time to Kill the Immortal and Offer a Sacrifice to the Sky?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3035: Chapter 3033: Is It Time to Kill the Immortal and Offer a Sacrifice to the Sky?","The summoned strand of Tyrannical Song’s consciousness was incredibly calm.","“Ba Mei, so that’s what it is... It’s a very wonderful blessing,” Shuhang’s consciousness spoke slowly.","Daozi was utterly puzzled, “????”","A blessing?","Is it a blessing from my little junior sister?","But I really can’t understand it at all, I can’t see what kind of blessing this is supposed to be.","Maybe... should I gouge out the eyeballs of the Heavenly Dao of the Three-Eyed Sovereign later? What if it works?","“This Ba Mei Sage Name is a blessing for the Sage and for the scholarly system, possessing a very beautiful meaning. Thus, if I use this Ba Mei as my Sage Name, I have no objections,” Song Shuhang said gently.","“Are you really not planning to change it?” Daozi reminded, “You should know, the blessings and meanings within Ba Mei, only you understand them, others can’t see them. They might even mistake it as Tyrant Dazed.”","“It is the meaning of Tyrant Dazed,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Daozi looked up at the sky, “...”","“However, Daozi Senior, what you said makes sense. Others seeing Tyrant Dazed might find it a bit odd... Hmm, let’s change it then. Let’s go with Tyrant Yan,” Song Shuhang spoke up.","“Tyrant Eye? Eyeballs? Are you sure about this one?” Daozi asked doubtfully.","Is it really okay to be so casual?","“No, not the eye of eyeballs, but the yan of speech,” Song Shuhang said, “It has the second tone.”","Daozi: “...”","When you say yan, you’re not making any distinction between the second and third tones.","“Tyrant Speech, why did you suddenly think of this dao name?” While asking, Daozi quickly operated in the background, covering the ‘Mei’ character with the character for ‘speech’.","“Just now, as I was communicating with the Immortal big shots, I gained insight into the embryonic form of another ‘path to immortality’. This path to immortality relates to the ‘Primordial Language’s Laws’ I realized earlier. So, I feel that ‘Tyrant Speech’ fits well,” Song Shuhang explained.","Daozi’s hands, operating in the background, stiffened: “...”","The embryonic form of a new path to immortality realized just like that?","Is the immortal path really that easy to comprehend?","As Daozi’s operation stiffened, Song Shuhang’s new Sage Seal completely solidified.","All the practitioners in the universe received the message of Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s New Sage Title—[Tyrant Speech]","“Eh? Weird, wasn’t it shown as Ba Mei just now?”","“Why did it suddenly change to Tyrant Speech?”","“Is this another of Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s clever tricks?” the practitioners in the universe wondered with puzzled faces.","“Wait, look closely, look closely at the bottom of the word ‘speech’!” someone suddenly noticed the truth.","After being prompted by their fellow friends, the cultivators started to closely scrutinize the character for ‘speech’.","The next moment, they all discovered at the bottom of the Sage Seal’s ‘speech’ character, there was actually another layer... it was the character for ‘Mei’.","This was a double-layered Sage Seal.","[Ba Mei + Tyrant Speech]The Sage Seal of a Sage with two Sage Names.","“We’ve lost, we’ve still lost to Big Shot Tyrannical Song. I never imagined that in the realm of ‘Sage Seals’, Big Shot Tyrannical Song could come up with such a fresh and clever maneuver.”","“What do we need to do to keep up with Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s pace?”","“I often feel out of place with Big Shot Tyrannical Song because I lack cleverness and don’t have a brain for clever tricks.”","“Next time, can Big Shot Tyrannical Song be even cleverer?”","“Stay calm, this is already Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s last speech... I believe in Big Shot Tyrannical Song.”","“But this time, Big Shot Tyrannical Song didn’t say it was ‘his last speech’, did he? I feel like even Big Shot Tyrannical Song has given up himself.”","In the midst of the various discussions among the practitioners in the universe, above the clouds, the speaking face of Big Shot Tyrannical Song suddenly became animated.","Previously, it was just a photo-like projection.","But now, Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s face began to come to life.","“Is it coming?”","“What’s coming will come, after all, there’s no hiding from it.”","“Do you have contraceptives? I want the durian flavor.”","“Contraceptives are useless, what you need now is a painless abortion...”","The practitioners in the universe clenched their teeth; some began to take medicine, while others skillfully found a comfortable position to lie down.","Since they couldn’t hide, the only choice was to bravely face it!","Running away is a sign of cowardice.","“Ahem~” At this moment, the talking face of Big Shot Tyrannical Song in the vacuum lightly coughed twice before speaking, “Well, I didn’t expect to meet everyone under such circumstances. This time it’s really unexpected... I don’t know what to say, so I’ll just wish everyone a happy New Year, okay?”","[Happy, happy~ Big Shot Tyrannical Song, if you say happy, then we’re happy, whatever you say goes.]","“This time it’s truly unexpected, because the one overcoming tribulation isn’t me, but a Golden Core my seniors and I conjured up. I didn’t expect my Golden Core to also come to overcome tribulation. But you can rest assured, I’m not going to concoct any new Golden Cores, so... there won’t be a next time. You can trust me,” Big Shot Tyrannical Song said with a sincere face.","[Trust, we absolutely trust you. We believe this is your last tribulation this month, Big Shot Tyrannical Song.]","[We also believe Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s Golden Core won’t come to overcome tribulation again; next time we’ll look forward to Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s dazed hair giving a speech.]","[Big Shot Tyrannical Song, don’t panic, please continue giving speeches for ten thousand more years.]","[A speech once a month is quite nice. This is my last shred of light of virtue. Please accept it, Big Shot Tyrannical Song~] A fellow friend who had already been squeezed dry once more wrung out a thread of light of virtue from deep within their bones to support Tyrannical Song.","“I didn’t prepare a script this time, so... everyone go about your business. I’ll head back after I collect the Golden Cores. See you all next time.” Above the clouds, a hand appeared next to Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s face, waving goodbye to everyone.","[Is it over? Is it really over?]","[What was expected to come, didn’t come? Did we dodge a bullet?]","[Farewell, Big Shot Tyrannical Song~~]","The practitioners in the universe were deeply moved in their hearts and bid farewell to Tyrannical Song with the warmest attitude.","In the vacuum, the screen showing the Profound Sage Speech gradually retracted.","The fat whale golden core + Sage Eye Golden Core were all collected by Big Shot Tyrannical Song.","“Three Corpses Tyrant Kindness.” In the vacuum, the voice of Big Shot Tyrannical Song echoed as the image that hadn’t dissipated was still broadcasted across the myriad practitioners in the universe.","——It was as if the live broadcast had ended, but the camera had been forgotten to be turned off.","After Big Shot Tyrannical Song finished the Profound Sage Speech, there was still a segment being played across the myriad practitioners in the universe.","“Main body, I am here,” the figure of Three Corpses Tyrant Kindness materialized.","Scoop~","Big Shot Tyrannical Song reached out and scooped out one of his glass gemstone eyeballs, handing it to Ba Mei, “Take it with you, and delve into the small black room of the Heavenly Dao.”","This glassy eye contained Song Shuhang’s “Seeking Life Through Death Method.”","Three Corpses Tyrant Kindness reached out, removed one of his own eyeballs, then fitted the glass gemstone eyeball into the socket.","Then, escorted by the “small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword,” his figure entered the Heavenly Dao’s small black room and disappeared from sight, along with the three-eyed young senior’s “Companion Magic Device.”","After Ba Mei disappeared, Song Shuhang reached out to take out a Sage Eye Golden Core and inserted it into his own eye socket.","“It’s time to make a sacrifice for the path to immortality,” Song Shuhang said.","The practitioners in the universe heard this and were shocked speechless.","Sacrifice a path to immortality?","Each Immortal only has one such path to immortality.","So, Big Shot Tyrannical Song certainly doesn’t intend to sacrifice his own immortal path.","Then the meaning in Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s words, could it be that he intends to sacrifice an Immortal big shot?"]},{"number":3036,"title":"Chapter 3036 - 3034: I am the Daoist Senior, and I am freaking out right now","paragraphs":["Chapter 3036: Chapter 3034: I am the Daoist Senior, and I am freaking out right now","So, the question arises... who will Tyrannical Song sacrifice next?","In the myriad practitioners in the universe, ordinary cultivators are calm, because they don’t even have the qualifications to be sacrificed by Tyrannical Song.","However, the Immortals and those who have already condensed the nascent form of their path to immortality are panicking.","Especially a few who once vehemently opposed Tyrannical Song.","For example, a certain inspirational emperor of the demonic sect, Senior Devil Emperor Hezhi.","Almost immediately, he activated multiple layers of protection around himself and expanded his consciousness to its limit.","Then he covered himself with multiple disguises and twisted his “Heavenly Mechanism” information to prevent divination.","And he made up his mind, no matter what, he would not respond to any messages sent by Tyrannical Song... he would definitely not take the bait this time!","“It’s still best to switch locations,” even though he had made full preparations, the heart of Demon Emperor Hezhi still wasn’t at ease.","Nowadays, he would change his reclusive location every ten days or half a month.","Over these months, his traces have spread across several planes of existence.","All this is Tyrannical Song’s fault!","Apart from Senior Devil Emperor Hezhi, Demon Emperor Og, who had already been won by the ruler of the Netherworld, is also in a panic.","He is worse off than Demon Emperor Hezhi... because he has already been turned into gambling chips and can’t move.","Now, he can only hope that the ruler of the Netherworld doesn’t hand him over to Song Shuhang. Otherwise, the one to be sacrificed by Song Shuhang would undoubtedly be him.","I am Demon Emperor Og, and I am freaking out right now.","— Besides, Demon Emperor Og and Demon Emperor Hezhi aren’t the only ones panicking. The Immortal-level stone giant that was taken away by Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven for resealing is also freaking out.","Back then... no, it was last year.","To be precise, it was a few months ago when he was joyfully opposing Tyrannical Song.","And he almost blew Tyrannical Song up!","Looking back, the time he spent opposing Song Shuhang was utterly enjoyable.","But now, the stone giant’s heart is in utter turmoil.","He feels like he fits the profile of ‘sacrificial target for Tyrannical Song’ perfectly.","Is Tyrannical Song’s sacrifice a one-time thing? Or is it multiple sacrifices?","Joining Demon Emperor Hezhi, Demon Emperor Og, and the stone giant in their panic is the egg of King Kun.","It’s being studied by Senior White’s clone’s scientific research incarnations.","And compared to the others mentioned above, it’s the most panicked.","Because it remembers... one of Tyrannical Song’s incarnations is still outside, waiting to receive it!","[Holy shit, could it be that I’m the Immortal Tyrannical Song wants to sacrifice?] The egg of King Kun trembles, its core quivering with fear.","Yes, it must be it.","Otherwise, why would Tyrannical Song specifically send an incarnation for it?","Even though it has been given to Lord White, it has observed over time that pretty much anything that belongs to Lord White is Tyrannical Song’s.","Lord White would not skimp on anything Tyrannical Song needs.","This is not at all the style of the ruler of the Netherworld.","So, whether it belongs now to Lord White or to Tyrannical Song makes no difference. If Tyrannical Song wishes to sacrifice it, Lord White would hand it over without hesitation.","I’m doomed, doomed.","The greatest mistake of my life was being a little bit greedy, coveting the White Emperor Sutra from Immortal Fairy White Bones. Not only did I lose all my possessions, but now I’m even going to be sacrificed.","Life as King Kun is too difficult.","Opposing Tyrannical Song feels great for a while, but to keep on doing it feels great all the time.","But as time goes by, the more fantastic it was to oppose him then, the more panicked it makes me now.","...","...","Besides, a group of Immortals in the myriad realms is also secretly communicating with each other.","[By the way, during the time Tyrannical Song challenged the myriad realms and fought for eternity, which of you severely offended him?]","“[There’s no such thing; Tyrannical Song and I are merely engaging in friendly sparring, no one would deliberately offend Tyrannical Song. Leave some leeway in life, so we can meet again in the future. Now, we are in a peaceful society.]","[So who is Tyrannical Song sacrificing?]","[Speaking of which... recently, Tyrannical Song’s metallic ball clone has been inviting Immortals to come and discuss the Dao with Tyrannical Song. If they don’t go, they will be challenged by the incarnation of Tyrannical Song’s metallic ball. Subsequently, a group of fellow daoists went over. Could it be that Tyrannical Song plans to sacrifice those Immortals who went to discuss the Dao?]","The thought was chilling, the more they thought about it, the more frightening it became!","How are those fellow daoists, who were taken away by the incarnation of Tyrannical Song, doing now?","They won’t be next to appear on the sacrificial altar, will they?","[Don’t panic, Tyrannical Song’s character definitely wouldn’t do something to provoke public anger.]At this moment, the Primordial Demoness spoke: [In fact, after careful research, we’ve found that Tyrannical Song isn’t really a nasty person. Even his character should be inclined towards kindness. So... I’m thinking, for this New Year’s event, the ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’ and ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls’ that Tyrannical Song is collecting with the Will of the Heavens, could they be for sacrifice? Although these two are not complete Immortals, among them are some special individuals who are no weaker than Immortals.]","[That makes sense. Now that you mention it, it all makes sense.]","[Just to be safe, why don’t we go and catch a few more ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’ or ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls’? It’s best to capture them alive, for Tyrannical Song to use for sacrifice?]An Immortal big shot suggested.","[Kindness~]","Then, the major powerhouses of the myriad realms set out, energetically diving into the activity of capturing ‘Virtual Sun Guardians’.","...","...","Song Shuhang was still unaware at this time that a single sentence from him had caused such great panic across the myriad realms.","He really didn’t mean it.","With his character, it was impossible for him to suddenly capture some Immortals who bore him no grudges or enmity for sacrifice.","Rather than sacrificing others, Tyrannical Song was more inclined to sacrifice himself.","After all, the ‘undying fat whale golden core’ was there.","“Phew, time to get started,” Song Shuhang extended his hand.","Fairy Creation appeared beside him, holding the Confucian Classic in both hands, handing it to Song Shuhang—this was an indispensable prop for the Saint’s secret techniques.","Then, she gently placed her hand on Song Shuhang’s eye socket, casting a Confucian Healing Technique.","The light from the healing spell flashed by.","Song Shuhang’s Sage Eye Golden Core in his eye socket rotated slightly and transformed back into the Scholarly Sage’s Eye.","However, the original Scholarly Sage’s Eye had now turned into a pure golden color.","[It’s out, the Scholarly Sage’s Eye!]Cultivators from the myriad realms instantly recognized this eye that had once brought them love and pain.","[Even if it changed color, I could recognize it even if it turned to ashes!]","[What is meant to come will still come, won’t it?]","[You can dodge the first day, but not the fifteenth.]","Whether it will be successful or not... let’s see now, Song Shuhang whispered.","He flipped open the Confucian Classic.","Then, another Sage Eye Golden Core, the Sage’s eye in his eye socket, resonated with the Confucian Classic.","A consumable Scholarly Sage’s Eye plus a path to immortality, combined with the secret techniques left behind by the Sage, there’s a chance to inherit the Sage’s innate abilities!","The secret techniques left behind by the Sage were profound and unfathomable.","Fortunately, Song Shuhang had the assistance of Senior White and a group of immortal big shots.","That complicated secret technique of the Sage, under the leadership of Senior White two, was now simplified to the difficulty of ten formation runes.","Song Shuhang began writing in the vacuum.","The secret technique, activated!","First Stage: [Consume a Scholarly Sage’s Eye.]","The Scholarly Sage’s Eye in Song Shuhang’s eye socket lost its luster... and after going blind, the entire Sage’s Eye began to melt.","The secret technique entered the Second Stage: [Consume a path to immortality.]","“Sacrifice the Seeking Life Through Death Method,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","But at this moment, the secret technique underwent a mutation—it locked onto a path to immortality within the Confucian Classic.","Daoist Senior: “???”"]},{"number":3037,"title":"Chapter 3037 - 3035: Are You Changing Clothes?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3037: Chapter 3035: Are You Changing Clothes?","“That is my path to immortality!”","“Stop, stop immediately~”","The Daoist Senior Heavenly Dao big shot was incredibly anxious.","As he was an 8.5 Heavenly Dao, he was bound to be ousted sooner or later... After stepping down, he would rely on a part of his existence stored within the Scholarly Classic and his own “path to immortality” to resurrect perfectly and become a new Scholarly Big Brother?Immortal?Daoist Senior.","But now, as Tyrannical Song was sacrificing the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eye’ + ‘path to immortality’, it had unexpectedly targeted the path to immortality he left within the Scholarly Classic.","This could be fatal!","If the path to immortality left in the Scholarly Classic was consumed, how could he resurrect?","Song Shuhang also quickly noticed the anomalies in the ‘Sage’s secret technique’.","The originally intended ‘Seeking Life Through Death Method’ was not listed as the ‘first consumption target’. Instead, a path to immortality hidden within the Scholarly Classic was particularly favored by the ‘Sage’s secret technique’.","Perhaps it was because the Heavenly Dao big shot’s path to immortality from the Confucian system was part of the immortality paths inside the Scholarly Classic, so it matched especially well with the Sage’s secret technique?","“Stop!” Song Shuhang hurriedly used his own intent to forcefully halt the operation of the ‘Sage’s secret technique’.","Thankfully... after the ‘Sage’s secret technique’ had been modified by Senior White Two and a group of dominant big shots, it had become much easier to control.","If it were the original Sage’s secret technique, the Daoist Senior’s path to immortality inside the Scholarly Classic would probably have been consumed completely by now.","“Whew~” The Daoist Senior breathed a sigh of relief.","He was nearly cut off from his future plans by Tyrannical Song!","“Big Dumb Dao.” Fairy Creation tilted her head and said.","Song Shuhang nodded, “Yes, it was Daoist Senior Brother’s path to immortality. I didn’t expect the Scholarly Classic to still contain Daoist Senior Brother’s path to immortality. Moreover, the Sage’s secret technique almost devoured it.”","Luckily, he stopped the secret technique in time. The Sage’s secret technique had merely locked onto Daoist Senior’s path to immortality and wrapped around it... it was just about to bite down.","After Song Shuhang forcibly stopped the secret technique, Daoist Senior’s ‘path to immortality’ was safely released back, leaving only a lingering taste in the mouth—the kind that leaves a fragrant aftertaste.","Although he didn’t chew off Daoist Senior’s method to immortality, Song Shuhang faintly came into contact with Daoist Senior’s method and noted down some specific information about it.","This effect was even more wonderful than exchanging the ‘core mysteries of the immortal path’ with the big shots in the time-distorted secret realm.","Regrettably, this effect could only be applied to the path to immortality stored in the Scholarly Classic and not on other Immortal big shots.","“Shuhang, wait a moment while I put a patch on the Scholarly Classic,” said Daoist Senior, still feeling the aftershocks.","He then mobilized the Heavenly Dao Authority to put a book cover on the Scholarly Classic.","As it was his teacher’s relic, he naturally wouldn’t alter its contents. Therefore, by covering it with a book cover for protection, he could secure his own remaining existence and the path to immortality and safeguard it from being sacrificed by Tyrannical Song once again.","After the book cover was added, Daoist Senior nodded and responded, “Alright, it’s done.”","“Shall I continue now?” Song Shuhang asked.","Daoist Senior gave a thumbs up, “Go for it.”","Song Shuhang took a deep breath, then reactivated the ‘Sage’s secret technique’.","The paused Sage’s secret technique started spinning again, dashing forward... This time, under Song Shuhang’s control, the secret technique bypassed Daoist Senior’s immortality method, directly locking onto Song Shuhang himself, focusing on the ‘Seeking Life Through Death Immortal Path’.","Everything was proceeding smoothly.","“Phew~ Thankfully, I almost sacrificed Daoist Senior Brother there,” Song Shuhang exhaled in relief.","Fairy Creation sang, “Yi~ Dao~ Big Dumb~ shoo shoo~”","This interaction between the two was broadcast to myriad practitioners in the universe through the yet-to-be-turned-off ‘Profound Sage Speech’ segment.","[Almost sacrificed Daoist Senior? If I remember correctly... Isn’t this generation’s Heavenly Dao the first of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of Confucianism, Daoist Senior?]","[Yes, you remembered correctly. Daoist Senior is the Heavenly Dao, and this generation’s Heavenly Dao is Daoist Senior.]","[Does that mean that Tyrannical Song almost sacrificed the Heavenly Dao?]","The hearts of the cultivators in the universe rose to their throats— even the Heavenly Dao almost became a sacrifice to Big Shot Tyrannical Song?","How ruthless!","Could the Heavenly Dao be so disparaged?","Additionally, after incorporating the Netherworld Realm, the Profound Sage Speech domain, and the immortal information into his palm, was Big Shot Tyrannical Song finally going to make a move against the Will of the Heavens?","“The sacrificial ritual definitely isn’t targeting the current body of the Will of the Heavens...” Immortal big shots, look deeper.","The stronger one was, the more they understood the mighty power of eternity and the Will of the Heavens.","Eternity, by its nature, cannot be consumed by sacrifice.","“But could the ‘Sacrificial Secret Method’ in Tyrannical Song’s hands possibly affect the Heavenly Axiom-level immortal existence?” speculated the Immortal big shots.","Those who shared the same thoughts included the giant of the Dark Sun, who was suppressed and sealed by Unknown White + White two + 33.","The Seniors within the Sealing Array were watching the ‘live speech broadcast,’ so, incidentally, the Dark Sun could also catch some of the broadcast benefits.","After seeing this segment of dialogue between Tyrannical Song and Fairy Creation, the once calm Dark Sun giant also started to panic.","It knew that the Will of the Heavens and Tyrannical Song were definitely devising methods targeting it. But, possessing ‘Immortal Material,’ it wasn’t afraid of being targeted.","But now... it seemed Tyrannical Song had indeed researched a technique targeting ‘eternity’?","“What exactly does this sacrifice mean? It definitely isn’t about destroying eternity, as no one in the myriad practitioners in the universe can destroy eternity. So, could it be a method to completely restrict eternity?” the Dark Sun giant, after several iterations of reasoning, but to no avail.","He could only continue watching the divine appearance in the speech, hoping to see what comes next.","The brilliance of the Sage’s Secret Technique enveloped Song Shuhang completely.","In his eye sockets, the Scholarly Sage’s Eye melted completely, leaving only a ‘Golden Core shell.’","Meanwhile, inside Song Shuhang’s body, the ‘Seeking Life Through Death Path’ was also completely depleted.","Song Shuhang’s rank fell from the Immortal level... and the ‘Immortal full moon’ above his head also began to dim.","The aura of an Immortal also began to disperse.","Although the projected image was not as vivid as being on-site, everyone could see that Tyrannical Song’s ‘momentum’ was also gradually decreasing.","The practitioners in the universe were all stunned.","What was this operation?","Tyrannical Song’s rank had fallen?","From an Immortal, he had fallen to the ‘Three Separations Executioner’ level?","Heavens!","It was originally thought that Tyrannical Song was going to sacrifice an Immortal big shot, but from what it looked like now, had Tyrannical Song sacrificed his own ‘path to immortality’?","What was this operation?","The practitioners in the universe were completely baffled.","They had never seen anyone harm themselves like Tyrannical Song did, actually severing his own foundation of immortality with a single strike.","“But this might be a good opportunity!” Some people’s eyes began to light up, including Emperor Hezhi.","With Tyrannical Song falling from the Immortal Realm, his strength had certainly plummeted.","Wouldn’t the next moment be the best opportunity to confront Tyrannical Song?","Excellent.","They immediately began to plan how to overthrow Tyrannical Song!","However...","Before those inclined had even prepared their plans to confront Tyrannical Song, a new ‘path to immortality’ aura emerged on Tyrannical Song’s body within the image.","The originally dimming ‘Immortal full moon’ once again lit up brightly... but the path to immortality within had already changed.","Once again, the practitioners in the universe were dazed.","“Did he switch to a different path to immortality?”","“I understand, Tyrannical Song, at the instant when the previous path to immortality disappeared, immediately supplemented it with a new complete path to immortality, achieving a seamless transition!”","“Is this like changing clothes?”","I concede defeat, it is my loss."]},{"number":3038,"title":"Chapter 3038 - 3036: Is It Still Resurrection If You Can’t Resurrect On the Spot?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3038: Chapter 3036: Is It Still Resurrection If You Can’t Resurrect On the Spot?","“When exactly was Senior Song’s Second Immortality Method perfected?” the Heavenly Emperor’s child asked in the research room.","Even with the passage of time in the ‘Heavenly Dao Secret Realm,’ it has been just over a month, right?","That incredibly complex Second Immortality Method of Tyrannical Song, it’s completed?","Is that Immortality Method... so easily deduced and perfected?","Also, when did Senior Song learn her method of ‘seamlessly interfacing with the immortal path’?","The Heavenly Emperor’s child is now very puzzled.","By the side, the Will of the Heavenly Axiom slowly shook its head and said, “It’s not the ‘Second Immortality Method’ that Shuhang had before, this is a new immortal path that he has realized, which is related to ‘the original Text Language Root Law.’","Tyrannical Song once mentioned to me that he had slightly grasped the prototype of a ‘Language Text Longevity Technique’... and not long after, he has managed to prove his Dao with this Immortality Method.","Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song truly embodies the essence of modesty, truly a persona fated with the scholarly faction... what a pity to have no share.","“I was prepared to gift him an immortal path, who would’ve thought he’d realize it by himself?” the three-eyed youth raised an eyebrow at his third eye – so the gift he prepared was all for naught?","“Fundamentals, these are just fundamentals. After all, in the past month or so, Shuhang has been communicating ‘Mysterious Principles of the Immortal’ with a large number of Immortals, and also had the Heavenly Dao’s Calculation Ability assisting him in the background. It’s completely understandable that he’d comprehend a new immortal path. Besides, a month has passed... by the normal process, a month’s time is enough for Shuhang to level up by a major rank. His previous state was at the Immortal Realm, this time he did not prove a pseudo-immortal body, but merely realized a new immortal path, which is already playing it down.” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair spoke calmly.","Chu Chu now displays a mental strength that’s frighteningly strong.","Even in the face of several rulers of the Netherworld plus the Will of the Heavenly Axiom, she, a regular Immortal, can still speak calmly – this is definitely a sign that she has a mature mindset!","“What Pavilion Master Chu says makes so much sense.” Scarlet Heaven Sword, which was responsible for roasting Song Shuhang, surprisingly couldn’t find any fault this time.","Yes, more than a month has passed.","With such abundant time, it was enough for Tyrannical Song to leap from a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender to the Immortal Realm.","So, after a month’s time, it is not surprising that Tyrannical Song has realized a new Immortality Method!","“Regarding that ‘Seeking Life Through Death Method’ Tyrannical Song consumed, was any information preserved? After all, it was a complete immortal path, and to directly sacrifice it seems a bit wasteful.” The three-eyed youth pondered while stroking his chin, raising the question.","Moreover, it’s unclear whether the immortal path would sacrifice ‘memory, theory’ and all after being sacrificed?","Or, can it somehow be re-cultivated afterward?","If not, preserving this complete immortal path’s information to pass on to juniors for cultivation would be ideal.","“Ye Si, you need not worry yourself over such trifles, this matter has already been taken care of,” Father Goudan said calmly.","Tyrannical Song placed ‘Tyrant Kindness’ into the Heavenly Dao’s small black room precisely for this step.","Preserving the information of the ‘Seeking Life Through Death Method’...and even preserving a part of its core Mysterious Principles.","In the future, whether it be re-cultivating it or passing it on to his disciples, there will be no issue.","“What comes next is for Shuhang to try his luck and see if he can hit the jackpot by inheriting the Sage’s innate skills within those limited chances,” Senior White Two continued to watch the showing of divinity.","“And also, to see if my teacher’s Sage Eye Golden Core can be resurrected afterward,” Daozi was a bit anxious – even with the capability of ‘Heavenly Dao’s Deduction,’ confirming that the Sage’s Eye and the undying fat whale golden core were bound, Daozi still felt unsettled until the Sage’s Eye was fully restored.","...","...","In the live broadcast by Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark.","Song Shuhang, who had switched to a new ‘path to immortality,’ opened his right eye... His left eye was blind and hadn’t recovered yet, so he was too lazy to open it.","The moment he opened his right eye, a light of wisdom shone forth.","All cultivators in the myriad realms subconsciously wanted to close their eyes, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s eyes are shining” had already become a phrase in the world of cultivation that could stop babies from crying.","However, the thought to ‘close their eyes’ only flickered through the cultivators’ minds.","Brain: Quickly close your eyes.","Eyelids: No, you don’t want to.","Body: Ma, how fragrant.","Although the scene of showing their divinity in front of the masses was becoming more and more blurred, cultivators from all over the universe still couldn’t help but be attracted by the eye that Tyrannical Song had opened.","Eyes are the windows to the soul... And at this moment, what Tyrant Song’s eyes revealed was exactly the information related to his new immortal path.","It was the origin of all the writings and languages in the myriad worlds.","Just by looking into Tyrannical Song’s bright right eye, practitioners in the universe felt their understanding of ‘text’ improve by leaps and bounds.","Even some obscure and difficult to understand fragments of techniques became understandable.","“Success,” Song Shuhang said softly, unable to hide the excitement in his tone.","This time, using the Text Language Root Law, he had proved his path to immortality once again and initially created a few characters unique to him.","Like the ‘Scholarly Rune’ of the Sage from Confucianism and the ‘Imperial Rune’ of the Heavenly Emperor... this time, Song Shuhang finally fiddled out characters that were unique to him.","Although there were only a few of them, the initial framework of the system was in place, and in the future, he only needs to fill this framework with new characters.","He originally wanted to name his exclusive characters ‘Song Typeface,’ but the name ‘Song Typeface’ was already taken. After much thought, it seemed nothing suited the newly created characters better than ‘Tyrannical Literature.’","This immortal path with Text Language Root Law as its core principle was not inferior in rank to the ‘Seeking Life Through Death Method’ that touched upon the domain of life and death.","Moreover, possessing this path to immortality, it becomes difficult to kill Song Shuhang from the root!","Once he fiddles together a sufficient number of ‘Tyrannical Literature’ characters and spreads them out... As long as ‘Tyrannical Literature’ continues to circulate in the world, even if Song Shuhang dies both in body and mind, he won’t be completely dead.","Even if he doesn’t have the undying fat whale golden core, as long as the world still circulates ‘Tyrannical Literature’ and people still use ‘Tyrannical Literature,’ Song Shuhang can return from the river of time even tens of thousands of years later.","This principle involving the ‘roots’ of the myriad worlds, the immortality achieved, in fact, has a bit of the flavor of a low-key version of ‘eternity.’”","But that’s not why Song Shuhang was excited; with the undying fat whale golden core, he didn’t care much for an ability that needed him to languish for thousands or tens of thousands of years just to come back to life.","What kind of resurrection is it if it doesn’t happen on the spot?","For Tyrannical Song, if the resurrection time exceeds one week, it’s considered a loss.","The real reason for his excitement was that this ‘Root Text Language Immortality’ was part of his second path to immortality.","The information brought to him by Shi and Zhu from the Future Child, aside from preserving fragments of the immortality method, also contained hints about constructing the second path to immortality through ‘splitting and recombining.’","The Root Text Language Immortality was Tyrannical Song’s second path to immortality, but it definitely wasn’t the last one!"]},{"number":3039,"title":"Chapter 3039 - 3037: Devouring Netherworld Ruler!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3039: Chapter 3037: Devouring Netherworld Ruler!","What’s even more wonderful is that with the “Confucian Classic” present, when Senior White is ready to inherit the Scholarly Sage’s Eye, he can complete the ritual by using up Song Shuhang’s “path to immortality” — just like how the Sage Secret Technique almost depleted Daoist Senior’s “immortal path” previously.","Senior White doesn’t need to consume his own immortal path at all.","Plus, the Sage’s eye can be resurrected through the “undying fat whale golden core”.","This means... theoretically, Song Shuhang could sacrifice his path to immortality over and over again, allowing the Scholarly Sage’s “innate skill” to be inherited by more people.","His own daughter, disciples, and members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group are all potential inheritors.","After the sacrificial ritual is completed, Song Shuhang himself can retain fragments of the “path to immortality”.","When the time is right, these fragments can be assembled into the true “Second Immortality” that Song Shuhang desires!","This is the main reason behind Song Shuhang’s beaming satisfaction.","“Then, moving on to the next step...” Song Shuhang said softly.","Under his operation, the information on the “Root Language Text Immortality” that he had just comprehended was copied and integrated into the “Cultivator Chat System”.","As the “Cultivator Chat System”, widely used throughout the myriad realms of the universe, aligns extremely well with this “Root Text Language Immortality”.","Text and language are the most fundamental aspects of the “Cultivator Chat System”.","And Song Shuhang’s true “Second Immortality” will use the “Cultivator Chat System” as its main framework.","Moreover, he has some leads on the next “path to immortality” he wants to sacrifice — he plans to create a highly inclusive way to immortality, connecting all the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Ideally, it would have the effect of “Heavenly Court Immortality”... it could be a weakened version, but it must not restrict the members like the Heavenly Court Immortal Method does, rather, it should allow the members plenty of freedom.","There are two possibilities for such an immortality path that Song Shuhang currently has leads on.","One is using the route of the virtuous network.","The other is through the techniques of karmic strings.","Both of these options are the escalation of the “Cultivator Chat System” network cables and can connect him to the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Once the new way to immortality is established, he can sacrifice the “Language Text Longevity Technique” to Senior White, allowing Senior White to inherit the Sage’s Devouring Talent.","“Very good, everything is going smoothly just as I deduced using Daoist Senior’s predictive ability,” Song Shuhang said, reaching out to touch his blinded left eye socket.","The “undying revival” power of the fat whale golden core was activated.","At this moment, the effect of the fat whale golden core was almost comparable to Cloud Gauze Three View Moon’s “bone of eternity”.","The immortal attribute’s power flashed by, but it was all hidden under Song Shuhang’s left hand, with information pertaining to immortality concealed.","A moment later...","The depleted Scholarly Sage’s eye, which resembled the skin of an Ultraman beaten to the brink of death, began to reverse and come back to life.","The shriveled golden core skin inflated with air, and the eye of the Sage manifested once again within.","“This is indeed true revival; to take effect instantly when needed. Only such a revival has a soul,” Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","In the void, Daoist Senior, who was closely watching him, also breathed a sigh of relief.","The relics of his teacher were finally preserved.","Moreover, from today onward, as long as Tyrannical Song’s “fat whale golden core” doesn’t encounter any issues, his teacher’s eyes will not face any mishaps, making it the best protection plan for the relics.","“Shuhang, try operating the ‘innate ability’ again and see if you have successfully inherited the teacher’s talent?” Daoist’s voice directly emerged in Song Shuhang’s ears.","The secret technique left by the Sage, after being upgraded by various rulers and big shots, has a significantly increased chance of success. But it’s still not a guarantee to successfully inherit the Sage’s talent.","If Tyrannical Song is out of luck, it’s very possible that the inheritance may fail.","And the price of failure would be too heavy.","“It’s already successful, Senior Brother Daozi,” Song Shuhang said with a slight smile.","At the moment the sacrificial ritual was completed, he knew he had succeeded, he had fully mastered the innate ability of the ‘Devour Existence’ from the Scholarly Sage.","Now, everything is ready!","“Kindness~ So, how are you feeling now? Are you going to act according to the plan?” Daozi asked.","“Better than ever before, after switching to a new immortal path, even the ‘ancient language’ that always troubled me has become something I’m proficient in, I can even smoothly pronounce @#%& Fairy Soft Feather’s name,” Song Shuhang confidently said, “I can execute the plan at any time.”","“Good, I’ll connect you to the Netherworld.” Daozi nodded, stretched out his hand and connected the Netherworld Realm with the space where Song Shuhang was at the moment.","In the Netherworld Realm, the fat ball was suppressed under layers of the Heavenly Dao Seal.","Song Shuhang showed an emotionless expression as she sat nearby.","After connecting to the Netherworld Realm, Daoist Senior secretly extended the camera time for Song Shuhang’s ‘Profound Sage Speech’.","——What followed was the scene of Tyrannical Song performing the ‘Devouring Netherworld Ruler’ act.","This act would push the already peak prestige of Tyrannical Song even higher, leaving an even more invincible impression in the hearts of the practitioners of the myriad worlds.","Of course, Daozi would not miss such an opportunity.","As the Will of the Heavens, I want the whole world to know Tyrannical Song’s awesomeness!","The Scholarly Sage was once called ‘Remarkably Awesome Sage’ by the practitioners of the myriad worlds.","Daozi’s goal was to have Tyrannical Song called ‘Awesome Song’ by the practitioners of the myriad worlds.","Netherworld Realm.","“You damned Netherly White... Tyrannical Song has so quickly mastered the Scholarly Sage’s ‘Devour Existence’ talent?” the fat ball’s expression changed dramatically.","The pitch-black metal color even started turning green.","“Not fast, it has been over a month since I stayed in the ‘time-distorted secret realm’ with my main body,” Dark Song said slowly without lifting her eyes.","“Even if it only took a month to master the Sage’s talent, you think that’s slow? [Sneer]” the fat ball said coldly.","Dark Song thought for a moment and said, “Shouldn’t be considered slow?”","“Go to hell,” the fat ball closed its mouth.","Dark Song stood up, “Anyhow, please cooperate with my main body following the agreement, fat ball Big Shot.”","This was also the only hope for the fat ball Big Shot to ‘survive’.","“I will cooperate,” the fat ball Big Shot said gravely, “I want to live, live better than anyone else.”","In the neighboring Sinful Black Lotus World.","Senior White’s two main bodies were deeply moved by the fat ball’s touching speech and coincidentally consumed several fruits from the fat ball’s leftover treasure.","A moment later.","Throughout the myriad worlds, within the remnants of the Profound Sage Speech broadcast.","The cultivators saw Big Shot Tyrannical Song slowly rise, his aura soaring crazily.","At this moment, Tyrannical Song seemed to turn into an Abyss Giant Beast, devouring everything that can be devoured!","He was like a black hole!","And opposite Tyrannical Song was a blurred area of the Netherworld Realm.","Within it, a figure shrouded in strange fog stood confronting Tyrannical Song.","[Netherworld... Netherworld Ruler?]","Despite being shrouded in fog, for some reason, the watching cultivators recognized the figure’s identity at first glance.","What is Tyrannical Song planning to do to the ‘Netherworld Ruler’?"]},{"number":3040,"title":"Chapter 3040 - 3038: The Battle is Extremely Fierce","paragraphs":["Chapter 3040: Chapter 3038: The Battle is Extremely Fierce","The strange fog covering the body of the fat ball, the liquid metal avatar, was naturally the handiwork of Daozi.","This was mainly to enhance the effect of “boosting Tyrannical Song’s prestige”!","After all, many Immortals were aware that Tyrannical Song had a ‘liquid metal avatar’ known as fat ball Song Shuhang, and a good number of them had been beaten up by ‘fat ball Song Shuhang.’","If Tyrannical Song were to devour a ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ at this moment that was quite similar to fat ball Song Shuhang, it would feel like he was swallowing his own clone, which would definitely diminish the prestige-boosting effect.","Moreover, there were layers upon layers of ‘Heavenly Dao Seals’ around the fat ball ruler. If these seals were to be seen, wouldn’t it let people know that the ‘fat ball ruler’ had been subdued before being devoured?","How would that show off Tyrannical Song’s awesomeness?","Therefore, the meticulous Daozi added a layer of fog to the fat ball ruler, rendering everyone unable to see its appearance and current status clearly; they could only guess through the fog that this was a ‘ruler of the Netherworld.’","Besides, the fog could maximize the domineering presence of the fat ball ruler, making it appear about ten times stronger than it actually was.","Even top Immortals, faced with a tenfold enhanced fat ball ruler through the live broadcast, felt their hearts palpitate.","“Is this the ruler of the Netherworld, reinforced by the laws of the Netherworld?” rulers of the Netherworld could not step out of the Netherworld, but it was said that some had managed to transmit part of their power to the main world. However, the ruler of the Netherworld in the Netherworld Realm and the one in the main world were entirely different concepts!","“Even we can’t help but feel a sense of palpitation... This has completely exceeded the limits that practitioners in the universe can reach. Even Immortals are far from the ruler of the Netherworld Realm.”","Some who followed the more peaceful and life-oriented path towards immortality, as opposed to combat, felt a tangible pressure.","“It’s several times more intense than the oppression I felt from the Confucian Sage back then.”","It was terrifying, truly terrifying.","“And have you noticed, this isn’t the ruler of the Netherworld from the Confucian Will of the Heavens!”","It was a very strange feeling; even without seeing through the fog, or even clearly seeing the appearance of the ruler of the Netherworld, there was an intuition—this was not Daozi’s Netherworld Ruler Body.","“And next to it, next to it is Great Ruler Song, is that the Netherworld Ruler Body cultivated by Tyrannical Song in the Netherworld Realm?!”","Some also caught a glimpse of Dark Song flashing by near the fog.","“If it is not the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ of the Confucian Will of the Heavens, could it be from the previous Will of the Heavens? The Heavenly Dao of the previous Will collapsed, but its ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ body is still alive?”","This speculation almost instantly emerged in the minds of the onlookers.","“What is Big Shot Tyrannical Song trying to do? Is he confronting this ‘former ruler of the Netherworld’?”","In the broadcast, Tyrannical Song’s aura grew stronger and stronger, capable of swallowing mountains and rivers, and even the whole universe seemed within his reach!","“If two tigers cannot coexist on one mountain, unless one is male and the other is female. It looks like after condensing his own ‘Netherworld Ruler Body’, Big Shot Tyrannical Song cannot tolerate the existence of the former Netherworld Ruler. Thus... he intends to deal with this ‘former ruler of the Netherworld’? And because of the very deep relationship between the Daozi of the Confucian system and Tyrannical Song, is this why the ruler of the Netherworld of the Confucian system can coexist with Tyrannical Song?”","How can one sleep soundly on the side of a couch where another is lying?","Big Shot Tyrannical Song is really going to take action against such a terrifying ruler of the Netherworld?","Truly worthy of being the man who has won 9+1 consecutive victories, tyrannical—his combination of the final Ba Mei and Tyrannical Words Sage Seals can be considered 1+1 Sage Names.","So now, Tyrannical Song has won 9 consecutive titles + an extra one, making it a ten-time champion.","In the past, when people stumbled upon Tyrannical Song and stuttered, they might say ‘Tyrannical... Tyrannical Song.’","Now, if they stuttered, just the ten ‘Tyrannical...’ would leave them panting and parched.","“He’s started! He’s really taking action!”","“Big Shot Tyrannical Song furiously strikes at the former ruler of the Netherworld!”","In the specially extended ‘Profound Sage Speech’ broadcast, Song Shuhang used all his strength to deploy the ‘devour existence’ innate ability of the Confucian Sage.","His figure turned into a black hole, enveloping the fat ball.","“`","Practitioners from across the myriad realms felt as if their “existence, everything, source” were about to be devoured and cleaned out by Tyrannical Song in an instant under the cover of that black hole.","This was just a strand of the impact shown through the “live broadcast footage.”","What kind of terror must the ‘former ruler of the Netherworld’ before, face in directly receiving this strike?","Upon witnessing this scene, members of Confucianism found their eyes suddenly brimming with tears.","In the eyes of the Confucian members, behind Tyrannical Song, there seemed to appear a ‘Sage phantom’—a vague manifestation that occurred when Song Shuhang was using the ‘Sage Talent Secret Method’ to connect with the power of the Laws.","And the scholarly disciples clearly witnessed the figure of the ‘Netherworld Ruler’—Confucianism’s archnemesis, the former Netherworld ruler liquid metal ball.","While Daozi concealed the perceptions of disciples from myriad realms with strange fog, he did not shield the senses of the scholarly disciples.","Because this was a chance for the children of Confucianism to witness ‘an eye for an eye’ process.","It was also the moment when the countless resentments in the hearts of scholarly disciples were liberated.","From then on, the thoughts of Confucian disciples expanded from a narrow path to a ten-lane road, with carriages coming and going freely without hindrance.","This was beneficial for cultivation.","[Tyrannical Song is blasting the former ruler of the Netherworld!]","[He is a Sage, is a reincarnation of a Sage!]","Ordinary Confucian disciples had already firmly believed in the notion of ‘Tyrannical Song being the reincarnation of a Sage.’ At this point, even if the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of Confucianism personally denied it, the ordinary disciples probably wouldn’t believe them.","People’s hearts always tend to believe in some ‘truths seen with their own eyes’, as well as truths that are more favorable to themselves.","Moreover, the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders hadn’t actively denied it—after all, Tyrannical Song hadn’t denied it himself.","And among the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders, several of them suspected whether Tyrannical Song might be the reincarnation of their teacher.","After all, tracing Tyrannical Song’s journey since he started his cultivation, there were traces of a Sage’s influence all along.","In the Profound Sage Speech footage...","The black hole of Tyrannical Song pressed directly towards the former ruler of the Netherworld.","Then, everything was covered by black fog.","There was no sound, no explosion.","But the battle was extremely fierce!","Within the black fog, the former ruler of the Netherworld seemed to be desperately resisting, the fog surging like a giant serpent, akin to the World Serpent opposing the black hole that was swallowing the world.","The area covered by the black fog grew larger and more frenetic, shifting shapes continuously.","Although the specifics of the battle were unclear, through the surging black fog, practitioners from all worlds imagined a magnificent battle.","The brutal fight of Tyrannical Song VS the former ruler of the Netherworld!","This must be a battle that shook the heavens and split the earth!","Palpitations of awe arose continuously from within the black fog.","Practitioners from all realms, especially the Immortal big shots, were increasingly convinced of Tyrannical Song’s prowess.","This was directly confronting and blowing up the ruler of the Netherworld in its own lair!","Fighting and defeating an enemy on their own turf!","What a domineering feat!"]},{"number":3041,"title":"Chapter 3041 - 3039: Safe and Sound Cheng Goudan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3041: Chapter 3039: Safe and Sound Cheng Goudan","“`","In the vacuum.","Having received the shock and admiration of practitioners and Immortal big shots from the myriad realms, Daozi revealed a gratified smile.","—Then, he continued to manipulate the strange fog as it surged crazily, releasing a palpitating aura to cover up the truth.","What you see with your own eyes, is not necessarily the truth.","Your eyes can deceive you, your ears can deceive you, your brain can deceive you, your experiences can deceive you, and your imagination can also deceive you... but mathematics won’t!","So, what are you waiting for? Why not pick up a mathematics textbook and study mathematics seriously?","Practitioners and big shots from myriad realms would never imagine that beneath the magnificent black fog, within the terrifyingly palpitating fog, there wasn’t the earth-shattering battle they were fantasizing about!","Sometimes, the truth can shatter one’s worldviews.","In fact, within the fog, Tyrannical Song and the fat ball were carrying out a ‘friendly’ trade.","“How much do you want to devour? Don’t go too far, Tyrannical Song!” The fat ball gritted its teeth. Not only was it not resisting, but it was also actively cooperating with Tyrannical Song, using the Confucian Saint Talent to devour its existence.","“I’ve devoured less than a third so far, fat ball. Don’t be so alarmed. Besides, be realistic and think about it... Anyhow, I’m definitely going to devour more than three-quarters of you. Otherwise, do you think Daoist Senior would feel reassured letting you live?” Song Shuhang transmitted his message as he devoured.","The fat ball tried hard to suppress itself, “Damn you, Netherly White.”","At the same time, it was very clear about one thing—what Tyrannical Song said about ‘three-quarters’ was likely not enough. To let that Confucian Daozi Heavenly Dao feel completely at ease and allow it to linger on with life, leaving a tenth of its existence would be quite good.","But, it was in agony.","The Sage’s talent ‘devour existence’ was very peculiar... and during the ‘devour existence’ process, the devoured side had no adverse reactions.","From the outside, there was no visible sign of any loss.","But ‘existence,’ that mysterious thing, was being sliced away bit by bit.","“To be killed by a thousand cuts, you damn Netherly White.” The fat ball couldn’t help but curse again.","The bewildered Song Shuhang, who was in the midst of devouring, asked, “What does this have to do with Senior White two?”","“None of your damned business.” The fat ball snapped back irritably.","“...” Song Shuhang didn’t know how to reply, so he silently bowed his head and continued to exert the Sage’s talent.","It’s not my business; I’m just responsible for activating the Sage’s talent, that’s all.","After the devouring is finished, he would also be responsible for cutting a part of the fat ball’s body that had ‘lost existence.’ This part, devoid of soul and existence, would be certified by Daoist Senior and then transferred to the main world. After some refining, a few ‘Soulless Fat Ball Song No.2, No.3, No.4’ could be refined.","Although they wouldn’t be as caring and warm-hearted as the current Fat Ball Song attached to him, their other functions wouldn’t be too different.","Thus, the New Year’s gift for his daughter, Xiao Lingxiao, would be ready... and in the distant future, he might even give a few ‘Fat Ball Song No.5, No.6, No.7, No.8’ to others.","It wouldn’t be bad to have one for each person.","After all, with just a bit of fat ball’s body and a large quantity of refining materials, a ‘Fat Ball Song No.×’ could be made. Producing several in one breath makes the New Year’s gifts for next year a non-issue.","As ‘existence’ continued to be devoured, reaching a critical point, the fat ball became weak.","The liquefied metal ball was only nibbled on by the Sage a little, so it was just a scratch... If the liquefied metal ball hadn’t become pseudo-immortal and was nibbled on just a little bit back then, it probably wouldn’t have affected its future life.","But now, more than half of the fat ball’s existence had been devoured by Song Shuhang.","The weakened fat ball couldn’t even curse Netherly White without sounding listless.","“Eh? Losing steam already?” Senior White two in the Sinful Black Lotus World lay within the sealing pillar, bobbing up and down, occasionally eating a thousand mile fruit.","“What a pity, I was quite enjoying the show.” Senior White two expressed some regret.","The more aggressively the fat ball cursed, the more pleasure he derived.","Unfortunately, seeing the fat ball getting weaker and weaker, Senior White two began to feel somewhat bored.","“From now on, take care. Well, you might not even have a ‘from now on.’”","Senior White two’s main body closed his eyes, drowsiness surged again, and soon, he drifted into deep sleep.","“`","“`","...","...","World of the golden lotus.","Several of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders who had resurrected, along with a large number of scholarly disciples, began chanting the content of Scholarly Scriptures silently, steadying their minds and, incidentally, strengthening their spirits.","They could distinctly see Tyrannical Song suppressing the ruler of the Netherworld, using some kind of Sage’s secret technique, extracting the power of the fat ball.","The fat ball was becoming weaker and weaker, to the extent that even its ‘presence’ seemed to be fading in and out.","After today, even if the ruler of the Netherworld doesn’t die, it is already completely ruined.","Above the Virtuous Golden Lotus.","The Heavenly Dao ‘Daozi’ was casting, dropping a sweet rain phenomenon.","This rain, as if tangible, fell upon each scholarly disciple’s head, soothing their minds.","This was a Heavenly Dao method.","With this method assisting, for the scholarly system, this enmity would thus dissipate.","All grudges settled, all karmic ties understood.","The state of the minds and cultivation of the scholarly disciples seemed to reach a new level.","Daozi relievedly released a sigh.","In the distant future, the scholarly system will be better off.","And he, as the eldest scholarly disciple, no longer felt unworthy of his title.","“This life, to have met Fairy Cheng Lin, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, and several fellow friends, and then to have encountered Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, is the greatest fortune of my existence.” Daozi thought to himself, his mind receding, quietly withdrawing from the world of the golden lotus.","...","...","Within the Netherworld Realm.","The process of Song Shuhang extracting the existence of the ruler of the Netherworld was finally coming to a close.","This time, the entire process took a whole day in the outside world!","The innate ability to devour existence, after consuming more than half of the fat ball’s ‘existence’, became difficult.","The deeper it was dug, the harder the ‘existence’ became.","And all of the ‘fat ball existence’ that was ‘devoured’ had been transferred by Song Shuhang to the adjacent Dark Song.","Dark Song’s aura became increasingly stable—Dark Song’s Netherworld ruler power all came from ‘Senior White two.’","It seemed powerful, but it was rootless.","Now, the ‘existence’ transferred from the fat ball ruler had become Dark Song’s root.","He had now become a fully-fledged ruler of the Netherworld!","“Then, it’s time for me to take action,” Fairy Cheng Lin’s voice sounded.","At this moment, she was Cheng Goudan.","The real Goudan was sealed within the eggshell.","Father Goudan was somewhat concerned, “Shall I enhance and upgrade you first, so you don’t break again later?”","“No need, it’s better if I break,” Cheng Goudan replied.","She felt it’s best to have a peaceful break.","“`"]},{"number":3042,"title":"Chapter 3042 - 3040: Heavenly Emperor, you pigeon, you actually scammed the distant future me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3042: Chapter 3040: Heavenly Emperor, you pigeon, you actually scammed the distant future me!","“The more pieces I break into, the happier I am,” Cheng Goudan said.","Father Goudan was taken aback, “Are you courting death?”","“Are you getting fierce with me, Father Goudan?” Cheng Goudan retorted without hesitation—she had decided that until Father Goudan changed her dao name back, she wouldn’t give him any good looks.","Ever since her dao name was changed to ‘Cheng Goudan’ by Father Goudan, she felt that her once somewhat charismatic self as the Jade Lake Empress had wildly sprinted towards becoming a ‘dog’.","A person is often influenced by their name, but conversely, a name can also subtly influence a person.","How could she date anyone if she wasn’t charming?","“I’m not being fierce with you, but are you sure you don’t want to reinforce a bit?” Father Goudan said softly.","He now seemed so gentle it was unbecoming of a ruler of the Netherworld—back when the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon was around, Father Goudan’s style was cold and silent.","But after the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon was gone, Father Goudan seemed to have inherited a part of the Striped Dragon’s whimsical character.","With that said, Father Goudan stretched out his hand to temporarily release Cheng Lin from the eggshell.","Next, Cheng Goudan was to be reborn as Dark Song, so she couldn’t be kept inside the egg any longer.","However, Father Goudan did not put away the eggshell.","When Cheng Lin really did break into pieces later, this eggshell could be used to collect Cheng Lin’s fragments.","“If you change my dao name back, I might also consider not shattering so thoroughly,” Cheng Goudan said, seizing the opportunity to propose her condition after being released.","Upon hearing this, Father Goudan fell into meditation.","After a long time.","Father Goudan gritted his teeth and said, “Then forget it... Anyway, you’re not my only daughter now. If you break, you break!”","Cheng Goudan was stunned, “???”","Did Father Goudan find out about ‘Fairy Lychee,’ my concocted ‘little sister’?","But on the other side, Father Goudan was smiling and looking at Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi.","She was also a large assembly of ‘Ghost God Cheng Lin’s’ fragments.","Moreover, the Heavenly Emperor’s Son had perfectly removed the parts of the liquefied metal ball’s ‘experimental Heavenly Emperor’ that were originally integrated into her fragments. So in a sense, she was just like Cheng Lin.","Following Father Goudan’s gaze, Cheng Goudan saw the Heavenly Emperor’s Son, “...”","At that moment, she had tens of thousands of alpacas she wanted to give to Father Goudan.","“Heavenly Emperor, if Cheng Goudan shatters into pieces, do you want to change your name to Heavenly Goudan?” Father Goudan asked, looking affectionately at the Heavenly Emperor’s Son.","The Heavenly Emperor’s Son was completely baffled “!!!”","Why am I suddenly being shot while lying down?","I don’t even want to be the Heavenly Emperor anymore; why would I agree to become Heavenly Goudan?","So she tactfully declined, “I think Mister Song really suits the Goudan name, Da.”","“He’s already Song Goudan,” Father Goudan said with disdain. “And besides, he’s not a daughter.”","After contemplating for a moment, the Heavenly Emperor’s Son wisely responded, “But Mister Song can find a fairy, have a daughter, and even have several, Da!”","“Makes sense,” Father Goudan nodded, “If it’s the daughter of Song Goudan... then she could be called Song Dandan?”","Upon hearing this, Cheng Goudan on the other side nearly rolled her eyes, “!!!”","Heavenly Emperor, you treacherous pigeon, are you actually setting me up remotely?","You have to know, within Song Shuhang’s plan list, there’s one called ‘Plan for Three Years Later’.","After three years, the troubles of the myriad practitioners in the universe should be mostly resolved, and Song Shuhang will also be of the age to marry and have children.","By then, Cheng Lin could retire in peace, step out of the ‘deader than dead’ state, and then, using a method similar to ‘reincarnation’, she could create triplets for Song Shuhang.","If she were to carry out this plan, she might become Song Goudan’s daughter, a legitimate daughter through the proper procedures.","So, isn’t the suggestion of the Heavenly Emperor’s Son just a trap for her future self?","The ‘Three-Year Plan’ of Cheng Lin and Song Wood was not just spoken in jest; it was a plan that truly needed to be in place.","And this plan wasn’t just about dealing with Song Wood’s relationship either.","Firstly, the portion of the ghost spirit fragment that originally belonged to ‘Song Wood’ inside her current body [Ghost God Cheng Lin Song One] had a slight hidden danger—after Song Wood’s ‘Plan A’ to collapse the Heavenly Emperor’s path failed and his path exploded, Cheng Lin gathered all his fragments.","However, during the Heavenly City’s Plan A process, Song Wood forcibly absorbed a small portion of the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s Son Fragment’. After the failure of Plan A and the explosion of Song Wood’s path, this fragment carried the risk of mutation and the potential for explosion.","Secondly, the former ‘Ghost God Cheng Lin’ was a single entity, but since splitting up, different personalities have emerged from the fragmentation. These individual personalities, having developed over a long time, now possess distinct characters.","Merging some unconscious small fragments is fine, but merging the larger fragments with independent personalities could lead to conflicts in personality.","During their time in Heavenly City, the fusion of Cheng Lin and Song Wood was an emergency measure... Now, for the sake of safety, it’s better to remain separated.","To achieve a perfect separation plus resolving the hidden danger, reincarnation is a good solution.","By then, Song Shuhang’s own natural child + Cheng Lin + Song Wood would make the perfect set of triplets.","——As for her current ‘safe and sound fragmentation’, it’s to separate her fragments from Song Wood’s as much as possible after breaking apart, laying the groundwork for the plan three years later.","What’s better is that after reincarnation, she could openly rid herself of the despised dao name ‘Cheng Goudan’ and choose a name she likes.","And now.","This plan hasn’t even started, and the future is still uncertain about whether it can be implemented... Yet the Heavenly Emperor’s Son has already dug a pit for her in advance.","By then, is she supposed to change from Cheng Goudan to Song Dandan?","She might as well not change at all!","Or, she could let Song Wood reincarnate when the time comes, and she could find another method.","“Daoist Senior, is it about time?” At this point, Song Shuhang’s voice rang out.","At this moment, the fat ball, which had been continuously swallowing ‘existence’, was so weak it could hardly move.","As it estimated, it was left with only about one-tenth of its ‘existence’.","Nine-tenths of the ‘existence’ had been transferred into Dark Song by Tyrannical Song using the Confucian Saint Talent.","“It is about time,” Daozi nodded in satisfaction.","Then, his will slashed at the body of the fat ball, cutting off the nine-tenths of its body that had lost ‘existence’.","The soulless body, later on, he would authenticate with the Heavenly Dao Authority, add some materials, and condense it again, and it would be able to come out from the Netherworld Realm, just like Ruler of the Netherworld White’s thigh.","At the same time, Cheng Goudan descended beside Dark Song.","Dark Song, having accepted a large quantity of ‘existence’ from the fat ball in one breath, emitted a foul aura all over.","“Are you ready?” Cheng Goudan asked.","Dark Song nodded.","“Then, welcome to your new life, Dark Song.” Fairy Cheng Lin’s figure transformed.","In Song Shuhang’s core world, a set of immortal clothing flew out, landing on Cheng Lin’s body.","It was the Jade Lake Empress Suit she had left in the Jade Lake Realm, which the virtuous lamia had been keeping safe ever since.","The phoenix robe and the Emperor Crown adorned Cheng Lin.","Fairy Cheng Lin’s charisma +1000","Additionally, accompanying the phoenix robe and Emperor Crown’s descent was the virtuous lamia."]},{"number":3043,"title":"Chapter 3043 - 3041: Unrivaled Domination by Occupying the Magpie’s Nest","paragraphs":["Chapter 3043: Chapter 3041: Unrivaled Domination by Occupying the Magpie’s Nest","The virtuous lamia saw Fairy Cheng Lin putting on the Jade Lake Empress Suit and then quietly descended.","She didn’t come closer but just watched the splendidly dressed Cheng Lin from a distance.","The splendidly dressed Cheng Lin, seeing Fairy Soft Feather arrive, was overjoyed.","She slightly smiled, and while wearing the phoenix robe, she spun around in front of the virtuous lamia... During the turn, the Emperor Crown on top of her head tilted and shifted to one side.","Cheng Lin awkwardly reached up to straighten the crown.","The virtuous lamia tilted her head as she watched Fairy Cheng Lin.","After a long moment.","Suddenly, she let out four classic, dramatic screams, “Ahhh~ Ah~”","Then, under the watchful eyes of everyone, the virtuous lamia’s body softly collapsed to the ground.","Even those beautifully long slender eyes of hers showed a look of pain as they slowly closed.","At the same time, half of a ‘spear’ sprang out from her back while the other tip of the spear squeezed through the gap in her chest.","It looked as if she had been impaled by the long spear.","Dead.","Fairy Cheng Lin was dumbfounded: “???”","It hurts so much, not only have her own art style and that of Fairy Soft Feather been corrupted by Father Goudan and Tyrannical Song, but even Fairy Soft Feather’s style isn’t what it used to be because of Tyrannical Song’s influence.","The virtuous lamia, now dead, lay very dutifully on the ground, motionless.","Even from the wound where the spear ran through, a red, sour tomato-flavored fresh blood flowed out.","Her acting abilities, worthy of an award, were undoubtedly on display.","Fairy Cheng Lin glared fiercely at Dark Song.","“It has nothing to do with me,” Dark Song quickly said: “I never taught her how to play dead, Fairy Soft Feather is self-taught.”","“Shut up.” Fairy Cheng Lin snarled. If it’s not your fault, could it be mine?","She waved her hands at the virtuous lamia who was playing dead.","Then, at the fastest speed in her life, she formed her seal, the full moon of the Immortal shone down, enveloping her and Dark Song.","A bud of a black lotus emerged, covering both Dark Song and Fairy Cheng Lin.","Cheng Lin’s Reincarnation Technique was activated.","In the past, Cheng Lin could complete the entire process of reincarnation within a few minutes when she did it on her own.","But this time, she also had to facilitate ‘Dark Song’s’ transformation, allowing him to become a second ninth dragon pattern similar existence. It would take a slightly longer time.","The lotus gradually rose, growing larger and larger.","Finally, the trunk of the lotus had turned into a giant tree, the bud pointing towards the sky.","“Eh?” Daozi’s will uttered softly.","He could clearly sense that the connection between himself and the ‘fat ball’ ruler was being cut off!","The first step of Cheng Lin’s Reincarnation Technique was to sever the connection between the ruler of the Netherworld and the Will of the Heavens — Daozi, as the 8.5th Wielder of the Will, corresponds to ‘fat ball’ as the ruler of the Netherworld.","And since Dark Song had now swallowed more than ninety percent of the ‘fat ball big shot’s’ existence, naturally, when Cheng Lin’s Reincarnation Technique was enacted, it cut off the connection between Daozi and fat ball ruler.","“This actually benefits the fat ball ruler.” Daozi looked at the fat ball, who was too weak to move.","After a moment of thought, Daozi flicked his finger.","The Profound Sage Speech that was prolonged for so long finally came to an end.","In the eyes of the myriad practitioners in the universe, that incredibly fierce ‘battle that shocked the heavens’ had finally finished.","The victor was Tyrannical Song!","In the last scene of the Profound Sage Speech, Big Shot Tyrannical Song stood lofty and high, looking down from above.","And that black mist representing the ‘former ruler of the Netherworld’ had shrunk to less than a hundredth of its former size.","Even through the “Profound Sage Speech broadcast,” people could clearly sense the weakness of the “former ruler of the Netherworld.”","——Daozi had already turned off the ‘tenfold aura enhancement’ function from before, and even intensified the sense of weakness emanating from fat ball at this moment.","The difference between the fat ball enhanced tenfold before and the now doubly weakened fat ball was too vast, like comparing the World Serpent to a small caterpillar!","Myriad practitioners in the universe couldn’t help but swallow their saliva.","[Such a powerful former ruler of the Netherworld... and yet he was utterly smashed by Big Shot Tyrannical Song.]","[And it happened in the Netherworld Realm, smashing the ruler of the Netherworld.]","[How can this fight even be won?]","[That is to say, during our last encounter when debating the Dao, Big Shot Tyrannical Song had been merciful...]","[At least ten of my Netherworld rulers could be defeated by Tyrannical Song to end up in this state. How many of me would it take to not be hammered so miserably?]","If right now, the battle for the Heavenly Dao seat were still underway, then after this fight, it’s likely that very few in the myriad realms would still be willing to challenge Tyrannical Song... Apart from masochists or battle maniacs, no one would enjoy being hammered by volunteering.","Immortals also have their pride.","The experience of being hammered by a Sage from the scholarly system in the past is not something many would boast about as a credential.","[Fortunately, the Heavenly Dao has already taken its seat, and perhaps for tens of thousands of years, we won’t have to worry about how to face Tyrannical Song anymore.]","Maybe the current Heavenly Dao won’t abdicate at all, staying in the Heavenly Dao seat forever.","That way, we would never have to face Tyrannical Song again.","[However, I feel with Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s cunning moves... it wouldn’t be surprising if, after some time, he assumed control over the Heavenly Dao Authority as a mortal. We wouldn’t have to worry about facing him anymore.]","Some began to console themselves.","Daozi smiled slightly, his goal had been achieved.","At this moment, the prestige of Tyrannical Song had reached its peak, no less than the Sage of the past... perhaps even surpassing him.","Now, even if he were to step down immediately, if Tyrannical Song simply mentioned his intention to prove his Dao as pseudo-immortal, it’s feared that few in the myriad realms would dare to obstruct him.","Even if someone tried to obstruct him, it wouldn’t matter... just smash them.","The pendants on Tyrannical Song were not for show.","“Perfect.” Daozi was extremely satisfied and extended his hand to turn off the Profound Sage Speech camera.","In the end, there was a fleeting shot that a few sharp-eyed cultivators caught.","Some saw that Tyrannical Song’s ‘Netherworld Ruler Body’ seemed to be swallowing the ‘former ruler of the Netherworld’ amid that smoke—needless to say, this scene was definitely also secretly added by Daozi.","After all, in the real Netherworld, Dark Song had already turned into a flower bud.","[Did Big Shot Tyrannical Song swallow the ruler of the Netherworld?]","[Could it be that this was Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s objective, to further strengthen his Netherworld Ruler Body, he mercilessly struck down the former ruler of the Netherworld?]","These sharp-eyed cultivators had a sudden realization.","Meanwhile, a portion of the mighty overlords secretly traveled to the Netherworld Realm, attempting to observe the changes in the Netherworld Realm.","As these powerful overlords traveled to the Netherworld, they communicated with each other.","[This is the second ruler of the Netherworld smashed by Tyrannical Song, right? Not long ago, Tyrannical Song also attacked a former Nine Hells Three Eyes ruler hiding in the main world, seemingly seizing a treasure from the other party. And this time, the ruler of the Netherworld was directly devoured.]","[Living in the same era as such a monster is truly difficult.]","Upon entering the Netherworld Realm.","The overlords closed their eyes briefly to sense around.","Coincidentally... as they arrived in the Netherworld, the Cheng Lin Reincarnation flower bud was just blossoming.","“The Netherworld Realm is really changing!”","“Now, the Netherworld Realm is filled with Tyrannical Song’s presence everywhere.”","This time, Tyrannical Song truly replaced the original occupant, becoming the invincible ruler of the Netherworld."]},{"number":3044,"title":"Chapter 3044 - 3042: Tyrannical Saber Song One Has a Wish","paragraphs":["Chapter 3044: Chapter 3042: Tyrannical Saber Song One Has a Wish","“Some time ago, Tyrannical Song, with his mortal body and before proving his eternity, had already managed to manifest the ‘ruler of the Netherworld,’ which was beyond my imagination,” he said.","“Now, the entire Netherworld Realm has been imbued with the aura of Tyrannical Song... it has completely become Tyrannical Song’s territory,” he continued.","“And given the close relationship between the current Will of the Heavens and Tyrannical Song, his corresponding ruler of the Netherworld likely will not be an enemy to Tyrannical Song’s ‘ruler of the Netherworld.’ Is the Netherworld Realm now joint-ruled by two rulers of the Netherworld?” he pondered.","“I better leave quickly. The Netherworld Realm is filled with Tyrannical Song’s presence everywhere; it wouldn’t be good to be discovered staying here,” he decided.","Now, every action within the vast Netherworld Realm was surely under Tyrannical Song’s watchful eye; it was not wise to linger.","So, a few of the bolder immortal big shots came quietly and left just as quietly.","...","...","In the depths of the Netherworld.","The bud of the giant tree-like black lotus opened, revealing the newly born Dark Song within.","At this moment, Dark Song’s aura was already like that of a true ruler of the Netherworld, nearly indistinguishable from that of Senior White two.","Surrounding Dark Song were countless ‘fragments of Cheng Lin’, shining like starlight at his side—these starlight-like fragments, if cultivated, could each produce a high-quality petty ghost spirit.","This time, Cheng Lin had been utterly shattered.","After the black lotus bloomed, these myriad ‘fragments of Cheng Lin’ instinctively began to spread out, fleeing towards the myriad practitioners in the universe.","At this moment, the prepared Father Goudan waved his hand and threw out the Goudan Shell in his hand.","The Goudan Shell gently sucked in most of the ‘fragments of Cheng Lin,’ drawing them into the shell.","However, a few tiny fragments remained in Dark Song’s hands, not retrieved.","“Song Goudan, let go,” Father Goudan cautioned—Don’t be improper, holding onto my daughter’s fragments.","“Father Goudan, just give me a moment,” Dark Song replied with his eyes closed.","The fragments he held were somewhat special.","These fragments had actively moved to Dark Song’s hands right after the bud opened.","At this moment, some data flowed from these fragments, transmitting to Dark Song and through him to the main body of Song Shuhang.","“Does Fairy Cheng Lin have any special messages that she wants to leave for me?” Song Shuhang’s main body received this data, decoding and reading its contents.","Reading data was an operation Song Shuhang had become very proficient in.","At present, as he read various data, he could also simultaneously check for any security threats in these messages.","After all, he was an immortal. He knew a few basic tricks of the trade.","After reading the data from the fragments of Cheng Lin, Song Shuhang’s mind gained a portion of memories... it felt like he was ‘recollecting,’ accessing their contents.","In this ‘recollection,’ he encountered a world rich in spiritual power.","The spiritual power was so abundant that even a single breath would nourish him with spiritual qi.","It was truly a paradise that any cultivator would dream of.","“What place is this?” he softly wondered in the memory.","A moment later.","In his memory, ‘he’ seemed to have given up thinking, or perhaps ‘he’ was never good at thinking in the first place.","“Let’s try to contact the main body first. This time, the main body must console me gently, and it has to console me for three hours, no... at least five hours to make up for the trauma to my mind!” the ‘he’ in memory said seriously.","But after a moment, the ‘he’ in memory suddenly froze.","Because ‘he’ couldn’t contact the main body anymore.","The contract with the main body was still in place, but the contract made with the ghost spirit was somewhat damaged! Moreover, the main body and he seemed not to be in the same world; the signals sent were like stones sinking into the sea, completely unresponsive.","At this point, ‘he’ began to panic.","Because ‘his’ ability to live independently was virtually zero. The previous ‘he’ just needed to act according to the main body’s plans never needing to think about questions like “What should I do, where should I go.”","Simultaneously, Song Shuhang, who entered the ‘memory,’ also began to panic.","Although he had guessed early on, although he had faintly noticed some clues, even though he had made some mental preparations...","Still, when the truth was revealed, even Song Shuhang’s tempered heart couldn’t help but race.","These were parts of Song Woodhead’s memories, carefully cherished and hidden until now, only to be shared at this moment.","And in this ‘memory,’ that fragmented ‘contract made with the ghost spirit’ and the uncontactable main body matched his own experience—it was his ghost spirit number one, taken away by the lustrous scholar and ultimately went missing.","So, the times he had been beaten up by several big shots over and over were really not accidental injuries.","According to karma, the big shots hitting him was not wrong...","Song Shuhang’s main body panicked for a short while, and the plot in the ‘memory’ switched to the next scene—what Song Shuhang held in his hand were pieces of the ghost spirit fragment, carrying memories that were naturally incomplete.","The scenes in the ‘memory’ shifted and transformed.","In the scene, ‘he’ waved goodbye to a fairy from the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion—it was a young Pavilion Master Chu.","At this time, Pavilion Master Chu was full of youthful energy, and she looked more like a slightly older sister.","Slow-Witted Song stood at the boundary of the bustling Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, watching ‘him’ leave.","This part of the plot was exactly when the ghost spirit had lived in the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion for a while and finally decided to venture out and explore the world beyond.","After moving away from the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, ‘he’ quietly turned his head to glance at its location.","“I will come back... I will definitely come back in time, wait for me!” the ‘he’ in memory clenched his fist tightly: “I want to seek out more ghost spirits with ‘blank’ attributes, break through my own limits as a ghost spirit, and become stronger.”","Having said that, he then used a quick movement technique and darted forward.","After traveling a very long distance, the ‘he’ in memory stretched out his arms.","“I, Tyrannical Saber Song One, have a wish,” he shouted loudly into the vacuum, “I want to find for the main body a beautiful, talented, capable fairy, and end his child Daoist’s state after he turns eighteen!”","Song Shuhang: “...”","What kind of wish is that?","And why are you shouting so loudly? Are you afraid others won’t know about your main body’s situation?","After shouting, as if he had released some pressure, the ‘he’ in memory took out a notebook: “Compared to the big sister type like Slow-Witted Song, isn’t Senior Sister Ye Si who hasn’t matured and is still very young, more likely to be liked by the main body? Should I consider adding an effect in Senior Sister Ye Si’s techniques that allows one to regain youth upon reaching a certain cultivation level in the future?”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Do you have some kind of misunderstanding about me?"]},{"number":3045,"title":"Chapter 3045 - 3043: What the Will of the Heavens Cannot Do, We Must Achieve!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3045: Chapter 3043: What the Will of the Heavens Cannot Do, We Must Achieve!","Moreover, the New Year has already passed, and I’m past my prime at eighteen.","Next, I’m going to be immortal~","So, Song Shuhang is thinking nonsense!","...","...","The following several fragmentary memory scenes quickly flitted by.","Mostly, they were about Song Shuhang seeking out ownerless Blank Nickname ghost spirits and then figuring out how to fuse their memories. This technique of fusing ghost spirits might be an ability he created previously within the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion. Each time he fused with a Blank Nickname ghost spirit, he managed to break through his own limits, thus ascending another story.","In the meantime, Song Shuhang had also returned to the ‘Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’ to visit Pavilion Master Chu.","In the memory scene, Pavilion Master Chu looked more mature and her dress was similar to the Pavilion Master Chu that Song Shuhang was acquainted with now.","After returning to the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, Song Shuhang strengthened some of the protective measures within and urged Pavilion Master Chu to establish several hidden sanctuaries within the pavilion.","However, in the scenes, Song Shuhang’s cultivation level did not seem very high, appearing to be at the Fifth or Sixth Stage. After losing contact with his main body, he had to rely on himself to advance in cultivation. Just like the myriad practitioners in the universe, he needed to step by step cultivate, and the resources for cultivation had to be seized by himself.","Despite being a petty ghost spirit that could have laid low, he had to bear a burden that did not belong to such a spirit.","Finally, before leaving...","Song Shuhang suddenly proposed to Pavilion Master Chu the suggestion to relocate the ‘Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’.","Opposite him, Pavilion Master Chu actually nodded her agreement.","[She agreed?] Seeing this scene, Song Shuhang was immediately stunned.","Pavilion Master Chu actually agreed to relocate the ‘Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’?","At this time, did her trust in Song Shuhang reach such a level?","Then came the calamity that destroyed the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion...","[Could it be that after agreeing to relocate, they changed location and then encountered that disaster?]","As he pondered, the ‘memory’ scene shifted once again.","In the scene, Song Shuhang was desperately using his escape technique, frantically rushing to a certain location.","He nearly drained all his spiritual power, pushing his escape technique to the limit.","Compared to the previous scene, Song Shuhang’s cultivation seemed to have increased. Was he secluding himself to break through his cultivation level during this period?","Song Shuhang sighed and closed his eyes: “Secluding oneself to cultivate, ah...”","Emotions were complex.","The ‘memory’ scene of Song Shuhang finally arrived at the location of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","As he approached, he hesitated.","From afar, the pavilion still appeared prosperous and lively.","At the entrance of the barrier, a pair of male and female attendants stood guard, dozing slightly, just like in the memories.","Inside the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, disciples moved to and fro, laughing and conversing.","Some were cultivating, some were gathering to exchange tips, and some couples whispered sweet nothings to each other.","It was just like before.","At least on the surface, it seemed just like before.","And Song Shuhang in the ‘memory’ noticed that the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion had not yet relocated... or better said, there hadn’t been time to relocate.","Relocating an entire sect is not something that can be completed within a day or two.","Moving homes and such were not much trouble with ‘technique methods’.","But where should a sect relocate to, what location would be suitable, and where would fit the development of the sect... These all required planning.","From afar, Song Shuhang looked at the bustling Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, as a heart-wrenching pain flooded his mind, this emotion unchanged as it transmitted to Song Shuhang’s heart.","Because everything prosperous before his eyes was an ‘illusory reality’.","“I haven’t changed anything...”","“I didn’t arrive in time... when she needed help the most...”","“Can the past, which cannot be changed, truly not be altered?”","What else can be done?","At this time... can anything else still be done?","For a moment, an emotion to obliterate everything surged from the ‘memories’ into Song Shuhang’s heart.","If it had been at a time when Song Shuhang’s cultivation was still low, just this burst of emotional feedback would have been enough to spawn a delicious Inner Demon.","The excruciating pain likewise infected the present main body of Song Shuhang.","Subconsciously, Song Shuhang reached out to gently touch the dumb hair of Pavilion Master Chu above his head.","‘Snap~’ The dumb hair of Pavilion Master Chu lashed out fiercely: “What’re you up to?”","“Nothing, I’m just removing the Hamster Ball,” Song Shuhang calmly moved his hand up, plucking off the Hamster seal ball, which was like a Calabash Brother, sealed onto his head.","The ‘memory’ scene abruptly stopped.","For the Song Shuhang of that time, there was nothing he could do...","The history of the past seemed to hold some sort of coercive force, preventing him from changing anything...","“Whether the past can be changed or not, I am uncertain; but the future I desire, that I can change,” Song Shuhang placed the ‘Hamster Ball’ into his bosom.","The dumb hair of Pavilion Master Chu looked confused: “???”","Why is Song Shuhang suddenly spouting these strange lines here?","[Even if proving his Dao can’t achieve it, then transcend it.]","What the Will of the Heavens can do, one day we can do too... What the Will of the Heavens can’t do, in the future, we must also achieve!","I am not fighting alone, I am not alone.","Me + Senior White + so many powerful seniors and experts, the Will of the Heavens stands with me!","Pitter-patter~ pitter-patter~","In the Netherworld Realm, Dark Song’s palm let loose several ‘ghost spirit fragments’ that fell off and were then sucked into the ‘Goudan Shell’ held by Father Goudan, being stored away.","From here on, these fragments will need a very long time to recover.","In the final moment that these ‘ghost spirit fragments’ fell away, numerous images passed to Song Shuhang in one breath.","[The White Dragon, save me~]","[Immortal Fairy White Bones, please wait, there’s a speech technique book here...]","[Eh? Little fairy maiden, are you an acquaintance of the Great Northern Emperor? Do you like puppets? If you do, I can teach you how to play with them.]","[Fairy Cheng Lin, has your bosom friend @#%× Fairy started seeing someone? Yes? Then do you mind changing your date, or perhaps, do you mind having one more?]","[Heck, little bamboo shoot, whose treasure are you? When will you change your form? Are you interested in transforming into a cute fairy maiden when you do?]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Stupid egg, what have you done?","[Absolutely must not admit to it, and definitely cannot let anyone know.] Song Shuhang silently swore an oath.","About the fact that the lumber Song was his ghost spirit, he would absolutely not let anyone know.","He would rather die than reveal this secret.","“What’s wrong with you? You look conflicted?” asked the dumb hair of Pavilion Master Chu.","Because the flurry of emotions that crossed Tyrannical Song’s face was too complicated, even the ‘face reading technique’ couldn’t discern the specific information.","Song Shuhang casually pulled out a disposable mask and put it on: “It’s nothing, Senior Chu. It’s just that the final step of Dark Song’s shaping is approaching, so some data from the Netherworld needs to be dealt with.”","After Dark Song’s transmigration is completed by ‘Cheng Lin,’ he will become like Senior White two and other rulers of the Netherworld.","Next, he will become the true Tyrannical Song Two, moving to a higher position.",".",".","It’s almost mid-month again, which means it’s time for the book recommendation segment: The new book “Creation Map”, which sweeps across the Heavens, has been uploaded~ At the annual meeting, we can feast on his banquet again~"]},{"number":3046,"title":"Chapter 3046 - 3044: So, Physically Whitewash the Fat Ball","paragraphs":["Chapter 3046: Chapter 3044: So, Physically Whitewash the Fat Ball","Originally, Dark Song ranked fourth among Song Shuhang’s many clones and manifestations.","However, now that the clone previously known as Song Two had vanished.","Dark Song was promoted to the official ruler of the Netherworld, and in accordance with tradition, he ascended to a rank equivalent to Senior White Two, the striped dragon Two, and the three-eyed Two!","This was the rise to a higher position.","After the rebirth ceremony ended, Dark Song concealed his aura.","Just like Father Goudan at this moment, he could leave the Netherworld Realm at any time and go to the main world... However, once he left the Netherworld Realm, his existence would be severed from it, and he would be unable to return to the Netherworld in a short period.","Then, like Father Goudan, he would rely on the strength of others to penetrate the Netherworld with a strand of consciousness and return home to have a look.","Therefore, Dark Song was not in a hurry to move out of the ‘Netherworld Realm’—after all, whether it was the Heavenly Dao or the Netherworld Realm, both were on his side.","Heavenly Dao would not target him, and Senior White from the Netherworld certainly wouldn’t deal with him either.","He did not need to hide in the main world as Father Goudan did.","After concealing his aura, Dark Song looked at the fat ball, who was weak and in a deep slumber on the ground.","The fat ball was now extremely weak!","But it also turned misfortune into a blessing... As Dark Song was reborn by Fairy Cheng Lin, its connection with the Heavenly Dao was also severed.","Subsequently, even if Daoist Senior stepped down from the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’, this remaining part of the fat ball would not dissipate due to the collapse of the Heavenly Dao.","It’s just that because it had lost nine-tenths of its ‘existence’ to the ‘Sage’s talent,’ the fat ball was now in a long slumber and would probably struggle to recover for thousands or tens of thousands of years—it didn’t want to sleep; it had wanted to grit its teeth and hold on until it escaped danger and infiltrated a safe place to hide and recover.","But it was too weak... Not only was nine-tenths of its ‘existence’ taken away, but even its physical body was largely excised by Daozi, taken away to be purified, and prepared to create more ‘Song fat ball cloaks’ raw materials for Song Shuhang.","Thus, although the will of the fat ball was strong, its body was weak. Ultimately, it could not hold out and, just before the moment of victory, fell unwillingly into a long slumber.","“Senior Brother Daozi, what do you plan to do with the remaining part of the fat ball?” Dark Song asked aloud.","The manifested Heavenly Dao Will responded, “I promised it that as long as it cooperated voluntarily, I would not seal it again, nor would I restrict its freedom, letting it continue to live. Since it has done so... I will not break my promise.”","A gentleman’s agreement is heavier than a mountain.","“However, I did not expect that Fairy Cheng Goudan’s method of rebirth would sever the connection between the Heavenly Dao and it. The methods of the former Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father are truly powerful.” The Heavenly Dao Will expressed admiration.","“You flatter me,” Father Goudan humbly said.","Although Heavenly Dao Father Goudan might have tricked its ‘Companion Magic Device,’ it was undeniable that the individual’s methods were indeed powerful and worthy of being its corresponding Heavenly Dao.","“I originally thought that after I left my position, it would naturally collapse, so I promised that it could linger for a while longer. Now... well, let’s cleanse it!” The Heavenly Dao Will spoke.","“Cleanse it?” Dark Song looked at the dark fat ball and imagined a white version of the fat ball.","Well...","A white ball doesn’t seem as attractive as a black ball?","Moreover, white is fattening.","Seeing how corpulent the fat ball already seemed, would it give off the impression of being too fat if it turned white?","“How do we whitewash this?” the three-eyed young senior asked aloud.","“Just erase the past,” the Will of the Heavenly Axiom flexed its fist, “While I was loading the knowledge base of the Heavenly Dao just now, I discovered that the previous Heavenly Daos had some permission-related development projects, similar to mini programs, that could be activated with a click. Among them, there’s the authority to manually change ‘a portion of the ruler of the Netherworld’s memories.’ Looks like it will come in handy!”","This was a new Heavenly Dao’s function he had just stumbled upon, so he brought it out to show off.","The words of Daozi Senior had barely settled when the faces of several rulers of the Netherworld present became complicated.","Senior White Two’s projected clone, the Three-Eyed Sovereign, and Father Goudan involuntarily rubbed their temples with their hands or dragon mustaches.","Indeed, not a single Heavenly Dao was a benevolent one.","“Which Heavenly Dao came up with this cruel authority to manually adjust memories?” Senior White Two asked through gritted teeth.","This unreliable authority always felt like the handiwork of Heavenly Dao White—he noticed that there were clear gaps in his memories. For instance, during the time when the Heavenly Dao was about to step down, he had no idea how he managed to survive, nor did he know what Wielder of the Will White had done to him.","“Was it the doing of the Heavenly Dao of the Three-Eyed one’s reign? Such low acts seem most likely to have been done by the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao,” Father Goudan said, accusingly.","But there was a guilty tone in his accusations—as far as research and development went, wasn’t it his corresponding Heavenly Dao, the Heavenly Dao Father Goudan who excelled at this?","When the three-eyed young senior was accused by Father Goudan, he also remained silent—since he didn’t even have the confidence to rebut.","Song Dark looked at the three ruling seniors.","It’s so hard to be the ruler of the Netherworld!","“It’s unclear which Heavenly Dao created it; these inheritable permission tricks accumulated over generations of Heavenly Daos. Whether it’s the Second Wielder of the Will who first had rulership over the Netherworld Realm, or the spherical Heavenly Dao, both could be possible,” Daozi Senior said.","Having said that, he unclenched his fist and gave several punches to the already weakened fat ball.","“Are you telling me it’s necessary to punch to alter memories?” the look on Senior White Two’s face grew more complex—had I been beaten like this by Heavenly Dao White too?","“No, I was just trying out the feel,” the Will of Daozi waved its hand, “In actuality, the physical contact between the Heavenly Dao’s main body and the ruler of the Netherworld is all that’s required.”","While he spoke, the Will of Daozi’s palm solidified, transferring over the ‘eternal’ Heavenly Dao’s palm, placing it on the fat ball.","Instantly, the fat ball’s memories turned into numerous files that floated up before Daozi’s eyes.","“First... erase all memories regarding the struggle for the Heavenly Dao seat. Hmm, better make a copy to keep as a memento for Confucianism,” he mused.","“Next, all memories related to Confucianism are to be cleared as well. As for the memory gaps that appear, they’re a bit tricky to fill in. I’ll have to write the plot to fill them... Ah forget it, I’m too lazy to do that, let’s just delete in big chunks. Soulmate, lost a part is soumate; lose a big chunk is also soulmate.”","Daozi made a sweeping gesture, erasing large sections of the fat ball’s memories.","Behind him, the three former rulers of the Netherworld’s hearts trembled—they could almost see themselves in the same position as the fat ball, stealthily approached by the shady Heavenly Dao during their slumber, who then with a wave of its hand, randomly altered their memories.","“Now, the next set of memories are of the rivalry and wit clashes with Lord White; do we change this section?” Daozi Senior considerately inquired.","“No need, no need,” Senior White Two’s projected clone slightly smiled, adding, “Although the fat ball often troubles me, its memories are more entertaining kept intact.”"]},{"number":3047,"title":"Chapter 3047 - 3045 Complete Ruler of the Netherworld, Dao Mark!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3047: Chapter 3045 Complete Ruler of the Netherworld, Dao Mark!","“Now that Fat Ball has become so weak, keeping these memories will make it feel so frustrated and miserable when it wakes up, realizing it has no strength to oppose me. The more frustrated and miserable it is, the more interesting it will be,” Senior White Two said with a smile.","Perhaps because there are still remnants of Fat Ball, which could bring some joy to his future life, Senior White Two was in a particularly good mood, his smile exceptionally radiant.","“Ruler of the Netherworld White, do you still need a sword? If you don’t mind, I’d like to abandon Tyrannical Song and follow you,” said Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Even if you want to abandon someone, shouldn’t it be Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven? Why has it become abandoning me?","As a passerby Song, why should I be abandoned by you for no reason?","Therefore, Song Shuhang’s palm slipped... and the brilliance of three hundred ‘Saber-Nurturing Techniques’ shone forth.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword immediately entered Sage Mode and stopped talking.","The despicable ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’!","Yet so refreshingly satisfying.","“All right, then we’ll keep that portion of memories. Next is little friend Shuhang, and your related memories?” Daoist Senior continued to ask.","“Keep them as well,” Dark Song made the same choice as Senior White Two. “There’s nothing about my memories with the fat ball that needs to be deleted.”","Even though there was a time when fat ball chased him with nowhere to escape in the heavens or on earth, running chaotically across space... But upon careful reflection, in all the confrontations he had with fat ball, he never suffered a major loss!","Whether he was at Fifth Stage, or in the Immortal Realm, most of the time, it was the fat ball who was at a disadvantage.","Since that is the case... why bother erasing Fat Ball’s memories?","It’s happier to keep them, isn’t it?","“Then there’s nothing else to change,” Daoist Senior nodded and withdrew his hand.","Dark flashes of green light flickered intermittently on the pitch-black Fat Ball; these were signs of its memories being continuously deleted and erased under the influence of Heavenly Dao Authority.","The entire process lasted for more than ten minutes before it finally stopped.","The fat ball continued its slumber, which has lasted for tens of thousands of years...","The pitch-black Fat Ball, now reduced by nine-tenths in size, lay quietly on the ground of the Netherworld Realm, motionless.","Looking at the shrunken Fat Ball, Dark Song couldn’t help but think of the ‘Fat Ball Cloak’.","As an enemy, Fat Ball is the most fearsome kind... It is goal-oriented, scheming, intelligent, powerful, and relentless. Except for being somewhat unlucky, Fat Ball hardly has any flaws.","As a companion, Fat Ball turns into the most considerate being... It is clever, thoughtful, caring, and incredibly capable—a single ball is more useful than ten clones.","“I’ll find a place in the Netherworld to send and settle the resting ruler,” Dark Song said.","Leaving the slumbering Fat Ball here at random could likely cause a change among the nearby ‘demodragons’. The longer they stay near the ruler of the Netherworld, the smarter they become, and their cultivation innate skills also improve... For instance, the pets of Senior White Two are obviously much smarter than the average demodragons and have extremely strong cultivation talents.","“I’ll leave the rest to you,” nodded the intent of Daozi, having ‘whitewashed’ the fat ball. He has completely let go of the past grievances in his heart.","Now, apart from pushing Song Shuhang as the next Heavenly Dao, resolving the calamity of the Dark Sun, and taking care of Confucianism, he has no other obsessions.","[Tyrannical Song, you must work harder. I fear I cannot hold on much longer,] Daozi thought to himself.","As he continued to use Heavenly Dao Authority and exert the power of laws, he realized that his ’emotions’ were growing colder and his emotional fluctuations were becoming fewer.","If it wasn’t for the few obsessions in his heart, he might gradually enter a ‘desireless’ state and become as cold and mechanical as a machine.","After all, he had not “completely” proven his Dao, and the Fat Ball Heavenly Dao itself had already been in a programmatic state when resigning, these factors would all affect Daozi.","Song Shuhang rose to his feet and approached the fat ball big shot.","He bent down and picked up the ‘Thin Ball big shot,’ now only the size of a volleyball, and held it up.","“Next... find a suitable location,” Dark Song activated the ‘ruler of the Netherworld authority,’ eyes sweeping over the boundless Netherworld Realm.","As he activated the ‘ruler of the Netherworld authority,’ a faint resonance occurred between him and the ‘Thin Ball big shot’ in his hands.","This resonance spread out through an invisible connection.","The ‘Fat Ball Cloak’ that Song Shuhang’s main body was wearing joined the connection.","In the Sinful Black Lotus World, the Heavenly Dao’s corpse ‘Overlord Corpse’, which Song Shuhang’s ‘excess primordial soul projection + Fat Ball Heavenly Dao’s remains’ had fused into, also joined the connection.","The daughter sitting on the shoulder of the steel manifestation, Xiao Lingxiao, also joined the connected web.","Xiao Lingxiao represented the [liquefied metal ball], which was the Heavenly Dao’s contingency.","Dark Song + Fat Ball clone + Thin Ball big shot represented the [ruler of the Netherworld].","The Overlord Corpse represented the [remains of the Wielder of the Will].","After this spatially spanning linkage combined together, with Dark Song at the center, a set of space coordinates was faintly revealed.","These coordinates, cast into the vacuum, were unknown as to where they were to be cast...","However, these coordinates suddenly veered halfway through, making a 360-degree turnaround.","In the end, the other side of the coordinates connected to Song Shuhang’s main body.","Song Shuhang’s main body was baffled.","“What’s going on?” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword asked in confusion.","Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair gently twisted: “Has Dark Song turned into a coordinate? Connecting to Shuhang?”","“To be precise, it’s a Dao Marker,” the three-eyed young senior said slowly, “So, Shuhang, if you ascend to the Heavenly Dao in the future, you must treat your ruler of the Netherworld well...”","“Senior, I already have a ruler of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang reminded.","“I know, I just meant that in the future you should treat your own ruler of the Netherworld kindly, and not follow the previous Heavenly Dao, who would dismantle the ruler of the Netherworld and conduct cruel experiments with it,” the three-eyed young senior advised.","“Understood,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Speaking of which, if he ascends to the Nine Heavens Dao in the distant future... will another ruler of the Netherworld be born? By then, would he have two rulers of the Netherworld?","“What is a Dao Marker?” Senior White two asked.","He had just noticed the phrasing from the three-eyed young man—he was a Dao Marker, so could he also be a Dao Marker?","“The complete ruler of the Netherworld is the Dao Marker of the Heavenly Dao, that’s all I know... My memories must have been tampered with by the Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes,” the three-eyed young senior added, “It must be the complete ruler of the Netherworld.”","Upon hearing this, Senior White two couldn’t help but glance at his own thigh.","“Is the Dao Marker the coordinate for the Heavenly Dao’s return?” Dark Song, holding the Thin Ball big shot, thought.","He flicked his wrist, and in his hand, the Thin Ball big shot transformed into a glaive.","The Fat Ball big shot was originally the Dao Marker of the ‘liquefied metal ball,’ but the liquefied metal ball had collapsed, thoroughly frozen. Plus, with 90% of the Fat Ball’s existence consumed by Dark Song... did it become the Dao Marker of Song Shuhang?"]},{"number":3048,"title":"Chapter 3048 - 3046 Strike the Salted Fish While It’s Hot","paragraphs":["Chapter 3048: Chapter 3046 Strike the Salted Fish While It’s Hot","“`","Additionally, since there exists a “Dao Mark” that acts as a coordinate to guide the retirement of the Heavenly Dao, it goes without saying...","“Most predecessors of the Heavenly Dao, after stepping down, haven’t thoroughly collapsed and vanished. Instead, did they enter a place not part of the ‘myriad realms’ where they can’t interfere with the main world, or did they go into a state of hibernation?” Song Shuhang speculated.","If there’s a return, then surely there must be a ‘place from which to leave.’","Moreover, if even the Heavenly Dao, endowed with extraordinary talents, needs a ‘coordinate’ to have a chance to return to the main world—that would mean their location is cut off from the world, rendering not even the Heavenly Dao capable of pinpointing the main world directly from there?","Senior Three-Eyed replied, “I’m not very clear about the situations of other Heavenly Daos... but the one corresponding to me definitely hasn’t completely dissipated. Occasionally, when my mood reaches extreme tranquility, I can feel a thread of targeted malice. That familiar malice must be emanating from my corresponding Heavenly Dao.”","Only that Tomb Egg would have such a special malice!","Father Goudan similarly stated calmly, “Heavenly Dao Father Goudan once told me that it was about to free itself from the Heavenly Dao seat. For this, a multitude of methods were prepared. In the end, in order to leave me behind as well, it overthrew the previous several sets of plans...”","With Heavenly Dao Father Goudan’s personality, it would surely only execute the plan to break free when there was absolute certainty! Father Goudan was certain of this.","Senior White Two’s projected clone nodded slightly, “The case of Wielder of the Will White is somewhat special, he has completely broken away. However, before doing so, he had reached a state of near-transcendence. So, after nearing transcendence, what kind of fallback he could arrange for the distant future, is anyone’s guess... Shuhang, you still often see that white horse roaming around.”","If you say Wielder of the Will White has completely cooled off, not even ghosts would believe it!","[So the Heavenly Dao corresponding to Lord White once neared transcendence?] At this moment, Daozi’s heart was filled with admiration for the successive Heavenly Daos. Compared with each generation of Heavenly Dao that never ceased to astound with their schemes, his biggest flaw was indeed not being cunning enough!","“So from the current perspective, only the liquefied metal ball corresponding to Fat Ball has collapsed more thoroughly due to its incomplete nature... Before its collapse, it had turned into a tool ball, and most of the fallbacks it left behind have become ineffective due to certain reasons,” Song Shuhang said while stroking his chin.","Scarlet Heaven Sword remarked in a soft voice, “You are that ‘certain reason,’ you instigator.”","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, don’t speak nonsense. Daozi and Senior White are the real culprits, I’m at most an accomplice,” Song Shuhang hurriedly said.","Daozi’s will: “...”","Well, he would be happy to take on the role of the instigator—it was he, Daozi, who struck down the fat ball, and he who destroyed its hope! You can all pin this blame on me; I’m happy to bear it!","To be precise, any disciple of Confucianism would gladly bear this blame!","For members of Confucianism, to carry this blame is a supreme honor!","“Aside from the Heavenly Dao Ball... My former friend, Daoist Priest Virtue, probably didn’t make it through the final phase either. After taking office, Wielder of the Will White had gone to confirm the status and clues of Daoist Priest Virtue. But the conclusion was rather regrettable,” Senior White Two added.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang’s mind conjured the image of Daoist Priest Virtue restarting the entire myriad realms, entering his ‘Tomb of Immortality’ and then suddenly dashing out in frenzy.","The outcome of Daoist Priest Virtue does not seem promising.","“Is Daoist Priest Virtue the Sixth Heavenly Dao before Lord White? Was he a practitioner of the power virtue?” Father Goudan suddenly asked, his interest piqued.","Senior White shook his head, “No, like Shuhang, the light of virtue was only a secondary path for him. However, he had amassed a great amount of virtue, which suggests he might have cultivated some principle of virtue.”","“Then the ruler of the Netherworld’s body for him is indeed too tragic,” Father Goudan remarked with empathy.","“`","Father Goudan, you’re overthinking it,” Song Shuhang replied. “In fact, memories related to the power of virtue don’t feel particularly strange to my Netherworld Body. Moreover, memories concerning the power of virtue get automatically beautified in the mind of the ruler of the Netherworld.”","Song Shuhang was very authoritative on this matter.","His own light of virtue was so immense it was unparalleled throughout history and across the myriad practitioners in the universe. It was extremely difficult to find anyone whose power of virtue was more formidable than his.","And if he were to step into Dark Song’s shoes and recall anything about the ‘power of virtue,’ those memories would automatically be beautified.","“For the ruler of the Netherworld, the power of virtue is actually a neutral force. Although it’s uncomfortable, it’s not loathsome... If it were a Heavenly Dao that cultivated within the holy light element, then the ruler of the Netherworld would truly despair,” the three-eyed young senior said.","“I think even that would be beautified. If it were a Heavenly Dao proven through the holy light element, perhaps in the ruler of the Netherworld’s eyes, it would be transformed into something like ‘dark light’?” Song Shuhang speculated.","“Why don’t we give it a try when we have the chance?” Father Goudan felt an itch to take action. “Together, let’s see if we can cultivate a Heavenly Dao of the ‘holy light element’?”","Upon hearing this, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword couldn’t help but say, “I feel like you and Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven... my master would have a lot in common.”","“But, I’m afraid there won’t be a chance,” the three-eyed young senior said with regret. “The next is the Ninth Heavenly Dao. This incarnation of the Heavenly Dao has too many issues to address and resolve; it would be best if Song Shuhang takes the higher position, with us assisting him by the side to solve the crisis. Speaking of which, what’s your own desire, Shuhang?”","“Don’t worry, the Ninth Heavenly Dao—I’ll definitely take it on,” Tyrannical Song exclaimed, as if infused with a new vigor from his previously listless demeanor.","Hot blood had been injected into the salted fish.","Apart from the heavy burden of saving the world, Song Shuhang now had other matters to resolve.","If these things couldn’t be solved by the Heavenly Dao, then break free from it!","Daoist Senior felt relieved upon hearing this.","“That’s too bad. I just found we have something in common, and I wanted to collaborate with you,” Father Goudan said with some disappointment.","“Maybe there will be a chance,” Senior White two suggested. “The Ninth Heavenly Dao isn’t the last one. Perhaps there will be an opportunity to have a Tenth Heavenly Dao.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","If in the future, there truly exists the possibility of a ‘Tenth Heavenly Dao’ or something like an ‘Eleventh Heavenly Dao.’","Then the ‘holy light element’ might have a great surge.","After all, with so many powerful beings acting covertly.","Perhaps they might truly manage to bring forth a Heavenly Dao of the ‘holy light element.’","This situation had the feel of “supreme powers secretly plotting the future behind the scenes.”","And he, Tyrannical Song, might also get a chance to play a small role in such a grand scheme.","“We’ll talk about the future in the future... For now, let’s focus on the present,” the will of Daozi said. “Fellow Daoist Shuhang, let’s move on to the next step, allowing Immortal White to also inherit the teacher’s innate ability.”","Tyrannical Song’s blood was finally boiling; while his blood was still hot, it was time to strike the iron fish!"]},{"number":3049,"title":"Chapter 3049 - 3047: White: Shuhang, Your Timing Couldn’t Be Worse","paragraphs":["Chapter 3049: Chapter 3047: White: Shuhang, Your Timing Couldn’t Be Worse","“But, Senior White’s main body is still in that seal, is there a way to temporarily swap out Senior White’s main body?” Song Shuhang asked.","Senior White’s main body, Senior White two gold thigh, white crane’s wings stretched white horse, Numbers 1-33 Unknown White, are now all in that seal, tasked with pressing the ‘Dark Sun big shot’ to the ground and rubbing it, preventing it from coming out and causing trouble.","“Don’t worry, since Fellow Daoist White temporarily can’t come out of the sealing formation... then why don’t you just enter the sealing formation?” Daoist Senior reminded.","The sealing formation was mainly to suppress the Dark Sun internally.","But as long as it does not affect the operation of the sealing formation, letting Tyrannical Song enter the sealing formation to check things out and such has no problem at all.","“Is that possible?” Song Shuhang wondered.","“Reattach my ‘Heavenly Dao Level Calculation’ assistive ability, and with us backing you, we guarantee that we can send you to Immortal White’s side without affecting the formation’s operation,” the will of Daozi assured.","Father Goudan, upon hearing this, couldn’t help but sigh internally, “Heavenly Dao Level Calculation ability, talking about attaching it just like that... Why didn’t I encounter such good fortune in my time?”","Tyrannical Song, with his mortal body, enjoys the conveniences brought by ‘Heavenly Dao’ every day, and the Heavenly Dao authority is almost becoming Tyrannical Song’s backyard.","“You’re dreaming,” the three-eyed young senior sneered—Father Goudan’s predecessor was him, yet he still expects his Heavenly Dao to open cheats for him? Dreams should be kept for nighttime!","“I feel that in the future, more people will enjoy this benefit,” said the Heavenly Emperor’s child with a smile.","After Senior Song proves his Dao and becomes immortal, perhaps the Nine Provinces Number One Group and his disciples, daughter, little girlfriend, and such could enjoy these ‘Heavenly Dao cheat’ benefits as well?","Of course, the prerequisite is that these people must be able to ‘endure the Heavenly Dao’s breath.’","A Heavenly Dao cheat isn’t something you can just access whenever you want; if you don’t have the constitution to bear the ‘Heaven’s Will,’ once this Heavenly Dao cheat is added, the false cannot withstand the truth, and you’d just drop dead.","Too bad, if she was like Soft Feather, truly a junior of Tyrannical Song, her path of cultivation would definitely be smoother, without so much nitpicking and struggle.","“Then seniors, I’ll go see Senior White first,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Meanwhile, he also arranged his clones.","Dark Song continued to stay in the Netherworld Realm, quickly adapting to the complete Netherworld authority. Song Shuhang had a hunch that in the future, Dark Song and the Netherworld authority would come in handy—in the meantime, he handed Hamster over to Dark Song.","Then, his self-corpse was left by Song Shuhang in the ‘Heavenly Dao Time Secret Realm,’ replacing the main body to communicate and discuss with the myriad practitioners in the universe, absorbing more Mysterious Principles of Immortal to inspire him.","The steel manifestation continued to play with the kids.","The Heavenly Dao’s Remnant Shell ? Overlord Corpse only needed to quietly fulfill its role as a corpse.","After finishing everything, Song Shuhang turned and entered the world of the sealing ‘Dark Sun.’","Upon sensing someone approaching, Numbers 1-33 Unknown White simultaneously opened their eyes and looked towards the spot where Song Shuhang was entering.","Being stared at simultaneously by thirty-three Seniors White, the feeling was simply thirty-three thumbs up.","Song Shuhang quietly recorded this scene and sent it through the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ to True Monarch White Crane.","Initially, True Monarch White Crane was perplexed: “???”","Then, as he saw the thirty-three Senior Whites all simultaneously turning their gaze through the ‘video’ to look in the direction of the camera, that feeling of being gazed at by thirty-three Senior Whites’ eyes nearly made him transcend with joy.","“Tyrannical Song, from today onwards, I am your best buddy,” True Monarch White Crane felt he was now dying without any regrets.","“Best sisters,” Song Shuhang corrected.","True Monarch White Crane was startled, “Best sisters? Tyrannical Song, are you a girl?”","“Senior White Crane, haven’t you been presenting yourself as a fairy lately? So, you should be my best sister,” Song Shuhang corrected.","“Buzz off!” True Monarch White Crane snapped.","“Then I’m off, [Kind Smile Emoji],” Song Shuhang said, and then, he turned off the broadcast camera.","True Monarch White Crane: “!!!”","After ending the call with Senior White Crane, Song Shuhang waved towards the thirty-three Unknown Whites, “Seniors White, I’m going to enter the formation and meet Senior White in the main world.”","“Hmm.” The thirty-three Unknown Whites nodded together, their actions synchronized due to their soul link.","“Speaking of which, if this scene were photographed and printed, how many spirit stones could it sell for if I put it up in the ‘Cultivator Chat System’?”","This is a big business opportunity!","Tyrannical Song had just discovered a new business venture.","After the 33 unknown Whites agreed, Song Shuhang stood up and began to enter the formation.","With the aid of Heavenly Axiom-level calculation capabilities loaded, Tyrannical Song was able to clearly “see” the path he should take to enter the formation without disrupting its operation.","Once he entered the nucleus of the formation, he saw Senior White two’s golden thighs and the drama king white horse.","At that moment, the drama king white horse was carrying the golden thighs on its side, pretending someone was riding on it and mimicking a ‘racing across the plains’ pose while trotting in place.","It was having a blast.","Song Shuhang: “...”","When the drama king white horse saw Song Shuhang approaching, it blinked its eyes.","Then, it silently placed the golden thighs of Senior White two down from its side.","Afterward, it acted as if nothing had happened and began to stroll along the trajectory of the sealing formation.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Originally, he was worried that the drama king white horse might feel too stifled or uncomfortable within the seal. Now, it seemed to be thoroughly enjoying itself.","The trajectory within the sealed nucleus kept rotating, and after the drama king white horse and the golden thighs passed, the present-day Senior White rotated into Song Shuhang’s view.","—Actually, the drama king white horse didn’t need to move; the three Senior Whites just had to stay on the trajectory, and the seal would operate without any issues.","As the trajectory rotated, the present-day Senior White appeared.","At that time, Senior White was sitting cross-legged, with a box of fruits next to him, a fruit held in his mouth, and his fingers were flying over his phone with astonishing speed.","Faintly, Song Shuhang could hear combat sound effects coming from the phone... it was the sound of a game.","It seemed that Senior White sensed Song Shuhang’s gaze.","Senior White slowly looked up.","Then, he saw a dumbfounded Song Shuhang.","Senior White was slightly startled.","Then he quickly packed up his phone and fruits. The fruit in his mouth was also swallowed in one go—without spitting out the seed.","Next, Senior White posed in a ‘meditative cultivation’ stance and closed his handsome eyes.","He calmly entered a meditative state.","“Senior White, I saw everything,” said Song Shuhang, who was not very good at reading the room.","He directly exposed Senior White’s act.","“Oh, Shuhang, you’re here,” Senior White opened his eyes and said with an air of immortality, “What brings you here?”","“I’ve come to bring the ‘Confucian Sage’ innate skill to Senior White,” replied Song Shuhang, sitting cross-legged in front of Senior White.","“You’ve come at the wrong time,” Senior White said slowly.","Song Shuhang was stunned: “???”","Could it be that there was a change in the seal?","“I was about to win that round just now. Your interruption means I’ll probably lose that game,” Senior White replied.","Song Shuhang: “...”"]},{"number":3050,"title":"Chapter 3050 - 3048: Dark Sun: What Kind of Monsters Are These!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3050: Chapter 3048: Dark Sun: What Kind of Monsters Are These!","“Senior White, aren’t you going to take advantage of the ‘Sealing’ to also close up for some cultivation?” Song Shuhang asked with a puzzled tone.","You should know, Senior White is the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’s’ madman when it comes to closing off for cultivation. Whenever he had time, he would seize every second to cultivate in seclusion.","But the current Senior White, instead of closing off, seemed to be having a great time.","Could it be that he was infected by the black horse’s acting bug?","——The confusion Song Shuhang felt at the moment was mostly feigned, as he was quietly shifting the topic. Moreover, the way he shifted the topic was extremely stiff and shoddy.","“I’ve been in continuous seclusion,” Senior White pointed to himself and said, “Look, I’m in a state of cultivation right now.”","Song Shuhang was stunned.","In cultivation right now?","But Senior White, you’re clearly talking to me...","While he was pondering, suddenly, he thought of a possibility.","“Could it be a background cultivation mode?” Song Shuhang asked—referring to his exclusive Song Family’s cultivation method called ‘Background Cultivation.’","In this mode, one could cultivate, gain enlightenment, listen to the Dharma, and eat meals all at the same time.","Some ‘motionless’ activities could run in the background, while actions requiring movement could be switched to the foreground.","“Yes, that’s it,” Senior White nodded and said, “Ever since I learned about your cultivation mode, I tried it a little and got the hang of it. Since then... I’ve been in seclusion every moment of every day. If I calculate the total duration of background cultivation hanging up, it should already be over three months. So, I can cultivate while playing games.”","“As expected of Senior White.” Song Shuhang skillfully gave a seamless flattery.","No wonder it always felt like Senior White’s time spent in seclusion seemed a bit less lately. It turned out Senior White had mastered the skill of ‘background cultivation.’","Their conversation was overheard by the Dark Sun sealed within.","[What the hell is background cultivation? And always hanging up for cultivation?]The Dark Sun felt the word ‘cultivation’ in its mind was being ground and insulted by the two guys outside.","Stop, your way of cultivation has no soul!","Moreover, how can background cultivation even count as cultivation?","Cultivation is about cutting yourself off from the world, closing your cave dwelling, sitting down alone to cultivate and seek enlightenment. That’s what ‘cultivation’ means!","Cultivation isn’t some kind of skill.","Do you two have some misunderstanding about the word ‘cultivation’?","“Right, did you successfully master the Sage’s ‘innate skill’ from Confucianism? How did it go?” Senior White asked.","“Fantastic!” Song Shuhang gave a thumbs-up and said, “After using the secret technique, the ruler of the Netherworld, fat ball, was devoured by me in one breath, nine-tenths of its existence gone. Now, the unconscious fat ball will probably need tens of thousands of years to wake up. During its slumber, my corresponding Netherworld Ruler Body, ‘Dark Song,’ is getting ready to use it as a Companion Magic Device.”","[The Sage’s innate skill of Confucianism? Swallowed nine-tenths of the ruler of the Netherworld’s existence? Is this the ability aimed at me?]The Dark Sun’s heart stirred, growing more uneasy.","At the same time, it cautiously raised its Sensing Ability, listening attentively to the exchange between Song Shuhang and Senior White.","...","...","“So next it’s your turn, Senior White. The brand-new ‘Language Text Immortality Technique’ I have can be offered as a sacrificial ritual, aiding you in inheriting the Sage’s talent,” Song Shuhang added.","Senior White countered, “After offering this ‘Language Text Immortality Technique,’ do you have any leads on a backup path to immortality?”","Previously, during the ‘Xuan Nu Sect’s Profound Sage Speech Live Broadcast,’ Song Shuhang offered the ‘Seeking Life Through Death Method’ only to immediately connect to the ‘Language Text Immortal Path,’ seamlessly keeping from falling from the Immortal Realm.","So this time, Senior White wanted to know if Song Shuhang had a third ‘path to immortality’ in nascent form that could seamlessly link up.","“I have some leads. I’m contemplating constructing the next path to immortality primarily around ‘karmic virtues’ or ‘light of virtue.’ However, I haven’t organized the outline of this way to immortality yet...” Song Shuhang honestly replied.","Truth be told, even if he fell from the Immortal Realm, it wouldn’t affect him much.","His confrontational strength didn’t rely on the ‘Immortal Realm.’","Besides, with a complete Netherworld Ruler Body ‘Dark Song’ at his disposal, his combat power wouldn’t be affected at all.","Moreover, in a day or two of the outside world’s time at most, he could perfect a new immortal path and return to the Immortal Realm.","“It’s better to complete a ‘seamless transfer.’ If your realm falls, it might leave some hidden problems,” Senior White stroked his chin, pondering, “Song Shuhang, send me the data you’ve organized about the ‘karmic virtues, light of virtue’ immortality methods first.”","“Alright,” Song Shuhang opened his divine eye on his forehead and sent all the data regarding his insights into the ‘karmic virtues, light of virtue’ network immortal methods, all packaged, to Senior White.","Compared to ‘karmic,’ Song Shuhang’s understanding of ‘virtue’ was much deeper. The power of virtue accumulated on his body was too immense, and coupled with the virtuous lamia possessing a set of ‘virtuous secret techniques,’ it greatly aided Song Shuhang in comprehending the ‘Virtuous Immortality.’","After receiving the information, Senior White began to mull over it, “I see, that’s the case. Hmm, I understand this part... This part makes sense as well, there should be no big problem. Song Shuhang, give me about an hour.”","“No problem,” Song Shuhang nodded in response.","Although he had no idea what Senior White was planning to do, an hour was merely a blink of an eye.","[An hour? Sounds like a unit of time measurement in some world? Doesn’t seem too long, does it?]The Dark Sun pondered in curiosity.","It quickly figured out the concept of ‘an hour.’","[That short? What can you do in that time?]","For a Big Boss who needed several years just to condense a single pill, an hour was extremely short.","What can be done in such a short time?","Soon... the Dark Sun discovered what an hour could mean for Senior White and Song Shuhang.","“Good, I’ve got it,” about 58 minutes later, Senior White opened his eyes and nodded with satisfaction.","From his body, a new ‘path to immortality blueprint’ shone forth.","This new ‘path to immortality blueprint’ was a network created from the combination of virtue and karmic, a way of immortality that could connect many people through karma and virtue.","[Wengba, wengba!]The Dark Sun was so shocked that it revealed its ancient language’s dialect.","An hour, and they deduced a formative path to immortality from ‘virtue and karmic’?","What kind of monsters are these?","Too wengba!","Is this even humanly possible?","Or rather, are they truly human?","“Next, Song Shuhang offers the ‘immortal path,’ and we start the Sage’s talent inheritance ceremony... While you perform the Sage’s talent on me, I’ll transfer this ‘path to immortality blueprint’ along with a part of my existence to you,” Senior White said."]},{"number":3051,"title":"Chapter 3051 - 3049: King Kun: I’m going to die, I’m going to die!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3051: Chapter 3049: King Kun: I’m going to die, I’m going to die!","The main issue is that transferring a complete path to immortality is riskier, and not as compatible as the ’embryonic form of the path to immortality.’","Otherwise, give Senior White a bit more time, and he could directly deduce the ‘Karma Virtuous Path to Immortality’ to the level of a complete path to immortality—after all, both karma and virtue are integral parts of what Senior White studied.","The ’embryonic form of the path to immortality’ that Senior White himself initially concocted involved both karma and virtue.","So, after obtaining the informational data from Song Shuhang, revising the Karma Virtuous Path to Immortality for Song Shuhang was a piece of cake for him.","“Even I, back when I was at the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, was not such a monster,” thought the Dark Sun, comparing his former self to the Immortal White before him...","To become immortal through proving one’s Dao, almost everyone’s innate skill had reached a level that shook the heavens and earth.","But recalling the time he initially concocted the ’embryonic form of the path to immortality’, even converting that time into Immortal White’s time units, it still measured in ‘years.’","The difference between years and hours is indeed substantial.","“Stay calm, stay calm. There’s definitely more to this; deducing an ’embryonic path to immortality’ within an hour is too exaggerated... Maybe they’re playing mind games.” The Dark Sun stabilized his emotions and began to speculate and guess.","Meanwhile, outside, Song Shuhang and Senior White had already started to take action.","Both were men of action; after confirming the plan, they briefly reviewed the process and then got straight to work.","The Confucian Sage Book was summoned by Song Shuhang.","The cover that Daozi added immediately started twinkling, protecting the ‘Dao’ within it from being sacrificed.","“Now, come out @#$&%!” Song Shuhang called out handsomely.","The virtuous lamia responded to his call, emerging from behind him.","The first thing she did after appearing was to wrap her tail around Song Shuhang, constricting him tightly like a giant snake capturing its prey, as if she intended to hunt Song Shuhang alive.","“Stop messing around, we have serious business, Fairy,” said Song Shuhang.","Give me some face!","Moreover, with his current constitution, even if the virtuous lamia exerted all her strength from the eggshell, she couldn’t make Song Shuhang feel the slightest pressure.","The virtuous lamia was choked up with frustration.","“Fairy, gouge out the eyeballs,” Song Shuhang reminded.","Don’t disrupt the rhythm!","Upon hearing those words, the virtuous lamia’s eyes lit up. She placed her hands on Song Shuhang’s eye sockets and gently scooped out both his eyeballs.","Then, Song Shuhang was blinded.","It was the virtuous lamia’s minor act of retaliation.","But still...","“Well done,” Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","True to her name, the virtuous lamia didn’t need much explanation to fully grasp his intent.","Then Song Shuhang pointed his finger, and the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eye’ that was replaced reverted back to its Golden Core form and returned to the ‘External Dragon Network System’, swapping out another Sage’s eye that hadn’t been sacrificed, and installed it in Song Shuhang’s right eye.","Then, the other ‘ glazed eyeball’ held by the virtuous lamia gently floated up.","“Come out, Tyrant!” Song Shuhang summoned again.","Three Corpses ? Tyrant came through the ‘main world’ as a transit, crossing space to arrive.","As he returned, he also brought along the ‘egg of King Kun’—his original task was to go to Senior White two’s Sinful Black Lotus world to bring back the egg of King Kun.","Previously, the egg of King Kun was still under study by Senior White two’s research manifestation.","Now, as the research ended, Tyrant conveniently brought it along.","...","...","When the egg of King Kun was brought over, it just so happened to see the scene where Tyrant Song gouged out his eyeballs and summoned the ‘Confucian Classics.’","— Fuck, wasn’t this the scene from earlier where Tyrant Song sacrificed his own ‘path to immortality’ in front of the myriad practitioners in the universe?","Is Tyrant Song doing this again?","Is he going to sacrifice another path to immortality and a Scholarly Sage’s eye?","— Tyrannical Song’s own path to immortality had already been sacrificed once.","Even if Tyrannical Song were a monstrous genius, there was no way a third ‘immortal path’ would be seamlessly waiting for him at this time!","Such a monstrous existence was impossible in this world!","Therefore, if Tyrannical Song were to conduct a sacrificial ritual this time, he would definitely sacrifice someone else’s immortal path.","It was obvious to anyone with a brain that Tyrannical Song would never allow himself to fall below the realm of ‘Immortal’!","Under this premise, he had been brought before Tyrannical Song by the Three Corpses Evil Corpse.","Was there even a need to guess the outcome?","Indeed, the next sacrifice would be me, right?","The ‘immortal path’ I’ve diligently cultivated is about to become Tyrannical Song’s sacrificial offering.","How tragic, being a Kun, it’s too tragic.","Clashing with Tyrannical Song felt exhilarating for a moment, but after being captured alive by Tyrannical Song, the past delights turned into present miseries.","I’m going to die, this time I’m definitely doomed.","I don’t even know if the immortal path, once sacrificed, will still have a chance to be cultivated again?","During the process of sacrifice of the immortal path, will it be painful?","Escape was already impossible, the egg of King Kun knew it could never escape from the palm of Tyrannical Song... At this point, it could only hope that Tyrannical Song would be a bit gentler later.","Inside the egg of King Kun, the consciousness of King Kun was filled with despair and trembling.","It closed its senses, quietly awaiting the merciless fate about to fall upon its head.","...","...","Song Shuhang summoned Tyrant after, pointing at that ‘glazed eyeball’—this glazed eyeball contained the Mysterious Principles of the ‘knowledge and language longevity technique.’","Tyrant nodded, then turned to face the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous fairy stretched her hand into Tyrant’s eye socket and, while at it, fitted the ‘glazed eyeball’ inside.","“So, main body, Senior White, @#%× Fairy, I’ll take the lead,” Tyrant bowed to them.","Afterward, he returned to the main world and dove into the Netherworld Realm.","Then from the Netherworld Realm he boarded the ‘small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword’ to enter the small black room of the Will of the Heavens and disappeared from the memories of the practitioners in the universe.","“Ready,” Song Shuhang activated his Magical Techniques, conjuring a new glazed eyeball in his empty eye socket.","Next step.","The Confucian Classic brightened.","Song Shuhang activated the modified ‘Saint’s secret technique.’","The other ‘Sage Eye Golden Core’ in his eye socket burned with golden flames, becoming a sacrificial offering.","“Very good, everything is smooth, next step,” Song Shuhang continued.","“I understand, be gentle, Tyrannical Song,” the egg of King Kun trembled as it transmitted its thought.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Be gentle my foot!","Your sudden sound transmission almost interrupted my ritual.","“Shut up,” Song Shuhang said.","Then, the secret technique of the Sage’s Eye enveloped him, and the freshly minted New Immortality ‘knowledge and language path to immortality’ was also integrated into the Saint’s secret technique, becoming a sacrificial offering.","Song Shuhang’s realm began to weaken once more.","The ‘full moon of Immortal’ above his head started to dim.","[Not sacrificing me?] thought the egg of King Kun.","Or perhaps Tyrannical Song, distracted by my disruption, accidentally sacrificed himself?"]},{"number":3052,"title":"Chapter 3052 - 3050: Come, Senior White, swallow me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3052: Chapter 3050: Come, Senior White, swallow me!","“[Ruthless.] When the Dark Sun behemoth witnessed this scene, his heart stirred.”","“Within a single day, sacrificing his own way to immortality twice, such ruthlessness toward oneself, the likes of which even the Dark Sun behemoth, who had lived for so long, had never before encountered.”","“It was almost as if he bore a grudge against himself.”","“Truth be told, such ruthless people are the last ones you should provoke... If he doesn’t even cherish himself, what makes you think he would care about the world?”","“But from a certain perspective, might this guy have much in common with him?”","“Perhaps, later on, he might try to tempt this guy and see if he could recruit him to his own camp?”","As he pondered this, Song Shuhang’s secret technique was already complete.","“Once is happenstance, twice is familiarity.”","This time, the ‘Sage’s secret technique’ was completed 20% faster than before, improving the efficiency significantly.”","As the ‘Sage Eye Golden Core’ in his eye sockets again dried up to only a Golden Core membrane, and all of the ‘language and text’ paths to immortality within him were sacrificed, Song Shuhang opened the “Confucian Classic,” directing it toward Senior White.”","The Sage’s innate ability merged into Senior White’s body.”","“The inheritance of Sage’s innate ability is chancy... But no matter how slim the chance is, even one in a billion, if it benefits Senior White, then this chance is no different from one hundred percent.”","“Now, acquiring the Sage’s talent is precisely the outcome Senior White desired.”","“The entire inheritance ceremony went off without a hitch.”","“[Now is the moment!] At this moment, King Kun saw Tyrannical Song’s weakness.”","“Falling from the ‘Immortal Realm’ would indeed leave him weak for a little while.”","“King Kun felt that his opportunity had arrived—the gates of freedom seemed to be opening for him.”","“But just then, Tyrannical Song’s aura suddenly shifted.”","“An aura that could swallow mountains and rivers, wanting to consume all things, surged from Tyrannical Song.”","“Not only that, an aura that made the shell of King Kun tingle emerged from Tyrannical Song—the aura of a Confucian Sage!”","“As an Immortal who had been beaten and taught by a Confucian Sage, the moment King Kun sensed this aura, his legs went weak.”","...","...","“Following Senior White’s instructions, as the ‘Sage’s talent inheritance ceremony’ was in its final stages, before the ‘Immortal full moon’ behind Senior White’s head completely faded, Song Shuhang applied the ‘Confucian Sage Talent’ to Senior White.”","“On the other side, Senior White did not resist but actively worked with Song Shuhang’s application of the ‘Sage’s talent,’ and also offered up the already prepared ‘karmic and virtue embodiment of the embryonic form of the way to immortality.’”","“They swallowed parts of each other’s ‘existence’—a crucial part of the planned strategy of [two different entities proving their Dao simultaneously] devised by Song Shuhang, Senior White, and Senior Two.”","“No need for too much, just a small portion of each other’s ‘existence’ was enough.”","“With Senior White not resisting and cooperating with Song Shuhang’s actions, the process went very smoothly. Since it was Senior White’s own intent, Song Shuhang did not have to worry about any ‘calamities’ befalling him during the process.”","“Sage’s talent returned.”","“It brought back a small part of Immortal White’s existence, along with the embryonic form of the way to immortality.”","“This embryonic form of the way to immortality, initially derived by Immortal White based on the insights and information given by Song Shuhang, was supremely compatible with Song Shuhang himself.”","“Upon accepting this part of ‘the embryonic form of the way to immortality,’ Song Shuhang instantaneously comprehended and understood this way to immortality.”","“At the same time, ‘Heavenly Dao’s Deduction Ability’ loaded upon him.”","Under the deduction of the Heavenly Axiom level, the original embryonic form of the Dao of Longevity was forcefully expanded into a spacious and complete path to immortality.","The ‘full moon’ of the immortal that was originally dim behind Song Shuhang’s head brightened up once again!","The whole process ended in the blink of an eye.","The time it took for the egg of King Kun to be stunned... and then Tyrannical Song regained the Immortal Realm once again.","This path involving karmic and the light of virtue was upright and direct, a King’s Immortality method, and its level was likewise not inferior to the ‘Seeking Life Through Death Method’ and ‘Language, Writing Longevity Method’.","Not only that, in a cycle of destruction and establishment, establishment and destruction, and establishment after destruction, the aura on Tyrannical Song became even more terrifying.","Every cycle made Tyrannical Song stronger.","As long as it was not the setback of death, it would make a person stronger!","Feeling that Tyrannical Song had become more terrifying and stronger, the egg of King Kun instantly chickened out.","Could you believe Tyrannical Song actually had a third path of immortality for backup? Was this the work of a mortal?","[Fortunately, I hadn’t started my ‘escape’ action yet... Otherwise, just as I started to run, I might have been captured by Tyrannical Song. Then I would be waiting for the frying pot and the barbecue grill.] King Kun felt a wave of relief inside.","It clearly remembered that several of the pendants on Tyrannical Song, upon hearing its identity as ‘Kun,’ immediately started clamoring for barbecue.","If Tyrannical Song caught the opportunity, it would probably really roast him.","What’s worse, as an existence at the Immortal level, even if a portion of him was sliced off for barbecue, it would grow back after a while.","Then what awaited him would be the real hell.","Being cowardly brought a peaceful interlude...","So, the egg of King Kun quietly calmed down.","Senior White opened his eyes and asked, “Was it successful?”","“Yes, Senior White, very successful,” Song Shuhang replied.","The path to immortality that combined karmic and the light of virtue was more successful than imagined, and better suited to become the ‘fiber of the Cultivator Chat System’.","Originally, Song Shuhang had only thought about using either the light of virtue or karmic, with a personal preference towards using the power of ‘light of virtue’ to weave a path to immortality.","But Senior White directly mixed the two together.","Now, Song Shuhang was trying to use this new path to immortality to weave the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group into this network, connecting them together for the distant future.","However, the ‘portion of existence’ he obtained from Senior White was still operating peacefully within Song Shuhang’s energy system.","This portion of existence, unlike the ‘existence of the fat ball’ that was swallowed before.","The portion of the fat ball’s existence that was swallowed was then transferred to ‘Dark Song’, quickly merged with Dark Song, and was absorbed completely by her.","However, the portion of ‘existence’ from Senior White that entered Song Shuhang’s energy system operated along with his immortal energy without showing any signs of fusion.","They still remained two completely different entities.","If they cannot merge, remaining two different entities, would the future plan of [two different entities proving their Dao simultaneously]not be doomed?","“Is something missing?” Song Shuhang wondered aloud.","“Is there a problem?” Seeing Song Shuhang’s serious expression, Senior White asked.","“Unable to fuse,” Song Shuhang described his current situation.","“Hmm... what’s missing might be because you are still ‘complete’. Since you are still complete, adding another portion would become superfluous,” Senior White speculated."]},{"number":3053,"title":"Chapter 3053 - 3051: Shocking, Eternity Could Actually Be Devoured!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3053: Chapter 3051: Shocking, Eternity Could Actually Be Devoured!","Song Shuhang suddenly had an epiphany.","It made sense.","If you have two hands, wouldn’t adding another simply make three hands?","And normal people don’t have a place to attach a third hand anyway!","Therefore, to fuse the ‘portion of existence’ obtained from Senior White, one needs to enter the next phase!","“Come on, Senior White, devour a portion of my existence,” Song Shuhang said boldly.","The atmosphere turned solemn.","[That’s so ruthless!] The watching Dark Sun involuntarily shrank back its light.","Not only has he sacrificed his ‘way to immortality’ over and over, but now he’s even ready to relinquish his ‘existence’ to let someone else devour it... It’s like he doesn’t consider his own body as anything valuable, this is self-abuse!","The egg of King Kun kept a low profile, reducing its aura to the limit.","Fearing that any accidental leakage of its aura could affect Tyrannical Song, and then it would get swallowed in one gulp.","On the sealing track.","Senior White first operated the ‘Confucian Saint Talent’ to get familiar with the operation process and effects of this innate skill.","“Ready,” Senior White notified.","He raised his two fingers in front of his eyes, and the Sage’s talent activated.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath, trying hard to relax himself and cooperate with Senior White.","[Here it comes again, here it comes again.] The egg of King Kun sensed the aura of the Confucian Sage once more.","But this time, the source of the aura was Immortal White.","[Just how many contingency plans did the Confucian Sage leave behind!] The egg of King Kun felt desperate.","Why did it seem like the Confucian Sage’s presence was everywhere?","Especially since it was captured by Tyrannical Song, it always felt like the Confucian Sage was related to everything in the myriad practitioners in the universe; everyone appeared to be a rebirth of the Confucian Sage.","Once again, the Sage’s innate ability activated, enveloping Song Shuhang.","“It feels like something in the dark is being grabbed, about to be sliced off. I feel anxious, as if I’m about to lose something important... Is this how the fat ball felt at that time?” Song Shuhang keenly savored this anxious emotion.","Whether it was pain or tribulation, it was all worth savoring, analyzing, and ultimately transcending all this pain.","Szzzzz~","While he was pondering, a grating sizzling sound started ringing in his ears. It was like the noise of a cutting machine slicing through metal, quite uncomfortable to listen to.","“What’s happening?” Song Shuhang wondered.","Then, he found that his entire body was enveloped and protected by the power of eternity.","Some sort of defensive measure from the fat whale golden core seemed to have been activated.","The Confucian Sage’s Devouring Talent was being blocked.","“Disengage the defense!” Song Shuhang quickly commanded—he needed to cooperate with Senior White, allowing a part of himself to follow Senior White instead of blocking the Sage’s talent here.","But this layer of ‘Immortal Power Defense’ was like the skin of an ordinary human.","It wasn’t temporarily activated, it had always been there, always protecting the individual that was Song Shuhang.","Forcing this layer of ‘Immortal Power Defense’ to be removed required Song Shuhang to operate with precision, actively peeling it away!","[Immortality, it really is a secret technique developed against immortality!] When the Dark Sun saw this scene, it was thrown into disarray.","This secret technique was indeed an attempt targeting immortality!","If this was successfully executed on this ‘Tyrannical Song’... then the next one to be targeted by this secret technique would definitely be him!","[But, how could the power of eternity be so easily affected? A mere secret technique, still a mortal one, is utterly incapable of shaking immortality!] The Dark Sun murmured.","Boom~","Just at that moment, behind Immortal White, a boundless galaxy spread out.","Yet another aura of eternity!","The same ‘immortal’ power surged from the endless galaxy, enhancing Immortal White.","The eternal energy of the fat whale golden core and the endless galaxy’s eternal power cancelled each other out for a moment.","In that brief moment, Senior White, who had activated the ‘Confucian Saint Talent’, had successfully taken a portion of ‘existence’ from Song Shuhang and brought it back to Immortal White.","Although there were some minor accidents along the way, overall, the goal of Song Shuhang and Senior White had been smoothly achieved!","The Immortal Defense was broken?","A secret technique that could even ‘devour’ immortality?","“Gulp~” The Dark Sun giant, witnessing the scene, gulped down some nonexistent saliva.","It’s confirmed!","This alpaca’s secret technique was specifically developed ‘against immortality’, targeting it!","Moreover, Tyrannical Song and Immortal White purposely experimented with this technique in front of it... a heart-piercing move.","This couldn’t go on.","If this continued, the next step would be Tyrannical Song and Immortal White joining forces to take action against it!","Even ‘immortal’ power probably wouldn’t be able to protect it.","Immortality had been the Dark Sun’s confident capital; now, this capital was being shredded before its eyes by Tyrannical Song and Immortal White.","After all, the Dark Sun was not the ‘Heavenly Dao Body’ and because it was the Netherworld Ruler Body that had been forcibly seized by remnants of the Heavenly Dao, the Dark Sun had many hidden dangers.","In handling certain emergency situations, its processing and reaction abilities would be slightly delayed.","At this moment, the Dark Sun frantically began to deduce, trying to find a way to ‘free’ itself.","But the more anxious it became, the more turbulent the deductions, unable to stabilize.","“What to do, am I really just waiting for death?”","The Dark Sun certainly didn’t intend to just wait for death.","It began to struggle frantically again, deducing continuously, while trying its best to send out the signal that it was in ‘crisis’.","It didn’t know to whom to send the signal.","Regardless, the signal had to be sent out!","...","...","At the same time, the ‘aura of eternity’ on both Song Shuhang and Immortal White simultaneously retracted.","After exchanging glances, they almost simultaneously turned their gaze to the ‘Dark Sun’ sealed within.","Combined with the ‘immortality’ attribute, the Confucian Sage’s ‘Devouring Talent’ seemed to be able to break through the defense against immortal information... then, it might also be effective against the Dark Sun!","The current state of the Dark Sun was somewhat similar to that of Song Shuhang.","It was not truly ‘immortal’ but relied on the remnant undying body of the Great Way to obtain the mode of immortal information—Its advantage over Song Shuhang was that the ‘Immortal Material’ inside it was the actual remnants of the Heavenly Dao. Unlike Song Shuhang, who had clumsily evolved his own immortality.","“Should we try it?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Theoretically, it is feasible,” Senior White replied. “But let’s notify Confucian Daoist to come over first... let him take command.”","Meanwhile, both he and Song Shuhang needed to adjust their states.","At this point, Song Shuhang and Immortal White both were in an ‘incomplete’ state, and each of their energy systems contained ‘a part of the other’s existence’, which could be used to complete themselves.","“I’m here,” Daozi’s voice sounded directly in the vacuum.","At the same time, in the special dimensional world belonging to the Heavenly Dao, Daozi’s main body set aside the experiment in his hands.","He was fiddling with the data from half of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ obtained from the ‘Dark Sun’.","Of course, Daozi would not attempt to create ‘stellar viruses’.","What he was experimenting with at the moment was the process of reversing this, dissolving the virus at its root."]},{"number":3054,"title":"Chapter 3054 - 3052: Infinite Karmic Flames","paragraphs":["Chapter 3054: Chapter 3052: Infinite Karmic Flames","Daozi’s portion of intent had always followed by Song Shuhang’s side.","Once he learned that Song Shuhang and Immortal White had figured out a method to “restrain” the Dark Sun, he immediately put down his own experiments, took his real body out of the Heavenly Dao Dimension World, and fled into the place where he was sealed.","If Tyrannical Song and Immortal White really could swallow the existence of the ‘Dark Sun,’ causing it to fall into a ten thousand year unconsciousness like the ‘Fat Ball Netherworld Ruler,’ then he would be able to retire peacefully.","Ten thousand years was already quite enough.","If not ten thousand years, a thousand years should suffice.","Tyrannical Song and Immortal White, together with the former rulers of the Netherworld, could definitely arrange the ‘Dark Sun’ completely clear and bright within a thousand years.","After Daozi’s real body arrived, he couldn’t wait to say, “Tyrannical Song, Fellow Daoist White... just cast your spells, I will defend for you. If you really can break through its ‘Immortal Data Defense’ and swallow its existence, swallow as much as you can, don’t be polite.”","Although Daozi remained expressionless... anyone could hear the excitement in his tone.","If he could solve the hidden danger of the Dark Sun before his ‘retirement,’ even if it required a cost, he was willing to do it.","Some calamities, if they can be solved in his generation, he didn’t want to leave them to the next.","Song Shuhang and Senior White silently nodded, but didn’t speak—they were both still completing the ‘complementing themselves’ step.","Inside the seal.","The Dark Sun grew more and more restless.","The arrival of the Heavenly Dao Body meant it had reached a dead end.","Even if it figured out the loophole in this seal and broke out... it would be suppressed by the Heavenly Dao in an instant.","Apart from waiting for death, it had no other options to choose from.","How desperate must it feel when one faces a significant life decision, but it’s a single-option question, and that single option is not only the only one available but also a wrong answer?","“Heh, you’re still thinking about sending out rescue signals?” After Daozi’s real body approached the seal, he said indifferently. He reached out and pinched in the vacuum.","With a crisp snap—a sound was heard.","The numerous ‘Rescue Signals’ desperately sent by the ‘Dark Sun’ within the seal were grabbed by Daozi and, like fragile goods, crushed into pieces!","Then Daozi reached out again and plucked out several ‘Rescue Signals’ from the vacuum, as if catching loaches, crushing them all.","These ‘Rescue Signals’, without a definite ‘recipient,’ were just signals that the Dark Sun desperately sent out in despair, spreading randomly. The Dark Sun itself did not know whom to send these signals to.","When Daozi caught them, he pondered over them for a while... but did not figure out the ‘object of the rescue.’","Even so, Daozi had no intention of allowing these few ‘Rescue Signals’ to spread out—he intended to kill all possible ‘accidents’ in the cradle, not giving the ‘Dark Sun’ any chance.","“If you don’t want to taste the heavenly punishment, then stay put,” Daozi said solemnly.","After mastering many Heavenly Dao Authorities, he finally activated the authority for ‘heavenly punishment to descend.’","Heavenly punishment can’t destroy ‘eternity,’ but it can bring great pain to the Dark Sun.","“Heavenly punishment?” When it heard the option of heavenly punishment, the Dark Sun did not feel fear but instead became more agitated.","It seemed to remember something, and even had an urge to face the ‘heavenly punishment’ as soon as possible!","Daozi: “...”","He silently withdrew the option to ‘activate heavenly punishment.’","No matter whether the Dark Sun within the seal was acting or not, but when the opponent showed a desire to ‘eagerly accept heavenly punishment,’ Daozi immediately lost the intention to lower the heavenly punishment.","Every generation of the Heavenly Dao are monstrous geniuses. Perhaps the real body of the Dark Sun, like Tyrannical Song, enjoys heavenly tribulations and adores heavenly punishments?","Thinking this, Daozi turned his head and glanced at Song Shuhang.","Coincidentally, Song Shuhang also opened his left eye... his right eye was still blind, with the ‘Sage Eye Golden Core’ inside it recovering with the aid of the fat whale golden core’s power.","As Senior White had guessed, after both he and Senior White became ‘incomplete,’ they started to complement themselves with the parts swallowed from each other.","The part of “Senior White’s existence” that had maintained its independence within Song Shuhang as his immortal energy circulated now moved into the “undying fat whale golden core” and began to fuse.","Now, Song Shuhang held Senior White’s primordial spirit arm in his left hand; a portion of Senior White’s “existence” was fusing into the golden core within his dantian.","He and Senior White had already met the preliminary conditions to prove their Dao simultaneously.","“How do you feel?” Daozi asked.","“It feels like when I replaced my colorful waist, but I can adapt.” Song Shuhang stood up, his body autonomously entering “pseudo-eternal mode,” resonating with the fat whale golden core in his dantian.","There was a much more restrained aura of eternity on Senior White beside him.","From Daozi’s perspective, Tyrannical Song and Immortal White complemented each other. Although they were two separate individuals, they now shared the concept of being a ‘whole’.","If it were them... perhaps they might truly succeed?","“Senior White,” Song Shuhang called out.","“We can begin,” Senior White nodded and said.","The two formed hand seals in tacit understanding.","Unknown White No. 31 stepped back slightly and unsealed the first three layers of the “Dark Sun” that was sealing the trajectory.","[Don’t come over here, don’t you come over!]","Some of the aftermath began to erupt as the “Dark Sun” was forcefully seized by the Heavenly Dao Remnant Body.","It was like a machine out of control, chaotically executing various actions.","Despite knowing that ‘Daozi’ was guarding outside, it still wildly sent out “rescue signals.”","Even its body couldn’t maintain stability... Dark flames spread out as if about to shatter.","Daozi reached out and mercilessly pinched all the “rescue signals” and burst them one by one.","But after bursting nearly a hundred “rescue signals,” Daozi suddenly had a thought.","He turned around handsomely, and without looking back, pushed his palm towards his rear.","A simple palm push, maintaining the elegance of a Confucian scholar.","Whoomp–","The space boiled in Daozi’s hands.","Within the boiling space, a burning figure showed itself.","This figure was maintaining a ‘palm against palm’ stance with Daozi.","Wrapped in karmic flames from head to toe, its true body was pitch black, as if it were covered in a layer of char.","“Was it lured here by the rescue signal? No... It was attracted by the ‘aura of eternity’ coming from Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White,” Daozi judged in his heart.","“Sizzle sizzle sizzle~” Burning karmic flames dripped from this charred figure, corroding the earth.","Daozi withdrew his hand, staring at the opponent—if this guy had faced him head-on with a palm strike!","Across from him.","The charred figure reached out and pinched a “rescue signal” in the vacuum.","It was drawn here by the immortal information emanating from Tyrannical Song and Senior White.","However, the rescue signal also reached its hands.","Snap–","Like the charred figure, it too crushed the signal.","Then it bent its waist, poised to leap towards the seal... as if it were trying to rescue the “Dark Sun” that was sealed?"]},{"number":3055,"title":"Chapter 3055 - 3053: Academy Award Winning Actor Graduate","paragraphs":["Chapter 3055: Chapter 3053: Academy Award Winning Actor Graduate","Song Shuhang and Senior White heard the noise and simultaneously turned to look behind them.","“Don’t be distracted... Leave it to me, just deal with the Black Sun,” Daozi Senior spoke calmly, leaving Song Shuhang with a wide, reliable back.","With that, he took a step forward and lightly tapped his foot.","Upon the existing ‘space,’ another layer of identical ‘space’ appeared as though a thin film was lifted, transforming into a Mirror World and taking him along with the charred figure surrounded by karmic flames—this was to prevent the battle fluctuations from affecting the sealing formation of Unknown White No. 31-33.","After being swept into the Mirror World, the charred figure remained unfazed, hunched over like a cheetah ready to pounce, eyeing the distant seal.","Because of its intense focus, aside from the Dark Sun within the seal, nothing else could enter its field of view.","“Immortality?” Daozi murmured slowly.","Despite not sensing any aura of ‘eternity’ from the opponent, the being had faced off against him and emerged unharmed, and was not affected by his Heavenly Dao identity... It must be some form of immortality.","Was it a contingency of a past Wielder of the Will?","The one the Dark Sun was calling for help?","A weapon left behind by a Heavenly Dao?","Throughout history, nearly every Wielder of the Will had pulled off some clever tricks, each more cunning than the last.","“But even if it is an immortal transformed from a Heavenly Dao Body... with me here, you can only stay in this Mirror World,” Daozi Senior pronounced slowly.","He is the current Wielder of the Will, holding significant Heavenly Dao Authority.","The opponent at most is an immortal who has stepped down and cannot exert Heavenly Dao Authority, perhaps just a contingency of sorts.","In other words, it is impossible for the being to bypass his Mirror World and interfere with Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White.","With authority, one can do as they please!","Daozi Senior had just reveled in his coolness for two seconds...","Across from him, the charred figure engulfed in karmic flames disrespectfully dashed over, its gaze locked continuously on the ‘Dark Sun’ within the seal, and it charged violently.","The next moment...","The Mirror World was breached!","The Mirror Space, which Daozi believed would be absolutely impenetrable by the opponent, was as fragile as a piece of paper.","After breaking through the Mirror World, the charred figure continued its charge right up to Song Shuhang and Senior White.","The karmic flames on its body flared like a tempest, striving to shove aside Song Shuhang and Senior White, who were in its path.","Daozi: “!!!”","He might be the first Wielder of the Will to be slapped in the face directly.","This charred figure was too strange; it bore not a trace of immortal aura, yet it couldn’t be confined even by the Mirror World created from Heavenly Dao Authority!","...","...","Meanwhile.","Facing the onslaught of the karmic flame storm, the @#%× Fairy Soft Feather swiftly appeared on Song Shuhang, automatically protecting her master.","She raised her hands and conjured a phantom of the ‘ancient Heavenly City,’ positioning it in front of the rampaging karmic flames.","The glorious ‘ancient Heavenly City’ reemerged, constructed entirely from the power of virtue, resplendent in gold.","The burning karmic flames met the virtue.","The karmic flames were formidable!","The karmic flames engulfed the entire phantom of the virtue-constructed ancient Heavenly City!","The karmic flames had a significant advantage!","The karmic flames quietly extinguished a vast portion...","The karmic flames conceded defeat...","The nemesis, the power of virtue is the ultimate bane of the karmic flames.","After a large area of the karmic flames that stood between Song Shuhang, Senior White, and the charred figure was extinguished, the two sides found themselves face to face.","Seven eyes met.","Tyrannical 3, White 2, charred 2.","The Scholarly Sage’s Eye had grown back.","The divine eye formed by the Sage Eye Golden Core seemed to exert significant pressure on the charred figure.","Furthermore, the profound power of virtue on Song Shuhang’s body also made it feel extremely uncomfortable.","Perhaps it was the influence of the power of virtue, the ferocity within the charred remains’ eyes seemed to have faded significantly.","A moment later.","The charred figure’s gaze shifted from Song Shuhang and landed on Senior White.","The violent light in its eyes gradually turned into confusion.","Another moment passed.","“White...” The charred figure called out using the ancient language, summoning the dao name of Immortal White.","Song Shuhang was startled and transmitted his voice quietly, “Senior White, do you know him?”","Senior White shook his head.","The other party was wrapped in a thick layer of char, and its aura was hidden by the karmic flames, making it impossible to identify.","Moreover.","[Perhaps, he doesn’t recognize me.] Senior White transmitted back.","The other party had used the ancient language when addressing him.","[Could it be he knows Wielder of the Will White?] Song Shuhang quickly grasped the meaning of Senior White.","Several clues connected in Tyrannical Song’s mind.","Knew Wielder of the Will White, body wrapped in karmic flames, possibly related to eternity.","“Daoist Priest Virtue?” A name slipped out of Tyrannical Song’s mouth.","—He had previously seen an image related to ‘Immortal Daoist restarting the myriad practitioners in the universe,’ where the final scene depicted Daoist Priest Virtue, wrapped in ‘karmic flames,’ with an eerie expression, bursting out from the Tomb of Immortality he had constructed.","Connecting the clues... Could this charred figure before him be Daoist Priest Virtue?","On the other side, the charred figure trembled all over.","He began to slowly retreat.","After taking a few steps back, the ‘karmic flames’ around him flared up again, wrapping him up.","Then the charred figure began to hunch over and continued to retreat — it was as if ‘time was reversing,’ his current posture mirroring the one he had charged forth with.","Song Shuhang: “...”","In the sky, Daoist Senior took no further action, silently watching Immortal White.","An attacker of unknown origin and formidable strength was about to succeed, but upon seeing Fellow Daoist White, he retreated in silence for some unknown reason.","Was this Fellow Daoist White’s lucky charm?","In a few breaths, the charred covered in karmic flames, finally retreated back into the ‘space expansion’ area and completely disappeared from sight.","“Drama King Char?” Song Shuhang pondered and commented.","The charred figure’s actions in retreat and final disappearance... were like he had inherited the essence from Senior Ma, the black horse.","Within the seal.","The Dark Sun was bewildered.","[Gone? Just like that?]","Whirr!","What was this all about?","The charred figure had a faint trace of aura similar to his own... which meant, was this perhaps a safeguard arranged by his own Heavenly Dao in the shadows?","Just now, as the charred figure broke through the Heavenly Dao’s Mirror Space and made it to Tyrannical Song and White, the next step would have been to rescue him — the Dark Sun saw hope!","With the abilities of the charred figure, it could free him from his predicament!","But for some inexplicable reason, the charred figure retreated ludicrously.","Being in despair isn’t the worst that can happen to someone.","The worst is glimpsing a ray of hope amid despair, a hope that seems within easy reach... and then, just as one is about to grasp it, seeing that hope shatter into pieces, leaving an even deeper sense of despair.","The Dark Sun felt his mindset collapsing.","[It seems quite likely that it was Daoist Priest Virtue.] Song Shuhang silently recorded the events that had just unfolded, planning to send them later to Senior White two for confirmation.","But there was no rush for now; he and Senior White had something even more important to attempt.","Senior White and Song Shuhang maintained synchronized positions, both turning simultaneously to face the Dark Sun, extending their hands to wield the Confucian Saint Talent."]},{"number":3056,"title":"Chapter 3056 - 3054: Lady Kunna’s Side Hustle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3056: Chapter 3054: Lady Kunna’s Side Hustle","Song Shuhang’s “Saint Talent” involved the sacrifice of the Sage’s left eye, whereas Senior White’s involved the sacrifice of the Sage’s right eye.","Perhaps it was for this reason that when the two synchronized their “Saint Talent Secret Method,” the effects perfectly complemented and overlapped each other, forming a Joint Attack—this was seamless cooperation!","Song Shuhang’s “undying fat whale golden core” unleashed its full power from within him, while the vast galaxy behind Senior White once again brightened.","Concurrently, the Joint Attack formed by the two “immortal information” struck the Dark Sun’s body.","The unwilling Dark Sun struggled valiantly to resist, but its resistance was fragile and insignificant against the Joint Attack of Tyrannical Song plus Senior White.","[What on earth am I facing?] A sense of powerlessness surged within the heart of the Dark Sun.","The next moment, the Joint Attack of Tyrannical Song and White broke through the Dark Sun’s “Immortal Information Defense” for an instant.","And in that brief time, Senior White’s and Song Shuhang’s “Saint Talent” revealed their fangs, striking the Dark Sun and biting off a “small portion of existence” from it, and while the opponent’s “Immortal Information Defense” had not yet recovered, they brought back this small portion of “existence.”","“Guh...” The Dark Sun let out a pained syllable.","There was no visible injury on the outside, but it could clearly feel a part of its “existence” being stripped away, bringing intense pain upon its soul.","As that “portion of existence” was deprived, the Dark Sun, which was originally in chaos and could not control itself, suddenly felt lighter and its muddled brain cleared up.","It could freely and unobstructedly control every inch of its body according to its will; not only was there no lag in its thought process, but its mind had never been so clear.","The thing taken by Tyrannical Song and Immortal White seemed to be a burden to it.","Because it was burdened with something beyond its capacity, both its thought process and body control were hampered.","Now that the burden was gone, it felt perfect instead.","But the Dark Sun couldn’t feel happy... Though it didn’t know what had been stripped away from it, it always felt like it had lost something extremely important, something it would have rather burdened itself to the point of overload to keep!","It was like a person carrying 100 pounds of gold, which, although so heavy that it hindered movement and was a tremendous burden—would fight desperately if anyone tried to take that gold away.","“You...” The Dark Sun opened its mouth to speak.","But on the other side, Song Shuhang and Senior White once again cooperated tacitly, activating the “Confucian Saint Talent” secret technique.","“Your uncle!” The Dark Sun immediately controlled every part of its body, hiding all of its being within the grains of “Heavenly Dao Remnant Body” in an instant.","The dark sun disappeared, turning into a pile of loose sand.","The sand-like “Immortal Heavenly Dao Remnant Body” floated within the seal.","The Dark Sun, with a clearer mind and more agile body, made the best choice at the first opportunity!","The “Confucian Sage Innate Joint Attack” from Song Shuhang and Senior White landed on the Immortal Sand, failing to break through the “Immortal Defense” this time.","The Saint Talent circled the layer of Immortal Sand before silently returning.","They failed to bring back a portion of the Dark Sun’s existence.","However, after circling around the “Immortal Sand,” the Saint Talent seemed to have picked up some detail-level information related to “immortality.”","These details were brought back and integrated into the bodies of Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Song Shuhang’s “undying fat whale golden core” was once again reinforced, increasingly resembling Cloud Gauze Three View Moon’s “bone of eternity.”","Senior White’s “Immortal Galaxy” became even clearer, with several more shining stars now adorning it.","“Teacher’s talent also has this function?” Daozi, who was observing, was taken aback.","He was aware that his teacher’s talent could devour the enemy’s “portion of existence,” but he had never expected that his teacher’s talent could also “lick immortality”?","Could this actually be the real function of his teacher’s innate ability?","“It could also be a mutation,” replied Senior White. “After all, the ‘Sage’s talent’ that we inherited must differ from the original version. Moreover, everyone has improved the ‘secret techniques’ of that Saint. The Sage’s eye has even been bound to Shuhang’s ‘fat whale golden core’... It would not be surprising if mutations occurred during this process.”","Daoist Senior’s face was filled with trouble as he looked at Song Shuhang. “Why is it that every secret technique you come into contact with always ends up mutating?”","Song Shuhang was utterly bewildered: “???”","Even if the Sage’s talent were to mutate, it wasn’t entirely his fault, right?","All the Netherworld Realm big shots and Daoist Senior, haven’t you all participated in improving these secret techniques?","However, thinking about it, the ability of the Sage’s talent to ‘lick toward immortality’ shares a mysterious similarity with the method previously used by his main world to lick the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s path’ from the Heavenly Emperor.","But the ‘lick’ of the main world was a direct plunder of the entire ‘Heavenly Emperor’s path’, while the Sage’s talent was like a copy, imprinting the data of ‘immortal information’.","[Hehe...] Within the seal, the Dark Sun had not yet noticed that its ‘immortal information’ was being licked and imprinted away by Tyrannical Song.","[As long as I hide within the Body of Eternity, what can you do to me?] Dark Sun calmly declared.","Under the constraints of the myriad practitioners in the universe, there were no means that could obliterate truly immortal objects.","As long as it hid within this immortal sand, neither Tyrannical Song nor Immortal White could do anything to it.","Cooling down, it began to carefully calculate how to send parts of its ‘immortal sand’ out.","As long as a grain of sand gets out, it could escape its confinement!","Having regained a clear head, Dark Sun fully restored its abilities to scheme and plot.","“Shall we continue?” Song Shuhang looked towards Senior White.","“Yes,” Senior White nodded his head.","Then, the two beings with the most bizarre luck in the current world once again joined forces to unleash the ‘Sage Talent Joint Attack’ on the Dark Sun, repeatedly imprinting ‘immortal information,’ strengthening themselves, and enhancing their understanding.","After four consecutive joint attacks...","Tyrannical Song and White simultaneously entered the ‘Song Clan’s Epiphany Mode’.","They were simultaneously in closed-door cultivation in the background, gaining enlightenment while on autopilot, and jointly performing the Sage Joint Attack.","After the joint attack was performed six times...","Tyrannical Song and White also simultaneously activated the ‘Weaving Longevity Technique’ state.","Using the epiphanies, they gained numerous inspirations from the ‘immortal information,’ thereby improving their own path to immortality.","And yet, the joint attack did not stop; it continued.","Within the seal, Dark Sun started to sense that something was amiss.","Tyrannical Song and Immortal White kept futilely casting the Sage’s talent at it, certainly trying something. But upon carefully inspecting its being, it did not find any damage to itself.","Yet the more this happened, the more uneasy it felt inside.","[What exactly are they doing?]","Unknown, and that is terrifying.","If only Dark Sun knew what Tyrannical Song and Immortal White were up to, it might feel a bit more at ease.","But precisely because it could not deduce what Tyrannical Song and Immortal White intended to do, and yet it could be certain that they were up to something, something undoubtedly disadvantageous for it, this made Dark Sun very uncomfortable.","More importantly, by constantly casting ‘Saint’s secret techniques’ at it, Tyrannical Song and Immortal White effectively fixed it in place, leaving it unable to do anything.","The moment it exposed even a bit of its ‘Dark Sun True Body,’ it would instantly be swept away by the ‘Confucian Sage Secret Method Joint Attack’, part of its existence devoured.","“`","This is no fun at all!","Even if it has a clear head and is full of strategies now, it can’t use them.","...","...","Behind him, Daozi glanced at the Black Sun—truly miserable.","Well, the contingency of a previous Heavenly Dao is just as faceless as he is.","Therefore, Daozi felt much more balanced in his heart.","The previous Heavenly Dao’s contingency had ended up like this... It wasn’t that embarrassing for him to have his ‘Mirror World’ broken through by another Heavenly Dao’s contingency.","At the very least, he was still bouncing around energetically.","After finding a bit of solace, Daozi didn’t lower his guard.","At the moment, he was protecting both Song Shuhang and Immortal White on one front and using the Heavenly Dao Authority on another to search every corner of the myriad realms for that charred figure who had hit him in the face!","Although that being full of karmic flames did not carry the breath of immortality, it possessed immortal-level combat power.","Such an existence, roaming freely through the myriad realms, was incredibly dangerous.","Especially at such a sensitive time when the myriad realms were facing huge threats, and he as the temporary Heavenly Dao had no idea how long he could last.","If he suddenly collapsed, and that being full of karmic flames started causing trouble, it would be very difficult to find someone who could directly counter it.","Daozi hoped to find it, or at the very least identify who it was and what it wanted to do.","However, even after searching the entire myriad realms with the Heavenly Dao Authority, he could not find that charred figure.","Daozi rubbed his temples in distress, with such force that sparks came out of them.","If he hadn’t had the Body of Eternity, he would have rubbed his temples to the point of bursting!","In the myriad realms, there were always some special spaces that could hide from the inspection of the Heavenly Dao—such as special secret realms left by previous Heavenly Daos for hiding the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’, or certain special locations in ancient fragments of Heavenly City; these were all blind spots for the Heavenly Dao.","That charred figure was clearly another contingency of a previous Heavenly Dao, and it surely wouldn’t be lacking a similar secret realm.","“Everyone has so many cunning tricks up their sleeve, and there are so many contingencies; do subsequent Heavenly Daos not care about losing face at all!” Daozi couldn’t help but think to himself.","Left with no choice, he could only add the information of the ‘charred figure’ to the ‘surveillance insight’ section through the Heavenly Dao Authority.","The moment that being exposed itself in the myriad realms and appeared within the reach of the Heavenly Dao’s insight, he would immediately notice and pinpoint it.","That’s all Daozi could do for now.","...","...","Elsewhere, in the Star Realm of the myriad realms, within a star.","A small-sized ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ was hiding inside, desperately suppressing its own breath to avoid being captured by the big shots of the myriad realms.","—The ‘New Year event’ initiated by Tyrannical Song in combination with the Heavenly Dao was insanely long in duration, with no end time specified.","Who knows, the New Year event might continue from this year’s celebration to the next!","After carefully hiding itself, the ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ split off a ‘pure breathing’ small life manifestation.","This newborn small life reached out, scanned a ‘QR code Golden Core Composition,’ skillfully downloaded a ‘Cultivation Chat System,’ registered an account, and logged in.","After coming online with a pure breath, it entered the newly developed [Reward Question and Answer] section of the ‘Cultivator Chat System.’","This section is a sub-section of the ‘Law Lecture Live’ section of the ‘Cultivator Chat System.’","In this sub-section, any doubts encountered during cultivation or while listening to the Dharma can be asked, with rewards set for answers.","The pure breath small life, using an alias, entered this section and posted a ‘reward question.’","However, the text it published was a very peculiar type of ‘Thousand Character Classic,’ quite obscure.","Fortunately, today’s ‘Cultivator Chat System’ integrates the ‘primordial language and character longevity path’ principles from Song Shuhang’s legacy.","The system’s powerful translation feature instantly converted this obscure ancient text into a language understood by all practitioners across the myriad realms.","But even after translation, no one understood the content of the text.","This ‘reward question’ seemed to be a ‘cryptic message,’ intelligible only to a specific group of people.","After posting the question, the pure breath small life also recharged a considerable amount of spirit stones through the ‘spirit stone recharge system’ as a reward.","To attract more attention to its reward, it divided the large sum of spirit stones into one billion portions—each cultivator who answered would receive a fraction, and each cultivator account could only reply once. This way, at least a billion cultivators would see the reward!","After finishing all this, it logged out of the Cultivator Chat System.","The Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull steeled its heart and crushed its small manifestation to death.","The cryptic text it sent out was a ‘rescue letter’ passed on from its ‘master.’","But it didn’t know who exactly the rescue message was for, or into whose hands it needed to be delivered.","The Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull and the Virtual Sun Guardians could only spread the ‘rescue text’ as widely as possible by all means.","And Tyrannical Song’s ‘Cultivator Chat System’ became an effective channel for their dissemination.","Using the enemy’s gun to stab the enemy’s horse!","The moves of the Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull were quite cunning.","Only... before the reward offer was published on the ‘front end,’ it was spotted by ‘Lady Kunna’ of the backend.","It wasn’t that Lady Kunna was particularly targeting it.","The main reason was that the ‘reward for answering questions’ section had only recently been launched.","In fact, the section was a bit awkward and hadn’t really taken off yet.","The big shots were too lazy to come answer the novices’ questions. The newbies who came to answer were unreliable at best, amounting to nothing more than bumbling among themselves.","So... until the section could fully develop, all reward questions sent out would first appear on the backend, screened by Lady Kunna.","And then many of the questions would be answered by Lady Kunna herself under an alias.","—Fortunately, Lady Kunna had recently been empowered with ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation Ability’ which made it possible for her to process these vast amounts of data with ease.","Lady Kunna saw the strange question and pondered.","A moment later...","She created one billion alt accounts in one go and used the ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation Ability’ to spam replies. With a swift move, she instantly replied a billion times and then delightfully collected all one billion portions of the reward.","These bits of money, she happily accepted!"]},{"number":3057,"title":"Chapter 3057 - 3055: Tyrannical Song Beast Evolution","paragraphs":["Chapter 3057: Chapter 3055: Tyrannical Song Beast Evolution","The Black Sun, nestled in the immortal sands, employed every conceivable plan to release its ‘Rescue Signal.’","But it had never imagined the cunning manipulation of the ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ in transmitting rescue signals, and Lady Kunna’s even more sophisticated divine maneuvers.","[I did my best.] The Black Sun sighed inwardly.","Meanwhile, in the outside world, Tyrannical Song and Immortal White’s ‘Sage Talent Joint Attack Technique’ had reached its ninety-ninth iteration!","Observing the tireless, seemingly endless barrage from Tyrannical Song and Immortal White made the Black Sun’s head ache.","Two mortals who had yet to prove their Dao had pushed it to this extent.","Differently from the tender and dispirited Black Sun, Senior White and Song Shuhang were quite busy now—juggling their joint attacks, closing up, reaching enlightenment, receiving ‘immortal information,’ and then integrating this information to refine themselves.","If not for the silent support of the ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation System’ behind them, Song Shuhang felt he might not have been able to hold on.","“Ninety-nine now ... so the next one will be the hundredth, right?” Daozi mused silently to himself nearby.","His eternal body of the Wielder of the Will stayed close to Song Shuhang and Immortal White.","“It’s about time to start transforming.” Daozi smiled inwardly, then expressionlessly reached out his hand to point at Song Shuhang and Immortal White, giving them the final boost.","“The hundredth strike!” Song Shuhang and Senior White, together, unleashed the hundredth joint attack on the Black Sun.","This strike was also the last one for the time being—because Song Shuhang could already feel that his body’s capacity for ‘eternal energy’ was nearly maxed out.","After these hundred strikes, he would need to properly digest it all to avoid overstuffing himself.","After he and Senior White had digested it, they could come back after some time for another round.","“It’s a pity, if we can’t withstand the ‘Immortal Data Shock,’ we won’t be able to leech off the eternal power from the immortal sands on the Black Sun’s body. Otherwise, I would definitely have all the seniors come over for a feast on the Black Sun’s immortal buffet,” Song Shuhang lamented to Senior White through sound transmission.","“Hmm, an immortal buffet ... maybe we can consider how to make it in the future,” Senior White said, almost drooling transparently as he spoke.","Ever since the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet’ that Song Shuhang had brought had opened the door to a new world of gourmet for Senior White, coupled with the Inner Demon Set and the Xie Wang Recipe that deepened the roots of this new gourmet world, many strange things in the myriad realms had begun to look like ingredients in the eyes of Senior White.","An immortal buffet from the Black Sun, if successfully concocted, might be delicious.","Song Shuhang and Senior White were having a private encrypted sound transmission chat, which the Black Sun couldn’t eavesdrop on—the Black Sun could only sense the fluctuations of ‘sound transmission’ between Song Shuhang and Immortal White, after which the gaze Immortal White gave it began to turn dreadful.","That gaze ... was like the top of the food chain hunter sighting a moving feast from the lower ends of the food chain.","The Black Sun felt every body it hid within each grain of Immortal Sand becoming unsettled.","Whoosh~~","The sound of flowing water passed by.","The hundredth joint attack swept over the ‘immortal sands.’","Bringing back a full load!","With all hundred acquisitions, Song Shuhang felt that the ‘fat whale golden core’ within him was about to undergo its final transformation.","Behind him, Daozi’s ‘final assist’ was timely delivered.","“Thank you, Daozi, for your assist~ Brother 666~” Song Shuhang gave Daozi a thumbs up.","The Scholarly Indifference showed no expression, his hands clasped behind him, graceful and suave.","Song Shuhang turned back, maintaining synchronization with Senior White as they backed away a few steps.","The seal closed, once again sealing the Black Sun away.","[Is it finally over?] The consciousness of the Black Sun subtly permeated out a bit, observing Song Shuhang and Immortal White retreating.","A hundred times, a full hundred times!","This was more humiliating than being rubbed into the ground.","The Dark Sun did not believe that Tyrannical Song and Immortal White had returned empty-handed; it was certain that they must have obtained what they desired.","Therefore, it wanted to observe any changes between Tyrannical Song and Immortal White.","On the surface, Immortal White seemed unchanged, merely having become a bit more celestial. His realm and power had not altered, remaining at the level of ‘spinning cocoons in the embryonic form of the Dao of Longevity as a Tribulation Transcender.’","But on the side of Tyrannical Song, the scene was much more magnificent.","Within Tyrannical Song’s body, strands of ‘Immortal Light’ were being released, these rays were like silk, weaving a strange pattern in front of him...","It looked like a fountain’s structure?","A big man bursting with a fountain of light, no matter how one saw it, it looked bizarre—it’s not like he was a magical girl undergoing a sudden transformation.","At this moment, all of Song Shuhang’s background idle programs began to shut down.","Enlightenment ended, seclusion ended... even the connections with all his major clones were temporarily severed.","The fat whale golden core had finally completed the last step of its transformation, evolving to the perfect level of Cloud Gauze Three View Moon’s ‘bone of eternity’.","The ‘fountain’ that had just erupted in front of Song Shuhang was the power of eternity being emitted from the ‘nostrils’ of the undying fat whale golden core.","From this moment on, Song Shuhang no longer had the trouble of ‘respawn intervals.’","A real man should be able to resurrect a hundred times on the spot without taking a breath!","The evolution of the fat whale golden core had ended... but the evolution of Song Shuhang had not yet stopped!","From the beginning, Song Shuhang’s ‘fat whale golden core’ was only a step away from Cloud Gauze Three View Moon’s ‘bone of eternity.’","Plus, this time, he was propelled by ‘a portion of Senior White’s existence.’","Even without the harvest from the ‘hundred joint attacks,’ Song Shuhang could perfect the fat whale golden core in a short amount of time.","The harvest from the hundred joint attacks consumed only a little on the fat whale golden core.","The surplus harvest was absorbed by the fat whale golden core, transformed, and then burst forth as ‘fountains.’","The ‘fountains’ turned into ‘Immortal Light’ like silk, starting to encase Song Shuhang by his side.","—Spinning cocoons was something Song Shuhang was now very skilled at.","He had once spun a perfect grand cocoon.","This time, the challenge was even smaller; he merely needed to control the silken rays of light to spin the cocoons with his mind.","Starting from Song Shuhang’s ‘head,’ the Light Cocoon began to condense.","The ‘power of eternity,’ transformed by the fat whale golden core, continuously erupted in the form of fountains, turning into light silk.","Tens of breaths later.","Song Shuhang’s head was now completely enveloped within the ‘Immortal Light Cocoon.’","But at that moment, the fat whale golden core stopped its ‘fountain’ action.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Hum~","Above his head, only a head’s worth of Light Cocoon was woven; it could only hastily close... The Light Cocoon enveloped and wrapped around Song Shuhang’s head.","It looked as though Song Shuhang’s body had been fitted with a glowing round egg.","Daozi: “...”","If he wasn’t currently expressionless and unable to effectively convey his emotions, he would have burst into laughter by now.","Senior White: “...”","“Senior, if you want to laugh, just laugh,” Song Shuhang shook his head, and the light cocoon on top of it scattered beautiful, flowing rays of light as it swayed.","“Actually, there’s nothing funny,” Senior White said calmly. “I was just wondering if this light cocoon tastes good?”","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","How could this thing even be edible?","Could it be... Senior White is craving something to nibble on?","“By the way, Shuhang, what’s going on with you?” Daozi Senior couldn’t help but ask.","What’s the use of spinning this light cocoon?","“I don’t quite understand it myself. Just now, I suddenly felt an urge to spin a cocoon, so I followed my heart and prepared to spin one... and as you see. I was only at the head part when the thread suddenly broke,” Song Shuhang poked at the cocoon on his head.","As his fingers gently poked, the light cocoon on his head suddenly burst open.","The power of the immortal light cocoon, with the bursting of the cocoon, infiltrated into Song Shuhang’s head, beginning to strengthen this area of his body.","The first aspect to be reinforced was “Tyrannical Song’s face.”","As a strong man, it’s essential to have a strong facade, both physically and spiritually.","On the physical level, a strong facade can keep a cultivator’s face fresh and maintain their demeanor, even in the harshest environments.","On a psychological level, the facade is one of the points most valued by bigshots, related to the issue of whether or not others give them face.","“Tyrannical Song’s face” was already one of the strongest parts of his body, which not even “heavenly punishment” could destroy.","Now reinforced, “Tyrannical Song’s face” faintly displayed a hint of ‘eternal’ radiance, a level higher than ‘pseudo-eternal,’ and just below the immortalized fat whale golden core—barely qualifying as ‘Sub-immortal.’","If he could gain an opportunity similar to the ‘fat whale golden core,’ perhaps in the future, it could evolve into a truly ‘immortal face’!","The power of the immortal light cocoon continued to permeate.","After “Tyrannical Song’s face,” Song Shuhang’s skull was also strengthened.","The light of the cocoon penetrated every part of his skull in a 360-degree angle without any dead ends.","Similar to the face, Song Shuhang’s skull also began its sub-immortalization, advancing beyond the ‘pseudo-eternal’ state.","“The skull and the face...is this the rhythm of sub-immortalization from the inside out?” Song Shuhang reached out and touched his face.","The power of the light cocoon slowly progressed in modifying Song Shuhang’s head; it wasn’t an immediate transformation.","The predicted time required for the upgrade was about a day...","A day isn’t too long; just entering the ‘time-distorted secret realm,’ a day will pass in an instant.","Roughly estimating, the energy from a hundred joint attacks could almost complete the sub-immortalization of a ‘skull’ plus ‘skin.’ To achieve full-body sub-immortalization of bones and skin without any hitches, it could be completed within about ten times!” calculated Song Shuhang internally.","About ten times—with the aid of the ‘time-distorted secret realm,’ it would be completed very quickly!","“Once the bones and skin of my entire body achieve sub-immortalization, I can further attempt to upgrade my flesh and blood... If I were to turn my whole body into a ‘Sub-immortal’ state paired with ‘fat whale golden core,’ it would almost be akin to a budget version of immortality,” Song Shuhang said, pinching his face.","It’s a bit of a beautiful thought, but living in this world, one must indulge in beautiful thoughts. Life is already so hard; if we don’t harbor beautiful thoughts, how can we continue day by day?","“Then for now, head back to the ‘time-distorted secret realm.’ Once you’ve assimilated everything, you can come back,” Senior White agreed.","Daozi looked at Immortal White curiously and asked, “What about you, Fellow Daoist White? Any changes for you?”","“Did the number of stars behind increase a bit?” Senior White glanced at the ‘immortal galaxy’ behind him.","This immortal galaxy, which opens and closes uncontrollably like a passive skill, is activated following events related to the ‘eternal attribute.’","“Even the Dao of Longevity hasn’t changed?” Daozi asked again.","After receiving such a massive influx of immortal information, at the very least, it should have stimulated Immortal White’s ‘Dao of Longevity,’ allowing its embryonic form to become whole, right?","“‘As for the path of immortality, it is sufficient for now,’” Senior White replied.","He believed so...thus, his realm remained at the level of ’embryonic form of the Dao of Longevity.’","“I see,” Daozi nodded.","Perhaps, Fellow Daoist White felt the time was not right yet?","About Immortal White’s cultivation matters, Daozi did not inquire further.","He reached out to open the passage back to the ‘time-distorted secret realm.’","Song Shuhang stood up and stepped into the space passage—Senior White still had to guard the seals, unable to leave the seal nucleus orbit. Moreover, Senior White did not need the ‘time-distorted secret realm’ to accelerate the digestion of eternal energy.","After Song Shuhang and Daozi’s figures disappeared, the consciousness of the Black Sun inside the seal became slightly more active.","“Are you coveting my immortality?” the Black Sun spoke in a deep and resonant voice.","The changes in Tyrannical Song were too obvious.","Combining the fact that Tyrannical Song and Immortal White continuously used ‘Joint Attack’ to smash its Immortal Sand, it quickly guessed this possibility.","However, its ‘immortality’ was not damaged in this process.","How exactly did Tyrannical Song and Immortal White manage to do that?","“You guess?” Senior White looked at the Immortal Sand, his mouth watering uncontrollably.","Black Sun: “...”","I must find a way to escape! Although it hadn’t been damaged itself, it didn’t want to be exploited by Immortal White and Tyrannical Song.","...","...","Song Shuhang’s main body returned to the ‘time-distorted secret realm.’","Connection with his clones was re-established, and they began to act according to their duties.","Song Shuhang’s main body found a comfortable position and silently lay down.","Fairy Creation, Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, and other pendants returned one by one to his main body.","“Shuhang, has your face gotten thicker again?” Scarlet Heaven Sword exclaimed upon seeing Song Shuhang’s shining face.","“It’s an upgrade, not thicker. They mean different things,” Song Shuhang replied calmly.","He placed the Scarlet Heaven Sword and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber on his legs, and closed his eyes to meditate.","In fact, Tyrannical Song no longer needed to close his eyes while meditating.","His current closing of eyes was merely to adjust his mental state, putting himself into an utterly calm mode.","In this mode, he could ‘see’ certain things—earlier, during the sub-immortalization of his skull, it was like having a daydream, where he saw several scenes.","Previously, the scenes flashed by before he could take a closer look.","[Is this a precursor to dreamland skill? Or something else?] Song Shuhang entered a tranquil state.","After a moment.","Inside him, the ‘existence’ that he and Senior White had sliced from the Black Sun was stirred.","Then, Song Shuhang saw a scene of Senior White preparing to prove his Dao!","“Is this... Wielder of the Will White?”"]},{"number":3058,"title":"Chapter 3058 - 3056: Will of the Heavens’ Conquest Secret Techniques – Losing Money to Granny’s House Edition","paragraphs":["Chapter 3058: Chapter 3056: Will of the Heavens’ Conquest Secret Techniques – Losing Money to Granny’s House Edition","In truth, Wielder of the Will White, Senior White two, Senior White of the main world, and Unknown White No. 1-33 all looked exactly the same.","When they simply showed their face without speaking, standing motionlessly, basically no one could distinguish between them.","It was only through extended interaction and upon seeing this ‘White’ in the footage about to prove his Dao, that Song Shuhang confirmed this was Wielder of the Will White.","In the footage, White was in a state similar to ‘Ascending.’","Beneath him were a group of Immortal big shots who had been defeated, along with one of the few standing members, the silhouette of ‘Daoist Priest Virtue.’","The peerlessly beautiful Wielder of the Will White began to be enveloped by the ‘Great Way Radiance.’","This radiance of the Great Way was profound and mysterious; anyone who glanced at it felt countless insights in their heart, and their realms were on the verge of breakthroughs.","No doubt about it, this was the moment the Wielder of the Will was about to prove his Dao!","It was a similar situation when Daozi’s senior brother proved his Dao.","[This must be the first time Senior White proved his Dao... In the fleeting scene just now, I saw Daoist Priest Virtue.]","At this moment, Song Shuhang was observing all this from a ‘third party’ perspective.","This viewpoint was neither from the Immortal big shots of the myriad practitioners in the universe who had been beaten down below, nor from the Wielder of the Will White, but rather like that of a ‘moviegoer,’ watching this scene from a distance.","[Speaking of which, did the Dark Sun ever encounter the Wielder of the Will Senior White when he proved his Dao?] he wondered.","The reason Song Shuhang activated this ‘vision playback mode’ was due to the portion of ‘existence’ he had swallowed from the ‘Dark Sun,’ which had been triggered.","The content being played back this time was a part of the Dark Sun.","But... during the earlier encounter, it seemed that the Dark Sun did not recognize Senior White’s identity?","[If I calculate the timing, when Senior White was proving his Dao, the ‘Heavenly Dao’ of the Dark Sun should have already stepped down? Or perhaps, it was about to step down at that time?] Song Shuhang thought to himself.","According to his and several seniors’ conjectures, the Dark Sun Heavenly Dao was either the fourth session or the fifth.","And from various clues seen before, it was more likely to be the fourth session.","Following afterwards were the sixth session Daoist Priest Virtue, the seventh session Senior White, the eighth session fat ball big shot, and the 8.5 session Daozi’s senior brother.","If the Dark Sun was the fifth session and the scene was the first instance of Senior White proving his Dao, then just after the Dark Sun Heavenly Dao stepped down; If it was the fourth session, then it had been in its second reincarnation after stepping down.","As the Wielder of the Will White began his ascension, the ‘Dark Sun Heavenly Dao’ vision firmly locked onto the Wielder of the Will White.","This feeling was like lurking and waiting for the right moment!","“The proof of Dao is finally about to start... I did not expect the last one to prove the Dao would be a newcomer who suddenly appeared. However, this is good for me, he is more suitable than anyone else!” a voice rang out.","He spoke in a dialect of the ancient language, obscure and difficult to understand—fortunately, Song Shuhang still retained the ‘language and script principles’ in his body; although the immortal path had been sacrificed, the information of this principle remained. Thus, he could understand the meaning of these words.","[Is this guy targeting Wielder of the Will Senior White?] Song Shuhang realized instantly.","The ‘Dark Sun Heavenly Dao,’ hidden in the shadows, seemed to be about to make a move against the Wielder of the Will White, who was proving his Dao?","“Strange, I feel like someone is...” Suddenly, that voice murmured again.","Song Shuhang internally cried out in alarm.","Was this after stepping down, the ‘Dark Sun’ sensed him?","It was like the times he had used the dreamland skill on top big shots and had been sensed by them. Entering the ‘Dark Sun vision playback mode,’ he was also likely to be sensed by the Dark Sun.","Just as Song Shuhang felt uneasy...","His head, his face, and his undying fat whale golden core secretly emitted a radiance that enveloped his body.","Especially that ‘Sub-immortal Face,’ it even simulated a scent close to the ‘Dark Sun Immortal Aura.’","Entering a dream to top big shots could indeed result in being sensed—but Song Shuhang was no longer the newbie he was last year.","Now, fitted with all attachments and clones, claiming to stand at the pinnacle of the myriad practitioners in the universe wasn’t an overstatement.","Moreover, he and Senior White had just fleeced the Dark Sun, which was now proving useful.","A moment later...","“Is it an illusion? But let’s still be cautious,” said the voice once more.","It failed to detect Song Shuhang’s presence!","Since becoming a big shot, Tyrannical Song’s clever tactics had finally barely caught up with the others.","Only a big shot could shield against another big shot’s senses.","Song Shuhang also secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","In the scene.","The depiction of Senior White’s ‘ascension’ was nearly at its climax.","The radiance of the Great Way around him grew increasingly intense.","In the void, a power descended upon him, intending to pull him upward, into the heavenly path, to take control of the myriad practitioners in the universe, proving his immortality!","“It’s coming, now is the moment!” exclaimed the voice, filled with excitement.","At the same time, it seemed to have launched something extremely precious... exactly what was unclear to Song Shuhang.","But it must be something very important, perhaps the kind that takes tens of thousands of years to craft.","“Very well, very smooth. Next, prove your immortality, new Wielder of the Will,” said the voice, its calmness barely concealing its thrill.","But just then, just as he was about to prove his immortality, the ‘Heavenly Dao White’ stopped in his tracks.","With his own strength, he forcibly paused the ‘Heavenly Dao Ascension Validation Immortality’ process.","“He stopped?” the voice said, confused.","Can this even be paused? Does proving immortality have a pause feature? Why didn’t I know?","In the vacuum.","Heavenly Dao White looked down at Daoist Priest Virtue: “Fellow Daoist Virtue... you’re still alive, right?”","“Of course I’m alive, rest assured Fellow Daoist White, I’m not dying yet,” the voice of Daoist Priest Virtue came through.","This voice, this appearance.","[It’s that Immortal who restarted the world, no mistake. He was the heavenly Dao before Senior White,] Song Shuhang concluded in his mind.","“Actually... I suddenly don’t want to ascend anymore,” declared Heavenly Dao White suddenly.","Daoist Priest Virtue: “What?”","The voice that belonged to Song Shuhang’s perspective: “Huh?”","Then...","Through the ‘Black Sun’s’ vision, Song Shuhang saw the exchange where Daoist Priest Virtue used [Universe-Piercing Flying Shuttle] to receive the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’ from Heavenly Dao White’s hands.","Then, Daoist Priest Virtue began his ascension.","The entire process left all the Immortal big shots below with looks of confusion.","Daoist Priest Virtue himself looked just as baffled.","“What!!!” The voice of the Black Sun that Song Shuhang was empathetically listening through was trembling.","Although he didn’t know what exactly he intended to do to ‘Heavenly Dao White’... it was clear that his plan had utterly failed.","Moreover, he had offered up a very precious, rare treasure or some kind of material.","That material, now on Heavenly Dao White, couldn’t be reclaimed.","“~” Song Shuhang mimicked a strange accent, bursting into a joyful chuckle.","This guy picked the wrong person to target... trying to steal a chicken only to end up losing a handful of rice.","Buddy, you’re walking a narrow path!","Just like that...","The “Dark Sun” that Song Shuhang visually entered could only watch helplessly as Daoist Priest Virtue ascended, unable to do anything.","His gaze kept switching back and forth between the ascendant Daoist Priest Virtue, who wore a dreamy expression, and Wielder of the Will White.","“Tens of thousands of years of waiting, tens of thousands of years of preparation, tens of thousands of years of effort...”","“What is this guy thinking? Isn’t the seat of the Great Way Immortal supposed to be more important than a Universe-Piercing Flying Shuttle? What do you take the Heavenly Dao seat for? Is it that cheap?”","“Don’t let me see you again, Argh!”","The voice swore in rage.","But apparently, there was some restriction, and he couldn’t do anything... He could only watch from behind a screen, staring at Wielder of the Will White who was happily playing with his new toy, the Universe-Piercing Flying Shuttle.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but laugh out loud: “Hahaha.”","I just love seeing you want to beat me to death but can’t even touch me.","And you even swore to show Senior White? Well, now look, the Dark Sun has been fleeced by Senior White and he will have to go back for more fleecing soon!","After laughing heartily, the screen gradually faded into darkness.","The dark screen seemed to be jumping through time.","It lasted for a little over a minute.","Then, the screen brightened up again.","Once more, Song Shuhang saw Wielder of the Will White in the midst of Ascension.","“Hahaha~” Right from the start, before the plot even unfolded, Song Shuhang was already brimming with pleasure.","“Argh! Again?” the voice of the Dark Sun rang out.","[Bet you didn’t expect it, it’s your Senior White again smoothly ahead!] Song Shuhang said.","Go on then, target him more!","“Are you addicted to proving pseudo-immortality? You already gave up on proving pseudo-immortality last time, why come back to prove it again? Since you gave it up, why don’t you find a place to properly go into seclusion, why come out and create more trouble?” Dark Sun was in a very foul mood.","Anyone would be in a foul mood.","Another long reincarnation, possibly lasting tens of thousands of years, maybe even longer...","Then a cycle ends, full of anticipation for a new opportunity to arrive.","But upon opening his eyes, he saw ‘him’ again and ‘he’ had once again seized the opportunity to prove his Dao.","Even if ‘he’ was good-looking, Dark Sun could only feel hatred and loathing.","Now, Dark Giant was not sure whether to use the ‘only opportunity’ on this ‘he’ again.","What if it turned out like last time, after finally using the only chance, this guy turns around and sells the position of the Heavenly Dao again? There’s a precedent, so it’s not impossible for him to sell the position of the Heavenly Dao a second time.","“Hold off, until the last moment... Only at the last moment, if he still has not sold the seat of the Heavenly Dao, then I’ll make my move!” whispered the Dark Giant.","The visual screen, now firmly locked onto Wielder of the Will White.","Not skipping a single frame!","Just like last time, Wielder of the Will White was enveloped by the ‘Heavenly Dao Radiance’ and pulled by the Immortal Radiance of the Heavenly Path into ‘Ascension’ state, this scene broadcasting across myriad practitioners in the universe.","Hidden in the shadows, the Dark Giant started casting, condensing the same ‘treasure’ as last time, ready for action.","“Good, there has been no pause this time. The next phase is his complete transformation into immortality. Then, he will have no chance to trade the Heavenly Dao seat. I just have to strike during that phase and... Why you little—” His emotions started to spiral out of control midway through speaking.","Because... the final phase of Wielder of the Will White’s immortality proof skipped!","Yes, he skipped the process.","It might be because he had already “proved his Dao twice,” bearing two “Ascension Ceremonies.” Therefore, the process for proving his immortality this time, was different from the normal procedure.","Normally, there should be a gradual process of becoming completely immortalized.","However, Wielder of the Will White skipped this process, or rather, it was just a flash of light, and his body was perfectly immortalized.","Following that, Senior White ascended at the speed of light, took control of the Heavenly Dao, and successfully proved his Dao.","The entire process left no chance for anyone to react.","Only the Dark Giant was left behind, utterly bewildered.","Even though he didn’t say a word, Song Shuhang could still sense that deep despair, indescribable bewilderment, and inner frustration.","“Hahahaha, would you have guessed? Would you have guessed the light-speed immortalization process of my Senior White!” Song Shuhang’s happiness value was about to overflow.","Look, sometimes a man’s happiness is just that simple!","At this moment, Song Shuhang began to vaguely understand why Senior two wanted to keep the fat ball bigshot around.","The fat ball bigshot was probably one of Senior two’s sources of happiness.","Besides... since Senior White ascended at light speed, the Dark Giant couldn’t release the ‘treasure’ he intended to use against Senior White in time.","Thus, Song Shuhang finally got a vague sense of some data about this ‘treasure’.","This treasure possessed very strong ‘seizing and conquering’ rules.","This was a rule for dominating a target.","“To sacrifice this treasure in the instant before the Heavenly Dao proves its immortality, that is to say, is it aiming to dominate the Heavenly Dao?”","“No, fighting the entire Heavenly Dao definitely isn’t feasible. The Heavenly Dao isn’t so easy to contend against... So, is it a hidden method to secretly seize some authority of the Heavenly Dao?”","Just as Song Shuhang was pondering, the ‘treasure’ in the Dark Giant’s hands dissipated—after being sacrificed, this treasure either hit its target or completely vanished, it had no saving function.","Heart-wrenching pain!","A deep pain surged.","“Tens of thousands of years of waiting, tens of thousands of years of preparation, tens of thousands of years of efforts...” the Dark Giant started his monologue.","Hefty losses.","Losing in terms of time, losing in terms of money, the treasure and secret techniques he intended to use, from their development to now, had always been at a loss!","“Tsk tsk tsk, even the lines are the same as last time... The true nature of humans is indeed just a repeating machine, oh wait, the giant isn’t human.” Song Shuhang was overjoyed.","Therefore, only another famous saying can summarize this—there is nothing new under the sun. What’s happening now has already happened in the past and will happen again in the future.","“Next time, there won’t be this guy causing trouble.”","“He has already proved his immortality, he won’t appear again,” said the Dark Giant, his voice fading again.","Song Shuhang’s vision was once again restrained to darkness.","A few minutes later...","Light reappeared.","And this time, two familiar figures appeared before Song Shuhang.","Sage of Confucianism vs Fat ball bigshot!","In the scene, the Sage of Confucianism obviously had an upper hand over the fat ball bigshot, one striking handsomely, the other resisting clumsily.","The gaze of the Dark Giant suddenly focused on the Sage of Confucianism.","This one, must prove his immortality!"]},{"number":3059,"title":"Chapter 3059 - 3057: How Wonderful!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3059: Chapter 3057: How Wonderful!","“Finally, it’s no longer that guy...”","“Moreover, the time I awakened from the darkness this time is shorter than ever before.”","“Does that mean, the duration for which that guy became the Wielder of the Will is also shorter than his predecessors?”","“Hahahaha~ I just knew it, that guy is a troublemaker, full of quirks, he couldn’t last that long.”","The Dark Giant secretly heaved a sigh of relief when he saw that the figure contending for the Heavenly Dao seat wasn’t the same incredibly beautiful character from last time.","To tell the truth, the Dark Giant was already inwardly afraid of Wielder of the Will White with his unusually high frequency of unexpected maneuvers.","If he were to encounter that beautiful guy again, he might have to endure another cycle of reincarnation, waiting hundreds of millions of years for the next opportunity...","Even, if that guy got bored and wanted to linger on the Heavenly Dao seat a little longer, hundreds of millions of years would be just the beginning.","If the Heavenly Dao truly stopped causing trouble and stayed firmly in its seat, it could last from everlasting to everlasting!","After feeling relieved, its gaze firmly fixed on the Sage.","“This game is definitely right, in my opinion... this existence is bound to achieve pseudo-immortality!” proclaimed the Dark Giant with certainty.","His tone was brimming with confidence!","Upon hearing these words, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but mentally draw a [facetious smile] emoji in his mind.","The more confident the Dark Giant sounded, the more pleasure Song Shuhang felt.","But to tell the truth, had he not known the outcome already, Song Shuhang would also believe that the Sage is destined to prove his Dao and become pseudo-immortal by looking at the scene before him.","Judging by the scene, the Sage and fat ball were on the same level in terms of realm, both much higher than ordinary Immortals.","However, the Sage’s technique methods, battle skills, fighting experience, formation ability, and talisman strength were all a notch stronger than those of the fat ball.","With the same realm, whoever has stronger skills and better equipment has the greater chance of winning!","Therefore, from the start of this battle to now, it was the Sage who had the absolute upper hand.","The fat ball could only barely defend, with little opportunity for counterattacking.","Seeing this scene, the Dark Giant could hardly resist prematurely unleashing that ‘priceless Domination Secret Method’, wishing he could immediately apply this ‘Domination of the Heavenly Dao Secret Method’ on the Sage.","But in the end, it still held back.","The beautiful dude from last time had taught it too many lessons.","Thus, one should not be impatient.","But one shouldn’t be too passive, either.","This time it decided to slow down its pace.","It wouldn’t deliberately wait for the ‘Sage’ to complete the final phase of proving his Dao.","Nor would it eagerly throw the priceless ‘Domination Secret Method’ on the Sage.","It would wait patiently for the right moment!","— Besides, due to the failures of the last two times, it had made some modifications to the ‘Domination Secret Method’; this time it felt more confident in its choices.","And so, time hurriedly swept by.","One day passed, two days went by.","In the end... ten days had gone by....","The Dark Giant began to grow anxious.","“Why is it taking so long?” The giant’s voice even began to sound uneasy.","Each time it awakened from the darkness, it was at the node of the ‘Wielder of the Will on the verge of proving his Dao’ or ‘the Wielder of the Will about to enter the final battle,’ which would rouse it.","Normally, upon awakening, it should have been able to witness the Wielder of the Will inheriting the Heavenly Dao or watch the Wielder of the Will swiftly annihilate the ultimate enemy in the finals, stepping over the enemy’s body to ascend to the Immortal Throne... and then, it could seize the opportunity!","But as it turned out, the final battle between the Sage of Confucianism and fat ball actually went on for a full ten days!","“It’s already been ten days, and it seems... it won’t end anytime soon.”","“That spherical entity is incredibly resilient; its defense and regenerative abilities are so exaggerated that they’re off the charts. I’ve never seen anyone take a beating like that. If I had encountered it back in my days, I might have been so frustrated that I would have given up the Heavenly Dao seat.”","“If this goes on, it won’t be good. Every time I’m awakened, my consciousness can remain in the main world, but there’s a time limit,” the Dark Giant said, frowning.","[Every time it’s awakened? Time limit?] Song Shuhang, who was secretly observing, took note of this.","So, the Dark Giant is only awakened when ‘the Heavenly Dao is about to be proved’?","Does that mean that the ‘Dark Sun’ that has been causing trouble in the myriad practitioners in the universe and this ‘Dark Giant’ are not the same entity?","[If we go by this assumption, a lot of things can be explained!]","—For example, although it witnessed ‘Wielder of the Will White’ proving his Dao twice and was duped for two entire reincarnations, the Dark Giant should have a deep impression of ‘Wielder of the Will White.’","Yet later, when the Dark Sun encountered Senior White in the main world, Senior White two, and various other Whites, it didn’t react at all, just like it was meeting strangers.","If these two are different ‘entities,’ and the ‘Dark Sun’ that was modified and seized by the Heavenly Dao and this true ‘Dark Giant’ lurking in the shadows do not share memories, then everything makes sense!","The ‘Dark Sun’ is the modified ruler of the Netherworld Realm... while the one awakened with every cycle of the Heavenly Dao is the true ‘Dark Heaven.’","Previously, when the ‘Dark Sun’ was on the verge of life and death, it frantically sent out ‘Rescue Signals,’ which might have been aimed at the hidden ‘Dark Heaven.’","Many clues, after following this ‘assumption,’ can be connected.","[Sure enough, each generation of the Will of the Heavens employs craftier strategies. On the surface, a proxy is left in the main world, while the real body still lurks in the shadows...]","[Without being aware of this, if we merely eliminate the external ‘Dark Sun,’ we cannot root out the calamity of ‘Myriad Worlds Destruction Plan.’]","[Even worse, if we let down our guard, thinking that dealing with the ‘Dark Sun’ resolved everything... we might be secretly stabbed in the back by the ‘Dark Giant’ lurking in the dark, resulting in a complete turnaround.]","Luckily, he had now become aware of this.","He would go back and discuss with Senior White, Daoist Senior, Father Goudan, Senior Three-Eyes, and all the pendant big shots to thoroughly prevent any chance of the ‘Dark Giant’s’ real body turning the tide.","It would be best to flip the table on him, destroying everything he hoped to seize!","After making this decision internally, Song Shuhang turned his attention back to the epic battle between the Sage of Confucianism and fat ball.","By watching this battle, Song Shuhang realized many things.","In particular, the Sage’s use of the ‘Scholarly Rune’ sparked a massive inspiration in Song Shuhang. In the future, once he tinkered with more of his own ‘Tyrannical Literature,’ he, too, could simply make a gesture in the vacuum, and a ‘Tyrannical Rune’ would appear.","The style of the battle suddenly improved!","How wonderful!","And then, just like that...","Thirty days passed, sixty days passed...","Finally, the Dark Giant could wait no longer..."]},{"number":3060,"title":"Chapter 3060 - 3058: Is this your ‘domination’ secret technique? But now, it’s mine!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3060: Chapter 3058: Is this your ‘domination’ secret technique? But now, it’s mine!","“I’ve never seen the final battle of the Heavenly Dao drag on for so long,” the Dark Giant said in complete despair.","It couldn’t wait any longer.","Its time had come.","“No choice, I have to make a move,” the Dark Giant stated.","If it didn’t act now, it would be ejected from this world again, only able to wait for the next “Heavenly Dao Reincarnation” to commence.","It didn’t want to wait for another cycle anymore!","“Fortunately, I’ve made some modifications to the ‘Domination Secret Method’... Now is the perfect time to use it,” the Dark Giant said and began to activate the incredibly precious secret method that took tens of thousands of years to condense.","[That secret method,is called ‘Domination Secret Method’? Such a blatant and straightforward name?]Song Shuhang’s attention shifted from the Sage of Confucianism and the fat ball back to the Dark Giant.","Any secret method that includes the word ‘domination’ always inexplicably felt familiar to him.","Although the ‘Domination Secret Method’ sounded blunt, Song Shuhang felt a connection with it and instinctively wanted to keep a closer eye on it.","By coincidence, the ‘gaze’ of the Dark Giant also shifted from the Sage of Confucianism back to itself.","A pair of pitch-black gravelly palms condensed and slowly began to form a modified seal—since this was the Dark Giant’s first time using it, he was very cautious.","Its caution provided Tyrannical Song a chance to learn.","Deep down, Song Shuhang truly was a top-notch scholar...","The reason he seemed like a poor student in ‘foundation establishment cultivation knowledge’ was mainly due to time constraints.","If he were a normal Immortal big shot, gradually advancing through small realms every few years, large realms every few decades, condensing a Nascent Soul in a few hundred years, becoming a Profound Sage in a few thousand years, and a Tribulation Transcender in tens of thousands of years, then his cultivation knowledge would absolutely match his own realm, becoming that of a ‘scholarly, reliable senior.’","Despite only having cultivated about a year, Song Shuhang’s grasp of cultivation knowledge, space spell theories, and combat skills far exceeded any other cultivator who had only cultivated for a year!","Song Shuhang stared at the pitch-black gravelly hands, watching the series of seals, and firmly memorized them.","[Hmm, I’ll go ask Senior White to see if we can decrypt this ‘Domination Secret Method’ and perhaps simplify it to just three formation runes, which seems more suitable for me]Tyrannical Song concluded.","Ever since having many senior pendants, Senior White, Daoist Senior, Senior Three Eyes, Father Goudan, and other big shots around him, Song Shuhang’s ‘scholar attribute’ gradually had fewer opportunities for use.","...","...","The highly precious ‘Domination Secret Method’ that the Dark Giant had condensed was successful, then it began to lock its gaze on the Sage of Confucianism.","—Although the battle had been prolonged so long without ending, from the look of the scene, the entire battle situation had already entered into the phase where the Sage of Confucianism controlled the environment.","The Sage always managed to identify the fat ball’s weaknesses, launching a series of strikes on it.","The fat ball could still barely defend itself, but its defenses were less and less effective against the Sage. The Sage had found a pattern and could easily break through those defenses, stringingly striking at the fat ball’s essence.","At this rate, even if they dragged out the time a bit longer, the ultimate winner would surely be the Sage of Confucianism!","Even among past Heavenly Dao figures, before proving his Dao, the Sage of Confucianism’s performance could be ranked very high!","Such an existence, it would be difficult for the Heavenly Dao not to acknowledge him!","The Dark Giant believed in its own judgment.","Therefore, it still planned to take a shot at the Sage, setting the Sage as its primary target.","Buzz—","The modified ‘Domination Secret Method’ was cast, aiming towards the Sage of Confucianism from afar.","—This peculiar ‘Domination Secret Method’ had an extremely low presence, basically impossible to detect.","The first time, even the Wielder of the Will White had been directly hit.","The Sage of Confucianism was no exception; just like the previous Wielder of the Will White, he completely received the effect of this ‘Domination Secret Method’.","Seeing the Sage of Confucianism receive the ‘Domination Secret Method,’ the Black Sun emitted a joyful laugh.","“Excellent, just like that. I believe you have a better chance of seizing the Heavenly Dao... However, given that bizarre and handsome predecessor’s example, I must make some changes,” the Dark Giant once again began to form the secret method.","But this time, he wasn’t rubbing the “Domination Secret Method.”","The Domination Secret Method, extremely tyrannical... it could only condense once every tens of millions of years. Moreover, given its bodily state, it could only store one shot. If it wanted to condense a second one, the energy would be directly swallowed by the first shot of “Domination Secret Method.”","This was a very tyrannical and aggressive rule of secret technique.","Since he couldn’t condense a second shot, he could only improve the effects of the first one.","After the secret technique was rubbed out, the Dark Giant secretly pointed at ‘fat ball,’ leaving a ‘mark’ on it without a sound.","Though the likelihood was very, very small, if by chance the last one to prove his Dao was Fat Ball, then this ‘mark’ could quietly transfer the Domination Secret Method from the Sage of Confucianism once Fat Ball started proving its pseudo-immortal body.","After undergoing the transfer, the ‘Domination Secret Method’ would certainly be somewhat inferior, but having something was better than nothing... If need be, it could patch things up afterward.","“Prepare for both hands, even if at the end, this Sage turns the Heavenly Dao seat over to Ball in the plot, my plan will not fail,” the Dark Giant said satisfied.","Then, its existence began to be repelled by ‘myriad practitioners in the universe,’ forcing it to retreat quietly.","“This time... I will go back and wait to receive the successful news of the ‘Domination Secret Method,’” the Dark Giant elegantly exited the scene.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang had recorded the entire process of the ‘Domination Secret Method’ and its ‘Domination Secret Method Mark Two.’","Later, he would discuss it with the seniors.","I really like your ‘Domination Secret Method’—later on, it will be mine.","Moreover, I don’t just want to dominate your ‘Domination Secret Method,’ I also want to improve it—the tens of millions of years is just too long, holding a move for so long practicality. Thus, the qi gathering time must be improved!","Thinking about this, Song Shuhang also left the scene, satisfied.","But this time was somewhat different from the previous rounds.","In the previous rounds, after leaving the scene, the Dark Giant would fall into a dark slumber.","But this time, Song Shuhang, in the darkness, could still hear its voice.","“Eh? It’s not done yet? It’s been over a year now.”","The darkness continued for a long time.","“Ten years now, ten years!”","The darkness persisted.","“Twenty years now, a full twenty years!”","The darkness remained.","“How much longer must I fight, it’s been thirty years now,” the Dark Giant started to grow restless.","The darkness continued its diligent sequence.","The Dark Giant was like a code monkey pulling an all-nighter, clearly very sleepy, yet still striving to stay awake.","“Buzz, what’s happening? Three thousand years now, it’s been three thousand years!”","Song Shuhang: “???”","Three thousand years?","He remembered, the epochal battle between the Sage of Confucianism and Fat Ball Senior, though it lasted long, it was just several decades, definitely not as long as three thousand years!","The darkness was still emotionless.","“Ten thousand years now, ten thousand years? A Heavenly Dao struggle, ten thousand years?”","Song Shuhang pinched his chin.","A moment later, he laughed out loud, pleased.","Well... keep waiting, Big Shot.","If nothing unexpected happens, you won’t even live to see the day ‘Domination Secret Method’ takes effect."]},{"number":3061,"title":"Chapter 3061 - 3059: Karma Flames Daoist and the Virtuous Network","paragraphs":["Chapter 3061: Chapter 3059: Karma Flames Daoist and the Virtuous Network","When Song Shuhang first saw the ‘Dark Giant’ manipulating the ‘Domination Secret Method No. 2 Mark,’ he was worried that the fat ball lord might have part of its Heavenly Dao Authority usurped...","Because of the fat ball lord’s poor performance in the later stages, it really couldn’t be trusted.","But when he saw the ‘Dark Giant’ had been waiting in the darkness for tens of thousands of years, Song Shuhang knew that the ‘Dark Giant’ would never witness the moment when the ‘Domination Secret Method’ took effect!","The ‘Domination Secret Method No. 2 Mark’ on the fat ball lord was likely taken away by the Confucian Sage.","[Was this also within the calculations of the Confucian Sage?]","Speaking of which... When he once entered the dream of the ‘Fairy Creation’ in the past, Song Shuhang was captured by the Confucian Sage.","At that time, while in a dreamland state, Song Shuhang made a choice—he tried to convey a hint to the Confucian Sage: “Don’t compete for the Heavenly Dao.”","The hint was successfully conveyed, but the outcome of the battle between the Confucian Sage and the fat ball lord remained unchanged.","[If the Confucian Sage really did swallow the ‘Domination Secret Method No. 2 Mark’ from the fat ball lord... and then recalling how Daoist Senior inherited the 8.5 Heavenly Dao so smoothly, without encountering any obstacles... could there be a connection between the two?]","For instance, did the Confucian Sage use the effect of the ‘Domination Secret Method No. 2 Mark’ to lay out in the ‘Confucian Classic’ a path for Daozi, leading him toward the ‘8.5 Heavenly Dao Authority’ he was to assume?","Of course, this is just Song Shuhang’s speculation at the moment.","Whether the Confucian Sage’s calculations are really that formidable is still unknown.","...","...","In a vision similar to a dream, the darkness had still not dispersed.","“One hundred thousand years have passed, failed, failed, failed...” the ‘Dark Giant,’ who had been waiting bitterly for one hundred thousand years, was on the verge of turning into a Husband-Gazing Stone Statue.","Finally, after pulling an all-nighter for one hundred thousand years without rest, the ‘Dark Giant’ finally gave up.","Although it did not know which part of the plan went wrong, it vaguely guessed that its plan had mysteriously failed once again.","Because it is impossible for a ‘Battle for Heavenly Dao’ to last a full one hundred thousand years!","There can be an ‘ownerless’ transition period for the Heavenly Dao, but it absolutely cannot be this long.","“Are all these guys toxic?” the Dark Giant thought bitterly but could not express it.","The beautiful figure that had tricked him twice before—at least he knew how he had been tricked by the other, and he was clear about the process.","But this time, with the Confucian Sage and that spherical guy, he had no idea how he was tricked or which part went wrong; the Dark Giant was completely clueless.","If he knew the process, he could specifically improve the ‘Domination Secret Method’ to lay the foundation for the next success.","But without knowing the process, how could he improve the secret method?","“Next time, it will be the ninth cycle of Heavenly Dao succession. Failure is not an option.” The voice of the Dark Giant grew lower and lower until it finally sank into a long slumber again.","After entering the state of slumber, several types of magical techniques within it began to operate.","These were gathering the energy for the ‘Domination Secret Method.’","This process was extremely lengthy and required tens of millions of years.","Song Shuhang took a brief look at the process and memorized the flow, preparing to hand it over to the reliable senior powers for in-depth study afterward.","[It’s about time.] Song Shuhang thought to himself.","The ninth ‘Battle for Heavenly Dao’ had not yet begun.","The Dark Giant would need some time before its next ‘awakening.’","So Song Shuhang estimated that it was about time for him to exit from the ‘Dark Giant’s vision mode.’","Truth be told... if possible, he would really like to see the situation of the ‘ninth Battle for Heavenly Dao,’ which would be an event occurring in the distant future.","Whoosh~","Song Shuhang’s consciousness began to quietly separate from the ‘Dark Giant Vision Mode.’","The entire process was smooth and silent, causing not even the slightest reaction from the Dark Giant.","“Next time, when the Dark Giant awakens again, it will be the decisive moment of the ninth ‘Battle for Heavenly Dao,’ or perhaps the ascension of the Ninth Heavenly Dao, right?” Song Shuhang opened his eyes and murmured softly.","And they must obtain the ninth Heavenly Dao for themselves, he and Senior White.","“`","Even if it is impossible to achieve “two different individuals attaining immortality at the same time,” at least one person should attain immortality first and then plan further.","“In other words, Senior White and I might encounter the awakening Dark Giant when proving the ‘Ninth Heavenly Dao’, and it’s possible that this fellow might secretly perform a ‘Domination Secret Method’ from behind the scenes and forcefully bestow us with a secret technique.”","This is not what Song Shuhang wanted.","Therefore, it is necessary to topple the Dark Giant’s table and smash his dish.","“Has the absorption of the ‘Sub-immortalization’ of the skull and face been completed? With a state similar to ‘entering dreamland,’ making contact with the vision of the Dark Giant can also speed up the digestion of ‘Sub-immortalization’?” Song Shuhang wondered, calculating the time with his fingers.","After a brief calculation, he realized that from the beginning of ‘entering a dream-like mode’ to opening his eyes, a month had already passed.","In the past, entering dreamland would only require a single dream for tens of thousands of years.","This time it might be a low-end version, consuming a month in one go... Fortunately, this is the ‘Heavenly Dao Time Secret Realm’.","“If the digestion is complete, then I should hurry to meet up with Senior White. While the ‘Dark Sun’ is still sealed, I should try to shear the sheep multiple times and complete the ‘Sub-immortal’ state for my whole body.” Song Shuhang hurriedly prepared to get up and meet Senior White.","Additionally, the intelligence regarding the ‘Dark Giant’ hidden behind the scenes needs to be informed to all the seniors.","The research on the ‘Domination Secret Method’ also has to be prioritized.","Mister Tyrannical Song is very busy today as well.","Boom~~","Just as Song Shuhang got up, the entire ‘Heavenly Dao Time Secret Realm’ suddenly started shaking violently, as if an earthquake was occurring.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Could it be? Just by standing up, did I trigger the shaking of the entire secret realm space? Am I that heavy?","“It’s not due to you; the Time Secret Realm has been interfered with by an external force.” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair replied.","Even the ‘Sub-immortal Face’ couldn’t block the transmission of information from Song Shuhang’s expression.","“Who dares to attack a secret realm space created by the Heavenly Dao? Do they not want to live?” Song Shuhang immediately contacted Daoist Senior.","...","...","On the other side.","In the ‘Heavenly Dao Dimension World’ situated above all the myriad realms.","Daozi furrowed his brows.","In front of him was the Stellar Destruction Virus, still being reverse-engineered.","Daozi had always been sparing time to research a solution to reverse the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus.’","This time, the experiment seemed to have some clues, but in the very last step, the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ was successfully reversed and began disintegrating.","Unexpectedly, the nascent form of the disintegrating Stellar Destruction Virus suddenly exploded.","The power of the explosion was enough to destroy a star.","What’s the difference between this and a direct detonation?","...","...","At the same time.","As the reverse-engineered ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ exploded in Daozi’s hands, in the myriad realms, a figure engulfed in karma flames sensed something and squeezed out from a crack in space.","The raging karma flames covered his aura.","He looked towards the location above the nine heavens.","Shortly after.","He arrived at the vicinity of the ‘Time Secret Realm Space’ personally crafted by Daozi.","Raising his hand, he punched out gently.","This punch wasn’t forceful, otherwise, with a single punch from the Karma Flames Daoist, the Time Secret Realm might be blasted apart.","“`","“`","He only needed to knock using his fists, letting the current ‘Heavenly Dao’ sense its arrival.","After all, this ‘time-distorted secret realm’ was a creation of the Heavenly Dao. Knocking outside the secret realm should have drawn the attention of the Heavenly Dao.","It wasn’t Daozi who appeared immediately, but rather Song Shuhang, who had the Scarlet Heaven Sword and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber tied to his waist, stepping out of the ‘time-distorted secret realm’ and appearing right in front of the Karma Flames Daoist.","“Is it you?” Song Shuhang looked at the charred daoist.","If he hadn’t guessed wrong, this outer shell of charred coverage caused by the karmic flames should be that of the former Sixth Heavenly Dao, Daoist Priest Virtue, right?","Hum~~","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ at his waist unsheathed itself, slashing towards the charred Karma Flames Daoist!","Back then, it was because of the other party that the ‘numbers’ of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had reset to zero, and everything had had to start all over again!","“Crack crack...” The Karma Flames Daoist made a dry sound from his mouth, just hearing it made you feel like his throat had been dried out.","At the same time, he reached out a hand to lightly block.","Ding~","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber cut straight through the karmic flames, slicing onto the daoist’s arm.","The charred cover on the arm of the Karma Flames Daoist broke slightly, revealing the skin inside—compared to the charred shell, the skin beneath seemed exceptionally pale and tender.","The Karma Flames Daoist didn’t resist and with a light flick, sent the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ to the side.","The karmic flames wrapping his body quickly recovered, and soon a new charred shell was burned over the open cut.","Clearly, the charred shell enveloping his body was deliberately burned onto himself by the Karma Flames Daoist.","“White...” The Karma Flames Daoist looked towards Song Shuhang, then tilted his head to search.","But he didn’t find ‘White’ anywhere.","So, he lowered his head as if sinking into meditation.","Having not seen ‘White,’ the red gleam in his eyes grew more intense, and his consciousness seemed as if it would once again fall into madness.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","This state could be described in one sentence—Not good, will I die without having seen ‘White’?","“Senior, are you alright?” Song Shuhang asked cautiously.","At the same time, he immediately began contacting Senior Daozi.","Currently, only Daozi could barely suppress the Karma Flames Daoist.","“Crack, not... good.” The Karma Flames Daoist spoke with difficulty.","It seemed like his consciousness was blurring again and he was on the verge of losing control.","“Shall I take you to see Senior White?” Song Shuhang tentatively asked.","Maybe after seeing Senior White, the Karma Flames Daoist’s condition could return to normal?","“No...” The Karma Flames Daoist resisted.","The red glow in his eyes intensified.","“Virtue?” He looked up, his eyes burning red as he gazed at Song Shuhang.","“Oh, right, the light of virtue!” Song Shuhang suddenly understood. Last time they met, it was suppressive virtue power that helped the Karma Flames Daoist recover somewhat.","Thus, Song Shuhang willed the virtuous lamia to appear with a thought.","Great, rich, and pure light of virtue began shining from Song Shuhang.","The karmic flames enveloping the daoist’s body were oppressed by the power of virtue, like a wronged little wife being forcibly squeezed out.","“Crack...” The Karma Flames Daoist let out a low cry, involuntarily stepping back several paces.","“Senior, don’t lie down, let me cover you with the light of virtue,” Song Shuhang reminded.","“Don’t...” The Karma Flames Daoist struggled to squeeze out a word.","Song Shuhang looked puzzled: “???”","“`","Karma Flames Daoist backed up a few steps, then looked at Song Shuhang and said, “Virtue, eternity, pseudo-eternity, weak eternity.”","On Song Shuhang’s body, there was a vast power of virtue, a fat whale golden core with the properties of eternity, a pseudo-eternity body, and a sub-immortal face.","What a complex man.","Karma Flames Daoist stared at Song Shuhang, the red glow in his eyes flickering continuously.","No one knew what he was thinking.","At this time, Song Shuhang really wished he could transfer his ‘face-reading’ skill to the other party without charging any copyright fees.","“Do not, research, virus,” Karma Flames Daoist finally seemed to use all his strength to squeeze out these few words.","Having said that, he turned around and began to run away into the distance.","Just like when he had originally run out from his ‘Tomb of Immortality’, in a pitiable and crazed state, eyes blood-red, and with a strange smile at the corners of his mouth.","[Don’t research the virus? The Stellar Destruction Virus? I’m not researching it.], Song Shuhang thought puzzledly.","However, other seniors might be researching this thing.","Senior Daozi, Senior White two, three-eyed junior, and Father Goudan might research the virus and go through the reversal process.","From the hint given by Karma Flames Daoist, could there be potential dangers in researching the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’?","“Senior Daozi?” Song Shuhang called out.","“I heard you,” Daozi’s voice responded.","“Will there be any hidden dangers?” Song Shuhang said—he was somewhat worried that Karma Flames Daoist’s current appearance might be related to his contact with the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’. From the previous ‘Immortal Daoist Restarting the Myriad Realms’ plot, the Immortal Daoist had once collaborated with the ‘Dark Sun Giant’ and researched the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’.","“I’ll open the Heavenly Dao Authority in a moment and conduct a thorough appraisal again to see if there’s any underhanded work. It’s just... if we don’t research it, how can we deal with these Stellar Destruction Viruses?” Daozi massaged his temples vigorously.","“Right, regarding the ‘Dark Sun Giant’, I have also discovered another piece of the inside story.” Song Shuhang utilized the Sound Transmission function to describe the existence of another ‘Dark Giant’ lurking behind the scenes to Senior Daozi.","In the Heavenly Dao Dimension World, Daozi rubbed his temples even harder.","His head ached; the Dark Sun was already challenging to deal with, and there was unexpectedly another ‘Dark Giant’ lurking in the background.","If I ever get the chance, I will surely uproot you completely and scatter your ashes!","“I’ll go talk to a few masters about this matter,” Daozi replied.","His intent withdrew from Song Shuhang’s side and moved to next door, where three-eyed junior and Father Goudan were.","“Let’s go too, let’s go pluck some more immortal wool,” Song Shuhang grabbed the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber that was still angry in the void.","Just as Song Shuhang was getting ready to open a spatial passage, not far away, a figure crossed through space and arrived—it was the long-unseen ‘Almighty Merchant’!","At this moment, this big-shot wore a complicated expression as he looked at Song Shuhang from a distance.","“Hi, Senior Almighty Seller~” Song Shuhang greeted warmly.","The Almighty Merchant did not respond to Mister Tyrannical Song’s enthusiasm.","He slightly crouched down, adopting a ‘starting run’ posture.","The next moment, his figure shot forth like lightning, turning into a gust of wind and rushing towards Song Shuhang.","One-thousandth of a second later, he brushed past Song Shuhang.","At the same time, he seemed to have tossed something onto Song Shuhang... and then, with a look of disgust, he ran far away.","Song Shuhang looked puzzled: “???”","He looked down at his chest.","There, a seed formed by pure virtue power, imbued with strands of the aura of eternity, was stuck on his chest.","Through this seed, Song Shuhang could vaguely sense that ‘virtuous network’ spread across the myriad realms.",".",".","Here’s today’s novel recommendation: Ru Shuiyi’s new book “Doomsday Final Battle” has started a new journey. Recently, many friends and big shots have been starting new books. I’ll milk every one of them before I complete mine!"]},{"number":3062,"title":"Chapter 3062 - 3060: The Bewildered Dark Giant","paragraphs":["Chapter 3062: Chapter 3060: The Bewildered Dark Giant","No need to go through the Virtuous Lamia anymore; just by holding this ‘Immortal Breath Seed,’ Song Shuhang could clearly sense the existence of the ‘Virtuous Network,’ and with a single thought, he could enter it.","Is this the key to the Virtuous Network?","Song Shuhang reached out and grasped the seed, examining it closely.","The seed emitted strands of an immortal aura, but it was not an ‘Object of Eternity.’ Rather, it was a treasure that the Will of the Heavens had nurtured with its eternal power over a long time—in fact, the original materials for ‘Primordial Treasures’ in this world all came from this process.","Unfortunately, this ‘seed’ was too small; otherwise, with some materials of the same rank and with Daoist Senior’s help, perhaps they could have crafted a ‘Primordial Treasure.’","“Almighty Seller Senior, are you planning to give me this precious seed?” Song Shuhang looked up at the disdainful face of the distant big shot.","Giving away something for free, with the character of ‘Almighty Seller Senior’?","Is the sun rising from the west? Is this the rhythm of the world ending?","“Someone has already paid for you,” the Almighty Merchant called back from afar.","“Who?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","“You don’t need to know,” Almighty Seller Senior retorted. “So, farewell, Tyrannical Song.”","May we never meet again!","You, the first man in history to take a treasure from me without even giving a single spirit stone!","Every encounter with you brings nothing but trouble!","The Almighty Merchant, as if warding off a ‘virus,’ waved at Song Shuhang from a distance, then opened a space gate and disappeared.","Song Shuhang: “...”","If he remembered correctly, this was at least the fourth time the Almighty Merchant had said ‘farewell’ to him.","But the myriad practitioners in the universe are vast, yet also very small.","If it’s fated, no matter how far apart, they’ll meet again.","Song Shuhang watched the ‘Almighty Merchant’ fade into the distance.","A moment later...","He opened the ‘Cultivator Chat System,’ pulled up [Blacklist·My Good Friend] Almighty Merchant, and sent a message: “Hi, Almighty Seller Senior.”","The existence of chat software is precisely to allow people at the ends of this world to communicate anytime, anywhere~","[System Notification: Ding~ The other party is a VIP customer and has added you to the ‘VIP Block for 7 Days’ list, you cannot send messages to this person.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","VIP customers, can’t afford to offend, can’t afford to offend.","Yet, he still needed to talk with the ‘Almighty’ big shot—because just now, he forgot to ask him what use this ‘Virtuous Seed’ serves, which someone had bought and given to him.","Thus, Song Shuhang pulled up his own [Server] feature.","The fleeing Almighty Merchant received a [System Notification]: “Hi, Almighty Seller Senior~”","The Almighty Merchant stomped a meteoroid to pieces: “Damn!”","Shameless!","Even after using the VIP 7-Day Block feature, still receiving system notifications? This is a scam!","[System Notification: Senior, you left in such a hurry, I still have something to ask you.]","The Almighty Merchant gritted his teeth and replied: “Spit it out fast!”","[System Notification: Senior, since proving my Dao and becoming a Tribulation Transcender, I don’t fart anymore!]","The Almighty Merchant coldly replied: “If you don’t spit it out soon, I will not answer any more of your questions.”","[System Notification: Senior, what is the ‘Virtuous Seed’ for? What does that generous buyer, who bought the ‘Virtuous Seed’ and gave it to me, want me to do?]","“I’m just a seller, what do I know?” the Almighty Merchant replied. “If you can’t figure it out, why don’t you just eat it and see?”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior, why must you deceive yourself and others?","This thing is related to the ‘Virtuous Network.’ In the myriad worlds, apart from the ‘Virtuous Lamia’ and ‘Senior Melon Eater,’ only the ‘Almighty’ big shot can move freely in and out of the Virtuous Network.","Thus, Song Shuhang was very clear in his heart that this thing was most likely sent by ‘Almighty Seller’ Senior himself.","He had simply seen through it without pointing it out.","“Do I really have to swallow this thing? But such things usually can’t be digested if swallowed,” Song Shuhang pondered while holding the Virtuous Seed. “Maybe I should use the secret appraisal technique? Or perhaps, let the Fairy Soft Feather try swallowing it?”","The virtuous lamia slowly emerged from behind Song Shuhang, stretching out her small fist, aiming at Song Shuhang’s belly.","“Just kidding, virtuous fairy,” Song Shuhang quickly waved his hands.","The virtuous lamia threw a punch, her fist entering into Song Shuhang’s abdomen and punching right through—her fist entered his front belly and came out from his lower back.","In the palm of the virtuous lamia, the fat whale golden core struggled like a fish pulled onto the shore.","The virtuous lamia silently lifted the fat whale golden core, aiming it at the ‘Virtuous Seed’.","“You want the fat whale golden core to swallow it?” Song Shuhang asked.","—-Hmm, that shouldn’t be a problem.","The fat whale golden core had already completely completed its evolution, turning into an existence on the same level as the ‘bone of eternity’. It was estimated that even the Will of the Heavens couldn’t completely destroy it now.","So, let’s swallow it and see!","The virtuous lamia extended her other hand, grabbed the ‘Virtuous Seed’, and directly stuffed it into the fat whale golden core’s mouth, forcing it to swallow.","The fat whale golden core cooperated, not struggling, but rather happily swallowed the Virtuous Seed.","...","...","Elsewhere.","Almighty Merchant fled into the ‘Virtuous Network’.","His figure directly entered into the core location.","There, a charred Daoist figure was standing motionless.","“I have already handed the ‘Virtuous Seed’ to Tyrannical Song... I didn’t even charge him spirit stones this time,” Almighty Merchant said painfully.","The Charcoal Daoist nodded slightly, then he stood up, ready to leave the Virtuous Network.","“Are you leaving again?” Almighty Merchant unexpectedly showed a hint of reluctance.","The Charcoal Daoist nodded again.","“How can I save you?” Almighty Merchant looked down at him and asked solemnly.","“The dead... what talk of... saving?” The Charcoal Daoist answered in a hoarse voice.","Finally, he looked at Almighty Merchant with satisfaction, his figure disappearing without a trace.","...","...","After leaving the Virtuous Network, the business flames burned fiercely once again on the body of the Charcoal Daoist.","“I can no longer... resist... from now on... it’s up to you...” The last bit of reason in the eyes of the Charcoal Daoist disappeared completely, turning into a mad red glow.","On his body, the layer of charred husk cracked inch by inch, revealing the white skin underneath.","Seconds later, the charred husk completely peeled off.","In the flames, the Daoist lightly shook his head, his long hair flinging off the husk shards, revealing an incomparably handsome face.","But this face was not that of ‘Daoist Priest Virtue’.","It was the face of ‘Senior White’.","Both pupils of this incarnation of ‘White’ were a deep red.","Meanwhile.","At the very moment this ‘White’ revealed his true face, a Dark Giant who had been in slumber for an entire cycle of reincarnation was suddenly forcibly awakened!","No battle for the Will of the Heavens had commenced yet, but it had successfully ‘linked’ with an object in the main world.","His ‘Domination Secret Method’ had taken effect!","The Dark Giant looked utterly baffled."]},{"number":3063,"title":"Chapter 3063 - 3061: I’m Finally Going to Experience a Turnaround!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3063: Chapter 3061: I’m Finally Going to Experience a Turnaround!","What happened?","Did my “Domination Secret Method” take effect?","Has the struggle for the Ninth Heavenly Dao already ended?","But I hadn’t used the secret technique on the “Ninth Heavenly Dao” yet, had I?","Could it be that I was dozing off just now, suddenly woken up, and instinctively threw the secret technique at the Ninth Heavenly Dao?","The “Dark Giant,” who had just been forcibly awakened, was momentarily confused.","He even almost had the illusion of “Time Chaos,” feeling like he had skipped part of the plot.","However, the Dark Giant quickly adjusted his mental state.","Following the connection between himself and the main world, he began to peer into the “Heavenly Dao” that had been seized through the “link.”","The moment his consciousness stealthily sensed the situation in the main world, he was almost excited enough to disconnect the internet cable!","Fuck, it’s that handsome guy who tricked him twice!","Why is it him again!","Damn it, wasn’t this guy already proven immortal during the seventh struggle?","Moreover, in the seventh struggle, because the other party suddenly went through “Light-speed Immortalization” in the last part of his ascension, his “Domination Secret Method” condensed but wasn’t used, and the secret technique he had saved for tens of millions of years disintegrated reluctantly, not having been used on the other party at all.","So now, what’s the deal with this “Heavenly Dao” that has been seized?","Why would he be subject to the effects of the “Domination Secret Method”?","“Could there be some kind of conspiracy?” The Dark Giant, who was normally the master schemer behind the scenes, suddenly found himself somewhat intimidated by this handsome and attractive individual—not because the other was too strong, but because he was too scheming.","Getting involved with this guy never led to anything good.","Caution, caution is a must.","I can’t just happily rush forward because the “Domination Secret Method” has successfully seized the possession, what if it’s a trap?","“First assume this is a trap from the secret technique, and then prepare a myriad of follow-up measures, safety first.”","“But on the other hand... This handsome and attractive guy should be the Seventh Heavenly Dao, right? Could this be some sort of contingency he left behind?”","“But that doesn’t make sense, if it’s a contingency, why would it only act now? He is clearly the Seventh Heavenly Dao, and now the Heavenly Dao is on its ninth cycle of reincarnation!”","“And what about the ‘Domination Secret Method’ on him... I clearly failed during the seventh cycle.”","“Could it be the effect of the ‘Domination Secret Method’ I threw at him during the Sixth Heavenly Dao struggle?”","“No, that’s not right, if the ‘Domination Secret Method’ I used during the Sixth Heavenly Dao is still effective today, then when this handsome individual underwent the Seventh Heavenly Dao, the ‘Domination Secret Method’ should have taken effect right after he proved his Dao.”","“Unless, he noticed the ‘Domination Secret Method’ I left secretly, and even thoroughly researched it, perhaps analyzing its effects, wanting to trap me?”","The cautious Dark Giant quickly came up with many speculations in one breath.","Just to be sure, he made almost a thousand precautionary measures while quietly connecting to the “Handsome Heavenly Dao,” predicting every possible “accident.”","If there’s any wrong reaction, he would retreat immediately.","After preparing thoroughly, the Dark Giant deepened the “connection” a little more.","Soon, some information was fed back from the “Handsome Heavenly Dao.”","[Huh? This isn’t the Handsome Heavenly Dao, but the “Daoist Priest Virtue” who took the Heavenly Dao position through trade and transactions?]","[Then why does he look like a ‘Beautiful Heavenly Dao’?]","[Could it be that because his ‘Heavenly Dao seat’ was obtained through a trade, after proving his Dao, his appearance was influenced by the Heaven’s Will, getting modifications that made him resemble the ‘Beautiful Heavenly Dao’?]","The Dark Giant thought for a long time, and that was the only possibility he could come up with.","Since this is the ‘Daoist Priest Virtue’s Heavenly Dao,’ not the ‘Beautiful Heavenly Dao,’ the Dark Giant felt an inexplicable sense of relief deep in his heart.","However, another question arose!","[I remember that I never sent the ‘Domination Secret Method’ to the ‘Daoist Priest Virtue,’ right?]","During the sixth Heavenly Dao battle, I sent the ‘Domineering Secret Method’ to the ‘Beautiful Heavenly Dao’ who was ascending... So, Daoist Priest Virtue shouldn’t have the effects of the secret techniques.","Then why did ‘Daoist Priest Virtue’s Heavenly Dao’ fall for the trap?","This doesn’t make sense!","[Did my Domination Secret Method on the ‘Beautiful Heavenly Dao’ get transferred to Daoist Priest Virtue’s Heavenly Dao after someone else took over the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’? Buzz! I hadn’t even figured out the feature that allowed the Domination Secret Method to transfer back then. And, if the Domination Secret Method truly transferred to Daoist Priest Virtue, I should have managed to conquer Daoist Priest Virtue’s Heavenly Dao Authority back then!]","So...","[Could someone have noticed my covertly deployed ‘Domination Secret Method,’ cracked it, and then used it on the Heavenly Dao of Virtue? Is there someone among the myriad practitioners in the universe with such powerful insight?]","Thinking of that scoundrel, the Beautiful Heavenly Dao, this possibility seemed all too real.","[Should I put a factory label on my ‘Domination Secret Method’ so that every piece that comes out can be identified by me? That would also prevent the possibility of someone figuring out my ‘Domination Secret Method’ and using it to create counterfeits, disrupting my senses,]” thought the Dark Giant inwardly.","After some consideration, the Dark Giant set up several defenses as a precaution, and then he strengthened the connection between himself and the usurped ‘Daoist Priest Virtue’s Heavenly Dao.’","Then, his expression turned strange.","He received more feedback.","After Daoist Priest Virtue achieved pseudo-immortality, things seemed normal; the traded Heavenly Dao seat was still a Heavenly Dao seat with no difference in authority, and his appearance hadn’t changed.","However... the ruler of the Netherworld corresponding to Daoist Priest Virtue was that ‘Beautiful fellow!’","[The Heavenly Dao and its born ruler of the Netherworld are two different entities?] The Dark Giant couldn’t fathom such an astonishing move.","[But considering that Beautiful fellow was already in the ‘Heavenly Dao inheritance’ ceremony, with the ceremony already underway, having the ruler of the Netherworld modeled after him was somewhat acceptable.]","And more coincidentally, since this ruler of the Netherworld took on the ‘Beautiful fellow’s form, it seemed my secret technique on the ‘Beautiful fellow’ was drawn over and affected the ruler of the Netherworld, resulting in a level of ‘Conquest.’","[Which means... did I occupy the ruler of the Netherworld corresponding to the Heavenly Dao back then? Is it just because I did not seize the Heavenly Dao, and was also in slumber, that I didn’t realize it until now?]","And the current situation is this.","After losing the ‘Heavenly Dao seat,’ Daoist Priest Virtue sought to use the power of the ruler of the Netherworld to suppress his rampaging body.","And, as he let go and drew on the power of the ruler of the Netherworld... the Domination Secret Method lurking inside the ruler of the Netherworld sensed the ‘Great Way’s undying body and triggered a second time.","Two reincarnation epochs later, with the Immortal Daoist retired, stripped of divinity, leaving only an indestructible body, he was successfully conquered!","Daoist Priest Virtue started to ‘beautify’ because he merged with the ruler of the Netherworld and was influenced by it.","[Which means, although I didn’t conquer the Heavenly Dao, I now have a powerful trump card?]","After three unfortunate Reincarnations, am I finally going to turn the tide in the coming epoch of the Ninth Heavenly Dao?","If I accept this trump card... it would make planning against the Ninth Heavenly Dao much easier when the time comes.","[Caution is still necessary. While remaining cautious, I’ll fully accept this undying body of Daoist Priest Virtue!]"]},{"number":3064,"title":"Chapter 3064 - 3062: Touching, an overnighter plus lack of sleep plus being forcibly awakened to work overtime like a boss","paragraphs":["Chapter 3064: Chapter 3062: Touching, an overnighter plus lack of sleep plus being forcibly awakened to work overtime like a boss","Cautious... This giant, tricked by “White” through two Heavenly Dao Reincarnations, was filled with caution inside and out on his third encounter with matters related to “White”.","Thus, even though he knew the reason behind the successful possession of the body of Daoist Priest Virtue with the “Domination Secret Method” was just a coincidence,","he still maintained a billion Heart’s Eyes while taking over the body, treading carefully, and retreating immediately at the slightest sign of anomaly.","Originally, a body that could have been possessed in a mere thought’s time under the extreme caution of the Dark Giant took half an hour to completely accept.","“Testing begins.”","“No rejection whatsoever.”","“No remnants of other wills.”","“Domination Secret Method achieved with flawless perfection.”","“Better than I imagined, this is definitely an unexpected surprise.” The Dark Giant finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Under his will’s control, the body of Daoist Priest Virtue with crimson eyes slowly started to move.","Lifting his hand, twisting his body, swaying as if dancing.","If used well, this body of Daoist Priest Virtue would become one of his greatest trump cards.","“However, now is not the time to use this body...” The Dark Giant thought, reigniting the intense karmic flames on the ‘body of Daoist Priest Virtue,’ enveloping his figure.","Daoist Priest Virtue’s body retreated backward, disappearing into the spaces between time, concealing its form.","“This time, the Ninth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation, I must transcend.” The Dark Giant seemed to be reinforcing his own confidence, murmuring softly.","Blessing oneself, reinforcing oneself.","–This is already the last chance.","Only after transcending the Heavenly Dao could he freely traverse the river of time, with the past, present, and future no longer being his constraints.","With one thought, all things could come into being, with one thought, all things could be annihilated, all rules of the worlds would no longer bind him.","Only after reaching the height of transcendence could he have the chance to pursue the traces of the ‘First Heavenly Dao’...","About the First Heavenly Dao, everything had been erased, cut off from the source. There was no one in the world who could remember information about the First Heavenly Dao.","If not for each Heavenly Dao being able to confirm their number in succession... perhaps the missing First Heavenly Dao could have been thoroughly diluted.","Unlike other Heavenly Dao who knew nothing of the ‘First Heavenly Dao,’ the Dark Giant held a tiny clue.","He had an impression in his mind, forcefully marked and reinforced with ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’.","In that impression, there was a being transcending ‘time constraints,’ moving in and out of the river of time, its appearance indescribable with words, and belonging to the humanoid race...","If there were to be a comparison, only the ‘handsome guy’ who had tricked him twice could compare with that existence.","Apart from this tiny impression, he had no more clues about that being–but in his heart, there was an obsession.","To transcend, no matter the cost, to break the limits of the Heavenly Dao, transcend beyond the myriad practitioners in the universe, time and space, to reach that supreme realm. Then, to pursue that trace.","The fact that such a profound obsession remained in his heart suggested that something had definitely happened between him and the ‘First Heavenly Dao’.","It might have been a grievance or perhaps a chance encounter.","But he had no more memories, only an obsession, a tiny impression, and a new pursuit.","The past Heavenly Dao was his pursuit.","Now transcending the Heavenly Dao is his new pursuit.","Unlike a salted fish, he had goals, he had plans.","“It seems there’s still some time before the true Ninth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation... I still need to wait for some time.” The voice of the Dark Giant grew even lower.","Every time he awakened and directly interfered with the main world, there were time constraints.","The last time, the battle between the Sage of Confucianism and that fat ball equally tricked him. After retreating from the main world, he had endured through the dark, staying awake for tens of thousands of years without sleeping.","Those tens of thousands of years of staying awake greatly affected the quality of his sleep.","Moreover, the Ninth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation had not yet officially begun, yet he was forcibly awakened again.","This sleep wasn’t very peaceful.","So now, he was extremely tired.","In the upcoming final battle or phase of proving the Dao in the Ninth Heavenly Dao, he had to enter a dormant state to adjust his condition as much as possible.","[Just a little longer, just a little bit...]","Now that he had mastered the ‘Virtuous Daoist Body,’ if there was any sudden accident during this period, he could also act using the ‘Virtuous Daoist Body’!","The consciousness of the Dark Giant gradually became emptier...","Right, before sleeping, there was one more thing he needed to do!","Before plunging into deep slumber, with his drowsiness intensifying, the Dark Giant checked the status of his backup plan—the state of the Black Sun.","He wanted to see how the Black Sun had been doing recently.","Several breaths later.","The sleepiness of the Dark Giant was stimulated once again.","Upon scanning, he discovered that the Black Sun had actually been sealed.","Sealed within a small world constructed by ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’!","“Buzz,” the Dark Giant rubbed his head.","The matter of sleeping had to be put on hold.","Fortunately, the ‘Eighth Heavenly Dao’ was still in its ‘in-service’ period.","Based on past experiences, the reincarnation of the Ninth Heavenly Dao shouldn’t start anytime soon.","Heavenly Dao succession, the battle for Heavenly Dao, the ascension of the new Wielder of the Will, this process would take at least a few thousand years.","Taking advantage of this time, he would first resolve the trouble with the ‘Black Sun.’","Then hurry up and sleep for a while, adjust the state!","A Dark Giant who was still sleep-deprived after an all-nighter, propped up by tiredness, started to work overtime with gritted teeth.","...","...","Elsewhere, at Song Shuhang’s location.","He and the virtuous lamia were squatting together, staring at the ‘fat whale golden core.’","After swallowing the ‘Virtuous Seed,’ the undying fat whale golden core had no reaction at all, looking utterly leisurely.","“Previously at least it would get pregnant or something, this time after swallowing even higher-quality treasure, there’s no reaction? How about we try to squeeze it out?” Song Shuhang suggested.","The virtuous lamia nodded, rolled up her sleeves, and reached for the fat whale golden core.","“Sshh~” the fat whale golden core hastily sprang into action.","It once again spewed out a great stream of ‘Immortal Light’ from its nostrils, wrapping around Song Shuhang’s body.","In just a moment, Song Shuhang’s entire upper body, except for his head, was encased in a cocoon.","This scene looked familiar.","“It’s Sub-immortalization!” Song Shuhang said.","Did the Almighty Seller know he was undergoing full-body ‘Sub-immortalization’ and thus specially sent up the Virtuous Seed?","As the cocoon formed, Song Shuhang’s upper body ‘Tyrannical Song Skin’ was reinforced, evolving into a Sub-immortal state.","The accidental force of virtue continued to seep into his very bones, synchronously reinforcing all the bones in his upper body.","“At least it saved me the time of shearing sheep five times...” Song Shuhang touched his upper body.","He wasn’t far from having his whole body ‘Sub-immortalized’ now!"]},{"number":3065,"title":"Chapter 3065 - 3063: My grand plan hasn’t progressed in so many years; it must be because you’re too useless.","paragraphs":["Chapter 3065: Chapter 3063: My grand plan hasn’t progressed in so many years; it must be because you’re too useless.","Worth mentioning was that, in this enhancement, even his waist was included in the ‘upper body’ range, which gave Song Shuhang an extra sense of security, a reassuring heftiness!","The pseudo-eternal ‘smoke’ body wasn’t absolutely defensive, and there was still a possibility of the waist getting eroded away.","But now, with his waist covered in ‘sub-immortal’ skin, the number of beings in the myriad realms capable of breaking through his defenses and delivering a kidney blow could be counted on one’s fingers — ten fingers were more than enough!","Moreover, the effects of the ‘Virtuous Seed’ swallowed by the ‘fat whale golden core’ hadn’t disappeared. Its ability to connect to the ‘virtuous network’ was perfectly inherited by the fat whale golden core.","Fat whale golden core skills +1.","Song Shuhang’s ‘virtue, karmic and everlasting path’ benefited from this and took a step further, with the ‘Cultivation Chat System’ also receiving a partial enhancement.","“Estimating four more times, I could complete the evolution for all of my external skin and internal bones,” Song Shuhang assessed internally.","The effects of ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials’ were truly amazing.","It was a shame that there was only one ‘Virtuous Seed.’ If he could get his hands on a few more, he would be able to complete the ‘sub-immortalization’ of his entire skin and bones in the shortest time possible.","From the Almighty Merchant, there was clearly no possibility of getting more ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials’ — even if there were, he would definitely need to spend spirit stones to purchase them next time.","Spirit stones were something Song Shuhang didn’t lack... in the distant future.","He had the ‘Cultivation Chat System.’ As long as he didn’t court death and developed it well, he would definitely be rolling in wealth in the future.","But the problem was, now is now, and the future is the future.","Right now, he was broke.","“Speaking of Dao Artifact Raw Materials, the previous Heavens might have some in stock?” The penniless Tyrannical Song came up with a few good sources.","So, he opened the ‘Cultivation Chat System,’ reached out to Father Goudan, and got straight to the point without further ado.","[Father Goudan, do you have any ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials’?]","The conversation with Father Goudan had to be direct; otherwise, it would be easy to get sidetracked — and before you knew it, you might inexplicably agree to name your future daughter, son, or even granddaughters and grandsons XX egg, joining the ranks of the Goudan family.","On the other end.","When Father Goudan received the message, he had a sense of déjà vu — it was like a child in high school calling his dad for living expenses.","Asking with righteous indignation, with no care whether dad had any private savings or how much was left in his personal vault — didn’t he know that mom was in charge of the family’s large treasury?","[Are you a four-legged gold-swallowing beast? No!] Father Goudan replied coldly, full-grown and still wanting living expenses?","[I can trade for it, Father Goudan. Do you want anything?] The other side, Tyrannical Song, responded smoothly — he never expected to get materials for free from Father Goudan; he was ready to trade from the start.","[You’re broke.] Father Goudan typed back.","Song Shuhang: [...]","[But fortunately, you still have the chance to find a fairy maiden and have children, which does give you a slight investment value. First, tell me what you want the ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials’ for?] Father Goudan replied again — Tyrannical Song himself had no value, but the Heavenly Emperor had said that Tyrannical Song would have a daughter and even granddaughters in the future, and that’s where the value of Tyrannical Song’s life lay.","[Sub-immortalization.] Song Shuhang responded: [After receiving a piece of ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials,’ my upper body has completed the sub-immortalization mode. If I could get one or two more pieces of ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials,’ I could complete the sub-immortalization of my entire body and finish evolving.]","[Goodbye.] Father Goudan replied.","——A fully sub-immortalized Tyrannical Song held no investment value.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","Was this a negotiation breakdown?","Right at this time, the three-eyed young senior sent a message: [Tyrannical Song, what are you discussing with Goudan’s dad? Its mood has suddenly turned sour, what changed?]","Hurry up and tell me so I can have a good laugh.","[Actually, I’m also a bit stunned. I was discussing ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials’ with Father Goudan, wanting to use them to accelerate the immortalization process for my entire body. But somehow, in the middle of our conversation, Father Goudan and I just suddenly broke off talks.] Song Shuhang replied.","Actually, to achieve full body sub-immortalization, just fleece the ‘Dark Sun’ a few more times and it’s done... but after receiving help from the ‘Virtuous Seed,’ Song Shuhang always felt that having different sources of ‘immortal information’ for the complete immortalization would yield better results.","Combining the ‘immortal information’ obtained from more different Heavens’ Wills together to complete the ‘semi-immortalization’ of the entire body will have an effect where 1 + 1 is greater than 2.","“Dao Artifact Raw Materials speeds up the semi-immortal state of the entire body? Does that mean, using the Heavens’ Will information contained within the dao artifact materials? Then... could a complete dao artifact have a similar effect?” the three-eyed young senior replied.","A complete dao artifact?","Song Shuhang looked down at the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ and also at the big-eyed planet that was bound with his ‘Cultivation Chat System,’ acting as a ‘Cultivation Chat Client Downloader.’","These were two perfect primordial treasures!","“Perhaps I can give it a try,” Song Shuhang said.","However, complete dao artifacts differ from ‘Dao Artifact Raw Materials’; you can directly absorb the materials, but you can’t do the same with dao artifacts.","Plus... copying and imprinting the immortal information without damaging the dao artifacts was necessary.","“Can the method of shearing the ‘Dark Sun’s’ wool be adapted for use on dao artifacts?” Song Shuhang thought of a rough plan in his mind.","In any case, he first needed to find Senior White!","Having made up his mind, Song Shuhang felt cheerful and pushed open the ‘main world,’ using it as a transfer point to arrive beside Senior White.","“Absorption complete? Continuing to shear the wool?” Senior White turned and asked.","“Continuing!” Song Shuhang nodded and began to coordinate with Senior White, launching a Joint Attack on the ‘Dark Sun Giant.’","While applying the Joint Attack, Song Shuhang shared with Senior White his idea of ‘imprinting the immortal information on a dao artifact.’","This topic was also forwarded by Senior White to the ‘Sage’s Eye Research Discussion Group’ for collective discussion and research.","AFK enlightenment, closing up, discussion, employing the Sage Talent Joint Attack...","Tyrannical Song and White kept up a steady and synchronized rhythm.","Within the Sealing World.","The Dark Sun Giant felt incredibly wronged.","“Again? Going to farm me another hundred times? What do you think I am!”","“Farm if you want, but do I have no dignity?!”","“Both of you, I’ll remember this!” the Dark Sun Giant said hatefully.","Meanwhile.","Supporting what seemed like a dying drowsiness, the consciousness of the Dark Giant stealthily attached to the ‘Dark Sun,’ poised to save the situation, when its giant form trembled!","“Again... again... It’s him again?”","It was that handsome and pitiful scoundrel again!",".",".",".","Attachment: The Cultivation Chat’s completed blessing video event is now accepting submissions.","Requirements: Vertical orientation; no longer than 20 seconds; shot on a mobile phone; please submit to the designated person by December 31.","The number of people currently needed: 1-2 people to receive videos; 2 to edit videos.","That’s all..."]},{"number":3066,"title":"Chapter 3066 - 3064: Three days...a full three days!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3066: Chapter 3064: Three days...a full three days!","Even if he turned to ashes, I would remember him!","After all, once you’ve seen this guy, you could never forget what he looks like.","Why is this handsome troublemaker showing up here again? Appearing right when the Ninth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation is about to begin?","It’s literally the worst time and the worst place to encounter the person I least want to see!","Moreover, wasn’t this troublemaker supposed to have ascended to the Seventh Heavenly Dao? Counting the time, even if he stirred up trouble and retired early, his real body couldn’t possibly appear in the main world, right?","Unless... the ‘handsome troublemaker’ before me isn’t the same as the Seventh Heavenly Dao troublemaker from before?","Is this his back-up plan left in the main world?","Or maybe he’s just a descendant?","[Be cautious, be cautious. Don’t panic just yet, let’s quietly observe his condition first.] The Dark Giant managed to adjust his mentality—not an easy task, and it showed his inner strength.","First of all.","This ‘handsome troublemaker’ in front of me seems to have just condensed the embryonic form of the Dao of Longevity and is in the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","Oh~ How familiar is this template?","When the handsome troublemaker contended for the position of the Sixth Wielder of the Will, wasn’t this the exact state template he used? Relying on the ‘Tribulation Transcender Realm with the embryonic form of Dao of Longevity,’ he actually managed to fight his way across the world, seizing the Heavenly Dao seat and making the myriad practitioners in the universe cover their faces and weep in shame.","But on closer inspection, I could find some differences between the ‘handsome troublemaker’ before me and the one who fought for the Heavenly Dao.","Could it be he really is a descendant who’s undergone a phenomenon of ancestral return and looks exactly like his ancestor?","Nonsense!","Who would have a case of ancestral return to this extent?","[Keynote! Bold! Red underline!] The Dark Giant immediately marked Immortal White in his mind.","This guy, definitely deserves special attention.","For the next while, I need to watch his every move and not let him have the chance to jeopardize my grand plan!","It would be best... if I could find a way to kill this handsome guy!","His existence is a hidden danger to my plan.","Just as the Dark Giant was nearly focusing all his attention on Immortal White and brainstorming a comprehensive ‘follow-up plan,’ Senior White and Song Shuhang’s ‘Joint Attack’ fell once more.","The Confucian Sage Innate Joint Attack was like a big mouth tasting delicacies, nibbling on the ‘Immortal Sand’ of the Dark Sun. Although it couldn’t bite through the immortality, it could nibble away some of the ‘data information’ released by it.","“Hiss~” After being nibbled by the Joint Attack, the Dark Giant, whose consciousness was attached to the sun, felt his skin crawl!","These two guys are actually trying to fleece me!","And they can actually break through the data protection shell of the ‘immortal body’ surface and copy its data?","Are they insane?","Those who haven’t proved their Dao daring to directly touch immortal information is simply courting death!","Even the most supreme Immortals, upon direct contact with true immortality, upon touching true immortal information, would directly fall into endless unconsciousness, and perhaps never wake up again!","Throughout the myriad realms... from the start of the First Heavenly Dao Reincarnation to now, there has never been anyone who, without proving the Heavenly Dao, touched ‘immortal information’ and came out unharmed.","[I thought this handsome troublemaker would become a hidden danger and hinderance to my plan, but now...it seems I no longer need to pay extra attention to him.] The Dark Giant thought to himself.","In just about ten seconds, these two guys will fall!","The Dark Giant even started counting down for Immortal White and Song Shuhang in his heart.","After ten seconds...","Tyrannical Song and Senior White ruthlessly unleashed another ‘Sage Talent Joint Attack’ on the ‘Dark Sun’.","Both of them were idling, having enlightenments, and having discussions with their minds wandering all over the place, busy beyond compare.","And the scenario the Dark Giant had imagined, where the two guys fell to the ground unconscious, simply did not occur.","Dark Giant: “???”","What’s going on here!","Why don’t these two guys show any side effects after coming into contact with the “immortal information”?","That ‘handsome scammer’ is one thing; he might be a contingency of the Will of the Heavens... but why does the guy with the completely unremarkable looks not show any sign of being affected either?","The Dark Giant really wanted to dedicate a wisp of his attention and check on Song Shuhang.","However, before his inspection could get close, it was blocked by an invisible barrier.","[No, this can’t go on. If I let these two continue to exploit the situation, who knows what kind of anomalies may occur when the Ninth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation begins.]","[It’s time... to deploy that ‘Virtuous Daoist Body’, break through this seal, and rescue my clone of the ruler of the Netherworld.]","Thinking this, the Dark Giant glanced over at the ‘Black Sun’ again and felt that this guy was somewhat useless.","Swoosh~","At this moment, the Joint Attack of Tyrannical Song and Immortal White descended once more—inexplicably, Song Shuhang felt that the ‘Heavenly Dao data information’ brought back by this Joint Attack seemed to have leveled up?","Was it the increase in skill proficiency, upgrading the attack?","[Grrr...] The Dark Giant gnashed his teeth internally, then his consciousness retreated, returning to the dark space.","After that, he made up his mind, activated the ‘Virtuous Daoist Body’, locked on the position of the ‘Black Sun’, and started to scheme.","Even though he held the trump card of the ‘Virtuous Daoist Body’, with his cautious character, he wouldn’t just recklessly charge in.","After all, the current Eighth Heavenly Dao is still in power—and the small world that sealed the ‘Black Sun’ was clearly crafted by the Will of the Heavens, which was not to be taken lightly.","[So... first, I need to find an opportunity to create chaos. Once chaos erupts, then let the Virtuous Daoist Body sneak in and carry out part of the body stored by the clone of the ruler of the Netherworld. As long as part of it is taken out, I can use the ritual to summon the whole body.]","[To create chaos, that thing is indeed very useful. My numerous remains of a Wielder of the Will could come in handy at this time.]","The Dark Giant quickly devised a tactic in his heart within a short time.","And in the shortest time possible, he began preparing for executing the tactic.","...","...","Three days later in the main world.","With a gloomy expression, the Dark Giant finally finished preparing the ‘tactic’.","In these three days, he forced himself to stay alert, proceeded cautiously, and carefully planned... He mainly had to avoid the sensing of the Will of the Heavens and quietly gather his ‘remains of a Wielder of the Will’.","And he positioned the ‘Virtuous Daoist Body’ at a key location.","Normally, these tasks could have been completed within half a day.","However, due to various unexpected incidents, they ended up dragging on for three days—for instance, some of his remains got lost on the way to gathering, he searched for a long time, finding back only ninety percent, with one portion still missing.","For another instance, when he mobilized a few ‘Constant Star Destroyers’ intending to create several Stellar Destruction Viruses, the ‘Constant Star Destroyers’ mobilized were suddenly rounded up—according to the feedback, it seemed like the myriad practitioners in the universe were having a ‘yearly activity to encircle and suppress Constant Star Destroyers and Void Sun Guardians’? What the heck is going on with these alpacas!","It took him three whole days to get everything set up.","On the other side.","Song Shuhang also showed a look of satisfaction on his face.","In the span of three days in the main world, he had finally completed the sub-immortalization of ‘Tyrannical Song’s Skin’ and ‘Tyrannical Song’s Bone’!"]},{"number":3067,"title":"Chapter 3067 - 3065: Under the Will of the Heavens, I Am Supreme!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3067: Chapter 3065: Under the Will of the Heavens, I Am Supreme!","Father Goudan, who had been monitoring Song Shuhang’s condition in secret, felt utterly hopeless at this moment.","“It’s over, there’s no hope left. Tyrannical Song’s daughter is gone, and his granddaughter is gone too...” Father Goudan, in this instance, resembled an elderly father lamenting over his sterilized child.","“Actually, Mister Song still has a biological daughter,” the Heavenly Emperor’s child hinted on the side—the mechanical girl, Xiao Lingxiao, was indeed Tyrannical Song’s genuine biological daughter.","In order not to become Heavenly Goudan or Emperor Goudan, she too was taking action.","“Xiao Lingxiao surely counts, but Tyrannical Song doesn’t have a son, and no son means no granddaughter. Besides, from the bottom of my heart, I also hope that Tyrannical Song can have a somewhat normal biological daughter. In this regard, I am both open-minded and conservative,” said Father Goudan as he affectionately picked up Xiao Lingxiao with his dragon mustaches.","“The life element’s path to immortality doesn’t work for Mister Song anymore?” Black-skinned Soft Feather asked cautiously.","“It’s ineffective, he’s sub-immortal... This kind of sub-immortality is actually a prototype of true immortality, much more advanced than the pseudo-eternal smoky form. At this level, sterilization is quite thorough,” the three-eyed young senior replied from the side.","Black-skinned Soft Feather nodded thoughtfully.","...","...","On another side.","The Dark Giant took a deep breath, conducting one final check of all the ‘tactical preparations’.","A moment later, fighting off the increasing weariness, he ordered, “Tactical scheme, activate!”","At the same time, he covertly manipulated a ‘Heavenly Dao regulation script’s back door and activated it.","– Every Heavenly Dao, before retirement, can leave behind some ‘Heavenly Dao regulation scripts’ for the next Heavenly Dao to activate and use, to quickly grasp the laws of the Heavenly Dao. For example, the ‘modification of the ruler of the Netherworld’s memories script’ that Daozi had previously activated belongs to this category.","Apart from the ‘modification of the ruler of the Netherworld’s memories script’, the Dark Giant, during his time in charge, also left behind a ‘myriad practitioners in the universe major calamity alarm program’... When a major catastrophe occurs in the array of worlds, this program will trigger an alarm.","This Heavenly Dao regulation script had always been operating normally, so the Heavenly Dao who succeeded him did not remove this script.","And within this ‘major calamity alarm program,’ the Dark Giant had hidden a back door. Even after leaving office, he could activate it through specific means!","The Dark Giant was neither the first ‘formal’ Heavenly Dao to do such a thing nor would he be the last.","Once the script was activated, Daozi was immediately awakened.","The next moment, Daozi sensed that a ‘gigantic calamity’ red dot flashed in every realm of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","The calamity alarm filled Daozi’s consciousness with messages.","Instinctively, Daozi expanded the ‘Heavenly Dao’s View,’ scanning each location that triggered the alarm.","[Now is the moment!] The Dark Giant seized the opportunity.","Opportunities were fleeting. The Heavenly Dao might react, close the program warning, and delete the back door in just a few seconds.","And he needed to seize this very brief moment to act!","First, three ‘Artificial Constant Stars’ were compressed and transported over, thrown into the Sealing Array formed by the 1-33 Unknown Whites.","Each of these Artificial Constant Stars contained the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus.’ Once detonated, they would release explosion attacks imbued with a trace of the ‘aura of eternity,’ along with the transmission of the virus.","If possible, the Dark Giant really wanted to directly move three stars for detonation... But the Eighth Heavenly Dao was watching from outside; he didn’t dare to make such a huge move, fearing it would attract the attention of the Heavenly Dao.","The three Artificial Constant Stars exploded, and the terrifying impact force peeled back the sealing shell of the 1-33 Unknown Whites, revealing the true forms of the 33 Unknown Whites.","The consciousness of the Dark Giant, attached to the Virtuous Daoist Body, saw this scene and involuntarily made a swallowing motion... Merciless! Were there truly 33 of those beautiful troublemakers similar to that beautiful scoundrel?","This left him no way out.","Mark them all, every single one.","The thirty-three ‘beautiful troublemakers’ didn’t impress him as much as the ‘sheep-shearing’ troublemaker, yet they still had to be taken seriously!","Moreover, there were thirty-three of them, an overwhelming number. If he wasn’t careful, any one of them could cause trouble, and accidents could happen.","However... Now was not the time to consider so many things with such pressing urgency.","Rough markings completed, after the outer shell of the Sealing Array burst open, the Dark Sun immediately sent the “Heavenly Dao Molt” it had collected into this world.","Hundreds of Dark Mini-Suns, composed of black particles, tumbled into the Sealing Array, crashing and slamming violently.","Heavenly Dao Molts are monsters that know only destruction and lack intelligence.","But they are extremely easy to use, especially because they have an “Black Hole Devouring Talent,” making them the perfect weapon for creating chaos when unleashed.","As each dark “Heavenly Dao Molt Mini-Sun” tumbled, it transformed into a black hole that devoured everything in the main world.","Song Shuhang had encountered these black holes before—he had nearly been swallowed by the black hole of a Heavenly Dao Molt Ball!","“Rotate!” exclaimed Unknown White No. 31 softly.","The entire Sealing Array revolved and shifted, exposing the trump card “Senior White two’s golden thigh” and the black horse’s flair for drama.","The drama king horse leapt out excitedly, directly stomping towards the black hole of a “Heavenly Dao Molt Mini-Sun,” shattering a small black hole and obliterating it with a single hoof.","However... with such a vast number of small black holes around, even at one stomp per hole, it would take some time to clear them all.","Moreover, the Heavenly Dao Molt Suns were not so easily obliterated.","After the small black holes were smashed, the mini-suns turned into rubble, which, after recombining and merging, would form an even larger “Heavenly Dao Molt Sun,” continuing to open black holes tenaciously.","[Now is the time, come out!]The Dark Giant issued a silent command to the ‘Dark Sun’ within the seal.","In fact, even without the Dark Giant’s silent instruction, the Dark Sun knew that its time of freedom had come—after ‘burdens’ were devoured by Tyrannical Song and Immortal White, the Dark Sun’s brain functioned more flexibly.","It actively began to break through the seal!","The Dark Giant assessed the situation in secret.","[More power is needed... it’s a pity, I had wanted to keep this trump card hidden and not expose it.]","But now, it was time to unveil it.","The body of Virtuous Daoist, burning with karmic flames, stepped forth, exposed in the vacuum.","Both the drama king horse and Senior White two’s golden thigh sensed each other’s presence instantly.","Between the three, there was a sense of resonance.","Both the drama king horse and the White two golden thigh paused momentarily.","And just at that moment, the body of Virtuous Daoist burst into Unknown White’s Sealing Array No. 1-33, breaking through all the way to Song Shuhang and White.","[What about taking this opportunity to blast this ‘beautiful troublemaker?]Such a thought flashed through the mind of the Dark Giant.","But that was all it was—a fleeting thought.","At the critical moment, it made the most correct decision—its goal was to rescue the ‘Dark Sun,’ and everything else could be put aside.","Virtuous Daoist threw a punch, aiming to smash at the Sealing World and help the Dark Sun break the seal.","Just then, the very ordinary-looking fellow suddenly appeared, stretching out his hand to execute the most basic fist technique, blocking Virtuous Daoist’s punch head-on!","Boom—fists collided.","[So reckless? Is he asking for death?]Though Virtuous Daoist’s body had lost its divinity and even the aura of immortality had faded, its constitution was still at an immortal level!","To the surprise of the Dark Giant, the very ordinary-looking fellow actually managed to withstand Virtuous Daoist’s punch!","Then, an intense ‘immortal’ radiance shone from the young man.","While not as advanced as true immortality, it was still a state of ‘sub-immortality.’","Most importantly, this person was not the Will of the Heavens.","Beneath the Will of the Heavens, this young man was supreme!"]},{"number":3068,"title":"Chapter 3068 - 3066: Outline Boxing Technique, I’m Fond of It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3068: Chapter 3066: Outline Boxing Technique, I’m Fond of It!","I’ve lived so long but I’ve never seen anything like this!","On the surface, this indeed appears to be a human being. At the root, is it also a human?","But how could an ordinary human achieve this state—resisting the retired Will of the Heavens without having proved his Dao?","Other cultivators, even in their dreams, wouldn’t dare to conjure such an absurd fantasy.","Reality indeed is more ludicrous than dreams!","With such an entity present in the myriad practitioners in the universe, what’s the point in fighting in the Ninth Heavenly Dao’s battle for supremacy?","This fellow merely standing there, releasing his ‘Sub-immortal Data,’ is an incredibly powerful combination of ‘Information Interference Secret Method’ and ‘illusion spells’!","Immortals with insufficient comprehension skills, upon encountering this data, would immediately indulge in this ‘Sub-immortal State Information,’ unable to extricate themselves.","—Although it’s not like true immortality, which could allow the top Immortals to enter slumber. However, this ‘Sub-immortal State Information’ effortlessly distracts ordinary Immortals for a few minutes or even days.","A few minutes or even days are long enough for Immortals to accomplish much—A few minutes might not be enough to completely kill an Immortal, but certainly enough for a lucid Immortal to wash the face of another ‘information-interfered’ Immortal, apply some nice makeup, pick a good spot, prepare a specific seal, and thoroughly seal them away!","And this seal could additionally stack up to a hundred or more layers!","“This is not good news for me...” the Dark Giant felt an unusual agitation within.","If this fellow also participates in the battle for the Ninth Heavenly Dao when the reincarnation commences, he might secure the position in a very short period, leaving no room for others.","And since this fellow is already in a ‘Sub-immortal’ state, the speed of inheriting the Heavenly Dao might be very fast, leaving very little time for him to deploy the ‘Domination Secret Method.’","“Besides him, there are others... No, there are another thirty-four handsome fellows who have tricked me.”","The difficulty of manipulating the Ninth Heavenly Dao just rocketed to a nightmare level.","“No, I can’t let these two... these thirty-six guys continue like this.”","“I must find an opportunity, before the ninth reincarnation of the Heavenly Dao commences, to deal with them. Killing them is tough, but at least I could try to seal them for tens of thousands of years!”","He had already secretly calculated that the Ninth Heavenly Dao’s battle will definitely commence within ten thousand years!","“But now is not the time to tangle with this guy. The tactics of the Eighth Heavenly Dao can’t last long. The Heavenly Dao turning back might even suppress the virtue-cultivated body I now control.”","So, although it’s a pity... now is not a good time to target this fellow and the handsome trickster.","I can’t afford any more distractions now.","As these thoughts flashed through his mind, the Dark Giant, controlling the body of Daoist Priest Virtue, launched a knuckle of causality-reversing technique towards Song Shuhang.","The body of Daoist Priest Virtue, swiftly swung his fists toward Song Shuhang’s location, delivering tens of thousands of punches in an instant.","Each punch possessed the destructive power of creation, but because they were within the Sealing Array range of Unknown White No. 31, the punches’ power was heavily suppressed.","However, even suppressed, if any of these punches landed solidly, they could blast an Immortal into oblivion.","But...","The Daoist Priest Virtue seemed to be flailing wildly, some of these punches targeted Song Shuhang’s body, while others exploded around him. The trajectory of the fists resembled a massive cage, enveloping Song Shuhang within it.","Song Shuhang tried to dodge a few punches... and then he gave up.","His current ‘Tyrannical Song Skin + Tyrannical Song Bone’ had ascended to sublimation, but his flesh and organs had not yet completed reinforcement.","In terms of battle awareness, he couldn’t directly face a frontal assault from a “Heavenly Dao” level existence.","So after dodging a few punches initially, he just obediently put up all his defenses, protected his vital areas, and took the hits to the end.","Now that his “Tyrannical Song Skin” and “Tyrannical Song Bone” were immortalized, his ability to withstand hits was absolutely top-notch, and he couldn’t be killed in a short time.","Song Shuhang had prepared himself to endure a real beating.","However, ultimately, only one punch solidly hit his crossed arms, knocking him back a step... The damage from this punch was all blocked by his defense and Tyrannical Song Skin; other than &#@#%&#% Fairy being blown up, he didn’t sustain any actual harm to his bones.","The rest of the punches just whizzed past his body.","Song Shuhang was stunned, “Outline Boxing Technique?”","Did the Virtue giant on the other side have a curse of ‘difficulty hitting the enemy’?","Or perhaps... was he going easy?","Across from him, the body of Daoist Priest Virtue, having thrown the punches, couldn’t wait to rush towards the sealed world of the “Dark Sun.”","Senior White, Senior White Two, and the drama king White Horse hadn’t recovered from the ‘Resonance Reaction’ yet.","“If you want to break the seal, step over my body!” behind Song Shuhang, the Fairy that had just been blown up by a punch reassembled and recited the impassioned lines.","Song Shuhang also reacted quickly, taking a step forward.","But just as he took a step, many ‘fists’ suddenly came flying toward his body and face from the vacuum!","It was the ‘Outline Boxing Technique’ of the previous Daoist Priest Virtue!","After these fists were thrown, their destructive power was somehow set in the ‘vacuum,’ undispersed. As soon as Song Shuhang stepped forward, these ‘fists’ were triggered.","Song Shuhang’s body instinctively retreated back to its original position.","Those ‘Outline Boxing Technique’ fists again whistled past his body.","“This move is strong, and it feels like it matches well with my Heavenly Horse Style... Basic Boxing Skill·Two. This fist technique involves the power of karma, and what I am now condensing is the ‘Virtue + Karma’ path to immortality, what a coincidence!” These thoughts flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind.","As the thought arose, in his dantian, the fat whale golden core that had fused the ‘Virtuous Seed’ began to stir.","From the virtuous network, a part of the information about the ‘Outline Boxing Technique’ emerged, transmitting to Song Shuhang.","Simultaneously, the Sage Eye Golden Core in Song Shuhang’s external elixir field lit up, working with the virtuous network to analyze the data from the recent ‘Outline Boxing Technique.’","From today onwards, any fist technique used against Tyrannical Song once, as long as it wasn’t too complex and matched Tyrannical Song’s attributes, could very likely become Tyrannical Song’s fist technique!","Besides his astonishing saber techniques, Tyrannical Song’s innate skill for fist techniques was actually not bad either.","Meanwhile.","Seizing this slight time difference, Daoist Priest Virtue’s body finally successfully blasted open the seal of the ‘Dark Sun’s small world.’","The Dark Sun, already ready, coordinated with the breaking of the seal to emerge!","Freedom at last!","The Dark Sun, which had been tormented by Immortal White and Tyrannical Song for several days, felt as if it was in a dream."]},{"number":3069,"title":"Chapter 3069 - 3067: Become the Strongest Tool Person!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3069: Chapter 3067: Become the Strongest Tool Person!","After the seal was broken, Dark Sun had originally wanted to say a few words to Tyrannical Song and Immortal White — those who had not experienced its situation could not possibly imagine how it had felt these past few days being jointly attacked with “Joint Attack” by Immortal White and Tyrannical Song.","It was a double strike, both psychologically and physically!","However, Daoist Priest Virtue’s body did not give it the time, directly pulling it up, tearing open space, and escaping into it, vanishing without a trace.","Neat and tidy!","And almost at the exact moment Dark Sun and the body of Daoist Priest Virtue disappeared, Daozi’s will crossed the void and arrived.","But it was already a step too late.","Looking at the already destroyed Sealing World, Daozi clenched his fist, “I’ve been outmaneuvered.”","After all, he was a genuine scholar, and he could not compare to the successive Heavenly Daos in terms of cunning tactics.","Just how many contingencies the successive Heavenly Daos had arranged within the ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ before their retirement, was truly unknown to anyone.","“Rescued, huh,” Senior White slightly smiled and said.","“Senior White’s smile, I shall protect it!” the virtuous lamia, having just resurrected her head, rushed to steal the line, leaving Tyrannical Song speechless.","Daozi was startled, “???”","In Fellow Daoist White’s smile, there seemed to be a reassuring power.","Daozi, who was originally frustrated from being outmaneuvered, instantly calmed down.","Suddenly, he was struck by the thought and emotion that even if Dark Sun was rescued, it was no big deal.","Could it be... Fellow Daoist White had already perceived it and made arrangements and preparations?","Otherwise, for someone capable of obliterating the myriad practitioners in the universe to break free, Fellow Daoist White should not be so composed.","“Right, Confucian Daoist, have you researched something called the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’?” Senior White’s second golden thigh suddenly asked.","Daozi nodded his head, “Yes, I wanted to study how to reverse the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’, so after returning to the Heavenly Dao dimension, I tried to research the rudimentary form of the Stellar Destruction Virus... but I failed.”","“If you have already begun researching, then it’s a bit troublesome,” Senior White’s second golden thigh said, “We probably have to start preparing for the transfer of the Heavenly Dao in advance.”","Having said that much, Senior Daozi immediately understood, “That ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ manufacturing scheme, was it a trap in itself? Even for the body of the Heavenly Dao, would there be problems as soon as one begins researching—whether reversing or normal—the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’?”","Senior White’s second golden thigh replied, “Yes, whether it’s reversing the research or conducting it normally, as soon as one starts to interact with the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’, they will be affected. If it’s a complete Heavenly Dao, this influence might be negligible. But...”","“But I am only an 8.5 term Heavenly Dao.” Daozi understood, which meant that the effect on him could potentially become magnified.","A virus that would at most cause a minor cold in a complete Heavenly Dao might be fatal to him.","[Was it a trap the moment the top half of the original template for the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ was handed to me?]","“Senior White, where did you get this information?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","How did it feel like Senior White had suddenly gained a lot more ‘knowledge’ and become suddenly erudite about the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’?","“I’ve just recharged,” replied Senior White as the golden thigh two.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang seemed thoughtful, then he turned his head to look at Senior White and the theatrical horse, “Are Senior White and Senior Ma also...?”","“Mm-hmm,” replied Senior White.","“I see,” said Song Shuhang, nodding—was it due to the body of Daoist Priest Virtue? The reaction that the body gave when it last saw Senior White was considerable.","“I was hoping... that at least while serving in my position, I would do my best to resolve this catastrophe,” Senior Daozi sighed.","His generation all had a nature hardened by hardships. They always hoped to shoulder the hard and exhausting work themselves, allowing the next generation to enjoy their blessings.","“Don’t worry, Senior Daozi. You’ve already done very well,” Song Shuhang consoled: “If it weren’t for your support, perhaps the myriad practitioners in the universe would’ve already met their end.”","This was no exaggeration!","“So, moving on... I will first arrange for my revival in the identity of ‘Chief Disciple of Confucianism.’ After I resurrect, all my memories and experiences regarding the Will of the Heavens might be completely erased. Before that happens, I’ll try my best to give you another push,” Daozi said, pointing at himself, “You need more ‘eternity data,’ don’t you?”","“It’s pointless, Senior Daozi. You’re currently in the true ‘Heavenly Axiom-level’ state. Even if Senior White and I jointly attack, we won’t be able to obtain ‘eternity’ data from you,” said Song Shuhang.","“Moreover, you don’t have to worry, Senior Daozi. I still have the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ and Senior Three-Eyes’ ‘big-eyed planet,’ two primordial treasures. Just give me some time, with the aid of these treasures, I will be able to completely transform the flesh and blood in my body into ‘Sub-immortal’ state.”","The sheep that was the Dark Sun had run away, but he could still acquire wool from other sources.","Full-Body Semi-Immortalization wasn’t a difficult task for him.","Father Goudan was taken aback: “!!!”","Can Semi-Immortalization work on flesh and blood in addition to skin and bones?","Senior White reminded, “Just now, I’ve sent a question on how to achieve Shuhang’s Semi-Immortalization using the power of theprimordial treasures without damaging them to the research group for everyone to discuss.”","On hearing this, Senior Daozi nodded approvingly.","Once Tyrannical Song achieves Full-Body Semi-Immortalization, there would be no accidents for the next Heavenly Will.","Even if something as unexpected as the fat ball popped up like the previous Heavenly Will, with Tyrannical Song’s state, he could grind down the opposition!","Senior Daozi continued, “The aid I’m going to give you isn’t the ‘Semi-Immortalization’ part. I’m considering, when I retire... leaving you a powerful external computational core. It will match your ‘Semi-Immortal’ body’s capability with calculation ability.”","Unlike the previous Heavenly Wills, Senior Daozi felt that if he were to retire, he probably couldn’t leave behind a ‘Body of Eternity’ and might end up like the fat ball, collapsing completely, or even merging into the ‘Will of the Heavens.’","Therefore, he wanted to maximize the use of this ‘Body of Eternity’ and ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ to become the ultimate tool-person.","“An external calculator? That can be done?” asked the three-eyed young senior.","“Tyrannical Song’s body has the ‘undying fat whale golden core,’ which is fully capable of withstanding a portion of the calculation strain at the Heavenly Axiom level... Sub-Heavenly Dao level calculations. Moreover, as the Eighth and a half Heavenly Dao, I also have some unique aspects. I got into my position by exploiting a BUG in the ‘Completion Plan’ of the Eighth Heavenly Dao. So when I leave my position, I should be able to similarly leave something behind through another BUG exploit,” said Senior Daozi calmly.","According to the ‘Completion Plan’ of the liquefied metal ball, after the Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City is complete, it will definitely expel some ‘residuals’ to prevent them from affecting the ‘perfect’ Heavenly Dao Authority.","And this function of expelling ‘residuals’ can be utilized."]},{"number":3070,"title":"Chapter 3070 - 3068: I’ll Wait for You in the Distant Future, Senior Song!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3070: Chapter 3068: I’ll Wait for You in the Distant Future, Senior Song!","“Before stepping down, I will focus on researching how to package the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Calculation Ability’ into an innate ability, and then, through the ‘impurity expulsion’ channel previously set up by the liquefied metal ball, I will produce this ‘Calculation Ability Compression Package’ before my resignation and hand it over to Shuhang,” Daozi shared his idea in the ‘research group’.","Heavenly Emperor’s Son: “...”","The ‘impurity expulsion’ channel set up by the liquefied metal ball, it wouldn’t be her who was supposed to be expelled, would it?","I can’t help but feel a little wronged.","“Daozi, you focus on tackling the issue of the ‘Heavenly Dao Level Compression Package’. We can’t help much with this research,” suggested the three-eyed young senior. “Shall we just focus on the study of ‘primordial treasures’ instead? Any other issues?”","Song Shuhang hastily spoke up, “Seniors, there’s another matter here that requires your technical support. This also relates to the Dark Sun... I’ve discovered there’s a ‘pulling the strings’ behind the ‘Dark Sun’, for now let’s call it the ‘Dark Giant’. Earlier, I managed to scrounge an interesting secret technique, the ‘Domination Secret Method’, from it through a dreamland technique. I want to ask the seniors to help me simplify the process.”","Well, it would be best if we could reduce it to the complexity of around three formation runes. And if possible, the time to accumulate mental energy must be shortened. Otherwise, just accumulating energy would take tens of millions of years, what use would that be?","Subsequently, Song Shuhang recounted in detail to the ‘research group’ the hidden enmity between the ‘Dark Giant’ and past Heavenly Daos.","After hearing Song Shuhang’s narrative, the members of the group fell silent for quite a while.","After a long time, Heavenly Emperor’s Son spoke up, “I don’t even know what to say about this guy, pretty unlucky, huh.”","This is the first time she’d seen a villainous boss so pitiful.","“It could also be because Fellow Daoist White is just too lucky,” Father Goudan reminded.","“My teacher is also awesome,” added Daozi.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White two: “Anyway, focus on the main point. The key is that when the Ninth Heavenly Dao comes around, this guy will come out again to offer someone the ‘Domination Secret Method’, right?”","“Absolutely. Whether it’s Fellow Daoist White or Shuhang who takes office, he won’t miss this opportunity,” the three-eyed young senior stated.","The ‘Dark Giant’ is truly pitiful. He has methods, strategies, patience, and he’s cautious enough. But he could never have imagined that his hidden plans would be thoroughly exposed by Song Shuhang through a dreamland skill, and even the ‘Domination Secret Method’ was plundered by Tyrannical Song.","“This Domination Secret Method might be of use to us,” said the main world’s White after a brief contemplation. “If we are to take the final step of ‘two different entities proving their Dao simultaneously,’ we might need to use this ‘Domineering Secret Method’ to perfect the last link.”","He and Song Shuhang had already absorbed a portion of each other’s existence, theoretically meeting the condition for ‘different entities proving Dao simultaneously.’","However, if they could supplement each other with a ‘Domination Secret Method’ in the instant before proving their Dao, they could make their connection more stable and ensure a smooth process.","“That means we need to decipher the ‘Domination Secret Method,’ and we also have to come up with a solution to counteract its effects to avoid falling into the ‘Dark Giant’s’ trap,” Father Goudan proposed after pondering for a moment. “In that case, let’s start with ‘absorbing the energy of the Dark Giant’s Domination Secret Method.’ When the Ninth Heavenly Dao segment arrives and he casts the secret technique on Shuhang or Fellow Daoist White, we’ll absorb and transform the ‘secret technique,’ turning it into energy for us to use when we cast the ‘Domination Secret Method’.”","The Domination Secret Method requires gathering the power of tens of millions of years before each casting.","Such power can’t come from nothing...","There’s only one solution—borrow and utilize force, absorbing and transforming the ‘Dark Giant’s tens of millions of years of secret technique energy.’","Killing two birds with one stone.","“Father Goudan, you truly are worthy of being the ruler of the Netherworld, such a dirty mind,” the three-eyed young senior taunted.","Father Goudan: “...”","Isn’t your alpaca the ruler of the Netherworld?","Is it fun to hurt oneself in the process of defeating the enemy?","Hmm... it really does seem quite interesting!","“So, I’ll leave the Domination Secret Technique, research on primordial treasures, and the Heavenly Dao Calculation Compression Package to the seniors. Right now, I’ll focus on perfecting the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path.’” Song Shuhang summarized.","With his body’s ‘Sub-immortal Transformation’ and continuous insights from the Immortals flowing back to him, Song Shuhang clearly sensed his progress bar on the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ rapidly filling up.","He estimated that once he completed the immortalization of his flesh through the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ and the ‘big-eyed planet’, he could then sacrifice his ‘light of virtue and karmic immortal path’ within him, and take the final step in ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’!","Using the ‘immortal information’ left by different Heavenly Daos to enrich his ‘Sub-immortal State’ was indeed the correct choice—the ‘immortal information’ from various sources was the greatest aid in perfecting his ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’!","By then, his ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ would integrate the strengths of a hundred paths, amalgamating the ‘immortal information’ left by past Heavenly Daos, to forge the mightiest path to immortality!","...","...","Main World.","The New Year feast had ended several days ago.","But the members of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ hadn’t dispersed yet... at the moment, most of them were passed out within the Main World.","A few clear-headed and reliable group members were responsible for taking care of the intoxicated ones.","Due to the lack of helping hands, this time even little Li Yinzhu was assisting.","“What exactly did the seniors drink this time? Why is it so potent?” Loli Zhu said, her gaze involuntarily drifting towards the side of the wine jar.","There was still a small amount of wine left in the jar, emitting an enticing aroma.","If not for Loli Shi keeping an eye on her, the curious Zhu might have already sneaked up and sneakily licked it.","“A part of it was brought by the seniors themselves, and another part... seems to have been brought out by the ‘Inner World Assistant’? Was it Mister Song’s private collection?” Loli Shi recalled.","The Inner World Assistant blinked its eyes—ah, that part of the wine was indeed brought over from Lady Kunna.","During the banquet when they were running low on wine, it went back to the Dragon Network World and brought some over.","“I wonder how Mister Song’s progress is coming along?” Soft Feather sat on a branch, leaning against the trunk, her legs gently swinging.","In her hand, she held a jade wine plate.","She gracefully pinched the wine plate and took a delicate sip.","“Things will change, right? Everything will get even better, right? This is the one past that Senior White never left behind,” she said, raising her head and looking up.","Detach yourself, Mister Song.","Surpass everything, no longer bound by time, space, or dimension.","And then... I’ll wait for you in the distant future.",".",".","At the starting point, there is a Glory Preselection event. Click the link in the author’s note to enter the event page... then search for the author’s name ‘Holy Paladin’... ahem! It’s ‘Legends of The Holy Knight’, and cast your vote for ‘Cultivation Chat’!"]},{"number":3071,"title":"Chapter 3071 - 3069: No Longer Memories, But Reality","paragraphs":["Chapter 3071: Chapter 3069: No Longer Memories, But Reality","“This should be my last visit to this time-space node, and I’m afraid I won’t be able to see how the future unfolds from here on... I really wish I had a few more opportunities to come here... at least to see Senior Song safely prove his Dao.”","“Sometimes, I wonder if I’m dreaming, if the me in the dream is desperately changing the past, changing everyone’s past. But when I wake up, the future remains unchanged.” Soft Feather’s lips left the rim of the wine cup.","Merely changing the past cannot change the future.","She was beginning to struggle to hold on.","But fortunately, this time she finally saw a glimmer of hope.","“Only after reaching the ‘transcendence’ mentioned in the information from Senior White, the Wielder of the Will, no longer limited by time, space, dimensions, and everything else, is it possible to twist all of the past, present, and future together.”","Senior Song here is more lively than ever, bouncing around, even though a salted fish, he is spirited and causes mischief.","Those who cause mischief usually die quickly... but as long as they don’t die, they become legendary figures!","So, Senior Song will become a true legend.","“I shouldn’t drink any more.” Soft Feather gently put the wine cup aside.","The wine was personally blended by Lady Kunna, far more potent than the legendary Immortal Wine. Any more and she might just fall asleep on the spot.","And even though she was being very restrained, Soft Feather was slightly tipsy.","“I’ll stay a little longer.” She leaned against the tree, softly humming a short melody.","For some reason, as long as she stayed at this time-space node, her mood would lighten.","She looked at the Senior members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group who were drunk in the distance, familiar yet strange.","It made her reluctant to leave.","If she could choose... she would want this moment to last forever.","After a long while.","Soft Feather slowly closed her eyes, the elegance about her gradually fading.","Intoxication flushed her cheeks red as she leaned against the trunk and fell asleep.","...","...","In the main world, inside a resting palace in a fragment of the ancient Heavenly City.","Sixteen struggled to push Su Clan’s Seven, who still wanted more drink, back to bed.","“Should we tie up Seven?” suggested the ghost spirit fairy maiden from within.","“No need, she’s already asleep,” said Sixteen with a sweet smile.","Then, she stood up, pushed open the palace gate, and gazed into the distance... immediately spotting Soft Feather sleeping on the tree branch.","“It’s the normal Soft Feather now,” the ghost spirit fairy maiden said.","You couldn’t tell the difference from the outside.","But from her ‘aura,’ one could determine if it was the normal Soft Feather or not.","“Yeah, Future Child must have left already. To be honest, the future Soft Feather really moves my heart,” Sixteen confessed sincerely.","The Soft Feather of the future is much more threatening than the current one...","The elegance in her very bones, and the occasional sorrowful expression in her brows made even Sixteen’s heart stir—if it wasn’t for Song Shuhang, she would be willing to choose Soft Feather as her dao companion, no joke.","“She is indeed moving... Wait, this sort of heart movement isn’t right, we must have been influenced by Fairy Cheng Lin,” the ghost spirit fairy maiden hastily interjected.","A moment later, she added, “Moreover, I think you need to be concerned about yourself. We are bound by a contract, and I can clearly feel something is off with you. I’ve finally made up my mind to align with you; you better not have any issues.”","“My condition is actually just... my time as the auxiliary consciousness has come, and soon I’ll switch to running in the background. Then, the real Sixteen will be switched back. Don’t worry, the fully restored me will have all the memories and emotions. The real me has always been operating in the background, there’s no real difference between us. Senior Sister Ye Si, you don’t need to worry about any mishaps,” Sixteen explained.","Ghost Spirit Fairy Maiden: “...”","You personalities are such players. Last time, I heard you mention that you wanted to restore the real Sixteen. Has it been ongoing in the background all this time?","Su Clan’s Sixteen smiled as she opened an umbrella, took a light leap, and jumped onto the rooftop of the Heavenly Palace Fragment, sprinting across it toward the depths of the main world.","The Inner World Assistant appeared before her, floating and silently guiding her way.","The place they were heading to was Song Shuhang’s treasure trove.","In the main world, the Inner World Assistant had a clear record of all the treasures Song Shuhang had hidden.","If Song Shuhang needed to use them when spending money on upgrades, she could dig them up immediately.","However... the place she was taking Su Clan’s Sixteen to was not a common treasure.","It was a safety measure once left behind for Song Shuhang by ‘Song Wood’.","“Once the real me fully recovers, that thin-skinned, proud character will come back. The real me would never do something bold. So before the assistive personality switches to the background, I want to do something big for my main body!” The ‘Tyrannical Song’s heart’ in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s chest began to beat powerfully.","Clearly, she was not as bold as she claimed to be; she was equally nervous at this moment.","As she ran... scenes from the past surfaced in her mind.","Last year, after Sixteen formally began the ‘Spirit River Su Clan Trial’, a copy of her personality with most of Sixteen’s memories was born.","When this personality was first created, it was like a blank slate.","‘Memories’ for her felt more like watching a very long movie—part of her character setting, somewhat illusory, not quite real.","Among them, the memories of interacting with Song Shuhang left a deeper impression on her—these were the most recent memories and parts of Sixteen’s life where her emotions were the most volatile.","Add to that, during the secluded meditation, Song Shuhang had Su Clan’s Seven send the ‘skeletal dragon’s withered vine’ to assist her.","So, the pure and blank slate she was began to look forward to the end of her secluded meditation, to meet the ‘Song Shuhang’ from her memories.","Several months later, she came out of secluded meditation.","She felt somewhat apprehensive.","The actual first encounter... happened after she was tricked away by Senior Dharma King Creation at the end of a live broadcast.","It was raining.","She held an umbrella and walked toward the passenger transport center.","At that time, she did not know that Song Shuhang had quietly come over to pick her up—because according to the chat records in the Nine Provinces Number One Group, Shuhang should have been in space, having been launched there by Senior White.","The rain grew heavier.","She thought about how to meet ‘Song Shuhang’ in the future, and was slightly distracted.","Under the eaves in the distance,","A big fellow leaned against the wall, his body soaked by the rain, every breath turning into mist.","All of a sudden, this big fellow jumped out.","It startled her.","Without recognizing who it was, she instinctively gave him a palm strike.","It wasn’t until after he was sent flying, letting out an ‘ahhh~ah’ scream,","That she truly met ‘Song Shuhang’ for the first time, in the true sense of the word.","He was more interesting than the ‘memory,’ and had changed a lot.","But he was more real and tangible.","At that moment, Song Shuhang became more than just a character from her memories; he was a real entity to her."]},{"number":3072,"title":"Chapter 3072 - 3070: Having a Second Master at Home Who Favors Outsiders Over Family, It’s Too Hard ```","paragraphs":["Chapter 3072: Chapter 3070: Having a Second Master at Home Who Favors Outsiders Over Family, It’s Too Hard","“`","After the Inner World Assistant took Sixteen far away...","In the grass near the ‘living spring’ in the main world, Steel Song Shuhang’s manifestation calmly climbed out, brushing off the grass clippings from his body.","“Were you hiding from Sixteen?” Pavilion Master Chu swam to the shore, crossed her arms, rested on the edge, and asked, “Is Sixteen off to find something?”","“If I’m not mistaken, she should be looking for a treasure that would make the Goudan family flourish. So, to avoid the embarrassment of her meeting me, I decided to hide for a bit,” the steel manifestation replied.","At the same time, he synchronized this scene with his main body.","In fact, everything in the main world couldn’t escape Song Shuhang’s observation. Even the guidance offered by the Inner World Assistant was tacitly approved by Shuhang.","“Youth is wonderful...” Pavilion Master Chu sighed softly, “If I had been so impulsive in my youth, I wouldn’t have ended up like I am now.”","Steel manifestation subconsciously wanted to voice its support for Pavilion Master Chu—but then it suddenly remembered that ‘Song Wood’ was petty ghost spirit number one, instantly feeling a pang of guilt, he dared not continue this topic to avoid drawing fire upon itself.","When one feels guilty, they tend to cower in terms of momentum.","“Since you don’t oppose it yourself, I’m going to lend Sixteen a helping hand.” At this moment, the voice of The White Dragon suddenly sounded behind Steel Song Shuhang’s manifestation.","The already sheepish steel manifestation felt even more uneasy upon hearing The White Dragon’s voice.","The figure of The White Dragon slowly appeared with the sound, coiling above the steel manifestation’s head.","“Good evening, The White Dragon. By the way, hasn’t your fleshly body resurrected yet?” the steel manifestation looked up at The White Dragon and asked.","At this moment, The White Dragon still appeared in a state similar to a ‘body of virtue’.","“No rush, it will come back to life when it’s time to resurrect,” The White Dragon swam around in the vacuum before looking at Pavilion Master Chu in the living spring, “You should be almost fully grown, right, Slow-Witted Song?”","“Just the calves left,” replied Pavilion Master Chu lazily.","“Once you’re fully grown, where do you plan to go? Will you start rebuilding your Crystal-clear Water Pavilion?” The White Dragon asked calmly.","Pavilion Master Chu leaned on the shore, shook her head, and said leisurely, “The obsession with Crystal-clear Water Pavilion was given to Chu Two when the path of immortality was divided. I will not rebuild an illusory Crystal-clear Water Pavilion again.”","Illusory things are, after all, illusory.","The current Pavilion Master Chu, with realistic hopes, naturally wouldn’t reconstruct an illusory Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","“So, are you saying that when you are fully reborn, you will have nothing to do? Then, would you like to accompany me to the ‘Dragon Realm’ to find a treasure that could speed up Song Wood’s recovery?” The White Dragon made an invitation.","The sheepish manifestation quietly recoiled inside—Fairy Cheng Lin and Song Wood self-ruptured to buy time. Unexpectedly, The White Dragon had a way to hasten Song Wood’s recovery?","“I’ll pass... I think I’ll soak in the living spring of the main world for a while longer,” Pavilion Master Chu said with a slight grin, “The Dragon Realm is your hometown; I’m afraid if I go there, I might end up being suppressed.”","The White Dragon rolled her eyes, “Am I that kind of dragon?”","As the conversation didn’t go smoothly, The White Dragon turned and veiled towards Sixteen’s last seen direction.","After The White Dragon left...","Pavilion Master Chu looked at Steel Song Shuhang and asked, “What do you plan to do about Tyrannical Saber Song One?”","Steel manifestation: “!!!”","“Don’t be stunned; my dazed hair has always been rooted at the top of your head. Some things can be inferred through numerous clues. Don’t underestimate a woman’s intuition,” Pavilion Master Chu said slowly.","“Actually, the plan for dealing with Tyrannical Saber Song One... has already come out, hasn’t it?” the steel manifestation tried to remain calm, then he looked towards where Sixteen and The White Dragon disappeared, “I will inherit a portion of Song Wood’s karma. One of his obsessions I will fulfill for him. As for other karmic bonds, he can solve them himself after he’s born.”","If the obsessions and sorrows of Pavilion Master Chu and the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion cannot be saved, Song Shuhang will resolve them.","The other consequences can wait for ten months.","Pavilion Master Chu rubbed her temples—do you really plan to give birth to him?","How will we face you then?","You might as well have him go through Mama Song’s way.","“My main body is going to start touching on ‘primordial treasures,’ so this side is going to enter standby mode... Senior Chu, talk to you later,” the steel manifestation waved at Pavilion Master Chu and then actively shut down its power.","Pavilion Master Chu like a mermaid retreated a distance, leisurely began blowing bubbles.","“`","“`","...","...","Meanwhile.","Inside the Heavenly Dao Time Secret Realm.","Senior White, Immortal White Two, Senior Three Eyes, Father Goudan, and a group of members had already preliminarily worked out a plan to use the “primordial treasure” to perfect Song Shuhang’s “Sub-immortalization.”","The process for “Sub-immortalization” was laid out; the main objective this time was to achieve it “without damaging the primordial treasure,” so progress was swift.","Currently, they were preparing for the first experiment.","“Should we start with the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber or the big-eyed planet?” Song Shuhang’s main body returned from the “fellow daoists’ discussion” to the research room, ready to become the experiment subject.","Father Goudan answered, “Let’s start with the big-eyed planet. The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber is actually a bit special... It’s not only a primordial treasure but also part of the plan for the Heavenly Dragon to free itself. So, let’s collect some data from the ‘big-eyed planet’ experiment first.”","“What does Senior Three Eyes think?” Song Shuhang asked.","“That works for me. I have no objections,” the three-eyed young senior nodded.","Immortal White Two, Golden Thigh, said, “Then do we need to move the test site? If I remember correctly, that big-eyed planet is quite large.”","At the time, he had his eye on the big-eyed planet and had wanted to capture it.","“Let’s go,” Senior White said as he pushed open a spatial passage, leading straight to the location of the ‘big-eyed planet.’","At the moment, the primordial treasure ‘big-eyed planet’ was anxiously serving as the ‘Cultivator Chat System client downloader.’","It did not yet know when it would be freed.","The big-eyed planet was also in despair.","What made it even more desperate was the fact that its ruler of the Netherworld, Old Lord Two, was obviously showing favoritism towards Tyrannical Song.","What was so good about Tyrannical Song? Were his eyes as cute as its own?","While it was pondering, suddenly the ‘big-eyed planet’ sensed a formidable enemy’s presence—it was the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber!","It instinctively wanted to rise up and confront the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","But the next instant, it also sensed that Old Lord Two of the Netherworld had crossed the spatial passages and arrived.","“Cooperate with Tyrannical Song,” the three-eyed young senior commanded.","The big-eyed planet blinked its cute eyes.","Its enemy was jumping around on it, yet it was helpless... It even had to cooperate with another enemy, Tyrannical Song.","What kind of tricks had Tyrannical Song used to bewitch its Old Lord?","Perhaps it should take this opportunity to secretly observe Tyrannical Song.","“So, let’s begin the first experiment... Who will record the process?” Father Goudan’s voice rang out.","The son of the Heavenly Emperor raised his hand, “I’ll do it. I seem to be the most suitable one present.”","Song Shuhang squatted down, placing his hands on the ‘big-eyed planet,’ and said, “I never imagined we would have a day of deep cooperation.”","The big-eyed planet: “...”","Song Shuhang maintained his squatting posture, his glassy eyes, the third divine eye on his forehead, and the Sage Eye Golden Core from the imitation Dragon Network system all began to shine brightly.","At the same time, his hands quietly lit up.","[Although I hate to admit it... I have to acknowledge that his various eyes are pretty.]","After seeing these beautiful eyes, the big-eyed planet’s aversion towards Tyrannical Song slightly decreased.","It even developed a bit of a favorable impression towards him.","—This must be out of respect for the ‘pretty eyes!’ The big-eyed planet thought to itself.","“Very well, so far, using Senior Tyrannical Song’s demonic technique to start things off and improve the synchronization rate seems to be the right choice,” the son of the Heavenly Emperor nodded and made a note of this.","“`","“However, the synchronization rate between the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and Tyrannical Song was already quite high, so it’s recommended to enter the ‘human-saber fusion’ state when the time comes.” Father Goudan’s voice sounded.","“Continue.” The three-eyed young senior instructed.","Song Shuhang nodded, his ‘Hand of Tyrannical Song’ continued to swiftly flash over the body of the ‘big-eyed planet’.","About half an hour later.","The entire colossal ‘big-eyed planet’ began to light up, showing signs that the originally cold holy light was about to transform into a warm holy light, almost becoming a sun-like attack.","The Tyrannical Song of today was no longer the same as before. Every demonic technique he unleashed could spread across the entire ‘planet,’ and after a whole half an hour, even a primordial treasure would react.","Not to mention, the ‘big-eyed planet’ was actively relaxing under the orders of Senior Three-Eyed, cooperating with Song Shuhang.","The first step of the experiment went perfectly.","Big-eyed planet: “???”","My body feels so strange!","“About there, what do you think, Senior White?” The son of the Heavenly Emperor estimated.","Senior White casually tossed a coin.","The coin landed on the back of his hand.","It showed heads.","Senior White nodded in satisfaction, “Heads.”","“Then Senior Song, we can proceed to the next phase,” the son of the Heavenly Emperor said to Song Shuhang.","Only after becoming friends with Senior White would one experience his handiness!","Moreover, the experience is even better after becoming friends with both Tyrannical Song and Immortal White.","“Huu~” Song Shuhang took a deep breath, then used the innate ability of a Confucian Sage towards the ‘big-eyed planet.’","The big-eyed planet suddenly sensed an immense crisis.","It quivered, trying to shake off Tyrannical Song.","“Don’t move.” The three-eyed young senior commanded.","The big-eyed planet master could only stop reluctantly.","Woosh~","The innate ability of a Confucian Sage moved over the ‘big-eyed planet’ and cut off a ‘portio’ of ‘existence,’ bringing it back to Song Shuhang.","The next step was the most crucial.","After retrieving his innate ability... Song Shuhang did not directly absorb the ‘existence.’ Instead, he allowed this ‘existence’ to make a brief appearance in his energy system.","Then, he returned the ‘existence’ in perfect condition, sending it back.","Feeling that a part of its ‘existence’ had returned, the big-eyed planet let out a sigh of relief.","Above it, Song Shuhang closed his eyes in concentration, while the immortal energy within him surged and circulated.","“How does it feel?” asked Senior White’s legs.","A moment later.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes and nodded, “It’s feasible, but the efficiency isn’t very high.”","This efficiency couldn’t compare to when he and Senior White had executed a Joint Attack against the ‘Dark Sun.’","“Then let’s try Plan 2 and enter synchronization mode,” the three-eyed young senior suggested.","He had cast so many phases of the Saber-Nurturing Technique just for this moment.","Song Shuhang adjusted his consciousness, beginning to resonate with the big-eyed planet in a ‘human-artifact familiar feeling.’","Big-eyed planet: “!!!”","You actually want to enter a ‘human-artifact fusion’ state with me?","How preposterous!","The state of human-artifact fusion is not something you can just enter by saying so!","Although I agreed to cooperate with you completely under the orders of Lord Two of the Netherworld, your compatibility with me is nonexistent, we simply can’t achieve human-artifact fusion!","Just as the big-eyed planet was pondering this, suddenly... it found that it had lost control over its body.","It was the three-eyed young senior who had used his authority to take over the ‘big-eyed planet,’ and then he personally took the initiative to sync with Song Shuhang.","Big-eyed planet: “...”","This is too difficult.","Having a lord who bends the elbow outwards is too challenging.","A few breaths later.","Under the guidance of the experienced three-eyed young senior, Song Shuhang successfully entered resonance mode with the ‘big-eyed planet.’","Next, the fat whale golden core dove into the body of the big-eyed planet, setting up a layer of ‘Immortal Defense.’","Song Shuhang’s main body once again started to energetically apply the Sage’s talent to the ‘big-eyed planet.’","This was essentially copying the model used previously against the ‘Dark Sun.’","“How’s the effect?” Senior White inquired.","“The effect of a single application is weaker than Plan 1. However... it has the advantage of process simplification, eliminating the need to swallow ‘existence’ and then return it. That is to say, Plan 2 allows for rapid experience gain. As long as the hand speed is fast enough, the overall effect is much better than Plan 1,” Song Shuhang calculated and replied.","“Then we’ll go with Plan 2.” Senior White nodded, “Do you need me to help you execute a Joint Attack?”","“Let’s try, but Senior White, don’t activate the ‘immortality’ attribute during the spellcasting process,” Song Shuhang nodded.","And so...","The familiar scene unfolded once more.","AFK, enlightenment, understanding Sub-immortalization...","The big-eyed planet master remained silent.","It quietly observed the ‘undying fat whale golden core.’","Tyrannical Song had actually come up with such a thing?","So now if it went head-to-head with Tyrannical Song, it might be blown up by him?","Just a few months ago, from several planes away, it could blast Tyrannical Song to bits with a distant strike.","Now, as fate would have it, a head-on confrontation could see it being the one defeated.","Is this the heartless march of time?","Several hours later...","“It’s done.” Song Shuhang stopped the enlightenment process.","He opened his eyes.","This time, his eyes, third eye, Sage Eye Golden Core... everything on him related to eyes began to undergo Sub-immortalization.","The moment all the ‘eyes’ completed their Sub-immortal transformation, Song Shuhang faintly felt as if he had seen some images.","With the current ‘him’ and the Netherworld’s ‘Dark Song’ as nodes.","Using all the Sub-immortally transformed eyes and the big-eyed planet as tools.","Song Shuhang vaguely saw the river of time."]},{"number":3073,"title":"Chapter 3073 - 3071: Time Box Voyager","paragraphs":["Chapter 3073: Chapter 3071: Time Box Voyager","Unlike the Time River in my cognition, composed of ‘past, present, future.’","This time, what he saw was a ‘Time River’ that spread out like a sea urchin ball, with himself and Dark Song as the nodes.","“Is this thing the Time River? Or is it a time sea urchin?”","Song Shuhang was also puzzled in his heart.","But precisely at this moment, he could clearly understand that this urchin-like, sea-urchin-shaped thing was the Time River!","To understand is to understand, without even a reason why.","It’s just too vague...","Even if he strained all his ‘Sub-Immortal’ eyeballs, it still felt like looking at flowers through fog, like being severely nearsighted.","“Perhaps, I need a lens?”","Like the monocular that Senior Three-Eyes wore, snapped onto the forehead—doesn’t that seem interesting?","While thinking this, Song Shuhang tried several more times, not willing to give up just yet.","But no matter how he operated his abilities, the limit of what Sub-Immortal eyes could see was only this much.","“If it’s just like this... it’s completely meaningless.”","Explaining things seen in a fog could only be done by one’s own imagination, or by wild guessing; it’s as unreliable as a low-end divination.","After having executed all of his meager methods, Song Shuhang finally gave up.","For now, it seems that being able to see a mosaic version of a sea urchin ball-shaped Time River is the limit of a ‘mortal’ like himself.","If he wanted to see more and further, he must ascend another level or rely on some other external force.","Depending on external forces is not something to be ashamed of.","Just like how humans became the top of the food chain after learning to use various tools, external forces can make one stronger.","In this regard, Tyrannical Song’s thoughts were especially clear.","As if sensing his thought... at his waist, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber vibrated slightly.","Although it too was a primordial treasure, unlike the ‘big-eyed planet,’ the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber needed to be refined by one generation of ‘Fourth Cultivator of True Virtue’ after another, undergoing the Eighth Revolution before it could achieve perfect form.","Moreover, it was also the ‘escape plan’ of the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon. The third-generation Heavenly Dao was able to free itself from the Heavenly Dao seat with its help.","This time, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber took the initiative to chime, urging Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang’s thought moved.","He laid his hand on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and with a slide, a thousand cycles of the Saber-Nurturing Technique fell—incidentally, he didn’t play favorites, as his other hand also delivered a thousand cycles to Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","One must not forget old friends.","One can’t forget the old saber when a new one comes along.","In the next moment, the three of them entered the supreme saber mode of ‘human-saber fusion’ with practiced ease.","The saber is me, I am the saber, and still, I am me.","Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","What are you doing? Why drag me into it again?","Haven’t you seen how silent I’ve been today?","All the high-level events that occurred today felt out of its league.","As a ‘divine weapon,’ it felt like it had no place to intervene.","So unusually for today, it maintained silence, not even jabbing at Shuhang’s heart.","But when it came to a critical moment, Shuhang wouldn’t let it be, insisting on including it in the ‘human-saber fusion’ with the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","Now, Tyrannical Song was simultaneously in ‘human-saber fusion’ with two weapons, which was frankly terrible.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword panicked, “My instinct tells me that the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber needs your assistance right now.” Song Shuhang’s thought came through.","In human-saber fusion state, thoughts and spirit were in unison.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s inner complaints would also be reflected back to Song Shuhang.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had not yet completed its final refinement, so it needed external assistance to activate certain functions.","At this moment, the best help for the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber from Song Shuhang was none other than Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword who was also a ‘saber’.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber thrummed excitedly, seemingly agreeing with Tyrannical Song’s statement.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","Well, considering the pleasurable one thousand casts of the Saber-Nurturing Technique just now, it wouldn’t stand idly by if it needed to help later.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “What are you planning to do next?”","“I don’t know.” Song Shuhang frankly replied.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword: “???”","You don’t know?","Then what are you doing with that hammer!","“But the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber should know what to do,” Song Shuhang added.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber continued to thrum excitedly.","However, it didn’t have the capability to speak like Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, and even in human-saber fusion mode, Song Shuhang and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword couldn’t understand what it was trying to say.","Just then, Father Goudan gave a hint: “Continue with your soulless ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’.”","Although soulless, Tyrannical Song’s Saber-Nurturing Technique was genuinely effective.","It had an outstanding effect in nurturing magical treasures.","Following Father Goudan’s reminder, Song Shuhang immediately reached out and placed his hands on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, with the glow on his hands flickering continuously.","The high-frequency flickering made the faint glow of the Saber-Nurturing Technique dazzling.","Moreover, due to the ‘Sub-immortality’ of Song Shuhang’s whole body, each cast of his Saber-Nurturing Technique carried a trace of immortal information.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword could clearly feel the difference—it felt like it was about to break through its limit once again, even though it was already at the ‘Divine Weapon Limit’!","This kind of limit breakthrough, it had felt once before—when it evolved from a normal ‘sword’ form and developed a young girl’s head plus a giant sword form.","And this time, the feeling was even stronger.","It felt like it was about to break through the limitations of ‘saber and sword,’ to transcend the framework of being just a ‘weapon,’ and to enter an entirely new realm!","If this continues, what exactly will I become?","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s heart fluttered with both trepidation and anticipation.","In worlds across several planes,","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven suddenly felt a movement in his heart, and he couldn’t help but stand up—Scarlet Heaven Sword was his life-bound magical treasure, and any change would provoke a reaction from Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven.","“Scarlet Heaven Sword, is it evolving?” murmured Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven.","The Scarlet Heaven Sword, being at the limit of ‘Immortal Divine Weapon,’ shouldn’t have any room for evolution—because the next step up would be a primordial treasure.","But a primordial treasure could not be forged by anyone other than the Heavenly Dao.","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven began to calculate with his fingers.","Soon, he arrived at a conclusion.","The change in Scarlet Heaven Sword wasn’t an evolution towards a primordial treasure, but rather a different kind of evolution?","...","...","“I’m about to start evolving,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang nodded, “Yes, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, I’ve sensed it too.”","“What will I evolve into?” Scarlet Heaven Sword asked with a mix of anticipation and worry.","Song Shuhang was silent for a long time before he said, “Perhaps... you might evolve into a Saber woman?”","He remembered that his Saber-Nurturing Technique came from that giant ancestor, whose ultimate goal was to nurture a saber into a Saber woman.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber: “Buzz buzz buzz~”","Song Shuhang remained silent, but the frequency at which he used the Saber-Nurturing Technique clearly sped up a notch.","“Wouldn’t a ‘Saber lad’ be okay?” After a while, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword suddenly asked.","It didn’t even ask about being a ‘Sword lad,’ but was willing to change to a saber, which was a huge concession on its part.","Song Shuhang thought for a moment and said, “Maybe ‘Saber lad’ might infringe on copyright?”","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","If it really turned into a Saber woman, it might die of embarrassment at the hands of Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven.","“Is the process of evolution irreversible?” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword couldn’t let go and asked.","After thinking it over, Song Shuhang said, “I’m sorry Senior, this Saber-Nurturing Technique isn’t originally mine. How about we stop ‘evolving’ and call it quits here?”","Although he really wanted to see what Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword would look like as a Saber woman, such things should ultimately depend on Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s own will.","After all, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword had always taken good care of him.","“Let’s evolve,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword made its final decision.","Not a single sword or other immortal divine weapons could resist the temptation of evolving to ‘break through their limits’!","Especially for a sword like Scarlet Heaven Sword that was at the ‘immortal divine weapon limit.’","Just like cultivators trapped at a limiting realm unable to break through, Scarlet Heaven Sword felt uncomfortable when stuck at a level and unable to advance an inch.","“Since that’s the case, please forgive my offense, Senior!” Song Shuhang immediately erupted with full hand speed.","With his current realm and ‘Sub-immortal’ Reinforcement, once his hand speed was fully unleashed, just by the act of stroking, he could flatten the world’s tallest peak in an instant!","For cultivators whose strength wasn’t enough, the caress of a top-tier expert was fatally tempting!","Currently, both Scarlet Heaven Sword and Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber were ablaze with fire out of nowhere.","That was the spark of Song Shuhang’s excessively fast hand speed.","“He’s gone completely crazy,” the three-eyed young senior commented.","“Actually, I’m quite tempted to try this exaggerated speed of the Saber-Nurturing Technique,” the Heavenly Emperor’s offspring suddenly said.","Father Goudan: “!!!”","From the words of the Heavenly Emperor’s offspring, had she endured the Saber-Nurturing Technique before?","Song Goudan, what have you done to Dada Egg?","“The transformation has begun,” Senior White said quietly as he gently pushed the wriggling Meteor Sword back to his waist.","As he spoke, the flames on Scarlet Heaven Sword and the light from the Saber-Nurturing Technique merged into a huge halo, enveloping both Scarlet Heaven Sword and Song Shuhang’s palm.","Within the halo, Scarlet Heaven Sword’s form seemed to be elongating and changing shape.","“Is it really going to turn into a human?” The three-eyed young senior couldn’t help but widen his third divine eye.","“I’ve never heard of the Saber-Nurturing Technique having this effect before,” Father Goudan slowly said.","Inside the light halo, the silhouette of Scarlet Heaven Sword had outlined a ‘human’ shape!","“If... magical treasures can really be nurtured into ‘people,’ then could it be possible that the Eighth Heavenly Dao ‘fat ball’ was also a magical treasure that was cultivated?” The Heavenly Emperor’s offspring couldn’t help but speculate.","“I’ve done it, I’ve really done it!” exclaimed the joyful voice of Scarlet Heaven Sword.","It could feel that its ‘limit’ had been broken, no longer bound by the ‘Immortal Divine Weapon’ limit.","Next, it could become a tiny bit stronger.","A tiny bit stronger is still stronger!","And as if stimulated by the change in ‘Scarlet Heaven Sword’, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber beside it also refused to be outshone, bursting into a halo of light.","The three-eyed young senior chuckled to Father Goudan, “Your primordial treasure is about to change, too.”","“It’s what I expected.” Father Goudan replied calmly: “Do you think I would be worried? No, I’m not only not worried, but I’m also looking forward to it. If Tyrannical Song succeeds, I’ll have an extra Nine Virtues Phoenix Dog Egg!”","The three-eyed young senior: “...”","He could no longer understand the thought process of Father Goudan.","Heavenly Emperor’s child: “...”","She was certain that Father Goudan had become obsessed.","“Hum~” As the halo on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber burst forth, the saber intent armor on its body began to undergo the Ninth Revolution.","During this evolution, the immortal information belonging to the ‘Heavenly Dao’ in the saber’s body was being continuously synchronized into Song Shuhang’s body.","Without needing to execute various schemes, in a state of human-saber fusion, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber actively provided Song Shuhang with the elements needed for ‘Sub-Immortalization’ upgrade.","Moreover, the ‘Heavenly Dao Immortal Information, power’ contained within the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was incredibly abundant.","Before Striped Dragon of the Will wielded its ‘escape’, it seemed to have left a portion of its power of eternity deep within the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","This final revolution of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber could activate this power.","These rich gifts from ‘Striped Dragon of the Will’ allowed Song Shuhang’s ‘Sub-Immortalization’ to complete the final piece of the puzzle.","Besides Tyrannical Song’s Skin, Tyrannical Song’s Bone, and Tyrannical Song’s Eye, all other ‘Tyrannical Song Components’ embarked on ‘Sub-Immortalization’ at this moment.","From inside out, he became entirely sub-immortal, flawless.","At this point, Song Shuhang had amalgamated the ‘immortal’ information of Senior Three-Eyes, Senior Striped Dragon, Dark Sun, Daoist Priest Virtue, Senior White, Fat Ball, and various other predecessors of the Heavenly Dao into one being.","And, as the last piece of the puzzle came into place, coupled with the power of the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’, the ‘sea urchin ball Time River’ scene before Song Shuhang opened up again.","This time, with the addition of the ‘Nine Cultivation Phoenix Saber Glasses’, the previously blurlike scene finally became crystal clear.","Song Shuhang gazed toward the end of time, following a ‘spike’ of the sea urchin ball.","Meanwhile, his incomplete ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ within him was stirred—watching the ‘Time River’ seemed to be a very important step in perfecting the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’.","At first glance...","Song Shuhang saw an ‘ordinary Shuhang’.","This was a Shuhang emitting the aura of an ordinary person, one who had never cultivated or come into contact with ‘cultivation’ — just Shuhang the mortal.","At this moment, this ordinary Shuhang was carrying his seriously injured father, running through an underground tunnel-like passage.","Above them, explosions sounded intermittently.","[An Shuhang that has never added Mama Yellow Mountain as a friend? And the scene before me, is it the world facing a ‘disaster’? An evil spirit’s calamity? Netherworld Realm’s invasion?]","The evil spirits, once just ingredients, had now become a world-destroying disaster.","[Can these evil spirits actually destroy the world?]","To Song Shuhang as he was now, this peculiar feeling was akin to — ordinary pigs, cows, sheep, chickens, fish and the like suddenly rising up and destroying the world.","It’s roughly that kind of feeling.","[Also... Does this correspond to my current time?]","Song Shuhang also noticed something else.","This Shuhang, who was running with his father, was at the same age as the corresponding time for him."]},{"number":3074,"title":"Chapter 3074 - 3072: The Long Legs in the Time River","paragraphs":["Chapter 3074: Chapter 3072: The Long Legs in the Time River","The consistency at the point in time, that is another “him” at this moment.","A perfectly ordinary university student.","Even from his unstable footwork, it seems he may have already lost his virginity.","It’s just unknown if “he” has a girlfriend or not?","If he hasn’t, it feels like a bit of a loss.","As these thoughts crossed his mind, violent bombing sounds came from the ground above, and the underground passage shook along with them.","Song Shuhang, carrying his father on his back, fell to the ground...","He appeared so weak and helpless.","I wonder what the reaction of the mighty powers from the myriad practitioners in the universe would be if they saw this scene?","[Without coming into contact with ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’, he couldn’t have encountered cultivation, wouldn’t have met the seniors in the group, and couldn’t have been there for Senior White coming out of secluded meditation... Therefore, he couldn’t face the evil spirits.]","Without hard work, one can’t even handle food ingredients.","Song Shuhang slowly closed his eyes, not having the heart to watch any further.","After that, his consciousness was ‘pulled’ back to the center of the sea urchin ball.","It was Dark Song who had been ‘pulling’ him all along.","“Eh? Could this be the Dao Mark function of the ruler of the Netherworld?” Song Shuhang speculated.","Since the very beginning, when he first touched this sea urchin ball-shaped ‘Time River’, it spread out centered on himself and Dark Song.","With Dark Song present, no matter where he is in ‘Time’, he doesn’t have to worry about losing direction and can return at any time.","Is this one of the functions of the ruler of the Netherworld’s ‘Dao Mark’?","Moreover...","[On the Sea Urchin Spine, is the ‘ordinary Song Shuhang’ at the same time point really existing?]Song Shuhang pondered calmly.","Or is it just the power of the ‘Time River’, after some kind of deduction, ultimately presenting a calculated result in front of him?","Unless he personally visits the past to experience it, there’s no way for Song Shuhang to make a direct judgment on this.","After a moment of thought, Song Shuhang’s consciousness submerged once more into his own ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ to observe the progress of the immortal path.","Since he achieved the ‘Sub-immortal’ state in his whole body, the entire ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ is nearing completion. If it were expressed in numbers, at least 96% is already complete.","Song Shuhang’s ‘Sub-immortal’ has gathered almost all the fragments of immortality information of the numerous Heavenly Daos, except for the most mysterious First Heavenly Dao and the Fifth Heavenly Dao that he has not yet come into contact with.","Under the feedback of so many different ‘immortal information’ pieces, the progress of the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ almost instantly maxed out.","Now, even if Song Shuhang does nothing and lies around like a salted fish... Under the gradual influence of the ‘Sub-immortal’ and ‘immortal’ information, the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ can still automatically complete itself.","Which means that the remaining 4% is just a tiny bit of grinding away.","But Song Shuhang, since the beginning of his cultivation journey, has gone through all sorts of great dangers and almost experienced everything except for ‘grinding’ through any realm!","The 4% progress could be ground away but could also be traversed by shortcuts for increased efficiency.","For example, now, as he observes time through the ‘sea urchin ball Time River’, the progress of the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ begins to speed up.","[It’s effective.]Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","As long as it’s effective!","He then continued his gaze on another ‘Sea Urchin Spine’.","This time his ‘entrance into the Time River’ view was zooming in from large to small. First, it was the entire world, then it closed in on Huaxia, narrowing down further...","On a broader scale, this ‘Sea Urchin Spine time’ was just as chaotic as the previous world.","The spiritual qi between heaven and earth was chaotic, mixed with the scent of evil spirits.","“`","However, this time Song Shuhang, stuck with Sea Urchin Spines, was in a relatively good environment...","He was in the Spirit River Su Clan’s base!","Song Shuhang had been a guest at the Spirit River Su Clan several times, so he was able to recognize the place through its layout.","[The outside world must still be in the state of the evil spirits calamity... Yet I am staying in the Spirit River Su Clan, being protected...]","[There’s only one truth!]","[I have married into their family?]","Song Shuhang intelligently guessed.","Soon, the scene zoomed in on the ‘suspected married-in Song.’","Then, Song Shuhang saw himself, with his legs broken, sitting in a wheelchair, looking dispirited.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Heavens, what happened?","For a moment, Song Shuhang’s mind conjured some melodramatic plotlines [the protagonist cheats, gets his legs broken by the heroine, and spends the rest of his life in a wheelchair].","Behind the wheelchair, Su Clan’s Seven’s tall figure appeared, gently pushing the wheelchair, heading deeper into the Spirit River Su Clan’s base.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Why is it Su Clan’s Seven!","It couldn’t have been Su Clan’s Seven who broke my legs!","Isn’t Sixteen here?","From beginning to end, there seems to be no sign of Sixteen.","While he was pondering, Su Clan’s Seven pushed him into a young girl’s boudoir.","It was Sixteen’s boudoir.","In the room, on the large bed, Sixteen was in a coma, each of her breaths carried the fiery scent of firecrackers—residual damage from the heavenly tribulation.","[Has Sixteen’s injuries not healed, did she fail her ‘Heavenly River Trial’?]","[No, if the trial failed, she would have died instantly. That means Sixteen is still in the midst of the ‘Heavenly River Trial’?]","Su Clan’s Seven pushed Song Shuhang next to Sixteen.","Sixteen’s hand moved slightly in her coma.","Seven bent down and placed Song Shuhang’s hand into Sixteen’s hand.","Then he sighed softly and quietly left the room.","[Obviously, ‘I’ have made contact with the Nine Provinces Number One Group and met its seniors. But... there’s no sign of Senior White. And the traces of cultivation on ‘my’ body are very faint, almost like I had just started the Hundred Days Foundation Establishment. Does this mean I was severely injured soon after starting my cultivation, with my foundation damaged?]","At that time point, the ones who would seriously harm me... could it be Young Master Hai’s trio?","Because of Sixteen, I was left crippled by Young Master Hai’s trio... Hence, there were no scenes of me greeting Senior White coming out of secluded meditation... following that, the trip to the mysterious island surely didn’t happen, leaving no chance for Sixteen and The White Dragon to come across the ‘skeletal dragon’s withered vine.’","With the Spirit River Su Clan’s resources, they might find another ‘skeletal dragon’s withered vine’ for Sixteen, but The White Dragon wouldn’t be in any other vine.","Without The White Dragon secretly assisting, Sixteen’s ‘Heavenly River Trial’ wouldn’t be completed so quickly, which is why she is still in the midst of the trial.","So, Young Master Hai truly is my lifelong enemy, huh?","He managed to corner me at some point and cripple me right in the Newbie Village.","After roughly deciphering the past events on this ‘Sea Urchin Spine,’ Song Shuhang continued to observe himself and Sixteen from a spectator’s perspective.","[Should I beat up Young Master Hai again when I get back?]","But thinking about it, forget it... a slight movement of my fingers now, and Young Master Hai would be crushed, let alone needing to strike him.","“`","“`","[Right, where’s Senior White? At this point in time, Senior White must have come out of secluded meditation... If Su Clan’s Seven seeks help from Senior White, maybe there’s a chance to save severely injured me, or provide some assistance to Sixteen?]","Either Su Clan’s Seven didn’t do so, or... Senior White isn’t here?","At this thought, Song Shuhang remembered the ‘ordinary Song Shuhang’ world from before.","There, there was no sign of Senior White either.","Although at that time, his vision was limited to seeing the ‘ordinary Song’ and Papa Song running frantically in the ‘underground passage’.","But... if Senior White were there, things like evil spirits shouldn’t be able to stir up much trouble.","Unless, at both points in time, there was no Senior White?","Or perhaps Senior White had left Earth for some reason?","Troublesome.","I’ll send what I’ve observed and my speculations to the seniors later. A single person’s thoughts are always one-sided, but a group’s thoughts tend to be more comprehensive.","Unity is strength.","Thus, Song Shuhang’s consciousness began to withdraw from this ‘Sea Urchin Spine Time River’.","As he withdrew, his comprehension of ‘time’ deepened a bit.","Roughly estimating, the progress bar for his ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ had risen by at least another 0.5% in a short period of time.","“Return,” Song Shuhang softly called.","Using Dark Song as a Dao Mark, his consciousness began to return from the Time River, back to his own node.","His consciousness slid off that ‘sea urchin spine’.","In the process, an idea struck Song Shuhang.","—He discovered that walking through the Time River also brought him different understandings, which similarly could stimulate his ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’.","As a result, Song Shuhang deliberately slowed his return.","With Dark Song there, he didn’t need to worry about getting lost. In case of an emergency, Dark Song’s Dao Mark could generate a ‘pulling back’ force, forcibly drawing him back.","He could afford to slow down and enjoy the scenery of the ‘Time River’.","—But to be honest, there wasn’t much to see on the journey through the Time River.","Sometimes it was an expanse of white, sometimes pitch black, and sometimes a dazzling array of colors. Someone who isn’t used to it might feel nauseated after a while.","“But cultivation is inherently a boring task. Those who cannot endure the boredom do not deserve to be called cultivators,” Song Shuhang felt that he might not be a very qualified cultivator.","Because...","After enduring for a while, illusions appeared before his eyes.","At a certain corner in the Time River, he saw a pair of long legs.","The impressively noticeable kind.","“Even an illusion like this with long legs has appeared. So what next, could the illusion of a ‘Red Powder Skull’ appear? If I proceed further, maybe a new Inner Demon could be condensed?” The more Song Shuhang thought about it, the more feasible he found the idea.","His current Inner Demon—a mechanical little hand that could cook demon cuisine—was too well-behaved.","It was so well-behaved that Song Shuhang couldn’t bring himself to deal with it harshly.","If he could create an Inner Demon capable of rapid growth, that would be quite nice. One to provide the ingredients, the other to make ‘demon cuisine,’ a match made in heaven!","While pondering, the owner of those long legs at the corner took a step forward, revealing her figure.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang was startled.","This head of long black hair cascading like a waterfall, the bright eyes, the sweet smile... is it Soft Feather?","No wonder he felt that those long legs were exceptionally out of the ordinary and somewhat familiar.","“`","“Wait, if this is the ‘Red Powder Skull’ stage, then Soft Feather’s appearance is somewhat hard to explain,” Song Shuhang whispered.","Across from him, Soft Feather also froze for a moment, almost thinking she had seen an illusion.","She had just quietly left the drunken state of Soft Feather and was returning from the Time River... At this moment, she was still weaving the images of seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group in her ‘main world’.","But when she looked up, she found Senior Song floating in the Time River with a puzzled expression.","Since when did Senior Song have such means?","A moment later.","Soft Feather from the other side tentatively called out, “Senior Song?”","“Ah, it’s me,” Song Shuhang nodded and said, “Soft Feather?”","“It’s me,” Soft Feather nodded and said.","“Not an illusion or something like an Inner Demon?” Song Shuhang asked again.","Soft Feather shook her head, “I think there isn’t a second Inner Demon that would dare to be born on Senior Song.”","Song Shuhang suddenly realized, “Oh, are you Future Child?”","Soft Feather: “...”","Senior Song had always been a genius at coming up with nicknames.","Da Da Zi, black-skinned, fat ball, Senior White two, Faint White, big monkey... and so on, a series of nicknames that later became customary, were originally just offhanded nicknames by Senior Song.","“If Senior Song wants to distinguish, the nickname Future Child indeed isn’t wrong,” said Soft Feather from the other side, nodding.","“You’ve come over again?” asked Song Shuhang.","“Mm... This last time, I went to see the seniors. After this, I probably won’t go there again,” Soft Feather said softly.","And she couldn’t go there even if she wanted to.","The next time frame for Senior Song was during the period of the heavenly tribulation’s reincarnation reversal.","Thinking of this, Soft Feather suddenly thought of a possibility and looked up to ask, “Senior Song, have you achieved immortality?”","“No, not yet,” Song Shuhang waved his hand, “I’ve just completed the ‘Sub-immortal’ status of my entire body.”","Does Future Child’s existence imply the reality of each spine on the ‘Time River’?","After hearing that ‘the entire body had completed Sub-immortalization’, Soft Feather’s expression relaxed considerably, and her smile became more lively.","Overall, her demeanor seemed to have become youthful by several years.","“Senior Song, I have to go,” Soft Feather waved her hand, “Please...”","As Soft Feather spoke, her figure began to fade and disappeared into the Time River.","“Please achieve pseudo-immortality? Or perhaps... transcend?” Song Shuhang’s gaze lingered on the place where Soft Feather had disappeared.","Future Child had come to his era multiple times, even mentioned his own thousand-year seclusion, and her significant transformation... it felt like a great change had occurred.","[Shouldn’t I go and see?]","A thought suddenly emerged in Song Shuhang’s mind.","The place where Soft Feather disappeared might just be the ‘Sea Urchin Spine’ on the Time River that she represented.","Although he couldn’t see the future... he could infer some content from the ‘current Song Shuhang’ information on that spine.","[Opportunity, I also have about one chance left.]","He could see many Time Rivers, but that didn’t mean he had the ability to understand each one.","With his own power, the big-eyed planet, and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’s strength, it should be enough for him to touch another Time River once more."]},{"number":3075,"title":"Chapter 3075 - 3073: A Man Who Studies Seriously is the Most Familiar Stranger","paragraphs":["Chapter 3075: Chapter 3073: A Man Who Studies Seriously is the Most Familiar Stranger","“Only one chance left,”","“I hope the place where the ‘Future Child’ vanished is in her Time River... otherwise, if we miss this opportunity, who knows until what time in the distant future we will be able to access the Time River again.”","Song Shuhang had not specialized in ‘Space-Time Immortal Path’ cultivation, so the next time, he might have to wait until he had proven his Dao or even transcended before he would have the opportunity to access the ‘Time River’ again.","Having made up his mind, with a thought, Song Shuhang followed ‘Dark Song’s’ Dao Mark to return to his own time node.","In the main world, his eyes opened.","He then found that Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was still enveloped in a ‘Light Halo,’ excitedly calling out.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was also still in the midst of its Eighth Revolution.","Which meant the time he just contacted the ‘Sea Urchin Spine Time River’ was only an instant in the main world.","“Time is truly a marvelous thing,” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but sigh.","To his side, the Heavenly Emperor’s child slightly smiled and said, “Mister Song, are you comprehending the Dao of Time? The Dao of Time is indeed quite marvelous~”","“I haven’t comprehended it, I simply relied on everyone’s power to briefly contact the Time River,” Song Shuhang said, then looked towards Senior White, who was deep in thought.","“Senior White,” he called out seriously.","“Mmm, go ahead,” Senior White responded with a nod—he didn’t need Song Shuhang to say much, as there was a kind of ‘connected at heart’ effect between him and Song Shuhang at this moment.","“Then I’m off!” After saying this, Song Shuhang closed his eyes again.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair: “???”","Father Goudan: “???”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet couldn’t help but ask, “Lord White, what cryptic puzzle are you and Tyrannical Song playing at?”","“Hmm, just now Shuhang asked for my assistance to use my power to bring him into the correct Time River, and I also found it quite interesting,” Senior White explained.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair: “...”","All that information was contained in Song Shuhang’s call for ‘Senior White’ just now?","It somehow feels like I’ve seen this scene somewhere before?","“Is it an evolved version of Fairy Creation’s ‘Dumb Dumb Language’?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suddenly realized.","“My younger sister’s method of communication is indeed profound.” Daozi’s will nodded—if he wasn’t also unable to understand his younger sister’s way of communicating, he would definitely promote her method throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe, making everyone speak ‘Dumb Dumb Language.’","“Mister Daozi, don’t be rash!” The three-eyed young senior saw Daozi deep in thought and, with his rich life experiences, immediately intuited some possibilities and hastily spoke up to stop him.","Just imagine, if every person in the myriad worlds greeted each other with ‘dumb dumb’ nods, responded with ‘stupid stupid’ replies, and called out ‘dumb dumb, stupid stupid, foolish foolish’ at work—such a world would drive people crazy.","...","...","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang’s consciousness, borrowing the power of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and the big-eyed planet’s primordial treasures, entered the ‘Time River’ for the last time.","“The place where the Future Child disappeared is unquestionably this Sea Urchin Spine,” Song Shuhang’s consciousness headed towards the Time River.","Klang~","This entry into the ‘Sea Urchin Spine Time River’ was slightly different from the previous ones.","In the past, one could enter with a mere thought, easily.","But this Time River required much more effort to enter...","[It feels like entering the previous Time Rivers was like entering an ‘illusory reality’; this Time River feels like the real reality.] Song Shuhang summarized with his limited cultivation vocabulary.","Being more real, it also required greater effort to enter.","Klang~ After the second collision sound, Song Shuhang finally squeezed into this ‘Time River’.","Node time synchronization...","This time, Song Shuhang’s “vision” started from small to large.","He first saw a “cell”.","A cell containing a tiny amount of “immortal information”—it was a cell from the “pseudo-immortal smoke body”.","[Hmm, this is definitely me, no mistake], Song Shuhang immediately confirmed.","The vision began to expand, zooming in closer.","Soon, a “Tyrannical Song” who was sitting with closed eyes cultivating, with a serious expression, appeared before Song Shuhang.","Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm.","Inside his body... there was also a presence of a fat whale golden core.","Except that the fat whale golden core had not completed “immortalization”.","Upon seeing this “Tyrannical Song”, Song Shuhang stroked his chin and fell into silence.","Clearly, this was himself, but there was an abrupt sense of strangeness mixed with an eerie sense of familiarity—both unfamiliar and familiar.","Strange, even the past mortal Song Shuhang, and the dispirited Song Shuhang with a broken leg, did not give Song Shuhang this kind of strange sense of distance.","Is it because this Tyrannical Song is too serious?","As he pondered, Tyrannical Song opened his eyes and looked towards the outside of the palace door—where he was in seclusion was a palace in the main world.","The palace doors were pushed open, and The White Dragon, holding a thick stack of books, flew in.","The originally serious expression on Tyrannical Song’s face rapidly transformed into a warm smile, seamlessly switching between seriousness and tenderness.","“The White Dragon, is it already time for my lesson?”, Tyrannical Song’s smile conveyed a reliable and tender feeling to the heart.","It was as if, as long as he was there, there was nothing to fear, even if the sky should fall.","Such a dazzling smile, unmistakably—it was the style of the senior that Song Shuhang had always dreamed of emulating!","The Song Shuhang of the past had dreamt of possessing the same presence as this current Tyrannical Song before him.","No wonder there was a sense of distance.","Because it was a presence he yearned for, yet could not obtain.","The White Dragon glanced at Tyrannical Song and sighed, “What do you want to learn today?”","“Let’s continue studying the ‘language of the ancient era’. I want to try to finish learning the remaining ancient language today. Without it as a foundation, perfecting the path to immortality would be like digging a well with bare hands, too inefficient.”, the gentle Tyrannical Song earnestly implored, “Please teach me, The White Dragon.”","[Without the ancient language as a foundation, perfecting the path to immortality is difficult?], Song Shuhang felt utterly puzzled—could it be that I was digging with bare hands from the very start?","“I only have time in the morning to teach you. The afternoon is for Chu Suxiong to have a lesson with you.”, The White Dragon set down the thick stack of books.","“Then, let’s use the morning to master the remaining language of the ancient era,” the gentle Tyrannical Song said slowly.","As he spoke, he secretly stretched out his hand and touched a “mark” on his abdomen.","It was originally a “Learning God System” where one could learn just by lying down, personally modified by Senior White.","But at this moment, the “Learning God System” had lost its effects.","“One morning is enough,” the gentle Tyrannical Song lifted his head, reaffirming confidently.","The virtuous lamia emerged from behind him, reaching out her hand to gently press on his temples, massaging his head.","“Thank you, @#%$ Fairy,” the gentle Tyrannical Song confidently called out the name of the virtuous lamia behind him.","Stab!","The virtuous lamia’s finger jabbed hard onto Tyrannical Song’s temple... but in the end, turned gentle and pressed lightly."]},{"number":3076,"title":"Chapter 3076 - 3074: I can rely on all you seniors, and you seniors can also rely on me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3076: Chapter 3074: I can rely on all you seniors, and you seniors can also rely on me!","[I called you by the wrong name, it’s Fairy @#%&, not @#%$.]","Besides...","This virtuous lamia must be fake!","The real virtuous lamia would have definitely jabbed her finger fiercely into my temple when I got her name wrong, stirring my brains into a mess!","Yet the virtuous lamia before me has been maintaining a gentle massage throughout, which just isn’t the one I know.","An entire morning passed swiftly.","The White Dragon taught very quickly, and during the lessons, her voice sounded like a movie played at 15x speed. Sometimes the syllables were so fast that they seemed to merge into one continuous sound.","Gentle Tyrannical Song had been seriously learning the entire time, quickly taking notes while learning and even producing the correct pronunciation of the ‘ancient language’ alongside The White Dragon.","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded by the side.","[Do I really have such an incredible aptitude for learning the ancient language?]","[Is this really me?]","[Have I truly not undergone any modifications?]","The feeling of unfamiliarity grew stronger, and the ‘Gentle Tyrannical Song’ before him seemed like an unattainable dream.","“Time’s up,” The White Dragon closed the book, “I have taught you everything I intended to.”","“You’ve worked hard, White Dragon sister,” Tyrannical Song replied in the ancient language.","His tongue became incredibly agile, easily pronouncing the twisted syllables of the ancient language.","So strong!","“You should review it by yourself for a while...” The White Dragon put away the book and turned to fly outside the palace.","When she arrived at the palace gate, The White Dragon suddenly turned back and said, “Shuhang, some things are not your fault. You don’t have to shoulder all the pressure on your own.”","“Don’t worry, White Dragon sister. You see, I am still relying on you all, right? And I haven’t taken all the pressure on myself; otherwise, I would have definitely developed an Inner Demon by now,” Tyrannical Song said with a carefree smile.","The White Dragon stared at Tyrannical Song’s face for a while, then sighed, “But now, we can’t even understand the expressions on your face anymore.”","The carefree smile on Tyrannical Song’s face stiffened slightly.","[Face-reading no longer effective? How is that possible?] The observing Song Shuhang was stunned — Gentle Tyrannical Song had taken another step closer to his ideal image of a ‘senior’!","“Don’t worry, White Dragon sister. Men will always grow up. I just haven’t been as... um, ‘cute’ as I used to be, right? Besides, the current me is actually what the old me dreamed of becoming,” Gentle Tyrannical Song gave The White Dragon a thumbs-up.","The observing Song Shuhang felt like banging his head against a wall — why are you so proud of calling your past self ‘cute’? As a grown man, doesn’t the word ‘cute’ make you embarrassed?","The White Dragon couldn’t help but smile ruefully.","She waved her claw at Tyrannical Song and rose to fly out of the palace.","Truth be told, she preferred seeing Song Shuhang in his current form of growth. She always felt men should be a bit more mature... it would be better that way.","However, maturity needs to be a process. Gradually becoming mature is best.","But the price of Song Shuhang’s maturity was too high.","As a result, it felt like it would be better for Song Shuhang to return to how he was last year.","“It really is a contradiction,” The White Dragon murmured softly.","...","...","After the White Dragon had flown away, Tyrannical Song gently picked up the notebook in his hand and, seizing the moment, reviewed the contents about the ‘ancient language’ on the notebook.","The virtuous lamia remained silent, simply giving him a gentle massage whenever Tyrannical Song furrowed his brow.","After another review, Tyrannical Song put down the notebook and let out a long sigh, “Fairy Soft Feather, do you think that we were wrong to have tried so hard to look for ‘clues to Senior White’s hometown’ back then?”","From the mouth of the virtuous lamia came a line from a movie: “Do you regret it?”","“Hmm... Although it might be a bit selfish, I might have some regrets now. If Senior White were here, many things might have changed,” Tyrannical Song said, pausing slightly before laughing and adding, “Ah, I can’t help but want to rely on the seniors even more.”","The virtuous lamia tilted her head and gave no answer.","[Here, has Senior White left? And was it ‘I’ who worked together with everyone to look for the clues to Senior White’s hometown, and in the end, was it us who sent him away?] Song Shuhang speculated as he watched.","He reflected on his own experiences.","Last year, he had done the same... traveling with Senior White to the ‘Holy Mountain Secret Realm’ in the Beast Realm to look for information about Senior White’s hometown.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was what he gained during that pursuit, and there, he also obtained some information about Senior White’s hometown.","If at that time they had continued to investigate deeper and eventually found Senior White’s hometown, would he have persuaded Senior White to return?","Possibly.","Senior White clearly had an obsession with his own hometown, and he was consciously looking for clues to it.","[But now, I can stand from an even higher perspective to look at this issue.]","[If there’s an unsolvable problem, then transcend and achieve eternity!]","[If Senior White missed the chance to return to his hometown and couldn’t go back... then transcend and achieve eternity, transcending all limitations. Once all limitations are gone, Senior White can freely jump back and forth between his hometown and the main world!]","[Pavilion Master Chu’s Crystal-clear Water Pavilion can’t even be restored by the Immortal Heavenly Dao... if that’s the case, transcend and achieve eternity, and then surpass the limits of time and space. Even in the worst-case scenario, it would be possible to lock onto the souls of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’s members, bring them back, allow them to complete reincarnation, recover their memories, and return to the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.]","[The Dark Giant and the Dark Sun are hiding behind the scenes, and even the Will of the Heavens can’t completely obliterate them... so transcend and achieve eternity. Even if we still can’t completely destroy the Dark Giant by then, surmounting dimensions, time, and space, there will definitely be ways to cast it into a dimension that can’t affect the main world, leaving it utterly alone to cool off.]","No matter what the issue, if it can’t be resolved, then transcend!","The perfect, universal solution.","Except... sterilization.","After transcending and achieving eternity, I wonder if one can still have children?","[And relying on the seniors... isn’t necessarily a bad thing,] Song Shuhang softly said as he looked upon Tyrannical Song at that point in time.","The process is not important; the result is what matters.","[The path to immortality in the Cultivation Chat Immortal Path naturally ties people together; it’s not a solitary pursuit of immortality based on individual power.]","The power of one person is ultimately limited.","As long as I can achieve the results I want, there’s nothing wrong with leveraging the power of the seniors and powerhouses!","While I rely on the seniors, the seniors also rely on my power.","This is an interactive relationship.","After understanding this... Song Shuhang’s grasp of the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ deepened further."]},{"number":3077,"title":"Chapter 3077 - 3075: Be more confident, eliminate ’maybe’, my present carries both the past and the distant future!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3077: Chapter 3075: Be more confident, eliminate ‘maybe’, my present carries both the past and the distant future!","And this deeper understanding was like the key to opening the final door, allowing Song Shuhang to continuously comprehend the ultimate truths of the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path”.","A moment later, Song Shuhang opened his eyes—this enlightenment was a true “sudden enlightenment”, coming suddenly and leaving just as quickly.","In a pause, Song Shuhang had concluded this session of “enlightenment”.","At the same time, his understanding of the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path” had reached a limit!","He estimated that he was about 99% of the way through— the more he understood the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path”, the more accurate his estimations should be. And the remaining 1%, he no longer needed to complete by “water grinding”. Because Daozi Senior had already prepared a great gift for him!","The moment Daozi Senior retired, he would send a “Heavenly Dao Calculation Compression Package” via Fat Ball’s waste disposal channel, handing it over to him.","Just waiting for that “Heavenly Dao Calculation Cheat” to load, the last missing 1% of the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path” would be instantly completed.","In fact, this missing last 1% was not because Song Shuhang’s understanding of the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path” was insufficient, but rather because his own calculation ability was lacking.","The final form of the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path” required an immense computational power to handle the level of information processing of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Even the ruler of the Netherworld would suffer from an overheating brain and eventually crash while continuously receiving this scale of information processing.","If it were solely up to Song Shuhang himself, to enhance his computational power to a level matching the “Cultivation Chat Immortal Path” could take thousands of years of enduring hardship.","And the “Heavenly Dao Calculation Cheat” that Daozi Senior was tinkering with would perfectly supplement his hardware deficiencies and complete the matching!","“Perhaps, I will never become a ‘reliable senior’. From the time I started cultivating until now, I have always been relying on the help of various seniors. Even the final stage of the path to immortality requires Daozi Senior to empower me.” Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","But he enjoyed the process.","Reliable senior... Once he proved his Dao and achieved immortality, or even transcended immortality, then he could slowly plan for it. By then, he would have infinite time to learn various cultivation systems’ knowledge, languages of the ancient era, and languages of eternity. Not only the cultivation system, but he could also learn about others like the wizard series, magical, holy light, beast cultivation, steel cultivation, star systems, and the death attribute, as well as other cultivation methods from the myriad realms; he could fill his knowledge and become a true “database”.","“I place my dream of becoming a reliable senior in the future!” Song Shuhang stated.","Pushing some matters into the “future” to be completed might have a sense of evasion.","Procrastinators often have an “infinite future” to delay the issues at hand.","...","...","Below.","Behind Tyrannical Song, the virtuous lamia withdrew her massaging hand and stepped back a few steps, her gaze directed toward Tyrannical Song’s shadow.","In the shadow, the figure of Black-skinned Soft Feather emerged.","After appearing, she gracefully bowed to the virtuous lamia, “Thank you, @#%× sister.”","Being a Heart Demon body, Black-skinned Soft Feather was gradually adapting to the presence of the virtuous lamia, but the power of the Heart Demon and the power of virtue always clashed.","The mild retreat was a delicate tenderness, nurturing silently.","“Butterfly Song White Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix, what has happened?” Tyrannical Song asked with a smile.","“Senior Song, please call me Black-skinned Soft Feather. The real name is too long and sounds odd,” Black-skinned Soft Feather said seriously.","In the vacuum, Song Shuhang: “...”","“There is a letter from the main body for you, Senior Song,” Black-skinned Soft Feather said, taking out a letter.","“Soft Feather isn’t contacting me directly?” Tyrannical Song looked puzzled as he reached out for the letter from Black-skinned Soft Feather’s hands.","At that moment, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suddenly spoke up, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, there are some things girls find hard to say in person, that’s why she has to write a letter to convey to you, you need to feel it carefully.”","Tyrannical Song’s hand holding the letter stiffened slightly.","Then he slapped his hand, stuffing Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet into his pocket and zipping it up. After that, he opened the letter from Soft Feather.”","In the void, Song Shuhang’s gaze also fell upon the letter from Soft Feather.","[Senior Song:","Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s injuries have stabilized, with my father and Senior Medicine Master looking after him, his life is no longer at risk. Although his primordial soul is slightly damaged, as long as there is time to treat it, it can gradually recover. Therefore, Senior Song, you can rest assured.","Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue asked me to tell you that the target is the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,’ they might want to acquire it before the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ reaches its Ninth Revolution. Thus, Senior Song, we need to figure out a way to have Lady Onion speed up the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’s’ Eighth Revolution as fast as possible.]","Upon reading this, Tyrannical Song breathed a sigh of relief: “It’s good that Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s injuries are stable.”","In the void, Song Shuhang’s thumb and forefinger gently rubbed together—Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue had been attacked, and the attack was related to the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.’ The assailant might have taken the power related to the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ from Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s body.","Later, he would secretly leave a mark on Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue. Whoever dared to attack him, he would smash their heads!","Not only that, but he could also borrow the ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation Ability’ from Daoist Priest Virtue to check which among the myriad practitioners in the universe had their eyes on the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ and Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.","The most likely possibility was the black sun and the shadowy figure behind it—that big pot. After all, when Daoist Priest Virtue was constructing the grand tomb, he had borrowed the power of the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.’","Once the black sun and the Dark Giant started causing trouble, they would definitely check on Daoist Priest Virtue’s backup plans, and following that clue back to the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ would be logical.","Besides that, another point caught Song Shuhang’s attention—by Gentle Tyrannical Song’s side, was Lady Onion still there? The ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ hadn’t completed its Eighth Revolution yet?","Below.","Tyrannical Song suddenly asked again, “After Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s injuries recover... will it affect his future realm?”","“It might a bit,” Black-skinned Soft Feather replied truthfully.","Tyrannical Song fell silent for a moment, then smiled gently at Black-skinned Soft Feather, “It’s alright. The impact of the injury... will definitely have a solution in the future.”","The look in his eyes grew even more determined.","This era’s battle for the Heavenly Dao, the Heavenly Dao seat, he must seize it. Therefore, he must tread a powerful path to immortality in a short time.","Short time, powerful, these were two key factors... so, the Cultivation Chat Immortal Path had to be set aside for now.","The Cultivation Chat Immortal Path was too vast, too profound, it was beyond the limits of what mortals and immortals could reach.","Thus, the path he needed to tread was the other associated with life and death and immortality on his body.","“Additionally, regarding Lady Onion, I will contact Senior Scarlet Heaven and other seniors to see if we can possibly accelerate her realm advancement... If really not possible, then both Lady Onion and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber will stay within my core world for now. At least, it would be impossible for anyone to break into my core world,” Gentle Tyrannical Song pondered.","Lady Onion had strong innate abilities. If given intense pressure along with sufficient cultivation resources, her cultivation speed could advance by leaps and bounds.","She was considered by several senior figures to be a ‘Wielder of the Will.’","However, time was too short.","The Eighth Heavenly Dao had already retired, and the battle for the Ninth Heavenly Dao had already begun.","In a short time, trying to raise Lady Onion to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm and to complete the refining of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was too difficult.","Lady Onion and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber couldn’t become a force to be reckoned with in a short time.","“Hmm,” Black-skinned Soft Feather nodded.","Tyrannical Song extended his hand and continued to flip through the letter from Soft Feather.","[Then, Senior Song, I also have to earnestly cultivate now.","I am leaving Spirit Butterfly Island and heading to the Netherworld Realm.","Senior White Two is about to fall into deep sleep, and before the birth of the Ninth Heavenly Dao, he will enter a state of deep slumber.","Before this, he customized a training plan for me to make me as powerful as possible as quickly as possible. I can’t let you pull too far ahead, Senior Song!]","Even Soft Feather was going to start serious closed up cultivation. It wasn’t just him, even Soft Feather had changed a lot... Song Shuhang in the void, sighed silently.","“Eh? Soft Feather is going to cultivate with Senior White Two? Wasn’t she with the Heavenly Emperor’s daughter?” Tyrannical Song suddenly froze when he saw this.","He remembered that Soft Feather had demonstrated an aptitude for the ‘Time Department’ in her cultivation. Since then, the daughter of the Heavenly Emperor had been subtly guiding her in her cultivation.","In the void, Song Shuhang also felt a bit stunned—Soft Feather was actually going to cultivate with Senior White Two?","“The senior, the daughter of the Heavenly Emperor, will go with her as well,” Black-skinned Soft Feather replied.","“That’s good...” After pondering for a moment, Tyrannical Song reached out and summoned his steel manifestation.","Then, he handed a treasure key to the steel manifestation. “I remember, the last treasure that Senior White left for me contained several items with special effects for cultivating the power of time. You take them to Soft Feather and Senior White Two.”","Senior White had distributed all the secret treasures he collected to the members of the group when he returned to his hometown.","Even ‘Tyrannical Song’ returned most of the spirit stones... in the end, they were once again gifted to him by Senior White.","The steel manifestation took the key, opened a spatial passage, and disappeared from sight.","Tyrannical Song flipped open the letter.","[Senior White Two mentioned to me about ‘two different beings achieving transcendence and eternity at the same time’.","Sometimes I wonder, if Senior White had not left, he and Senior Song would have definitely accomplished ‘two different beings achieving transcendence’ together.","But now, I will also strive to study it! I, and many others, together.]","As Tyrannical Song read this, a radiant smile spread across his face—a feeling akin to a father watching his daughter finally grow up.","[By the way, Senior Song... do you think something that has already happened can be changed?","If the power of the time department is cultivated to its limit, could it change the past?","And could the changed past affect the future?]","“Change the past?” Tyrannical Song gently pinched the letter.","“Change the past?” Song Shuhang and Tyrannical Song uttered the same word.","Future Child wanted to change the past, which naturally meant that a lot had happened in the past that she wanted to change.","At that moment, a lot of things clicked for Song Shuhang—Future Child had not only once returned to the ‘past’ to interact with him.","Was Future Child trying this sort of thing?","Changing what is ‘past’ for Future Child is his ‘present’.","“So, you’ve been working so hard,” Song Shuhang murmured softly.","You must have already made many attempts without me fully realizing it, right?","Darling Song struggled fiercely against fate in the ‘past’.","Future Child continuously attempted, refusing to yield, in the ‘future.’","The past and the future, everyone’s efforts, might all converge in his ‘present.’","No, not might.","Be confident.","Remove the might.","His ‘present’ is carrying all the past and the future.","So...","“I’m back,” Song Shuhang said.","The past that Future Child wanted to change might have already been changed. Hence, from his perspective, he no longer knows what had happened in that ‘past.’","But that is not important.","What is important is the mature Tyrannical Song and Future Child’s changes, and both of their convictions.","[In my world, Senior White hasn’t left.]","[We have already prepared everything; the foundation for transcendence and eternity has been laid.]","[The enemy lurking in the dark, we already know its root, know its methods. Even its ‘Domination Secret Method’ will be turned to my advantage. There are no more secrets it can keep from me!]","[Cultivation Chat Immortal Path, the next step could be perfected.]","[Be confident, I have already carried the past, present, and future.]","[I am now a man who has won nine consecutive victories.]","[In this world, nobody is ‘more tyrannical’ than I am.]","His consciousness withdrew from the river of time.","The Dao mark of Dark Song guided him back to the correct time node.","At the same time, the power provided by the Sub-immortal Body, the big-eyed planet, and the Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber had all been exhausted.","Under Senior White’s blessings, everything developed just perfectly.","...","...","Main World.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","“Eh?” Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair stretched out, her hair tips peering at Song Shuhang’s face.","For a moment, she felt that Song Shuhang seemed much more mature.","Not older, but a maturity in his demeanor.","Thus, Pavilion Master Chu inquired doubtfully, “Did you spend a lot of time in the river of time this journey?”","Without a change lasting decades or centuries, with Song Shuhang’s personality, it would be difficult for him to mature so much.","“No, just about half a day elapsed,” Song Shuhang replied. “But the gains were significant... I encountered a version of myself who has become a reliable senior.”","“You must be dreaming,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword stepped out of the ‘Light Halo.’","At this moment, Scarlet Heaven Sword had completed its final transformation and truly turned into a human form!","Song Shuhang instinctively wanted to use his ‘Hand Slip’ talent on Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","But just as he was about to stretch out his hand, he saw what Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword looked like now, and forcefully suppressed the urge to ‘Hand Slip.’","Scarlet Heaven Sword, at this moment, had naturally wavy long hair, delicate features, and a slender figure... all composed of ‘steel armor.’","It looked like a mechanical girl.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, your persona conflicts with my daughter’s,” Song Shuhang said after a while.","Pavilion Master Chu’s dazed hair: “...”","Not only did their personas clash, but she also noticed that Scarlet Heaven Sword looked somewhat similar to Song Shuhang, and standing together, they looked like siblings."]},{"number":3078,"title":"Chapter 3078 - 3076: Catch it off guard and deal with it clearly and unmistakably!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3078: Chapter 3076: Catch it off guard and deal with it clearly and unmistakably!","“What does character setting even matter for a sword? I’m a sword, not a person,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword didn’t care about such things.","“Brother, you’re a saber.” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was the first to express dissatisfaction, reminding out loud—it felt that it might be jealous, jealous that Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword was the first to evolve from a magical treasure into a human form. It wanted to evolve too!","Scarlet Heaven Sword directly blocked what its little friend, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, had said, tossing its wavy long hair handsomely: “For a sword, how much fighting strength it can enhance when held in hand is what truly matters. Don’t be short-sighted and only look at my appearance, you should see my inner qualities!”","“Has Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword transcended?” Dada Egg observed Scarlet Heaven Sword closely, her tone uncertain as she asked.","Under her observation, Scarlet Heaven Sword had broken through a limit of the ‘divine weapon of an Immortal’.","Even though it was only a tiny bit.","But this tiny bit was a historic step.","After breaking the limit, Scarlet Heaven Sword could continue to reinforce itself further, no longer bound by the ‘limit’ of the past!","“That’s right, although I can’t evolve into a primordial treasure, I’ve now broken through the limit. Before the next ‘limit’ arrives, I can evolve freely, keep growing stronger. Even I can’t estimate what the final limit is at the moment,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said, tilting its head up proudly.","At this point, it turned its head to Song Shuhang and said, “Come, Tyrannical Song, use me to swing a ‘Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique’ and give everyone a treat!”","Song Shuhang looked at Scarlet Heaven Sword in its current form, then at his own hand.","How am I supposed to use Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword?","You’re not in a sword form, so what part of you am I supposed to hold to slash with ‘Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique’?","“My neck, grab my neck! That’s how Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven did it, the neck is the hilt,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said discontentedly.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Even if your neck is the ‘hilt’, your current size isn’t suitable for me to hold and use!","Just then, the virtuous lamia behind Song Shuhang suddenly stepped forward.","Her body grew several times larger, and then she reached out to grab, holding Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s neck as if picking up a small chick, lightly swinging it around.","With saber qi rushing forth, a casual wave seemed to split space itself without using any skills!","Father Goudan: “...”","Three-eyed young senior: “...”","After swinging a few times casually, the virtuous lamia inverted her grip on Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, facing it eye to eye, locked in a stare.","“Hold on, @#%× Fairy, what are you trying to do?” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword asked nervously.","No sooner had it spoken when the virtuous lamia in front appeared to have made up her mind, slowly opening her small mouth.","“Stop, virtuous Fairy, please don’t go through with it... Right now, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword isn’t in sword form, if you swallow it down, it’s not sword swallowing, but eating a person. That scene would be too 404!” Song Shuhang hurriedly called out.","The virtuous lamia looked disappointed and ceased her actions.","“@#%× Fairy, hand Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword to me for a look.” At this moment, Senior White suddenly spoke up from below.","The virtuous lamia bent her snake tail slightly, grabbing Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword and passing her to White.","Senior White reached out and gently took Scarlet Heaven Sword under the arms, catching it like a child.","Being held gently in such a position for the first time with ‘human vision’, Scarlet Heaven Sword felt very peculiar.","Senior White held Scarlet Heaven Sword aloft, as if observing it.","A moment later...","“`","“It’s the evolution of the power system.” Senior White spoke.","Song Shuhang looked puzzled, “Power system? Do magical treasures have their own cultivation systems?”","After all, he was someone who had refined two sets of the Combined Magical Treasure of the Thirty-Three Beasts. For the most part, the strengthening of a magical treasure was achieved through the cultivators themselves slowly nurturing them, or by adding various formations, enriching them with precious refining materials, to enhance the rank of the magical treasures.","“This is the change that Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword is undergoing right now,” Senior White said, tossing the Scarlet Heaven Sword high up before catching it again, clearly having a great time.","As White played, he explained, “Inside Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, a complete cultivation system has evolved. In other words, from now on, it can slowly cultivate on its own and then, through the feedback of cultivation, further reinforce itself.”","This was why, after breaking through its ‘limit’, the Scarlet Heaven Sword had only become slightly stronger.","However, the Scarlet Heaven Sword itself was already at the level of a ‘divine weapon of an Immortal’. After evolving a complete cultivation system, it would only need a little time to buffer, and it could quickly elevate its realm to match the state of its magical treasure form. With the aid of Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s ‘path to immortality,’ its own realm could reach a level close to that of an Immortal.","Even if it comprehended a complete ‘immortal path,’ it could actually evolve into an ‘Immortal’. By then, possessing both the identity of an Immortal’s divine weapon and a new Immortal, it could simultaneously call upon the power of two paths of immortality.","Unfortunately...","A magical treasure and a cultivator themselves cannot be considered ‘two separate entities’.","Otherwise, the tacit cooperation between a magical treasure with a complete cultivation system and a cultivator might be the optimum choice for ‘attaining Dao as separate entities’.","However, the current relationship between him and Shuhang has gradually become superior to the bond between the magical treasure and the cultivator himself, as they have been working together to achieve the foundation of ‘attaining Dao as separate entities’ step by step.","“So next, before Daozi retires... Shuhang, you should upgrade all of your Thirty-Three Beast Combination Magical Treasures. I have a feeling they will come in handy,” Senior White finally concluded.","At the same time, his Meteor Sword at his waist gently vibrated.","Besides the Combined Magical Treasures, his Meteor Sword also required an upgrade.","“They will come in handy? I understand, Senior White. In the following period, I will focus all my energy on upgrading the three sets of ‘Thirty-Three Beast Combination Magical Treasures’ and the Meteor Sword,” said Song Shuhang solemnly.","He knew that if Senior White said so, then in a certain aspect of the future, the upgraded Thirty-Three Beast Combination Magical Treasures plus the Meteor Sword would definitely be needed.","Of the three sets of treasures, one set was refined by the Heavenly Dao White to be given to Senior White; of the other two sets, one was owned by Song Shuhang himself, and the other set was commissioned by Senior White Two for him to forge, although since then it was always used by Song Shuhang, the ownership actually belonged to Senior White Two.","“For a better present and an even better future.” Song Shuhang deployed the “small hair growing technique,” causing his flowing hair to dance in the air, then transforming it into a hundred waving little hands.","He would become a toolperson without sense, investing all of his love into enhancing the power of all magical treasures.","It wasn’t just the Thirty-Three Beast Combination Magical Treasure and the Meteor Sword that needed it, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet should be included too!","Right, and the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.’","Song Shuhang gazed towards the position of the Light Halo; the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ had already completed the Ninth Revolution. However, it did not transform into a human figure like the Scarlet Heaven Sword did. Within the halo, the vague phantom of a phoenix could be seen.","Nor did the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber come out from within the halo as the Scarlet Heaven Sword had.","After a long cry, it flew behind Song Shuhang and merged into his body, forming a pair of flame-wing tattoos on his back.","“Such a beautiful tattoo, too bad it ended up on Song Goudan’s body,” Father Goudan regretfully said. Such a beautiful tattoo would be more fitting on Cheng Goudan... if not, there’s also Fellow Daoist White.","“They’re both Goudans, how can you be so partial?” The Heavenly Emperor was in a good mood, happy as long as the good things didn’t end up with Cheng Lin.","Father Goudan earnestly said, “Because Song Goudan’s looks aren’t up to par.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Isn’t the lower half of my face still very handsome?","Furthermore.","After completing the Ninth Revolution, the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ was in a state of being ready to unleash its power. It had possessed Song Shuhang, turning into a secret technique waiting to be activated.","This secret technique was related to the ‘freedom’ from the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon boss.","“`","“Father Goudan, can I get Cheng Goudan’s fragments first?” Song Shuhang spoke up.","“For what?” Father Goudan asked.","“Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon left behind some clues that require several conditions to be met in order to unlock,” Song Shuhang mused.","And he had already gathered these ‘clues.’","The Eighth Revolution’s ‘Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber.’","A core world, the Virtuous Golden Lotus, or the Sinful Black Lotus—just one would suffice.","Next, a substantial chunk of Ghost God Cheng Lin’s body. It needn’t be complete, as long as it was a significant piece.","And finally... the acknowledgement of Father Goudan.","Without realizing it, Song Shuhang had found himself in possession of all these ‘conditions.’","Perhaps it wasn’t ‘without realizing.’","As he came into contact with these ‘conditions,’ the items belonging to the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon were attracting each other, eventually converging in his hands.","Upon hearing it was a clue left by the ‘Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon,’ Father Goudan took out the egg containing ‘Cheng Lin’s fragments’ and tossed it to Song Shuhang.","“Thank you, Father Goudan,” Song Shuhang subconsciously revealed a gentle and reliable smile.","This excessively reliable smile sent shivers down Father Goudan’s spine!","It was too dramatic a change in expression for his liking.","In the exploration of the ‘Time River,’ what exactly had Song Goudan encountered?","Song Shuhang caught the egg and cradled it in his hands.","Behind him, the exit of the core world opened up, and a ‘projection of the golden lotus’ symbolizing the core world materialized.","Song Shuhang reached out and placed the big egg atop the golden lotus projection.","Behind him, the ‘Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber’ tattoo transformed into a pair of crimson wings, alighting upon the egg resting on the lotus.","Upon the lotus, an egg with wings had formed.","An extremely beautiful scene.","As for the ‘acknowledgement of Father Goudan,’ that was even simpler.","The title change from ‘Cheng Goudan’ to ‘Song Goudan,’ in essence, represented Father Goudan’s acknowledgement.","“In the past, you’ve all had it tough,” Song Shuhang said softly to the lotus egg, “Now, leave everything to me!”","The lotus, the egg, the wings, and the dao name ‘Cheng Goudan’—all four layers of verification flashed by.","Authentication successful.","Then, everything reverted to as before.","Without any apparent change.","The Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber tattoo remained as it was.","The core world remained the same core world.","The Cheng Lin and Song Shuhang fragments inside the egg had not congealed either.","Above his head, Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair slightly rotated, a bit faster than usual.","Song Shuhang was still the same Song Shuhang, and yet he seemed to have become a bit more reliable.","This reliability stemmed from an aura change.","Was it the ‘freedom’ clue left by the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon that made Tyrant Song more confident?","“Father Goudan, can I keep Cheng Goudan and the others with me for the time being?” Song Shuhang turned his head towards Father Goudan and, as he spoke, that reliable smile surfaced again.","This smile had a magical power, almost making Father Goudan feel that ‘Tyrant Song is so reliable, I could entrust him with the egg.’","“No,” but as the ruler of the Netherworld, it was Father Goudan’s job to say no to this kind of ‘reliability.’","“However... I mean, if... In the distant future, if you were to unexpectedly have a granddaughter, I could take the liberty of giving her a nickname,” proposed Song Shuhang.","“Deal,” Father Goudan nodded.","Heavenly Emperor: “...”","This was the magical communication mode between Senior Song and the ruler of the Netherworld.","“Thank you, Father Goudan.” Song Shuhang pocketed the fragments of Cheng Goudan.","Then he turned back to face the will of Daoist Senior, “Daozi, about how long will it take to complete the ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation External Device’?”","“It is the Heavenly Dao Calculation Compression Package, not an external device,” the will of Daoist Senior insisted sternly.","As the standing 8.5 Wielder of the Will, how could I possibly make something as underhand as an external device?","It’s a compression package!","“Sure, a compression package,” Song Shuhang gave Daoist Senior a thumbs up. “To ensure the balance of the game, refuse the external devices, starting with you and me.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair: “...”","I just felt Tyrant Song had become a bit more reliable, it must have been an illusion!","“In fact, I’ve already completed it,” Daoist Senior replied.","As expected of the current Wielder of the Will—what an efficient work ethic!","“All the templates and channels are in place, so I just need to access some information left behind by Fat Ball and make a few modifications to use it. To be on the safe side, I have also tested it several times to ensure that there are no errors and that it can be deployed at any time,” explained Daoist Senior.","At this point, Daoist Senior paused and added, “I plan to step down from the Heavenly Dao seat ahead of schedule!”","Song Shuhang: “???”","“We’re going to create a time difference, since that Dark Giant is secretly watching, wanting to cause trouble. At the appointed time, I’ll make it look like ‘the Heavenly Dao is flourishing and will continue for tens of thousands of years’ to hide the truth and blind the Heavenly Mechanism. Should any strong entity divine, they’ll only be able to deduce a ‘change in the Heavenly Dao within tens of thousands of years.’","“Under these circumstances, we’ll finish all the preparations in the next few days... Afterward, at the first opportunity, I’ll gather all the ‘Immortals’ of the myriad realms.”","“When I suddenly step down, it’s your cue, Shuhang. Together with Fellow Daoist White, suppress all the Immortals and prove your immortality.”","“Take the opportunity to test the option of ‘two different individuals achieving pseudo-immortality simultaneously’ before the Dark Giant gets time to react. If it works, great; if not, one of you two needs to go for it!”","“When the Dark Giant, caught unprepared, realizes something’s up, it won’t have any time to think and will have to hastily provide you with a ‘Domination Secret Method.'”","“But the ‘Anti Domination Secret Method’ we have developed can turn its ‘Domination Secret Method’ to our advantage.”","“At that time, we’ll have everything perfectly laid out for it.”","“`"]},{"number":3079,"title":"Chapter 3079 - 3077: Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon’s Backup Plan, Transfer the Binding of the Immortal Heavenly Dao!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3079: Chapter 3077: Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon’s Backup Plan, Transfer the Binding of the Immortal Heavenly Dao!","“`","“But Senior Daozi, you’ve only just ascended to your position not long ago,” said Song Shuhang.","This was the Eternal Realm that countless Immortals in the myriad practitioners in the universe dreamed of, the Throne of Authority over all under the Sky.","“My obsession has already been fulfilled... and besides, since I can’t resolve the ‘Black Sun’ threat during my tenure, what I can do is to maximize the effect of my ‘Heavenly Dao.’ I’ll amass as many advantages against the ‘Black Sun’ as possible for you,” the senior Daozi voiced, “There’s not much time left for us, and as soon as you and Fellow Daoist White are ready, we’ll proceed with the handover.”","Leaving the hidden threat of the ‘Black Sun’ to Song Shuhang, Daozi already felt quite ashamed.","Therefore, anything that could be done to confront the ‘Black Sun,’ he was willing to do.","——Moreover, his authority as the Heavenly Dao had always been time-limited.","In the limited time given, maximizing the effect of the Heavenly Dao Authority was the right choice.","On the side, Father Goudan nodded and said, “Daoist Daozi’s decision is correct, and we’ve also made some headway with the ‘Anti Domination Secret Method’ we’ve been studying on our side. Give us a few more days, and we will see results.”","Senior White said, “It will take Shuhang a few days to nourish all his life-bound magical treasures to the ultimate state like the Scarlet Heaven Sword.”","“Then it’s settled. In these few days, I’ll lay out a plan and gather the Immortals of the myriad practitioners in the universe together as much as possible. At the same time, I’ll simulate a strong Heavenly Dao to deceive everyone,” Senior Daozi affirmed.","The Heavenly Emperor’s son reminded Song Shuhang, “Senior Song, our action in a few days will be a do-or-die situation. Make the most of these last few days to do whatever you want.”","“The things I can do and want to do have already been arranged. And...” Song Shuhang declared resolutely, “We will succeed in becoming detached!”","The clues left behind by the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon, validated through multiple verifications like the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,’ ‘Cheng Lin’s significant fragments,’ ‘main world,’ and ‘Father Goudan’s recognition,’ have also given Song Shuhang greater confidence in ‘becoming detached!’","If ‘proving one’s Dao as two different individuals’ is the foundation of detachment, then the clues left by the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon are the next guideposts for ‘becoming detached.’","Based on the Wielder of the Will White’s ‘near-transcendence’ experiences, at the final stage of detachment, the connections between the Immortal Heavenly Dao and the myriad practitioners in the universe will be like the strings of a kite, tightly binding the Heavenly Dao and preventing it from breaking free and becoming detached.","However, without proving one’s Dao as the ‘Heavenly Dao,’ there is no qualification for detachment.","This is a huge contradiction.","To detach, one must first become the Heavenly Dao, but once one becomes the Heavenly Dao, they cannot break free from the strings.","Therefore, the hint from Wielder of the Will White is for two different individuals to prove their Dao at the same time... This is the key to detachment!","But once two different individuals have proven their Dao simultaneously, how do they become detached?","Wielder of the Will White didn’t leave enough hints.","Now, the clue left by the Striped Dragon Boss, who had completely retreated from the Heavenly Dao, has revealed to Song Shuhang the next step towards detachment.","The ‘complete retreat’ plan left by the Striped Dragon was actually a concept for how to ‘become detached.’","With Striped Dragon’s temperament, how could he possibly not research ‘detachment’ during his time in office?","In fact, research on ‘detachment’ has been involved by almost every Heavenly Dao throughout history.","The detachment plan of the ‘Dark Sun Heavenly Dao’ is very extreme – it contemplates obliterating the myriad practitioners in the universe, thus removing the source of the Bind.","As for the plan of Heavenly Dao Father Goudan, it is much more sophisticated – he created a complete small world like the ‘Black Dragon World,’ which has both ‘Netherworld Realm’ and ‘main world’ aspects. Then, through the secret techniques of the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,’ he transferred the binding of the ‘Immortal Heavenly Dao’ to that complete small world.","As long as the transfer of the binding is successful, what happens to that small world next is up to Heavenly Dao Father Goudan – even if it means destroying that small world to achieve his own ‘detachment.’","The Virtuous Golden Lotus World, Sinful Black Lotus World, and the small black room of the Heavenly Dao are all experimental results of Heavenly Dao Father Goudan.","From the current clues, it is still uncertain whether Heavenly Dao Father Goudan has detached successfully; but considering his current state, it seems more likely that the Striped Dragon hasn’t yet achieved perfect detachment.","But its ‘Immortal Heavenly Dao binding transfer’ scheme is complete.","After successfully transferring the ‘Heavenly Dao binding,’ the Striped Dragon has fully retreated from the seat of the Heavenly Dao! Before pulling out, he even managed to arrange matters for Father Goudan.","Combining the plan of Striped Dragon, Song Shuhang has a ‘next step’ in mind.","After two different individuals prove their Dao at the same time... one can stay behind to take up the responsibilities of the Heavenly Dao, maintaining the connection between the Heavenly Dao and the myriad practitioners in the universe.","The other, using the ‘transfer of Heavenly Dao binding’ plan of Heavenly Dao Father Goudan, can transfer the binding to another Heavenly Dao individual, and then follow the path set by Wielder of the Will White to achieve his own ‘detachment!’","This is what Song Shuhang has deduced to be possible, based on all the clues and information currently in his hands.","True ‘detachment’ may differ from his imagination, but at least for the detachment phase, he now has a ‘next step’ option to guide him.","So... it will be successful.","Senior White and I are currently in a miraculous state, culminated from the past, the distant future, and the present, from the efforts of all who have strived!","This is not blind confidence, but faith in all who have worked hard.","Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, which had been attentively watching Song Shuhang and grown continuously, agreed, “Your existence is indeed a miracle. In the myriad realms, no one has transformed from an ordinary person to the Immortal Realm in just one year like you.”","“And this miracle is likely to continue,” the Scarlet Heaven Sword, held high by Senior White, chimed in.","“Be confident, remove ‘likely.’ It must succeed,” said the will of Daozi.","If this miracle does not continue, the myriad practitioners in the universe might all be doomed.","So, this miracle must continue.","“Then, in the last few days, let’s work overtime and make a final push,” the three-eyed young senior said.","After becoming ruler of the Netherworld for so many years... this was the first time he was so passionate about doing something.","“Yes, in the last few days, there’s a place I’d like to visit,” Senior White said to Song Shuhang as he set down the Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Hometown?” Song Shuhang asked instinctively.","“No, there will be plenty of opportunities to visit the hometown later. Let’s go to the Ancient Nether primordial chaos will in the ‘Black Dragon World,'” Senior White said.","“Oh, to plant a pillar?” Song Shuhang remembered the pillars in the Ancient Nether, where past Heavenly Daos and candidates had left their marks.","Senior White nodded, “Exactly there.”","“Then I will apply with Lady Kunna,” said Song Shuhang.","His consciousness dived into the main world, making contact with Lady Kunna.","While communicating with Lady Kunna, he also stealthily glanced at the depths of the main world – at Sixteen’s location."]},{"number":3080,"title":"Chapter 3080 - 3078: Hidden Clues and the Fifth Heavenly Dao Relic","paragraphs":["Chapter 3080: Chapter 3078: Hidden Clues and the Fifth Heavenly Dao Relic","The steel manifestation, fearing awkwardness, deliberately avoided Sixteen of the Su Clan—because it, having studied under the Heavenly Emperor’s child, lacked a thick skin and was somewhat shy.","But Tyrannical Song himself was different!","He would not avoid Sixteen; on the contrary, he would sneak peeks at Sixteen’s current state.","With the assistance of the reliable Inner World Assistant, the treasures deeply hidden by Song Shuhang were unearthed with ease.","Upon seeing the treasure’s jade box dug up, Song Shuhang’s face reddened—a truly precious moment.","This was the face of someone in the Sub-immortal State, and it was actually struggling to hold up!","“Need my help?” the white dragon yawned and inquired once more.","She had asked more than once.","Humans can be like paper tigers, appearing steadfast at first, but hesitating when push comes to shove.","Still too young, after all.","If it were her... she wouldn’t have such a daring thought in the first place, simply out of worry of ‘losing the other person’!","“Wait... just a moment,” Su Clan’s 16.1 responded. At that moment, she was communicating with the hundreds of ‘Sixteens’ inside her, inquiring who had experience in this matter.","Unfortunately, none of the over hundred ‘Sixteen’ personalities could be of use.","“How about we pull out Su Clan’s Sixteen?” suggested Big Sister Sixteen.","The Su Clan’s Sixteen she referred to was, of course, the real Sixteen who was always operating in the background.","“Bringing out the real body now will only make things worse. It’s better for me to do it. Don’t be a coward, just go for it,” the impulsive Sixteen shouted.","“I think it would be better on the wedding night. After all, Song Shuhang is already sterile, so we don’t need to panic,” a timid Sixteen suggested.","“The problem is, we can’t miss this opportunity; if it slips by, it won’t come again. What if the real body moves from the background to the forefront? Given her personality, she might bury the thing again and pretend to know nothing about it, then go and start a very straightforward romance with Mr. Song, all the way to discussing marriage again,” the impulsive Sixteen reminded.","“Moreover, we don’t know if we’ll have another chance to come out once the real body moves to the forefront. Damn it, I can’t believe I lost. I still can’t believe it; I am supposed to be the strongest,” the skilled Sixteen couldn’t accept it even now.","“You don’t have to worry about that... Even if the real body moves to the forefront, we can still come out. This is called being playful, you wouldn’t understand,” Su Clan’s 16.1 coolly said.","This was a major advantage of the current ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen’!","Over a hundred different personalities and modes of Su Clan’s Sixteen, experiencing romance and companionship together—this is the taste of adulthood.","“Eh? Not good, the real body is about to end her background operation,” warned the observant Lady of the House Sixteen.","The ‘background operation’ mode of the real body was coming to an end step by step.","The ghost spirit fairy maiden urged quickly, “Hurry up, don’t hesitate, let the White Dragon help us.”","“White Dragon, quickly!” Su Clan’s 16.1 immediately handed the jade box into the claws of the White Dragon.","There was no time left.","Once the real body took over the forefront, all the efforts of her and all the little Sixteens would be in vain.","The White Dragon didn’t waste words.","As soon as she grabbed the jade box, she displayed the power of ‘space’—a powerhouse handling ‘space’ could do whatever she wanted at certain times.","The power of ‘space,’ always capable of achieving the unimaginable.","Unless the other party also mastered the power of ‘space’—only the space power could defend against space power!","Just as the White Dragon started casting, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s eyes became slightly trance-like for a moment, and the real body ended her background operation.","The ghost spirit fairy maiden glanced at the ‘jade box’ in the White Dragon’s claws and, after a brief sensing, said regretfully, “Too late?”","“We should... have made it in time?” the White Dragon answered.","Furthermore, just to be safe, she had only used half of Song Shuhang’s genetic material contained within the ‘jade box’.","Some things shouldn’t be staked on a single throw.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s eyes still appeared somewhat hazy.","She extended her hands.","The White Dragon handed the jade box to her.","Then, Sixteen staggered over to the pit and buried the jade box back into it.","After a moment of thought, she pinched and cast a technique, causing a patch of vegetation to sprout over the soil pit.","Inner World Assistant: “...”","The treasure hiding area was originally a sandy region; Sixteen’s attempt to conceal the site with new vegetation only made the area more conspicuous.","After burying the jade box, Sixteen rubbed her temples.","At this moment, in her mind, the voices of over a hundred Sixteens were echoing together, creating a cacophony like that of a bustling marketplace.","“Sixteen point one, how’s the situation? Was it successful?”","“The White Dragon only said ‘it should be in time,’ but is it really in time?”","“Can even the White Dragon not be certain of the situation?”","“That’s why I said, don’t hesitate, hesitation leads to defeat! It’s not such a big deal!”","“If it weren’t for Mr. Song’s too quick advancement, we wouldn’t be so troubled, it’s all Mr. Song’s fault.”","“Song Shuhang has only been cultivating for a year, we can’t blame it all on him. It’s not like he wanted to be sterile.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen felt her head ache.","“Shuhang,” she called out to the sky.","This was the main world, so as long as she called out, Song Shuhang was sure to respond.","“I’m here~” Song Shuhang responded online instantly.","“Can you open the main world for me? I want the exit to appear at the Spirit River Su Clan,” Sixteen sweetly smiled.","Song Shuhang pondered for a bit and asked, “Do you want me to accompany you back?”","“Not this time, maybe next time,” Sixteen said as she opened her umbrella sword, “Go and prove your Dao to achieve pseudo-immortality, Shuhang! Don’t be concerned about what’s behind you; we’re all here supporting you.”","“Got it,” replied Song Shuhang, “I’ll open the gate for you.”","The passage to the Spirit River Su Clan opened up directly.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang quietly sent the last of the three corpses, ‘Self-Corpse · Tyrannical Ba Ren’, to follow Sixteen, just in case.","After watching Sixteen leave, Song Shuhang began contacting ‘Lady Kunna,’ applying for entry.","Being acquainted with the highest authority of a world has its perks. Entry is granted as soon as it’s requested.","...","...","At the Spirit River Su Clan.","Sixteen quietly returned to the Su Clan’s territory.","“Seven is still asleep, and the other clan members shouldn’t particularly notice me,” Sixteen spoke softly.","She then tiptoed to the clan’s ancestral hall.","In the hall, there were memorial tablets of the ancestors of the Spirit River Su Clan.","The spot for the memorial tablet of the ancestor ‘Su Clan’s Knot’ had been left empty. It was quietly removed by the Golden Core Cultivators after ‘Knot Ancestor’ suddenly returned.","Sixteen lit incense sticks in the ancestral hall.","A few moments later.","An illusionary figure began to form in the hall.","It was the Spirit River Su Clan’s great ancestor, the one Song Shuhang had encountered before, the founder of the Spirit River Su Clan Trial, whose real name hadn’t been appraised, ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen.’","“Greetings to the ancestral manifestation,” Sixteen said as she bowed to Su Clan’s Sixteen, eventually adding, “After choosing to retain all ‘Sixteens,’ following the trial’s hidden hint, I have come to seek the ancestor and glimpse the primordial weapon of the Fifth Heavenly Dao.”","Apart from the mysterious first Heavenly Dao, the only Heavenly Dao Shuhang had not yet encountered was the Fifth."]},{"number":3081,"title":"Chapter 3081 - 3079: So, The Spirit River Su Clan Are Actually Aliens?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3081: Chapter 3079: So, The Spirit River Su Clan Are Actually Aliens?","Compared to previous Heavenly Daos, the Fifth Heavenly Dao indeed tends to keep a lower profile.","Her ruler of the Netherworld doesn’t hop around everywhere, and it’s even unknown whether her ruler of the Netherworld still exists... Her primordial treasure has never appeared, and legends about her are even rarer. Even the few ‘primordial weapons’ she left in the world were collected and studied by the previous fat ball Will of the Heavens, leaving none behind for humanity.","It is for this reason that Song Shuhang hasn’t had the chance to come into contact with her—Song Shuhang’s encounters with the traces of previous Heavenly Daos are either through the rulers of the Netherworld or through primordial treasures.","“In the end, you still chose not to fuse all the ‘Sixteens’ together?” Su Clan’s Shield Fairy looked Sixteen up and down and asked, “Why did you ultimately decide to keep the personalities of all the ‘Sixteens’?”","Sixteen blinked her eyes, recalling the answer given during the exchanges between the various Sixteens, and replied, “Adult tastes?”","The White Dragon: “...”","Su Clan’s Shield Fairy: “???”","“Maybe it’s because I feel that each ‘Sixteen’ is me, so I can’t bring myself to do it?” Sixteen replied again, “Furthermore, a hundred different ‘Sixteens’ with unique personalities are interesting. As long as I hold the ‘main body’ position, I want to keep them around.”","The reason humans are human is because they have emotions, not merely surviving on instinct alone.","Su Clan’s Shield Fairy held her chin, “I see, this is adult taste?”","Sixteen: “...”","Is there ‘network lag’ in the manifestation of an ancestor? It always seems to be a beat behind in its reactions.","“Prepare yourself, I’ll take you to the Su Clan’s Ancestor Star to see the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s legacy,” said Su Clan’s Shield Fairy with a smiling face.","“Ancestor Star?” Sixteen was slightly startled.","It sounds like a planet?","And from the name Ancestor Star, is it literally the origin planet of the Su Clan?","Are we, the Spirit River Su Clan, of extraterrestrial origin?","Then the story of my meeting with Song Shuhang and our interaction, rather than belonging to the urban cultivation genre, would be classified under science fiction romance—the story of friendship between an alien and a human?","Su Clan’s Shield Fairy looked at Sixteen’s vivid expression: “...”","Has she been influenced by that little friend Shuhang?","And this style of leapfrog thinking, it always feels like some kind of virus passed down.","“Are you ready?” Su Clan’s Shield Fairy reminded her gently.","Sixteen made sure The White Dragon was settled and asked, “I’m ready, Ancestor. Can I bring The White Dragon with me?”","“There’s no problem with that, you and Fairy Golden Dragon are currently in a coexistence relationship, it would be unreasonable to leave her behind,” Su Clan’s Shield Fairy replied softly.","After speaking, Su Clan’s Shield Fairy drew a stroke through the vacuum.","A miniature Rainbow Bridge formed between her palms.","Moments later, the miniature Rainbow Bridge turned into a light screen, one end appeared in front of Sixteen, enveloping her, while the other end breached the cosmos and myriad realms, directly leading to a star region of other ‘myriad realms’, linking two starry skies and acting as a ‘space gate’.","The brilliance of the Rainbow Bridge was too dazzling, and the entire Spirit River Su Clan was stirred.","“What’s going on? Why is there such dazzling light in the temple?”","“Is it a spatial fluctuation? Has a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender intruded?”","“Who dares to make trouble in the temple of our Spirit River Su Clan?”","“Go request the presence of Su Clan’s Knot!”","Causing trouble in someone else’s family clan temple could result in a feud over life and death!","Sixteen: “...”","She sneaked back to the Spirit River Su Clan, only for an ancestor to create such a grand scene, instantly making her return known to everyone in the clan.","[There’s no need to panic.] At this moment, the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan’s voice covered the entirety of the Spirit River Su Clan’s base: [This is Sixteen’s fortuitous opportunity, she has summoned the manifestation of an ancestor. The splendid light is the Rainbow Bridge leading to the Su Clan’s Ancestor Star. After the light fades, send someone to tidy up the ancestral hall.]","The voice of the ancestor of the Su Clan immediately stabilized the members of the Spirit River Su Clan.","“Has Sixteen come across a new opportunity?”","“Could it be related to Big Shot Tyrannical Song? At the beginning of the year, Tyrannical Song took Sixteen away. Now, as soon as Sixteen returns, she has triggered a brand-new opportunity.”","“Did Big Shot Tyrannical Song come as well?”","“Do you think Sixteen, sneaking back all secretive, could be... pregnant?”","——Such bold speculation arose because there seemed to be a tradition among Su Clan’s diviners, that whenever they met someone with the surname Song, something unexpected would occur. In the history of the Su Clan’s diviners, more than one had entangled affections with someone bearing the surname Song.","“Stop it, Big Shot Tyrannical Song is a seasoned Immortal, he doesn’t have that function.”","In the ancestral hall, Sixteen, thanks to her exceptional hearing, heard some of the exchanges and felt her cheeks burning.","Actually, most of the disciples of the Spirit River Su Clan didn’t deeply understand Song Shuhang; most of them thought of Song Shuhang as a ‘seasoned Immortal’, just as the rumors in the myriad practitioners in the universe suggested.","“Ancestor, let’s go,” said Sixteen, feeling a bit guilty.","Su Clan’s Sixteen, seeing her guilty expression, contemplated—should they establish a new rule within the Su Clan that whenever a Su Clan’s female cultivator encounters a person with the surname Song, they must report back to the clan so that elder family members can keep an eye on them?","Never mind, never mind. Why should she interfere in the young people’s affairs?","“Let’s go~” Su Clan’s Sixteen said softly.","The light of the Rainbow Bridge bloomed once more, leading Sixteen through the stars, instantly transferring her from the Spirit River Su Clan’s base to the far side of the endless starry sky.","After Sixteen disappeared, the light of the Rainbow Bridge did not dissipate.","Behind...","The Self-Corpse Overlord, maintaining its ‘invisible’ mode, contemplated for a moment, hesitating whether to follow.","[Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, what are you waiting for?] Su Clan’s Sixteen’s gentle voice reached the ears of the Self-Corpse Overlord.","“Eh? Fairy, you’ve noticed me?” The Self-Corpse Overlord felt a faint sense of being moved.","Even in his invisible state, he was noticed. Perhaps there was still hope for the lineage of Scholar Fish-belly.","[You’re actually nearby.] Su Clan’s Sixteen said aloud.","——She had just bluffed a response, to see if Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song would follow after Sixteen sneaked over.","The manifestation she revealed in the ancestral hall didn’t have as many functions as her main body. If Tyrannical Song intentionally went sneaking, her manifestation would not be able to sense it.","But after bluffing, someone actually responded to her.","The Self-Corpse Overlord: “...”","Su Clan’s Sixteen, what about the trust between people?","[Since you’re here, come along. Step onto the Rainbow Bridge, and I’ll take you to the Su Clan’s Ancestor Star.] Su Clan’s Sixteen said.","The Self-Corpse Overlord paused to think, then said, “So, the Spirit River Su Clan are actually aliens?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","As expected, you must all be infected with the same virus, with ways of thinking that jump so similarly!"]},{"number":3082,"title":"Chapter 3082 - 3080: Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade","paragraphs":["Chapter 3082: Chapter 3080: Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade","“Stop joking around, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you are already at the Immortal Realm. Are you still so narrow-minded to be influenced by the concepts of ‘aliens’ and ‘Earthlings’? From ancient times to the present, through the reincarnation of Heavenly Daos and the transformations of seas into mulberry fields. Based on the current concept of ‘aliens and Earthlings,’ perhaps it was your ancestors who were the aliens,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said.","And their Spirit River Su Clan originated from the ‘Spirit River Secret Realm,’ which itself is located on Earth.","As for the ‘Ancestor Star of Su Clan,’ it was not the origin of the Spirit River Su Clan.","“Once my main body proves the Heavenly Dao, I will go and investigate our family tree,” self-corpse muttered inwardly.","At that moment, Su Clan’s Sixteen spoke again, “Don’t just stand there, come out quickly and stand on the Rainbow Bridge. I’ll ferry you to the Ancestor Star of the Su Clan.”","“Fairy, I have already been standing on the Rainbow Bridge for quite a while now,” self-corpse•Ba Ren said plaintively.","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","Her manifestation carefully sensed and finally perceived an extremely faint presence on the Rainbow Bridge.","If it weren’t for her being on her ‘Rainbow Bridge,’ she would have overlooked the other party in the blink of an eye.","What kind of sneaking technique is this? So Tyrannical?","“Stand firm,” Su Clan’s Sixteen coughed lightly, somewhat awkwardly.","The self-corpse nodded its head and stood firmly on the Rainbow Bridge.","The next moment, the Rainbow Bridge retracted, and the dazzling light disappeared from the ancestral hall of the Su Clan’s territory.","The figures of the self-corpse•Ba Ren and Su Clan’s Sixteen also vanished.","A moment later...","Several senior members of the Spirit River Su Clan entered the ancestral hall.","These Su Clan elders scanned the hall, and seeing that the spiritual tablets in the hall were undisturbed and did not need rearranging, they nodded slightly and exited the hall.","“Sixteen has already disappeared.”","“However, just after Sixteen’s aura dissipated, the Rainbow Bridge seemed to pause for a while, was it waiting for another person?” a meticulous member of the Su Clan wondered.","“If the ancestor was waiting for someone, that person must possess the status and strength worthy of our ancestor’s ‘waiting.’ Thus...”","“It’s Big Shot Tyrannical Song!”","The members of the Spirit River Su Clan easily guessed the truth.","Related to Su Clan’s Sixteen and significant enough to be specially regarded by their ancestor, it undoubtedly had to be the currently renowned Big Shot Tyrannical Song, among the myriad practitioners in the universe.","“Is Big Shot Tyrannical Song escorting Sixteen back to Su Clan’s territory? Hmm...” This certainly led others to speculate further!","“Indeed, when the digital fairies of our Spirit River Su Clan venture out in the future, we must be wary of those surnamed Song. Even old-time Immortals like Big Shot Tyrannical Song should not be treated lightly!”","“Even with old-time Immortals, we must not lower our guard simply because they are elders.”","Mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan: “...”","The ancestor felt that even if he told his clanspeople that Tyrannical Song was not an ‘old-time Immortal,’ no one would believe him.","People are always inclined to believe what they see and hear themselves, but sometimes these things are not the actual truth.","...","...","Elsewhere.","The self-corpse traveled on the Rainbow Bridge, traversing endless starry skies in a short time, arriving at another plane’s star region!","“This is a spatial means, but not a ordinary spatial gate. What’s the principle?” the self-corpse asked.","This technique, if applied in battle, would be incredibly advantageous, more so than a simple ‘spatial gate’.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you have a keen eye, to have noticed the extraordinariness of this Rainbow Bridge technique so quickly,” Su Clan’s Sixteen slightly smiled and then she began to explain the ‘Rainbow Bridge technique’ to Song Shuhang.","Due to the fact that it was Su Clan’s Sixteen, the Rainbow Bridge, a ‘civilian technology,’ fell within the scope of technology she could share.","Possibly because it had been a long time since Su Clan’s Sixteen had discussed techniques with anyone, she was in a good mood. As she began to explain the ‘Rainbow Bridge technology,’ various specialized terms continually emerged.","Even Ba Ren, the smartest among the three corpses, started to develop a headache as he listened.","He couldn’t understand, couldn’t comprehend.","He could only forcibly memorize what Su Clan’s Sixteen explained in his mind, and then pass it on to his main body, letting his main body calculate, absorb, and digest it through the ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation Function.’","“That’s pretty much the principle,” Su Clan’s Sixteen concluded, her voice still full of enthusiasm, “If there’s anything you don’t understand, feel free to ask me anytime.”","“Thank you, Fairy. I need to ponder it well,” the self-corpse replied with a smile, trying to use a loud voice.","“One really needs to ponder it well to digest and understand it,” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s manifestation began to lead the way ahead.","“By the way, Fairy, where is Sixteen?” the self-corpse asked.","After getting off the Rainbow Bridge, he looked around and didn’t see Sixteen, who had gone ahead of him.","“My other manifestation has already taken Sixteen ahead to make contact with the ‘Fifth Heavenly Dao Relic’... After Sixteen finishes, I’ll take you there,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied. “Stick close to me. Just ahead is the forbidden zone of the Su Clan Ancestor Star, where there are spatial imprisonment techniques.”","She was worried that if this manifestation of Tyrannical Song lost her, she would never be able to find him again.","The self-corpse nodded and followed close behind the Fairy.","At the other end of the Rainbow Bridge, after stepping into the forbidden zone, the self-corpse discovered that the scene before him had undergone a drastic change.","Before entering the forbidden zone, this star region looked just like ordinary star space.","But that was just a cover.","Within the forbidden zone was a space where blood-colored power was surging.","These blood-colored powers had both yin and yang sides, filled with vitality, yet everywhere there was an aura of death.","What was even more terrifying were the ‘principles’ hidden within this blood-colored power.","It seemed to be the power of ‘reincarnation.’","Cut off from the outside world, it formed a ‘mini-reincarnation’ world of its own.","“Hang on, is this plane the Infernal Realm?” the self-corpse wondered, asking aloud.","“You guessed right, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. This indeed is the location of the Infernal Realm. But to be precise, it is located at a ‘Plane Barrier’ of the Infernal Realm. It’s the border between the Infernal Realm and another small world plane,” Su Clan’s Sixteen explained. “The Su Clan Ancestor Star is located within that small world plane. Additionally, the ‘Spirit River Secret Realm’ of the Su Clan on Earth is also connected to the Su Clan Ancestor Star through the channel I built.”","“Is the Su Clan Ancestor Star a special reincarnation land for the members of the Spirit River Su Clan?” the self-corpse wondered internally.","He actually didn’t want to delve too deeply into the secrets of others.","Knowing too much could easily lead to being silenced.","However, Su Clan’s Sixteen directly revealed these secrets before him, and he understood them at a glance.","“That’s right. Members of the Spirit River Su Clan, if they wish, can enter the reincarnation land of the Ancestor Star,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied. “The foundation of the Ancestor Star’s reincarnation is built upon the relic of the Fifth Heavenly Dao.”","“The Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade, besides possessing the power of reincarnation, also has the power to peer into time and ‘see’ the different versions of oneself. The one Sixteen is to make contact with is it.”"]},{"number":3083,"title":"Chapter 3083 - 3081: Ancestor, I am a Rare Mutant","paragraphs":["Chapter 3083: Chapter 3081: Ancestor, I am a Rare Mutant","Great beauty?","For someone to be called a ‘great beauty’ by a major figure like Su Clan’s Sixteen, she must certainly have the looks of an immortal.","— But what does it have to do with me whether she is a great beauty or not?","Self Corpse was puzzled in his heart.","Moreover, to tell the truth, there are countless fairies in this world, but among the criteria that would move Tyrannical Song’s main body, ‘beauty’ is definitely not that important a factor.","Apart from that, which part of Tyrannical Song’s main body isn’t associated with a beauty-level big shot?","With so many ‘cheats’ equipped, one develops immunity to the ‘great beauty’ attribute.","Thus, Self Corpse didn’t have much of a reaction to this topic; he just nodded his head and hummed in agreement, considering the matter settled.","Ahead.","The guiding manifestation of Su Clan’s Sixteen, after intentionally revealing that the Reincarnation Blade was associated with the great beauty attribute, was slightly taken aback as she didn’t receive any feedback from the Tyrannical Song manifestation for a long time.","She then thought of a possibility, hastily turned around, and started looking around while her consciousness swept across the area.","In her hands, a shining thread appeared, gently tugging it.","Soon, she sensed Tyrannical Song’s Self Corpse a meter behind her.","Self Corpse looked at Su Clan’s Sixteen with a puzzled face as she went through her series of actions.","Su Clan’s Sixteen hid the ‘thread’ and complained softly, “Why did you suddenly stop responding? I thought I had lost you.”","“Ah, sorry?” Self Corpse felt wronged in his heart—when his main body cut his three corpses, he shouldn’t have used that ‘Forgotten Divine Technique’.","“What were we talking about just now?” Su Clan’s Sixteen continued to hook the thread with her fingers, leading Self Corpse so that she wouldn’t lose him.","“We were talking about the great beauty attribute,” reminded Self Corpse.","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded and then asked back, “And you had no reaction when you heard that?”","“Reaction? Let me think.” Self Corpse thought seriously for a moment, then suddenly his eyes lit up: “The Reincarnation Blade is a great beauty, which means, is she a Saber woman? Is she also cultivated into the ultimate mode with the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’?”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “???”","The ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ can cultivate sabers into Saber women?","What kind of ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ has such a terrifying feature?","I’ve lived so long, and I’ve never heard of such a thing; you better not fool me!","“No?” Seeing Su Clan’s Sixteen’s reaction, Self Corpse felt that his reply might have been wrong.","“I have never heard of ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ being able to cultivate sabers into Saber women,” said Su Clan’s Sixteen. “Where did you get such messy information?”","“I have cultivated one before, to be precise, my main body has, not long ago,” Self Corpse replied sincerely.","While speaking, Self Corpse stretched out his hand in a vacuum, using the power of ‘Defiant Whale Glove artifact spirit fairy,’ and cast the Shadow Casting Technique, playing out the scene where ‘Senior Scarlet Heaven was transformed into a sword woman.’","The figure of the Scarlet Heaven Sword stretched out in the light halo, finally transforming into a metallic young girl with long wavy hair.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s eyes widened: “!!!”","This is unscientific, and it’s not even about cultivation!","It completely contravenes the laws of cultivation.","“Which ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ did you use?” After a long while, Su Clan’s Sixteen finally asked.","“Speaking of this Saber-Nurturing Technique... it should also be related to the Spirit River Su Clan. Fairy, you really don’t know?” the self-corpse asked in return.","In his memories, Tyrannical Song’s main body acquired this Saber-Nurturing Technique when he first entered the dreamland of Su Clan’s Seven and obtained it from that ‘whopper’ great master.","“Isn’t there a ‘whopper’ great master in the Spirit River Su Clan who is the founder of this Saber-Nurturing Technique? If I remember correctly, the great master’s saber has already been nurtured into a saber woman. Moreover, during the nurturing process, the saber woman could be ‘set’ up to have the appearance and personality that he likes most,” the self-corpse replied.","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","When she heard this, the fairy’s expression became very complex.","After a while.","“From where did you meet this ‘whopper’ great master?” Su Clan’s Sixteen asked.","The Tyrannical Song’s Self Corpse explained in a way everyone could understand, “I used a special method to see a segment of the Spirit River Su Clan’s ‘whopper’ great master teaching his disciples, during which I heard about the ❮Three Thousand Sabers Scripture❯ and the Saber-Nurturing Technique. In the process, I also met the great master’s saber woman, a woman with short black hair, her entire being exuded an extremely sharp saber intent, she was absolutely a ‘saber’ without any doubt!”","He still vividly remembered that whopper great master’s saying: With love, all things are possible!","When Su Clan’s Sixteen heard this, her facial expression grew even more complex.","It was indescribable what she was feeling at that moment.","It was like one day, you jokingly bought a three-yuan toy bamboo-copter from the roadside and gave it to the cute neighbor’s kid, telling her that if she just spins the bamboo-copter above her head, she would be able to fly.","Then, the cute kid did as told... and she actually flew!","It’s that feeling of a mental explosion.","“Could there be some misunderstanding in this?” the self-corpse asked upon seeing Su Clan’s Sixteen’s complicated expression, immediately guessing the reason.","“That ‘period-ancestor’ saber woman you mentioned, in a certain sense, is indeed a saber woman,” said Su Clan’s Sixteen. “Come with me.”","Under the lead of Su Clan’s Sixteen’s manifestation, the two quickly passed through the ‘Blood-colored Reincarnation’ forbidden area and entered the atmosphere of the Su Clan’s ancestor planet.","Above the clouds of the Su Clan’s ancestor planet, a series of defensive measures were structured.","There were floating buildings similar to the ‘ancient Heavenly City’ floating in the clouds.","Above the clouds, some of the Su Clan’s disciples took turns guarding.","The self-corpse sensed the aura of the ‘Spirit River Su Clan bloodline’ from these disciples.","“Is the entire ancestor planet filled with members of the Spirit River Su Clan?” the self-corpse asked—considering this, how vast must the Spirit River Su Clan be?","“More or less... However, the members of the Su Clan on the ancestor planet are somewhat special. Also, besides rotational duties, they do not always live on the ancestor planet,” Su Clan’s Sixteen led the self-corpse, flying all the way.","Finally, they arrived at a palace in the clouds.","The gate of the palace was pushed open... and the self-corpse encountered an acquaintance.","The ancestor of the Spirit River Su Clan, Mister Knot.","“Senior Knot?” the self-corpse first froze, then said, “Is the one at the Su Clan’s territory your clone?”","“No, I was worried about Sixteen’s condition, so I came over using the internal Rainbow Bridge. After Fellow Daoist Song and Sixteen form a dao companion relationship, he will also be able to use the internal Rainbow Bridge passage to directly enter the Su Clan’s ancestor planet,” Mister Knot casually replied.","The self-corpse: “...”","“Knot, you’re just in time, cooperate with me,” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s manifestation waved at Mister Knot and said: “Transform into the heavenly saber!”","“Ancestor, I do not possess the function to transform into the heavenly saber,” Mister Knot reminded. “I have the rare mutated innate skill, my manifestation is that of the Heavenly Sword.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","The self-corpse: “!!!”"]},{"number":3084,"title":"Chapter 3084 - 3082: The Disgusting Tyrannical Song, But Becoming Warm?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3084: Chapter 3082: The Disgusting Tyrannical Song, But Becoming Warm?","“Do you need me to demonstrate?” asked the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan, who had not transformed in many years.","“I think I’ve understood,” the self-corpse said, covering his forehead with one hand and rubbing it hard. “So, the giant ancestral master’s saber woman... wasn’t actually transformed from a saber? The Saber-Nurturing Technique he taught doesn’t actually have this function?”","Such a headache!","“Yes,” Su Clan’s Sixteen responded calmly, “His saber was his dao companion, a numerically-designated Fairy from the Spirit River Su Clan. The imposing saber intent you sensed was also innate to that numerically-designated Fairy.”","“So Fairy, can you also transform into a heavenly saber?” the self-corpse asked casually.","Su Clan’s Sixteen shook her head, “Unfortunately... not every member of the Spirit River Su Clan possesses this talent.”","The self-corpse looked up at the sky, “Then what’s the deal with my ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’?”","In fact, deep down, he had already begun to suspect—the Saber-Nurturing Technique of Tyrannical Song was definitely due to non-standard usage, lacking a soul and even wholesale ‘Cheap Love’, thus causing a mutation.","“You’re asking me? Who should I ask?” said Su Clan’s Sixteen. “Why not try using your ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ on the knot and see if there’s any difference?”","“No, no, no, I’d rather not,” the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan continuously waved his hands. Even though his mind was as calm as still water, the thought of a big guy using the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ on him sent shivers down his spine.","After transforming into a ‘Heavenly Sword’, his body theoretically could also accept ‘Saber-Nurturing Techniques’ or ‘Sword-Nurturing Techniques’ and other artifact nurturing skills.","But in the process of performing the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’, the caster must convey their own love to the ‘magical treasure’.","Just thinking about Tyrannical Song conveying various ‘affections’ to him made him feel terribly unsettled.","“There’s no need for so much trouble, just hand me any magical treasure, and I could demonstrate for the seniors,” the self-corpse waved his hand.","Su Clan’s Sixteen asked, “Any magical treasure will do? Not just sabers?”","“Yes, anything will do,” the self-corpse confidently stated.","His ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ had long transcended the category of ‘sabers’. Whether it be sabers, swords, pillars, shields, or even clones and seals—as long as his hands could touch, he could apply the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’.","Su Clan’s Sixteen smiled and then reached her hand out into the vacuum.","Subsequently, she pulled out an exquisite sword scabbard from the vacuum.","—On the surface, except for being slightly more refined, the scabbard seemed ordinary.","But beside them, the eyelids of the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan twitched slightly.","Seeing this, the self-corpse asked cautiously, “This scabbard... it’s not transformed by a numerically-designated Fairy from the Su Clan, is it?”","If it really was a Fairy from the Spirit River Su Clan, then his ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ would be hard to perform.","“Rest assured, this is a normally refined magical treasure, not a member of the Su Clan. If you sense carefully, you should be able to recognize it,” Su Clan’s Sixteen handed the scabbard to the self-corpse.","The self-corpse looked at the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan nearby.","“Indeed, this weapon is not a transformation of a Su Clan member,” the Knot ancestor replied.","But the more it was so, the less confident the clever self-corpse became.","So, he placed his hand on the ‘scabbard’ and first activated the ‘secret appraisal technique’—as for the cost of appraisal, it could be paid by the current main body.","The current main body was in a ‘Sub-immortal’ state, and even direct appraisal of the Will of the Heavens would not cause him to die on the spot.","Of course, such a matter needed to be pre-approved.","A moment later...","[Done!]Tyrannical Song’s main body sent a response.","So, the self-corpse happily executed the ‘secret appraisal technique’.","The light of the secret technique flashed by.","Intense pain affected his spirit... while physical pain was borne by the main body.","“Pain ranking, approximately 77 out of a hundred. It’s quite flavorful,” the self-corpse meticulously savored the spiritual pain and carefully rated it.","As long as it didn’t exceed 100 points, it was theoretically within the range Tyrannical Song could easily endure.","Appraisal succeeded.","The turntable of time began to reverse, and the appraisal information emerged in the mind of the self-corpse.","[Dao Artifact·Reincarnation Blade’s former sheath: Due to an uncomfortable style, it has now been upgraded and replaced. The creation of the scabbard employed special refining techniques of the Fifth Heavenly Dao...]","The appraisal results he received were very clear, yet quite brief.","Through the power of time, only so much information could be obtained.","Moreover, his self-corpse could sense that this information was what the “saber scabbard,” or rather, the Dao Artifact·Reincarnation Blade behind it, was willing to let him appraise. If the other party didn’t wish it, all information would be shielded.","Does that mean if the intimacy is sufficient, more information could be appraised?","Song Shuhang had never considered this possibility before.","Now it seems that “Saber Nurturing Technique” could also be used in combination with the “secret appraisal technique”?","“Fairy, then I am going to make a move. Once I do, you can’t regret it,” his self-corpse, holding the once saber scabbard of this ‘Dao Artifact·Reincarnation Blade,’ cautioned.","“Just go ahead, don’t worry, this scabbard is no longer in use. I have about seven or eight similar items in my possession, you don’t even have to worry about damaging it,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said generously.","“Then, excuse me,” his self-corpse flipped his head, first activating the “small hair growing technique.”","A head of jet-black long hair condensed into shape.","Su Clan’s Sixteen blinked, did the “Saber Nurturing Technique” also require growing a head of long hair first? This was something she had never seen before.","While she was pondering, his self-corpse’s long black hair condensed into a thousand tiny palms, roughly creating one small hand for every hundred strands.","These thousand palms, along with his self-corpse’s pair of arms, pressed onto the scabbard simultaneously!","Because the target was related to ‘primordial treasure’, and it was a scabbard once used by a Dao artifact and even used the ‘Fifth Heavenly Dao’s refining techniques.","His self-corpse started by deploying his full strength.","Whoosh!","The radiance of the “Saber Nurturing Technique” exploded, turning into a sun-like attack.","Now, in just one second, his self-corpse’s palms could slide over the target a thousand times!","In a second, the scabbard endured a thousand instances of the “Saber Nurturing Technique”!","Su Clan’s Sixteen and Su Clan’s Knot felt as if their eyes were about to be dazzled blind...","They had never seen such a brazen use of the “Saber Nurturing Technique”.","Moreover, Song Shuhang’s “Saber Nurturing Technique” utterly exceeded the normal specifications of the Saber-Nurturing Technique.","What happened to the “love” that the “Saber Nurturing Technique” was supposed to involve?","This was a thousand bursts of ‘love’ in just one second, what kind of ‘love’ slides a thousand times in a second?","But, no matter what Song Shuhang’s ‘love’ was, its effect was undeniably real.","Three seconds later, a temporary seven-colored divine artifact appeared on the scabbard.","Su Clan’s Sixteen felt her worldview being challenged.","Meanwhile...","In some mysterious space, Dark Sun Big Shot was with the body of an Immortal Daoist.","Suddenly, Dark Sun Big Shot’s heart stirred.","In his mind, the image of a man kept emerging.","It was that detestable Tyrannical Song.","But for some reason, the originally loathsome Tyrannical Song suddenly seemed somewhat warm.","Dark Sun Big Shot: “???”","What happened?","Did something strange occur within my body?","Dark Sun Big Shot earnestly checked his body, but did not find any abnormalities from head to toe.","Could it be that my psychology has twisted?","Or maybe, did Tyrannical Song do something to me?"]},{"number":3085,"title":"Chapter 3085 - 3083: Are you afraid? I have seven more sword scabbards like this!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3085: Chapter 3083: Are you afraid? I have seven more sword scabbards like this!","The Big Boss of the Dark Sun immediately activated its divination capability and began deducing the causality—his body had become so odd, it must definitely be the doing of Tyrannical Song and Immortal White!","Regardless of the reason, as long as the source of the anomaly cannot be found, the blame could be pinned on Tyrannical Song and Immortal White.","Because during this period, only these two individuals had been meddling with him for several days!","Big Boss of the Dark Sun’s divination started, and its level of divination was completely different from that of ordinary people; the initial array of its divination spanned the area of a major city!","True massive calculation power was all poured into the divination array pattern, deducing the causality.","However, halfway through its deduction, it discovered that the causalities were blocked and the Heavenly Mechanism was obstructed.","“Buzz!” The Dark Sun forcefully shattered the divination array pattern.","It was the current Fifth Heavenly Dao, who was concealing the Heavenly Mechanism, plotting secretly!","Besides the current Fifth Heavenly Dao, someone else was severing the chain of causality in the shadows, preventing him from tracing this segment of causality.","However, the more the Heavenly Dao concealed, the more it inadvertently revealed the identity of the schemer—it was Tyrannical Song!","In the myriad practitioners in the universe, only Tyrannical Song could make the Heavenly Dao intervene to help him scheme.","This place holds no silver three hundred taels.","Moreover, when his body underwent transformation, it was only the favorability toward Tyrannical Song that was changing, which served as even stronger evidence.","“One day, one day, I will...” He paused midway again, hesitating for a moment: “Forget it, both Tyrannical Song and that Immortal White seem too dangerous. Before my grand plan succeeds, it’s best to avoid the two of them to prevent unnecessary complications.”","It was not because his favorability toward Tyrannical Song was continuously increasing, but rather, after losing a ‘burden’ on his body, his mind had become clearer, making him think rationally and understand what needed to be forsaken.","Rather than seeking trouble with ‘Tyrannical Song’ and ‘Immortal White’ and investing a lot of energy in retaliating against them, it was better to avoid them and scheme in the shadows.","This was how the Dark Sun reconciled it with himself internally.","“Stay calm, calm down. Do not be influenced by external information, prepare again for the annihilation plan, but this time, be more cautious.” The Dark Sun seemed to be talking to itself, yet also seemed to be communicating with the unresponsive body of the ‘Immortal Daoist.’","[Ding~ Are you afraid?] A woman’s voice abruptly resounded beside its ear.","The Dark Sun was startled: “!!!”","The fact that this woman’s voice had directly reached his ear implied that his hiding spot had been detected by someone.","If this woman could detect his hiding spot... then the Heavenly Dao would also have methods to pinpoint his location.","Having barely escaped from a wool-plucking operation jointly organized by Immortal White and Tyrannical Song, he had no desire to go back.","[But I must tell you, I still have seven similar sword scabbards!] The woman’s voice came through again.","The Dark Sun was utterly bewildered.","What was this similar sword scabbard thing, and did the recent strange transformation of his body have something to do with the ‘sword scabbard’ the woman mentioned?","Moreover, as there were still seven similar ‘sword scabbards’, did that mean he had to endure seven more transformations?","“Had it not been for the Heavenly Dao blocking the Heavenly Mechanism, my divination technique alone would have been sufficient to lock down the location and gather more information. What exactly is the current Fifth Heavenly Dao plotting?” the Dark Sun said in a deep voice.","At the same time, it called out into the void, “Who are you?”","[Ding~ Are you afraid?] It seemed to trigger a kind of ‘cycle mechanism’, as the woman’s voice echoed again.","About two seconds later.","[But I must tell you, I still have seven similar sword scabbards!] It was the same phrase, the same lines, even the tone had not changed at all.","Was it a recording?","This meant ‘she’ had recorded this long ago and left it behind... thus, this was likely a trap laid for him a long time ago.","Oh no, here it comes again.","Another wave of ‘subtly increasing Tyrannical Song’s favorability’ is attacking.","The effect this time is stronger than the last.","In the air, it almost seems like there is the scent of ‘Tyrannical Song’s favorability +1’.","“Continuing like this, I will be at a disadvantage. I need to set up a plan, secure a ‘hostile state’ towards Tyrannical Song, and not be influenced,” Dark Sun quickly made a decision and calmly chose the most rational option.","...","...","Elsewhere.","Self-corpse initially intended just to demonstrate ‘one-second’ of the Saber-Nurturing Technique to Su Clan’s Sixteen and mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan, and to exhibit his proficiency in the Saber-Nurturing Technique.","However, due to a slip of the hand, he accidentally slid and two extra seconds passed.","After stopping the Saber-Nurturing Technique, the self-corpse returned the sword scabbard, which radiated the ‘temporary divine artifact rainbow light,’ to Su Clan’s Sixteen.","In the process of handing back the scabbard, it made a buzzing sound as if it was reluctant to part ways with Tyrannical Song.","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","She had lived so long and had never seen such a domineering Saber-Nurturing Technique; it had already transcended the scope of Saber-Nurturing Techniques and touched the level of ‘principles and laws.’","[It’s a good thing I didn’t let Tyrannical Song try this Saber-Nurturing Technique on me. Otherwise...], the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan thought, imagining herself radiating multicolored light all over, which would have been a sheer embarrassment.","“Although I completely fail to understand the principles of your Saber-Nurturing Technique, if it is your Saber-Nurturing Technique that cultivates magical treasures into a ‘Saber woman’ state in your mind, maybe it really is understandable,” Su Clan’s Sixteen eventually concluded.","She took back the glowing scabbard, intending to put it back in her storage space.","Just then, a woman’s voice came into her mind, conveying a vague intention — to ask her to help out and pass on the remaining seven scabbards to the fellow friend exhibiting the Saber-Nurturing Technique.","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “???”","This woman’s voice was likely from the sentient treasure of ‘Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade.’","The always dormant Reincarnation Blade had awakened?","For Su Clan’s Sixteen, this was a beneficial matter.","A fully awakened Reincarnation Blade could bring greater advantages and opportunities to Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Moreover... with the Reincarnation Blade asking her to hand over all the scabbards to Tyrannical Song’s manifestation, could the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ for the scabbards also be effective for her?","If this continues, would the Reincarnation Blade turn into the shape of Tyrannical Song?","Tyrannical Song’s Saber-Nurturing Technique is really eerie!","Many thoughts flashed through Su Clan’s Sixteen’s mind, but ultimately, she took out the remaining seven ‘sword scabbards’ from her storage space and handed them to Tyrannical Song’s manifestation.","Self-corpse, puzzled, asked, “Fairy, why is this?”","“Why don’t you brush up each scabbard with the Saber-Nurturing Technique again? Although I can’t explain the principle, it would be greatly beneficial for Su Clan’s Sixteen!” Su Clan’s Sixteen said.","She felt uneasy explaining this scabbard to Tyrannical Song’s manifestation.","But on the other hand, self-corpse slightly smiled, seemingly grasping her intent in a second.","Song Shuhang already knew that Su Clan’s Sixteen was going to meet the ‘Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade’ left behind by the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","And since the scabbards in his hand had once housed the Reincarnation Blade and were somehow connected with it,","Thus, applying the Saber-Nurturing Technique to these scabbards might influence the ‘Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade’ and bring benefits to Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Song Shuhang had great confidence in his Saber-Nurturing Technique—using it on a dao artifact wasn’t his first time. Both the buzzing, cute-sell ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ and the cool, big-eyed planet had endured the Saber-Nurturing Technique.","“Leave it to me,” replied his self-corpse.","He took the seven scabbards and grabbed them all in one breath.","“Not one by one?” Su Clan’s Sixteen inquired.","“No need. Just now I was only demonstrating my Saber-Nurturing Technique to the seniors, without exerting my real strength. So not just seven scabbards, even if you multiply that number by ten, it wouldn’t be a problem for me,” the self-corpse replied confidently.","When it comes to the cultivation of the Saber-Nurturing Technique, his main body, Tyrannical Song, is at the great master level.","[That one-thousand-strikes-per-second Saber-Nurturing Technique just now wasn’t his real strength? Moreover... this isn’t even Tyrannical Song’s main body, but one of his Three Corpses Avatars.] The mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan was astonished.","In the future, even shaking hands with Tyrannical Song’s main body must be done cautiously. A handshake might take about three seconds, and in that time, Tyrannical Song’s main body could do a lot—this thought made the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan extra cautious.","Whoosh~","Opposite, the self-corpse went all out.","One-thousand strikes per second in the Saber-Nurturing Technique was something Tyrannical Song’s main body could achieve at the Eighth Stage Realm.","Now, his main body had surpassed ordinary immortals, reaching the ‘Sub-Immortal’ state. A thousand strikes per second were as effortless as breathing for him.","Nowadays, as long as the material of the magical treasure could endure it, ten million strikes per second were just basic operations for Tyrannical Song’s main body.","Being an avatar, the self-corpse, when going all-out, could achieve this number too.","This time, the objects to be nurtured were Dao Artifact scabbards; there was absolutely no need to worry about them being damaged.","Thus, the self-corpse went all out.","If it could be said that the splendor of the Saber-Nurturing Technique previously demonstrated by the self-corpse resembled the early morning sun... then the radiant splendor of the technique at this moment was like the scorching midday sun of summer.","Su Clan’s Sixteen and the mysterious ancestor were enveloped by this brilliance, feeling an intense heat and... an intangible increase in their favorability towards Tyrannical Song.","“So far apart, and still affected?” the mysterious ancestor of Su Clan exclaimed in surprise, stepping back a bit more.","Whoosh whoosh whoosh~","This time, Su Clan’s Sixteen had not set an ‘end’ time, and the self-corpse, reveling in freedom, simply could not stop.","...","...","Meanwhile, elsewhere.","The Dark Sun had completely gone mad.","It had just been preparing to research a magical technique to lock Tyrannical Song in a ‘hostile state,’ but at this moment, a woman’s voice relentlessly echoed in its mind.","Those two sentences, with a pause of 2-3 seconds between them.","Yet this time, each utterance of these sentences came with its own echo, six echoes to be exact.","[Ding~ Are you scared? Scared, scared, scared, scared, scared, scared?]","[But I must tell you, I have seven more similar scabbards! Each, each, each, each, each, each!]","The Dark Sun’s mind was filled with ‘scared, scared, scared’ and ‘cut, cut, cut’...","After struggling against this devilish echoing female voice, the Dark Sun gritted its teeth and developed a rudimentary form of the ‘lock Tyrannical Song in a hostile mode’ magical technique.","A big boss is truly a big boss; a few simple spells could be figured out just with a few thoughts.","The moment the rudimentary form of the spell was completed, the Dark Sun couldn’t wait to apply this technique to itself to test the effects—it just wanted to resist the shocks of physical anomalies, and could upgrade it slowly later on.","The magical technique was significantly effective.","After using this technique, its deep inner allegiance to Tyrannical Song was locked in ‘hostile mode.’","However, that function of ‘favorability towards Tyrannical Song +1’ seemed to be continuing still.","This function, within its body, was divided into two parts.","One part acted on the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ segment of its body and produced a continuous effect.","The other part landed on the ‘Immortal Sand,’ and was quickly neutralized by the ‘eternal’ characteristic, losing its effect.","The eternal attribute, theoretically a good thing, should eliminate all adverse status effects.","But now, the ruler of the Netherworld segment continued to be affected... The eternal attribute part remaining unharmed, a subtle balance between the two was subtly being disrupted.","[This time, the most correct choice is to retreat the ruler of the Netherworld part back into the ‘Immortal Material.’ By the protection of the eternal attribute, separate the impacts brought by the physical anomalies.] The Dark Sun was very calm internally, knowing what the most correct choice was.","But...","Its subconscious seemed somewhat resistant to this choice!","Just as the Dark Sun was feeling conflicted... The woman’s voice next to its ears and the body’s anomalies suddenly disappeared.","Had Tyrannical Song stopped his actions?","Or had the duration of the trap’s effects come to an end?","[It’s good that it’s over.] The Dark Sun thought to itself.","Thus, it need not be conflicted about whether to retreat into the ‘Immortal Material’ to eliminate the impact Tyrannical Song had left.","...","...","At the Su Clan’s Ancestor Star.","“It should be about enough,” the self-corpse suddenly stopped the delightful action of nurturing the scabbards.","He could have continued to nurture endlessly as long as Su Clan’s Sixteen did not call a halt—he could directly induce anomalies in those seven scabbards!","But a certain intuition transmitted from his main body made the self-corpse stop his actions.","That intuition seemed to be entangled with a ‘lucky karmic connection.’","[Is it the part of me affected by Senior White calling for a halt?] A realization dawned in the self-corpse’s mind.","At this moment, stopping the Saber-Nurturing Technique was the luckiest choice for him?","“Not continuing anymore?” asked Su Clan’s Sixteen—Reincarnation Blade had not alerted her about halting, and honestly, she was quite curious to see if the ‘scabbards’ could transform into Saber women just like in Tyrannical Song’s hologram.","“It’s about enough, moderation is key, and slow is smooth,” the self-corpse slightly smiled, his expression brimming with reliability.","As he smiled, his presence gradually diminished...","[Does his presence weaken when not demonstrating the Saber-Nurturing Technique, meaning the sole purpose of Tyrannical Song’s this avatar is to nurture sabers?] Su Clan’s Sixteen thought to herself, while quietly pulling on that invisible thread, preventing Tyrannical Song’s avatar from wandering off.","...","...","Deep within the Su Clan’s Ancestor Star.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was led by another avatar of Su Clan’s Sixteen to the palace where the ‘Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade’ was located.","“I won’t go in any further,” said Su Clan’s Sixteen with a smile.","“Okay,” nodded Su Clan’s Sixteen, and pushed open the grand doors of the Reincarnation Blade Palace."]},{"number":3086,"title":"Chapter 3086 - 3084: Shocking, Reincarnation Blade Fairy actually refined the Sword Scabbard like this!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3086: Chapter 3084: Shocking, Reincarnation Blade Fairy actually refined the Sword Scabbard like this!","Before entering, Sixteen of the Su Clan had already mentally prepared herself for various challenges.","“A relic of the Fifth Heavenly Dao... what Song Shuhang lacks now is only the attribute of the Fifth Heavenly Dao, right?” Sixteen spoke to the White Dragon sister around her neck.","“And the mysterious First Heavenly Dao,” replied the White Dragon sister.","During this time, apart from accompanying Sixteen from the Su Clan, she spent her other time either discussing ‘fellow daoists’ with Song Shuhang’s self-corpse or following Song Shuhang’s main body to watch dramas, thus she was quite aware of Song Shuhang’s condition.","Currently, Song Shuhang’s condensed ‘Sub-immortal’ body had almost gathered all the attributes of the Heavenly Daos from past generations, lacking only the ‘Fifth Heavenly Dao Relic’ and the Mountain Opening Heavenly Dao that Sixteen was about to come into contact with.","“If possible... think of a way to get the ‘Reincarnation Blade’ to agree to meet Song Shuhang,” Sixteen whispered softly.","She had a bit of a collecting obsession and hoped to gather some things as perfectly as possible.","Well, the above is just an excuse.","She simply wanted to do her best to let Song Shuhang gather all sorts of ‘Immortal Information’ from the different Heavenly Daos.","Softly tugging at the White Dragon sister’s scarf, pulling the White Dragon sister flatter and longer, Sixteen nervously entered the ‘Reincarnation Blade Palace.’","Pushing open the grand doors... what met her eyes was not the spacious palace space she expected, but instead, the originally grand palace space was blocked, leaving only a narrow corridor.","It was extremely narrow, feeling only an inch wide, and even Sixteen from the Su Clan could only squeeze in sideways.","If it were Soft Feather, upon seeing this corridor, she would only bow her head in a sigh and leave disappointed.","The corridor was also filled with a lot of fog, severely limiting visibility.","Sixteen from the Su Clan squeezed sideways into this corridor and slowly moved forward.","“Speaking of which, is this corridor some kind of special seal or something?” Sixteen asked doubtfully as she advanced.","The White Dragon sister shook her head: “No, it’s just a regular narrow corridor, possibly a hobby of the palace’s owner. Maybe if you go further, it will become more spacious?”","In this palace, even the consciousness of immortals was suppressed, and the consciousness of the White Dragon sister could only sweep an area about ten meters ahead.","Sixteen sighed, forcefully inhaled, and cooperated with techniques like the ‘bone shrinking technique’ to make her advance smoother.","After walking for a long while, there was no sense of the path ahead becoming ‘spacious’ at all.","Meanwhile, Sixteen faintly noticed some details.","“Is it shaped like a scabbard?” she guessed out loud.","From the entrance all the way here, the long narrow corridor felt like it was inside a huge scabbard.","Thinking this, Sixteen reached out her hand and lightly tapped the walls of the corridor.","A metallic echo returned from the walls.","Was this corridor really transformed from the ‘Reincarnation Blade’s’ scabbard?","“White Dragon sister, I suddenly have a bold idea,” Sixteen said after pondering for a moment—more precisely, it was an idea discussed by her auxiliary personality and the more than a hundred Sixteens.","“What idea?” the White Dragon sister asked. “Do you need my cooperation?”","“I was thinking... can we try using the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ on this ‘corridor’?” Sixteen replied.","The ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ she was referring to was not the one used by Song Shuhang, but a very orthodox saber technique from the world of cultivation—as a talent who had realized ‘saber intent’ at a very young age, she naturally knew the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique.’","The corner of the White Dragon sister’s mouth twitched: “...”","“Have you been influenced by that guy Song Shuhang?”","“No matter what it is, you want to nurture it?”","“However... to be honest, Song Shuhang’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ really is effective.”","“Why not give it a try?” replied the White Dragon.","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded slightly—in such a confined space, even the degree of her nod was affected. If she nodded too vigorously, her little dragon horns would hit the wall.","Then, as she moved forward, she began to try condensing the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’, her delicate hands pressing against the wall as her body slid forward.","About ten breaths later, a bright light from the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ emerged from Su Clan’s Sixteen’s hands.","The gentle light first appeared between Su Clan’s Sixteen’s fingers, enveloping her pink fingernails, gradually spreading to her entire palm.","Afterward, the light from the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ continued for about twenty breaths before slowly stopping. This duration alone was enough for Song Shuhang to perform ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ billions of times.","But the actual ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ process was only just beginning—after the light ceased, it was necessary to use the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ to establish a connection with the magical treasure, conveying the caster’s ‘intention’ to the magical treasure, strengthening the bond between the magical treasure and oneself, and nurturing the magical treasure with one’s spiritual power bit by bit!","Senior cultivators commented that Song Shuhang’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ was ‘soulless’ precisely because it lacked this process.","It’s like a true author, who needs to draft a detailed outline before starting to write, considers the plot details, reviews the comments from readers, summarizes the previous part of the story, then disconnects from the internet and seriously starts writing.","But a false author just opens Word and starts writing.","Su Clan’s Sixteen continued with the follow-up steps of the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ as she advanced.","Moments later, a tranquil female voice came from the end of the passage: “Are you a disciple of the Su Clan? Your ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ seems a bit off; even though it’s the same Su Clan’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’, your results aren’t quite up to par.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s motion of executing the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ stiffened slightly.","For some reason, a thought suddenly surfaced in the White Dragon’s mind—could this woman’s voice have experienced Song Shuhang’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’?","“Is it the Reincarnation Blade senior?” asked Su Clan’s Sixteen, calming her mind.","“Yes, it’s me. Just come slowly; I’m waiting for you at the end of the passage... Continue with the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ on your way, ignore the cumbersome subsequent steps, and just try brushing with the light,” the tranquil female voice continued.","“It’s definitely Song Shuhang’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique,’ no mistake,” the White Dragon whispered to Sixteen.","“Reincarnation Blade senior, have you seen Song Shuhang?” asked Su Clan’s Sixteen, her heart stirring.","—Regardless of whether the other party had encountered Song Shuhang or not, she intended to showcase the name ‘Song Shuhang’ before the other party, ideally to pique the ‘Reincarnation Blade’s’ interest and allow her to meet Song Shuhang.","“Song Shuhang?” The tranquil female voice was filled with confusion: “I haven’t heard of him.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s mind raced; she felt the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ might be a breakthrough. She was thinking of a way to use the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ as a bridge to introduce Song Shuhang to the Reincarnation Blade senior.","“However, not long ago, while I was asleep... suddenly a disciple of the Su Clan performed the Su Clan’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ on my retired ‘Sword Scabbard.’ His nurturing was performed to the utmost perfection, with outstanding results, which I greatly appreciated,” the tranquil female voice slowly said: “It was because of his ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ that I was able to awaken from my tens of thousands of years of slumber. You are very lucky to be the first Su Clan’s disciple to contact me in my awakened state.”","This was the ‘benefit for Sixteen’ that Su Clan’s Sixteen had told Song Shuhang about.","—An awakened state of the Reincarnation Blade could bring greater opportunities for Sixteen.","Opposite.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s soft fingerpads pressed against the ‘wall’ as she fell into contemplation again—Su Clan’s disciple? Su Clan’s ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’?","She had thought that the Reincarnation Blade senior might have encountered Song Shuhang, but it was another Su Clan’s disciple?","Not Song Shuhang?","Are there disciples in the Su Clan particularly skilled at the “Saber Nurturing Technique”?","Moreover, the “Saber Nurturing Technique” that circulates within the Spirit River Su Clan seems quite similar to the Artifact Cultivation Skill in the world of cultivation, doesn’t it?","“After I left behind the Su Clan’s heritage years ago, I specifically emphasized the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ as a key point of focus, and indeed it proved effective. I’m sure this time, the results of the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ will definitely be effective. Moreover, we can nurture it slowly and steadily, practicing the technique several rounds each day.” The gentle female voice was filled with pleasure.","—The Spirit River Su Clan’s “Sword Nourishing Technique” contains the mysteries of the universe and was specifically arranged by the Reincarnation Blade.","As Sixteen listened, she pondered, and the glow of the “Saber Nurturing Technique” in her hands lit up again as she followed the instructions and simplified the nurturing process.","Nevertheless, even after removing that process, she still needed nearly forty breaths of time to perform the “Saber Nurturing Technique” once.","“By the way, speaking of which, your ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ also has that flavor of the Su Clan disciple from before. Is that scent... emanating from you?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy suddenly asked.","Upon hearing this, Sixteen blinked, and a thought crossed her mind.","The White Dragon perked up her ears to the point of nearly curling them: “...”","“Is it my heart?” The 33 hearts of Tyrannical Song inside Sixteen’s chest began to beat faster.","“Yes... your heart isn’t your own?” The calm female voice sounded somewhat surprised, “To entrust you with his heart, he must be quite a remarkable man.”","Sixteen’s cheeks flushed slightly: “Yes, he is a remarkable man.”","“Unfortunately, he’s already sterile,” the White Dragon added.","Sixteen gently tugged at the White Dragon, stopping her from continuing.","At the same time, she felt elated—she hadn’t expected that Shuhang had already made contact with the Reincarnation Blade Senior. Moreover, the Reincarnation Blade Senior’s first impression of Shuhang was very favorable.","With this, it would be somewhat easier for her to seek any favor for Song Shuhang.","“Reincarnation Blade Senior, actually, Shuhang isn’t a disciple of the Su Clan,” Sixteen explained.","“He isn’t a Su Clan disciple? Then is his surname Su too?” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy seemed taken aback.","“No. His surname is Song,” Sixteen said a bit awkwardly.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy paused for a moment.","After a long while.","She lamented, “Another Song? Is our Spirit River Su Clan destined just to groom daughters-in-law for the Song family? Why does everyone only focus on those surnamed Song? Can’t they consider others?”","My Spirit River Su Clan’s painstakingly nurtured little fairies, why should they all surrender to those surnamed Song?","Before going into her long slumber, she had encountered several of the Su Clan’s fairy maidens, many of whom were also seduced by those surnamed Song. Now, the first Su Clan little fairy she meets upon awakening after tens of thousands of years turns out to be seduced by another Song.","And he even gave her a ‘heart’, a dao companion relationship couldn’t be escaped now.","No, in the future we must establish a new family rule—everyone surnamed Song must marry into our clan!","But upon further thought, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy sighed.","Love shouldn’t be forced.","If, because of marrying into the clan, it harms the feelings of the Su Clan’s little fairies and their dao companions, it would ultimately not be ideal.","“It must just be a coincidence, my encounter with Shuhang was completely by chance,” Sixteen said softly.","“Never mind, I won’t indulge in your love affairs,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy sighed, “Relax, I’ll pull you in... After stabilizing your state, I want to meet this Song Suhang you speak of.”","“Okay,” said Sixteen, smiling sweetly.","She had been thinking for a long time, just to find an opportunity to introduce Song Shuhang to Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","Now that the other party had taken the initiative to request this, it was in precise alignment with what Sixteen had in mind.","[This smooth?] The White Dragon scratched her chin with her small claw—she was now coiled into the shape of a scarf, and her hind limb’s small claw could just manage to do this.","Ever since Song Shuhang and White teamed up, his luck seemed to have improved. Although Song Shuhang’s luck was not bad from the start.","But now, in some small aspects, it could be seen that everything about Song Shuhang was becoming smoother, like an oiled track that couldn’t be stopped once it started sliding.","At this moment, from the depths of the Reincarnation Hall, a gentle pulling force emanated and fell on Sixteen, gently pulling her to the end of the corridor.","At the end of the corridor was a massive round table.","A strikingly beautiful woman with a hat sat opposite the door at the round table, her hands crossed under her chin—yet she struggled a bit while posing this way, as there were some obstructive items on her chest that interfered with her imposing posture.","Sixteen glanced at this beautiful woman and instinctively looked downward, only to then see the White Dragon.","“What is your name?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked gently.","“Su Clan’s Sixteen,” Sixteen replied, giving her Dao name.","“Hmm.” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s gaze lingered on Sixteen’s chest as if trying to peer through her ribcage at the ‘lustrous heart.’","[Is it an illusion?] she thought to herself.","She always felt that this heart emitted a subtle, deep, and unfathomable aura, somewhat similar to that of her owner, the aura of the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","Immortality? Will of the Heavens?","Have I slept a bit too long?","Should I change to waking once every thousand years next time?","“Having this heart is just right... otherwise, for the next part, I would have to figure out a way to strengthen your heart,” the Reincarnation Fairy whispered. “I’ll ask you one last time, are you ready?”","Sixteen straightened her body and nodded.","“Then next, I will forge a sword scabbard for you. Afterward, you and all the ‘little Sixteens’ inside you will join hands to activate the innate skills of the Su Clan,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy declared.","The innate skill of the Spirit River Su Clan was also a legacy of her own—transformation into a blade.","She was a primordial treasure, but she was the most unique among all the primordial treasures.","Before becoming a primordial treasure, she was human.","“Do you need materials to forge the sword scabbard?” asked the White Dragon, speaking up. She had some treasures in her personal collection that she could provide to assist Sixteen in making the ‘sword scabbard’ even more perfect if needed.","“Not necessary,” the Reincarnation Blade removed her hat, revealing pointy elf ears and long red hair.","Then, she straightened her long hair with her hands, fluffing it up dramatically.","Under the puzzled looks of Sixteen and the White Dragon, she stretched out her hand, and her entire red hair was pulled out, beginning to condense.","In the vacuum, something akin to a ‘curse’ or ‘secret technique’ descended, attaching itself to the red hair.","Just like that, the red hair began to transform into a sword scabbard."]},{"number":3087,"title":"Chapter 3087 - 3085: The Curse of Being Scammed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3087: Chapter 3085: The Curse of Being Scammed","The whole head of hair was thus lifted up by the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","At that moment, her skull was smooth and bare.","However, even in a bald state, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s beauty remained at the level of great beauty, without the slightest decline—a bald head is probably the hairstyle that most challenges a beauty rating, and those who can pull off the bald look are truly beautiful individuals.","Across from her, Sixteen appeared stunned, “A wig?”","Inside her, a personality of the Little Sixteen couldn’t help but say, “Such a beautiful fairy, yet to be bald, what a pity.”","The White Dragon on her neck carefully examined the Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s bald head and shook her head, “It’s not a wig, it’s her own ‘long hair’ that she’s completely removed.”","“Will the long hair that Senior Reincarnation Blade has removed grow back?” inquired the gentle and caring big sister-type little personality of Sixteen, somewhat worried.","“Don’t worry, they will grow back before long, at most it will take a hundred years. I’m used to this process, it’s no hassle,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said with a wave of her hand, calmly—she could directly communicate with the hundreds of little Sixteen personalities within Sixteen, a unique communicative ability between her and the ‘Su Clan’s Number Fairy’.","“Then, Senior, you should meet with Mr. Song even more. He has a space spell that can make hair grow instantly,” advised the lady-like little Sixteen personality.","“Besides a masterful Saber-Nurturing Technique, this time Song Shuhang also possesses a secret technique for instantly growing hair? It seems, indeed, that we are somewhat fated,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy mused quietly.","In the vacuum, the red hair was continuously refined and shaped by the effects of the secret techniques, bit by bit transforming into an exquisite scabbard.","At the same time, from the Reincarnation Blade Fairy herself, more energies similar to ‘curses and bizarre possession secret techniques’ emerged, finally all merging into the sword scabbard, becoming patterns on the scabbard, enhancing its capabilities.","“Reincarnation Blade Fairy, this power merging into it... is it a curse?” The White Dragon furrowed her brow and asked.","She had been paying attention to these energies from the start.","The power of these curses made even the White Dragon feel a sense of ‘threat,’ it was something of a high rank.","“Dragon Fairy, your guess is correct, these energies are indeed something like ‘possession curses.’ Moreover, it is because of them that the Fifth Heavenly Dao decided to refine the primordial treasure ‘Reincarnation Blade.’ In other words, they are one of the foundations of my existence,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy explained to Sixteen and the Fairy White Dragon.","About her origins and karmic causes, she was naturally going to introduce them in detail to Sixteen, it’s not a secret at all.","However, upon hearing this, something clicked in the White Dragon’s mind.","—Possession curses, and they’re even forcing the Will of the Heavens to create a primordial treasure specifically targeted at curses, does this mean these possession curses are also ‘Heavenly Axiom-level’ things?","She couldn’t help but think of Song Shuhang’s recent entanglement with the ‘Dark Sun.’","If everyone’s speculations are correct, then the ‘Dark Sun’ would correspond to the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","Is it its fault again?","Because it was black, it seemed that all the blame in the myriad practitioners in the universe could be thrown onto its head.","“Was it a curse crafted by the Fourth Heavenly Dao?” The White Dragon asked.","“Eh? Fairy White Dragon, you know some insider information?” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy was somewhat surprised. Then she nodded and said, “Yes, this strange possessive curse, according to my main body’s deduction, is indeed something the Fourth Heavenly Dao did in secret. Moreover... it was added secretly either right before my main body ‘proved its Dao’ or in the very moment of ‘proving the Dao’. Fortunately, this curse doesn’t seem to have been fully researched and developed. After my main body successfully proved its Dao, it detected the existence of this curse.”","Taking advantage of the fact that the Sword Scabbard was still being forged, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy began to explain the history of the curse in detail to Sixteen.","The Fifth Heavenly Dao initially didn’t know who crafted this ‘curse’.","It was only after proving her Dao and her immortal body actively began to expel the ‘curse’ within that she realized she had been cursed clandestinely. Furthermore, this curse obviously carried the power of ‘eternity’, strong enough to affect existences at the level of Heavenly Axioms.","Afterward, following a lengthy period of covert research, the Fifth Heavenly Dao managed to trace some clues and deduced that her assailant might have been her predecessor, the Fourth Heavenly Dao — although the Fourth Heavenly Dao had stepped down, he seemed to have retained some ability to act in the mortal world.","To counter the ‘curse’ of the ‘Fourth Heavenly Dao’, the Fifth Heavenly Dao began to research a specialized primordial treasure.","She activated a ‘resurrecting formation’ that she had used when she was in the Immortal Realm before proving her Dao... After becoming pseudo-immortal, this Immortal-formulation had lost its ‘resurrecting’ function.","However, with the modifications of the Fifth Heavenly Dao, this resurrection formation eventually condensed into a special ‘manifestation’.","This ‘manifestation’, with an empty consciousness and carrying the bloodline power of the Fifth Heavenly Dao, is the current ‘Reincarnation Blade Fairy’.","The Fifth Heavenly Dao did not obliterate the curses expelled from her ‘immortal body’ but instead transferred them into this manifestation of herself and step by step refined this body into a special primordial treasure.","In targeting the ‘curse’, she was also scheming to trap the Fourth Heavenly Dao in the distant future.","The Saber-Nurturing Technique passed down in the Su Clan was just an insignificant part among the many schemes laid out by the Fourth Heavenly Dao—the retaliation of the Fifth Heavenly Dao was stronger than that of all the previous Heavenly Daos combined.","During her tenure, she actively struck against anything related to the ‘Fourth Heavenly Dao’, attempting several times to obliterate the contingency plans left behind by the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","Even after stepping down, many of her preparations to target the Fourth Heavenly Dao have yet to be activated!","Even the Reincarnation Blade Fairy doesn’t know exactly how much the Fifth Heavenly Dao prepared in secret against the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","The White Dragon nodded and said, “So, as someone who inherits the bloodline of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, can Su Clan’s disciples also use the power of the ‘curse’ to activate their innate skill within? But wouldn’t the power of the curse turn around and invade Su Clan’s disciples?”","After all, the ‘curse’ is a product of a Heavenly Axiom-level power.","“This curse lost its ‘invasive’ feature a long time ago... In fact, the ‘Curse Power’ you now see is no longer the original work of the Fourth Heavenly Dao. The true ‘Fourth Heavenly Dao’s Curse’ was exhausted during the process of my main body refining the Reincarnation Blade. The ‘Curse Power’ you see now has been engendered by my power. Like reaping leeks, what has been clipped is a force under the control of my and Su Clan’s bloodline power,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said with a slight smile.","She was a primordial treasure created by the Fifth Heavenly Dao specifically to target the ‘curse’.","“A curse clipped like reaping leeks?” When the White Dragon heard this, for some reason, she thought of the Inner Demons being reaped by Song Shuhang."]},{"number":3088,"title":"Chapter 3088 - 3086: Tens of thousands of years ago, my main body had not been born yet","paragraphs":["Chapter 3088: Chapter 3086: Tens of thousands of years ago, my main body had not been born yet","Even a “curse” created by the Will of the Heavens, if luck is against it, can become like leeks—continuously harvested.","This world is just that cruel and unfeeling.","Even... if Song Shuhang knew about such a curse that could grow continuously like leeks, who’s to say he wouldn’t come up with a “Curse Banquet” after the “Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet, Heart Demon Menu, and Evil Immortal Banquet”?","“It might actually be quite delicious,” thought the White Dragon, slightly distracted by memories of the delicious Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet.","——Being currently a pure energy body, there wasn’t much she could directly eat.","The White Dragon grew more and more expectant of the upcoming meeting between Song Shuhang and the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","On the other side, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was taken aback.","Eat?","What would be delicious?","Weren’t we just discussing “curses”? Why did the topic suddenly shift to “eating”?","Was she hinting that I have been a poor host by not serving tea and snacks to my guest?","For a moment, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy felt the atmosphere had turned a bit awkward.","Luckily, at this moment, the “Sword Scabbard” finished refining, giving them a moment’s respite.","The exquisitely designed sword scabbard fell from the air and landed in Sixteen’s hands.","When Sixteen caught the scabbard, she experienced an intimate resonance.","On the scabbard, the patterns formed by “Curse Power” seemed to come alive, slowly starting to rotate.","Under the influence of this aura of curse power, Sixteen felt an innate skill hidden within her starting to awaken.","At the same time, in her mind, all of the little Sixteen personalities also felt the impact and began to undergo a transformation.","“It’s so hot,” the White Dragon suddenly murmured, moving slightly away from Sixteen’s neck—her existence, similar to a ‘body of virtue,’ actually felt heat?","“Fairy White Dragon need not worry, this is just the prelude to the transformation,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy assured.","She reached out and gently touched Sixteen, and the principles of reincarnation emerged, enveloping Sixteen and separating the small area of space around her from the rest.","The principles of reincarnation enveloped Sixteen like strange fog, concealing her figure.","At the same time, the hundreds of little Sixteen personalities and Sixteen’s auxiliary personas all became visible as projections within the “strange fog.”","The auxiliary personas floated behind Sixteen like ‘Soul Guardians,’ with their arms making an ’embrace’ gesture to protect the main body.","The hundreds of little Sixteen personalities were scattered irregularly at Sixteen’s sides, with each connected to the auxiliary personas by numerous ‘spikes.’","The scene resembled Sixteen + auxiliary personas turning into a hedgehog or sea urchin, with each “spike” threading through a little Sixteen.","It held a sense of sci-fi.","“The power of reincarnation... and a taste of Time,” the White Dragon commented, turning her head towards the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","“Yes, including the power of Time. The attribute of reincarnation is inherently tied to Time,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy replied. “This evolution will take a bit of time. While we wait, let’s meet this young man named Song Suhang.”","“Shall I call him?” the White Dragon asked. “Also, about the passage outside, Song Shuhang might not be able to get in, right?”","That passage was tight even for Sixteen to enter; Song Shuhang’s physique seemed too large for it.","“How one enters is a trial for members of the Spirit River Su Clan. However... since he is not yet a disciple of the Spirit River Su Clan, there is no need for such a troublesome trial; I will directly draw him over,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy responded.","While they were speaking, another manifestation of Su Clan’s Sixteen had already brought the self-corpse of Song Shuhang to the entrance of the Reincarnation Hall.","“You go in and meet the Reincarnation Blade Fairy yourself now. I won’t accompany you inside,” Su Clan’s Sixteen told her left side.","Self-corpse: “...”","Su Clan’s Sixteen, I am on your right side! And there are lines connecting us!","Moreover, the self-corpse glanced at the Reincarnation Hall; the doors that Sixteen had previously pushed open had not yet closed.","So he immediately spotted the narrow passage.","How do I get into this passage?","“As for how you’re going to enter this passage, it’s up to you to figure out,” Su Clan’s Sixteen continued to speak towards her left side.","The Self-Corpse Tyrant Body: “...”","After a brief contemplation, he borrowed the power of his main body and summoned the “Sub-immortal Sage Golden Core” to look at the narrow passage.","The strange fog within the passage could not confuse the Sage’s eye anymore.","“Is that a sword scabbard?” The thought crossed the mind of the Self-Corpse Tyrant Body.","If it is a scabbard... should I use the “Saber-Nurturing Technique”?","Since Su Clan’s Sixteen had already said to rely on his own methods to enter,","without a word, the Self-Corpse Tyrant Body rolled up his sleeves, his long hair whirling, and it fell upon the narrow passage.","The radiance of the “Saber-Nurturing Technique” bloomed, as dazzling as a little sun.","At the same time.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy had just finished communicating with the White Dragon and snapped her fingers lightly, casting a spell to bring ‘little friend Song Shuhang’ directly into the Reincarnation Hall.","Therefore...","After the instant teleportation magic concluded, the Self-Corpse Tyrant Body was instantly transferred beside the true body of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","Those hundreds of millions of “Saber-Nurturing Techniques” that were supposed to fall upon the narrow passage, all landed on the main body of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","The dazzling light of the Saber-Nurturing Technique nearly blinded the White Dragon’s eyes.","“You’re starting off with ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’ upon meeting? Isn’t that a bit direct?” the White Dragon commented.","The Self-Corpse Tyrant Body awkwardly retracted his palms and hair.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “...”","Although she had already sensed little friend Song Shuhang’s “Saber-Nurturing Technique” through her former ‘sword scabbard,’ the experience of taking the technique head-on without the scabbard and from the main body itself is entirely different.","“Are you Song Shuhang?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked softly.","“Replying to the Reincarnation Blade Senior, I am one of the three corpses of my main body, the Self Corpse Tyrant Body,” the Self-Corpse Tyrant Body greeted the Reincarnation Blade Fairy with a bow—present were only Senior White, Sixteen, and the ‘great beauty’ before him.","Therefore, there’s no doubt that this fairy must be the primordial treasure, the Reincarnation Blade.","While he spoke, his presence began to diminish again.","When he’s not casting the “Saber-Nurturing Technique,” he becomes nearly invisible.","“Not the main body?” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy peered at Song Shuhang’s Self-Corpse, scrutinizing him.","After a long while.","“Can I see your main body for a while?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked.","“That will take a short while, is that okay?” the Self-Corpse Tyrant Body responded. Right now, Tyrannical Song is with Senior White, visiting the Ancient Nether in the ‘Black Dragon World,’ setting up columns.","“It’s possible, I have a period of time I can wait before Sixteen completes her evolution. But don’t make me wait too long,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said.","The Self-Corpse Tyrant Body nodded, “My main body will come as quickly as possible.”","“Hmm,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy nodded her head.","What followed was a lengthy silence.","“By the way, have we met before? Maybe tens of thousands of years ago, or even earlier?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy suddenly looked up and asked.","“I don’t think so,” the Self-Corpse Tyrant Body replied, “Tens of thousands of years ago, my main body hadn’t been born yet.”"]},{"number":3089,"title":"Chapter 3089 - 3087: Is Your Real Target to Covet My Body?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3089: Chapter 3087: Is Your Real Target to Covet My Body?","The self-corpse’s answer was very conservative.","If this was asked a few months ago, at the end of his response, the self-corpse might have added: “My main body Tyrannical Song is nineteen this year.”","But now, the self-corpse was feeling rather insecure.","Although there was no indication in his memory that he had encountered the Fifth Heavenly Dao... it couldn’t guarantee that the future ‘Tyrannical Song’ wouldn’t come into contact with the Fifth Heavenly Dao from ten thousand years ago!","This dreamland skill, despite its concealment, would still be detected by truly top-tier big shots.","What if one day in the future, the main body Tyrannical Song had an impulse and entered a dream of the past, encountering the Fifth Heavenly Dao from ten thousand years ago, and then got his tracks captured?","Even without entering a dream, what if there was a situation similar to that of ‘Song Woodhead’?","Thus, as the most cautious and wise among the three corpses, the self-corpse dared not speak too confidently.","Upon hearing this, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy blinked in surprise.","She sized up the increasingly less conspicuous self-corpse and nodded after a long while: “Not bad, not even ten thousand years and you’ve already embarked on your own path to immortality, proving the Immortal Realm. Such innate skill and cultivation speed are extremely rare across the myriad realms.”","“Thank you for the compliment, Senior,” the self-corpse said modestly.","The corner of the White Dragon’s mouth twitched: “...”","But she didn’t verbally point it out.","To realize but not speak out, to avoid heartache.","“Since you weren’t even born ten thousand years ago, my sense of familiarity with you might stem from other aspects. It’s possible that I’ve met your predecessors, or that your techniques are somehow familiar to me,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said casually: “In any case, we are somehow connected.”","Living long, one meets many; it’s understandable to occasionally feel a mysterious familiarity towards some things.","“Could it be the techniques from the Xingri Hermit lineage that seem familiar to you, Senior? Have you ever come across a cultivation technique related to my invisible state?” the self-corpse followed up on the topic.","“It’s possible, but to be honest, even if I had encountered the cultivation technique you practice, I would’ve quickly forgotten it,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy slowly said.","Self-corpse: “...”","Originally, he had wondered if the existence of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy might help the Xingtian Hermit lineage stand out a bit more. But it seemed now that she was powerless to help.","And while talking, the self-corpse noticed that the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was somewhat distracted.","—She gradually began to ignore the invisible, planning to turn her attention to talking with the White Dragon.","The self-corpse sighed quietly to himself and turned his head to look at the evolving Sixteen.","“It looks like my main body is wandering in the ‘Time River’,” the self-corpse contemplated.","Could the numerous Sixteens also be related to the ‘Time River’?","While he was pondering, the self-corpse suddenly felt a strong force transmitting from his arm, pulling him toward the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","The self-corpse was dragged several meters, a puzzled look on his face: “???”","“Eh? Oh... almost overlooked you,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy waved her fingers, revealing a thread somehow tied between her finger and her Reincarnation Blade.","Before, Su Clan’s Sixteen had done the same thing.","“This technique of yours...it’s even affecting me. Is your main body okay? I wonder if Su Clan’s Little Sixteen Fairy might, during a romance with your main body, forget him halfway and then turn to someone else in love?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said.","The White Dragon tightly curled her dragon mustaches to keep herself from laughing inappropriately.","“Don’t worry, Senior Reincarnation Blade. The main cultivation technique of my main body is not this technique but mainly the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique,’ and ‘Forgotten Divine Technique’ is a secondary technique, all passed on to me through the cutting of the three corpses,” said the self-corpse, weary at heart.","“Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy propped her cheek with one hand, supporting herself on the round table, falling into meditation.","When the Self Corpse saw this scene, his emotions accelerated, and he started moving—Reincarnation Blade Fairy was obviously reacting to the “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique.”","But the problem was, the creator of these techniques was Wielder of the Will White.","After nearing transcendence, Wielder of the Will White used the “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique” and the Combined Magical Treasure as coordinates, casually throwing a brick into the past, aiming for the distant future.","In other words, this technique was a product of the Seventh Heavenly Dao.","Yet, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, being a primordial treasure of the Fifth Heavenly Dao, showed a significant reaction to it.","[Could this be another mess caused by Tyrannical Song’s main body?] The Self Corpse suddenly understood the mentality of the ‘fat ball.’","—When there was nobody else to blame, just let White two take the blame, and you can’t go wrong.","For the Self Corpse, Tyrannical Song could be the one to take the blame.","At that moment, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy looked up and asked, “When is your main body coming over?”","“He is still inserting the column... Wait, my main body just replied that there is about an hour of standing the column after inserting it. He could make some time to come over. But I need to exchange space coordinates with my main body, Reincarnation Blade Senior, please grant me the space authority,” the Self Corpse replied.","He was merely a Three Corpses•Self Corpse, and manifestations needed to act like manifestations. Significant responsibilities didn’t need to be borne by them; it was better to leave them to the main body.","“Granted.” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy nodded, granting the Self Corpse ‘space authority,’ allowing him free access to and from the ‘Spirit River Su Clan • Reincarnation Hall’ area.","The next moment,","Space was swapped, the coordinates of the Self Corpse and Song Shuhang’s main body were exchanged.","The Self Corpse went to assist Senior White, waiting for the column insertion process to buffer.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang’s main body crossed space to arrive, accompanied by a heavy spiritual pressure, making the air around him seem thick.","This was an aftereffect of ‘Full Body Semi-Immortal.’","If he wasn’t careful, an invisible spiritual pressure would continuously release.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s eyes widened: “!!!”","Aura of eternity?","Fully resembling immortality?","Was this an Immortal?","Except for not having the ‘laws of the Heavenly Dao’ accompanying his body, this was simply the spitting image of a junior Heavenly Dao.","“I am Tyrannical Song, honored to meet you, Senior,” Song Shuhang strived to contain his aura of spiritual pressure as he bowed with his fists clasped.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy rubbed her eyes—It wasn’t an illusion.","If not for the fact that the Heavenly Dao was incapable of reproduction, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy almost wondered if this ‘Tyrannical Song’ in front of her might be the Heavenly Dao’s own son.","“Fellow Daoist Song, with your current state, if I were not a primordial treasure, I probably couldn’t stand it,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy sighed. “Without proving the Heavenly Dao, how did you manage to reach this stage?”","You should know that even the current Heavenly Dao couldn’t turn its ‘manifestation’ into something like this. At most, it could only reach the level of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, turning into a ‘primordial treasure’ was already the limit.","Tens of thousands of years, was it really enough time for someone to cultivate to the extent of this ‘Tyrannical Song’?","Moreover, an existence that had reached this realm, it could be said to surpass even the limits of an Immortal.","This kind of existence was interested in a Sixth Stage fairy maiden from her Spirit River Su Clan... Could it be that Fellow Daoist Song had known about her existence beforehand, and had come specifically for her?","After all, she too was a primordial treasure; such beings also held research value. Was he coveting her body?"]},{"number":3090,"title":"Chapter 3090 - 3088: You really have a network of the path to immortality, huh?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3090: Chapter 3088: You really have a network of the path to immortality, huh?","The existence of a ‘primordial treasure’ slumbering within the Ancestor Star of the Spirit River Su Clan was something that very few in the myriad practitioners in the universe knew about, and even those who knew were among their own.","But there’s no wall in the world that doesn’t let the wind through, it’s impossible for her existence to remain an absolute secret, so it’s not unexpected that someone became aware of it.","Had it not been for the nearly hundred million laid down previously, Reincarnation Blade Fairy would probably already be deeply suspicious of Tyrannical Song, and might even have isolated him by now.","But the current Reincarnation Blade Fairy didn’t harbor much suspicion in her heart; instead, she gestured with her hand, signaling for Song Shuhang to sit down opposite her at the round table.","After Song Shuhang sat down, he answered the fairy’s question, “My current state is actually quite complex. I refer to it as the Sub-immortal Mode, which is the result of a combination of coincidences, opportunities, and the assistance of many seniors. If it were just up to me, I couldn’t have done anything. The help of those seniors was of utmost importance.”","“Many seniors?” Reincarnation Blade Fairy mused, then asked, “What rank of existence could help you achieve this?”","Are cultivators these days so audacious? To research immortality of the Great Way with a mortal body, and they even succeeded?","And, they succeeded?","That question could be answered by the White Dragon: “Today’s Will of the Heavens, several rulers of the Netherworld, along with a group of top Immortals, if I remember correctly, there was also a Lady Dragon Network.”","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “???”","I was initially just suspecting you to be the ‘illegitimate child of the Heavens,’ but now, I don’t even have to doubt, this is the truth!","Top Immortals quantified by ‘groups,’ historical rulers of the Netherworld, and the current Heavenly Will...","To gather such a collection of support...","“Is your immortal path by chance one based on connections?” Reincarnation Blade Fairy said. If it weren’t a path based on connections, how else could you link up so many entities?","“The immortal path I’m currently using is one of virtue and karmic blessings. However, in some time, I indeed plan to switch to the ‘Communicative Path to Immortality,’ which does relate to a ‘network,'” replied Song Shuhang grandly from across the table.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “...”","You really do have a network-based method for immortality!","And, listening to this ‘Tyrannical Song,’ it seems he changes immortal paths as easily as changing clothes. Could it be he has more than one immortal path swapped over the years?","Could one really grasp multiple ‘immortal paths’ within ten thousand years?","“Did you indeed reach this level within ten thousand years?” Reincarnation Blade Fairy looked at Song Shuhang with complexity in her eyes.","Song Shuhang paused slightly, then nodded, “Yes, it was within ten thousand years, no fraud involved.”","“So, your real goal in contacting Su Clan’s Little Fairy was to reach me?” Reincarnation Blade Fairy stared at Song Shuhang, her eyes intently digging deep.","The more Tyrannical Song answered like this, the more it confirmed to her that someone who could reach such heights in a mere ten thousand years must have profound reasons behind every action.","It wouldn’t be something mundane like falling in love with Su Clan’s Little Fairy.","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “Before today, I was not aware of the fairy’s existence.”","“Then why did you contact the Little Fairy of my Spirit River Su Clan? An entity like you, with ten thousand years of experience in proving his Dao and undergoing full body semi-immortalization, would you have a common crush on my Su Clan’s Little Fairy, ordinary love?” Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked earnestly.","The White Dragon sister looked up to the sky—the inevitable had finally arrived and couldn’t be dodged.","Across the round table, Song Shuhang spoke seriously, “Reincarnation Blade Senior, do you want to hear the truth?”","“Naturally,” replied Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","The White Dragon sister silently regarded Reincarnation Blade Fairy—she had tried not to disclose, but unexpectedly the fairy still bumped into the muzzle herself.","“In fact, it was just last year that I got to know Sixteen,” Song Shuhang said with a gentle smile on his face as he reminisced.","[Last year? That means, at most only a year’s time?] Reincarnation Blade Fairy raised an eyebrow... A ten-thousand-year cultivator becomes intimately involved with Su Clan’s Little Fairy within just one year—is she supposed to believe it was love at first sight?","“At that time, Sixteen failed her tribulation of the Fourth Stage and appeared in Jiangnan College Town. And I, had just started cultivation, still in the Foundation Establishment stage,” continued Song Shuhang.","“Wait a minute!” Reincarnation Blade Fairy extended her palm to interrupt, “What did you just say? You had just started cultivation, in the Hundred Days Foundation Establishment stage? Last year?”","“Yes,” Song Shuhang nodded.","[Yes my head! Last year, you were at the Foundation Establishment stage, but now you are at the Immortal Realm, full body semi-immortalized, and you have mastered multiple immortal paths?!] Reincarnation Blade Fairy stared at Song Shuhang.","“Is this what you call ‘telling the truth’?”","“What kind of truth is this!”","“Are you sure the time was ‘last year’? You were just starting cultivation last year, so this year...” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy gritted her teeth.","Song Shuhang replied, “It was definitely last year, and this year... well, after the New Year, I’m supposedly 20 years old by nominal age.”","“Do you think I would believe what you’re saying?” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy said.","Song Shuhang generously said, “If the fairy doesn’t believe me, she can fully use her means to test my words.”","“Fairy White Dragon?” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy turned her head and asked.","The White Dragon sister sighed, “When I came into contact with Shuhang, he was almost at the Fourth Stage Realm, and that was about five months ago.”","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “...”","If ‘Tyrannical Song’ really was a cultivation newbie who just started last year, then his relationship and feelings with Sixteen could be understood.","But how is it possible to achieve such a thing within one year?","“Come here, hold my hand... I still want to test it using my own methods,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said, extending her hand toward Song Shuhang.","“There’s no need to grab the neck?” Song Shuhang asked subconsciously.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “???”","Why would you want to grab my neck?","[It seems he’s different from Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword?] Song Shuhang revealed a gentle smile to ease the awkwardness.","Then, he reached out and grasped the Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s wrist.","A halo of light enveloped the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","After the halo dissipated, a three-meter-long giant blade appeared in Song Shuhang’s hands.","On the body of the blade, there were designs of the Infernal Realm, Hell Channel, Paradise, and so on.","“My principles are related to reincarnation and also to time,” the voice of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy rang out. “Do you know how to use primordial treasures?”","“I do, I currently have two primordial treasures in my possession,” Song Shuhang answered.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “...”","The next moment, Song Shuhang sat straight, adopting the ‘saber meditation’ posture: “The next step, human-saber fusion!”","A dazzling flash of light went by.","Then, Song Shuhang and the Reincarnation Blade Fairy entered the state of human-saber fusion that sabersmen dream of.","“Is this how you always use primordial treasures?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked with a complicated expression.","“Instinctual hand slip,” Song Shuhang said with embarrassment.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy sighed, “Forget it, the state of human-saber fusion is fine too. Get ready, I’m going to start running it.”","“No problem,” Song Shuhang nodded.","While talking, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy began to activate the full extent of her ‘Reincarnation’ power, covering Tyrannical Song.","——However, this step was actually an ‘security check’!","First, she had to see whether this Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song had been possessed by someone.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy wasn’t guarding against Song Shuhang, but the sly Fourth Heavenly Dao.","The power of the laws flashed past.","The next moment, a piercing alarm sounded from the Reincarnation Blade!"]},{"number":3091,"title":"Chapter 3091 - 3089: Transforming into Reincarnation, Experiencing Countless Lives","paragraphs":["Chapter 3091: Chapter 3089: Transforming into Reincarnation, Experiencing Countless Lives","“`","The “security check program” of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was mainly created to guard against the Fourth Heavenly Dao—after all, the Fourth Heavenly Dao sneakily endowed the Fifth Heavenly Dao with a possessing curse while her main body, the Fifth Heavenly Dao, was proving its Dao and becoming immortal.","This was something one could not fail to guard against.","Therefore, after the Fifth Heavenly Dao had forged the Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade, it included the function of detecting “Heavenly Dao Immortal Information” related to the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","Now, when she swept her “security check” over Tyrannical Song, alarms blared out loudly!","And the alarm was extremely piercing—which indicated that on top of having the Fourth Heavenly Dao immortal information, Tyrannical Song seemed to have even more on him!","“Have you come into contact with the Fourth Heavenly Dao? Have you been affected by the secret techniques of the Fourth Heavenly Dao?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy immediately entered emergency isolation mode. She brandished her blade light, which transformed into a light screen to isolate Song Shuhang and everyone else.","Song Shuhang was baffled, “???”","“Don’t panic, I estimate that you, Tyrannical Song, haven’t yet proved the Heavenly Dao and have already condensed the Sub-immortal Mode, hence arousing the covert scrutiny of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, who secretly took action against you. But don’t worry, I have means to deal with the possessing curse of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, and will now remove it for you,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy reassured him.","As she spoke, she used the “human-saber fusion” mode and intensified the “security check” to help Song Shuhang eliminate the “possessing curse” of the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","As the intensity of the security check increased, a series of information was “activated” from Song Shuhang’s body, each displayed one after another.","There were phantoms of giant eyeballs...","Phantoms of single-legged striped dragons...","Phantoms of Dark Suns...","Phantoms of Daoists wrapped in the light of virtue...","Phantoms of the incomparably handsome White...","Phantoms of liquid metal fat balls...","Six different sources of eternal aura emerged from Song Shuhang, nearly blinding the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","In the myriad practitioners in the universe, it was rare for someone to encounter so much immortal information at the same time!","If it weren’t for her being a Dao Artifact’s manifestation, coming into contact with so much “immortal information” in one breath might have overwhelmed her and caused her to fall into a temporary unconscious state.","“Are these the ‘immortal information’ of the previous Heavenly Daos?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy pointed at the phantoms and asked.","Among them was the phantom of the Dark Sun, which hwo was familiar with as the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","“That’s correct... from the previous Heavenly Daos, apart from the First Heavenly Dao and the current Fifth Heavenly Dao who is your main body, the rest of the immortal information is all here,” Song Shuhang explained.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy fell silent for a long time upon hearing this, unable to find words to respond.","She really did not know how to follow up on Tyrannical Song’s words.","Ever since her interaction with Tyrannical Song began, she felt that he was never not showing off. What made her even more uncomfortable was that it all had been her either actively cooperating with him or forcing him to show off.","Besides... Tyrannical Song, can you still claim that you’re not coveting my body? Clearly, this is your way of collecting the immortal information of the Fifth Heavenly Dao through me, right?","“No, Senior. Meeting you was an utter coincidence. I had no idea that the Spirit River Su Clan was concealing the Fifth Heavenly Dao,” Song Shuhang shook his head, “Moreover, my Full Body Semi-Immortal Transformation is already complete; my bones, muscles, skin, and flesh have all achieved Semi-immortalization and no longer lack immortal information.”","Of course, if he could collect the immortal information of all the previous Heavenly Daos, he wouldn’t reject it. At the very least, it could satisfy his collecting hobby to a small extent.","“How did you acquire the ‘immortal information’ of the Fourth Heavenly Dao?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked, still somewhat uneasy.","“Regarding the information of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, Senior White and I used the Sage of Confucianism’s ‘Devouring Talent’ to nibble it off from him. Actually, one of the issues we are facing now is how to deal with the crisis of the ‘Fourth Heavenly Dao’. If we cannot resolve it, he might destroy the entire myriad practitioners in the universe,” Song Shuhang took this opportunity to describe the situation with the Dark Sun to the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","He shared in detail the process of discovering the ‘virus’, finding the manipulator behind the scenes, and the information about it with the Fairy.","“I hadn’t expected you to accomplish so much,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy felt pleased to hear that Song Shuhang and ‘Fellow Daoist White’ had worked together, nearly achieving a permanent suppression of the aftermath of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, the ‘Black Sun’, and even used a certain secret technique to devour ‘immortal information’ from it during that process.","As she said this, she glanced at Sixteen from the Spirit River Su Clan, who was undergoing a change, and said, “Sixteen has tried every means to recommend me to you, probably eyeing my body. She wants me to complete the missing ‘Fifth Heavenly Dao’ immortal information for you.”","At those words, Song Shuhang felt a warmth inside.","“I heard you have a space spell that can cause hair to grow rapidly?” the sentient treasure of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy materialized, reaching up to touch her bare scalp and inquiring.","Song Shuhang nodded, “It’s a ‘small hair growing technique’ created by a Senior of mine, and it works very well.”","Moreover, Dharma King Creation had made the technique open-access; anyone who wanted to learn it could do so.","“Teach me this technique, and I’ll take you to experience the ‘immortal information’ of the Fifth Heavenly Dao... but, I can’t guarantee whether you will obtain anything ‘immortal,'” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy stated.","This was merely her looking for an excuse to fulfill Sixteen’s wish—in fact, it was not difficult for her, with her state of ascension, to regrow any lost hair.","“Thank you, Senior.” Song Shuhang extended his hand to jot down the principles of the ‘small hair growing technique’ and pass them to the sentient treasure of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","After looking through ‘small hair growing technique’, the sentient treasure of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy nodded in satisfaction, “The Daoist friend who invented this technique is quite interesting.”","In the meantime, she silently practiced the ‘small hair growing technique’, and red hair that reached her back quickly regrew. However, her main body was still transformed into the blade in Song Shuhang’s hand, so no visible changes could be seen for the time being.","“Not bad, I’m very satisfied. So now, as agreed, I’ll take you to experience the ‘immortal information’ of the Fifth Heavenly Dao. The principle that the Fifth Heavenly Dao attained immortality through was ‘Reincarnation’, and her reason for stepping down was also due to ‘Reincarnation’,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy explained.","“Didn’t the Fifth Heavenly Dao step down because her experiments on becoming ‘detached’ went awry?” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","If that was the case, the Fifth Heavenly Dao was indeed a unique existence among the previous Heavenly Daos.","“She did not research ‘detachment’... but she indeed went awry,” replied the Reincarnation Blade Fairy calmly. “While in office, she researched the Infernal Realm, the Ghost Realm, and the principles of reincarnation and rebirth. Eventually, she found that the rules of death in the myriad practitioners in the universe were too simplistic and disorganized, lacking a comprehensive system. Thus, during her tenure, apart from confronting the remnants of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, she spent the rest of her time perfecting the ‘Reincarnation System’.”","In the final step, the Fifth Heavenly Dao transformed herself into the cycle of reincarnation, using her body of the Heavenly Dao to cast the foundation of reincarnation!","“The very foundation of reincarnation is what I am about to introduce you to now,” said the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, and utilizing the ‘human-saber fusion’ state, she led Song Shuhang’s consciousness downwards.","They plunged into an endless abyss...","“`"]},{"number":3092,"title":"Chapter 3092 - 3090: Tyrannical Song, you’ve finally come to pick me up!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3092: Chapter 3090: Tyrannical Song, you’ve finally come to pick me up!","This “sinking” was also not a physical descent, just as when Song Shuhang’s consciousness had “sublimed” and come into contact with the “Divine Show Saint Rules.”","He had originally thought that he would have to “sink” until reaching the foundation of Reincarnation before coming in contact with the “Immortal Information” of the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","But during the process of sinking, Song Shuhang’s consciousness was already continuously coming into contact with the data of “Reincarnation + Immortality.”","The “passage” through which he sank was infused with the “law and dharma” of the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","The Immortal Information belonging to the Fifth Heavenly Dao kept emerging.","Then... they actively reached out to Song Shuhang, through his consciousness feeding back to his fleshly body on the Su Clan’s Ancestor Star, reinforcing his “mental energy.”","Now that Song Shuhang’s entire body, flesh, bones, and skin had completed Sub-immortalization, even the “Calculation Ability” that needed to be connected later already had Daoist Senior waiting to load cheats for him.","Now, even the last flaw, “mental energy,” has begun to sub-immortalize, transitioning from Immortal-level “immortal yuan” to “Sub-immortal Power.” Combined with the fat whale golden core, its power could rise to another level.","If this wave of Reinforcement is completed and after having the “Daozi calculation cheat” loaded, Tyrannical Song would truly be a little immortal.","Apart from the Will of the Heavens, there would be no one else who could harm him!","...","...","In Song Shuhang’s hands.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy had been paying close attention to his state.","When she saw the “Immortal Information” of the Fifth Heavenly Dao actively making contact with Song Shuhang, her eyelids twitched slightly.","The affinity was too strong!","The “Immortal Information” of the Fifth Heavenly Dao had no conflict when merging with Song Shuhang, as if it were returning to its mother’s home.","“If you weren’t male, I’d have suspected that you might be a reincarnation of my true self,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said aloud.","“Perhaps it’s because I carry the ‘Immortal Information’ of the past Heavenly Daos, and with so much of it, my body has become attractive to ‘Immortal Information’?” Song Shuhang said. “The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy is a kind Senior, or perhaps she is intentionally helping me?”","In the process of coming into contact with Reincarnation Immortal Data, he could clearly sense the gentle emotions contained within this power of immortality.","—To use his own “Immortal Body” as foundation to perfect the Reincarnation System for the myriad practitioners in the universe was, in itself, a very compassionate act.","As an Immortal Heavenly Dao, having already detached from Life and Death and out of sympathy for all beings, at the cost of its own “Body of Eternity,” it perfected the Reincarnation System to complete the cycle of life for all beings in the Myriad Realms.","To have such a “Heavenly Dao” is the fortune of all beings.","“By the way, was the Reincarnation System imperfect during the reign of the 1-4th Heavenly Daos?” Song Shuhang asked again.","The 1-4th Heavenly Daos, that’s half the number of the Heavenly Daos.","Yet it wasn’t until the Fifth Heavenly Dao that the Reincarnation began to be perfected?","“In ancient times, there might have been a ‘Reincarnation System’ for that era. However, as times changed, the old Reincarnation System seemed too simple and chaotic, unable to meet the demands of the new era, and even leading to the collapse of reincarnation in some worlds,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said.","These problems exploded in the era of the Fifth Heavenly Dao—she even suspected whether the malfunction was caused by the predecessor Will of the Heavens messing things up during his term.","“So, is the Reincarnation System running smoothly now?” Song Shuhang asked.","“It’s running smoothly, but even the current Reincarnation System can’t be called ‘perfect.’ Over these many years, the system centered on the eternal body of the Wielder of the Will is still evolving and being completed... We’re here,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said softly.","“Still evolving and being completed?” The next moment, Song Shuhang felt his consciousness hit the bottom.","At the same time, everything around him began to brighten.","The source of the light was a huge ‘seal.’","The body of the seal was like glass gemstones, with ice crystal-like energy flowing within.","Countless passages were connected to this great seal.","This was the foundation of Reincarnation, evolved from the “Body of Eternity” of the Fifth Heavenly Dao and manifested as the “Reincarnation Seal.”","Song Shuhang could vaguely sense that all planes of the myriad practitioners in the universe were connected to this “Reincarnation Seal.”","Countless passages on the seal manifested the Six Paths of Reincarnation.","However, Song Shuhang couldn’t see the details of these “Reincarnations”—the Reincarnation Blade Fairy brought him to see the ‘seal,’ not the process of Reincarnation.","“Is the body of the Fifth Heavenly Dao in this ‘seal’?” Song Shuhang clasped his hands together and bowed to the Reincarnation Seal.","“That’s right.” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy said, “Come closer, hold one hand on me and lightly touch the seal with the other. The time you can touch it is limited, so how much ‘Immortal’ related information you can get depends on your own fortune. You only have one chance.”","Song Shuhang nodded, followed the instructions of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, approached the Reincarnation Seal, and gently touched it.","“Slip your hand a little,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy reminded.","Song Shuhang was stunned: “That doesn’t seem very nice?”","As they spoke, his current fleshly body, due to the ‘Sub-immortalization’ of immortal energy, began to automatically operate the “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique.”","The Reincarnation Seal seemed to react as well, resonating faintly with Song Shuhang.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang exclaimed—”The Fifth Heavenly Dao, does it resonate with my ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?”","In his mind, he immediately recalled the figure of Senior White.","The “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique” was a masterpiece of Wielder of the Will White.","Could it be that because it’s also a creation, it resonated?","As he pondered, the Reincarnation Seal actively transmitted a large amount of “Immortal Data,” rushing toward him.","More importantly, Song Shuhang sensed that this “Immortal Data” seemed adjusted especially for him—it matched him perfectly!","On the side.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy furrowed her brow—was the seal being too proactive today?","From start to finish, it seemed to be cooperating with Song Shuhang’s actions.","Did Tyrannical Song possess a charm specifically for primordial items?","Would other primordial weapons, primordial treasures, or rulers of the Netherworld also unwittingly aid Tyrannical Song, allowing him to gather an unprecedented Sub-immortal Body?","“You’ve come to fetch me!” At that moment, a voice came from the seal.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “???”","Song Shuhang was also startled: “Fetch you? Me?”","“Yes... Tyrannical Song, you have finally come to fetch me,” the voice continued.","It was calling ‘Tyrannical Song.’","Which meant the other party recognized him and had not mistaken him for someone else.","“It’s me, it’s me, I am buzzing—” the voice said anxiously.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Unseal! Unleash the secret techniques! Let the memories return!” the voice kept reminding. It seemed unable to call out its own identity, so it could only hint and remind desperately.","As Song Shuhang heard this, a possibility suddenly struck him.","He raised his index and middle fingers in his consciousness: “Clone, unseal.”"]},{"number":3093,"title":"Chapter 3093 - 3091: Memories of Tens of Millions of Screens and the Respectable Fifth Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["Chapter 3093: Chapter 3091: Memories of Tens of Millions of Screens and the Respectable Fifth Heavenly Dao","Clone Song Two—this was Song Shuhang’s bold guess!","—The clone Song Two that had previously gone missing along with Lady Onion, Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and the inner demon of Scarlet Heaven Sword!","Why had the ‘immortal information’ from the Fifth Heavenly Dao been flocking to him as he came along?","Moreover, why did this ‘immortal information’ seem as though it had been adjusted to specifically suit him?","Could it be that in the shadows, there was already someone silently completing everything for him?","Establishing a good relationship with the Fifth Heavenly Dao on his behalf, adjusting the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s ‘immortal information’ ahead of time, and then waiting here for him to catch up?","Thus, he thought of Song Two.","If it were a few months ago, Song Shuhang’s thoughts would not have been so bold, nor his imagination so expansive.","But ever since he found out that the pot Song Muhead was actually his own big pot, Song Shuhang became more daring in his ideas and thoughts about the ‘past’.","Therefore, he attempted to form handprints, unlocking his ‘clone’.","Whoosh whoosh whoosh—","A tide-like surging sound emanated from the Great Seal, the secret clone technique took effect!","Not long ago, ever since clone Song Two had disappeared, Song Shuhang’s ‘secret clone technique’ skill had ‘greyed out’—becoming non-activatable and unable to cancel the clone.","But now, this ‘greyed out’ secret technique was reactivated.","Amidst the surging roar of waves, a joyful voice faintly transmitted, “I’m back.”","—Song Shuhang had guessed right!","The voice from inside the Great Seal was undoubtedly that of clone Song Two.","“Although I don’t know what happened to you during this time... welcome back,” Song Shuhang, maintaining the handprints for ‘retrieving the clone’, said softly.","Rustle rustle—In those waves of cheerful tides, from the ‘Great Seal’, a continuous flow of power began to merge into the main body of Song Shuhang.","...","...","By his side, Reincarnation Blade Fairy was completely stunned.","Why was Tyrannical Song’s clone inside the Great Seal formed from her main body’s Fifth Heavenly Dao using the ‘Immortal Body’?","Aren’t you just nineteen years old this year?","“What on earth is going on?” Reincarnation Blade Fairy tried to remain calm and asked composedly.","If not for the foundations laid down by hundreds of millions of activations of the ‘Saber-Nurturing Technique’, being a primordial treasure herself, she would have already drawn a saber and slashed upon seeing another’s clone hidden within the Great Seal formed by her main body!","“Reincarnation Blade Fairy, please be patient. Let me finish receiving my clone and synchronize the memories. Then, I will explain everything to you,” Song Shuhang said gently.","At the time, both Lady Onion, Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, the inner demon of Scarlet Heaven Sword + clone Song Two had simultaneously vanished.","Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber reappeared at the original spot just moments later, and even accomplished Lady Onion’s ‘eighth transformation,’ allowing Song Shuhang, this ‘Nine Transformations,’ to inherit him.","Moreover, regarding Lady Onion, Song Shuhang also obtained information from Loli Shi and Loli Zhu—Lady Onion appeared to be in a distant future and had undergone a huge transformation, turning into a short-haired young woman.","However, there were no updates regarding Inner Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and clone Song Two.","Now it seemed, Song Two might have returned to the past and made contact with the Fifth Heavenly Dao?","Whoosh—","The water sound inside the Great Seal stopped.","After a long separation, clone Song Two finally completed the ‘liberation’, the secret clone technique was unlocked, and he merged back into the main body.","At the same time, he brought with him a flood of memories + a massive amount of immortal information.","This section of immortal information was a gift from the Fifth Heavenly Dao and also the effort of Song two’s clone, having already been polished by him and perfectly adapted to the main body of Song Shuhang.","Upon entering his body, Song Shuhang’s fleshly body on Su Clan’s Ancestor Star perfectly received this “immortal information,” and the “immortal energy” inside his body completely transformed, originating from the source of energy, into “sub-immortal.”","The change in energy caused Song Shuhang’s consciousness to shake, and he was in a trance for a moment.","In that moment of distraction, the memories brought back by the clone, Song two, transformed into numerous images before him.","These images did not play in sequence but instantly became thousands of snapshots, forming screens, and projected into the memories in Song Shuhang’s mind.","These screens spoke simultaneously, each playing their content...","What Song Shuhang saw was not only Song two’s memories but also some other images.","For example, on a particularly large and conspicuous screen, he saw an exceptionally beautiful Fairy, barefoot descending into the depths of the abyss.","This Fairy bore an eighty percent resemblance to the “Reincarnation Blade Fairy”—capable of pulling off a bald hairstyle attractively.","Was it the Fifth Heavenly Dao?","At that time, in the image, the Fifth Heavenly Dao had all her “immortal information” converged.","If his guess about her identity was not made, it would have been impossible to discern her identity as a “Heavenly Dao.”","At this time point... she was already in the final step of perfecting “reincarnation,” nearly ready to step down from the seat of Heavenly Dao.","After arriving in the endless abyss, the form of the Fifth Heavenly Dao began to crystallize, quickly transforming into a “Giant Seal.”","Based on this Giant Seal, a new cycle of reincarnation was constructed!","Embodied in reincarnation, her virtue was boundless.","The Giant Seal formed, but the Fifth Heavenly Dao seemed to have paid a great price—not even a single Heavenly Dao’s immortal form could construct the entire “reincarnation” structure in one breath!","After investing her all, what was constructed was merely the rudimentary form of reincarnation.","And it seemed that the Fifth Heavenly Dao was already prepared for this.","Once the Reincarnation Seal was formed and the Reincarnation System was established, “light points” from the Fifth Heavenly Dao emerged from within the Reincarnation Seal, proactively entering into the Reincarnation System, and began to gradually evolve and finalize the system.","Song Shuhang’s gaze shifted from the giant screen to several smaller screens beside it.","In the main world, the Human World, a Fairy was born... Years later, she grew into a petite and cute Fairy, her surname Su.","Years later, in the Dragon Realm, a white real dragon with exceptionally pure bloodline was born, eventually evolving into one of the leading clans of the White Dragon Clan.","After an even longer time, in the Beast Realm, a simple and innocent young girl was born... Unlike the girl surnamed Su and the white real dragon, this simple young girl lived an ordinary life, married ordinarily, had children ordinarily, and ended her ordinary life.","Song Shuhang continued to move his gaze across these smaller screens.","He discovered that the girls on these small screens were from different times and eras.","The time span covered was immense, stretching continuously from the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","The one commonality was that, after their lives ended, they would return to the “Reincarnation Seal,” to supplement and evolve the Reincarnation System.","“Is this the method by which the Fifth Heavenly Dao perfected ‘reincarnation’?” Song Shuhang felt increasing admiration for the Fifth Heavenly Dao in his heart.","This benevolent Heavenly Dao, her actions are worthy of respect by any being in the myriad realms of the universe.","While pondering, Song Shuhang’s gaze fell upon a particularly small screen.","This time, what was born into the world was not a young girl.","From humans, to dragons, to beast cultivators, to other races, the Fifth Heavenly Dao had nearly experienced them all.","And this time... she transformed into an inanimate object.","Song Shuhang’s expression became complex.","He saw the Fifth Heavenly Dao begin to transform into a plant."]},{"number":3094,"title":"Chapter 3094 - 3092: Spirit of Self-Sacrifice","paragraphs":["Chapter 3094: Chapter 3092: Spirit of Self-Sacrifice","“`","The amount of information was overwhelming, and the impact was too intense.","It was so extensive that Song Shuhang’s face couldn’t properly express the ‘meaning’, even if he stood there without wearing a mask, his expressions couldn’t be read! This was a very rare occurrence.","It’s an onion...","On the smallest screen, what the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy had transformed into was a green onion shoot, which could be seen everywhere, with nothing special about it.","——I don’t want to be human anymore!","Seeing this scene, Song Shuhang immediately thought of Lady Onion.","Was it a coincidence?","“There usually aren’t such coincidences in this world. The reincarnations constructed by the Fifth Heavenly Dao include the Spirit River Su Clan and the White Dragon Clan, which means that even through reincarnation, as long as she comes into contact with cultivation, her aptitude will still be top-notch. As for Lady Onion... no, her aptitude... it’s top-tier,” Song Shuhang murmured softly.","As soon as he finished speaking, in the plot shown on the small screen, a pair of thick and powerful hands grabbed the green onion shoot, laying it flat on the chopping board, with a shiny kitchen knife about to come down.","Just as the mighty avatar of the Fifth Heavenly Dao was about to be chopped...","But at that moment, the owner of the powerful hands stopped and said aloud, “Wielder of the Will.”","Song Shuhang pressed a hand to his forehead and gently massaged it.","There was no doubt about it.","It was Lady Onion!","The owner of those powerful hands... was Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven!","Although I don’t know how Senior Scarlet Heaven was able to see that a green onion shoot had the ‘Wielder of the Will’.","But I must say, his discernment was incredibly sharp!","This onion indeed has the foundation of the ‘Wielder of the Will’—because she is the Heavenly Dao! Ahhh!","The Wielder of the Will is not necessarily about becoming the Heavenly Dao after proving one’s Dao and achieving eternity. She came down from the position of the Will of the Heavens, so saying she has the Wielder of the Will is not wrong at all.","If she doesn’t have the ‘Wielder of the Will’, then there wouldn’t be many in the myriad practitioners in the universe who could be called ‘Wielder of the Will’.","That being said.","Since Lady Onion is the reincarnation of the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","“Am I doomed?” Song Shuhang rubbed his cheeks.","My employee is actually an incarnation of the Heavenly Dao.","Yet, I often pinch her green onion shoot.","And even practice the Saber-Nurturing Technique on her.","I’ve turned her, who clearly has the ‘Wielder of the Will’, into a homebody onion.","Moreover, I still owe her part of her salary, which I haven’t been able to pay up to now.","To dare not pay the salary of Lady Onion, who possesses the ‘Wielder of the Will’...","Question: How much longer can I, Tyrannical Song, survive?","How can I explain my relationship with the Fifth Heavenly Dao to the Reincarnation Blade Fairy so she won’t cut me down?","Do I have to wait until I truly prove my Dao and achieve eternity?","Because, only the Heavenly Dao can get away with not paying the Heavenly Dao a salary!","In a flash, Tyrannical Song’s thoughts were in turmoil.","“If... there is still a chance, I have to prepare a batch of spirit stones to properly pay Lady Onion her salary,” Song Shuhang chuckled.","Though, I don’t know if I could save up enough spirit stones.","To be honest.","Even knowing Lady Onion’s identity, Song Shuhang’s heart couldn’t immediately bring together the silly onion and the image of the Fifth Heavenly Dao; the gap between the impressions they gave was too vast.","Actually, these two indeed could be considered as two separate entities prior to the return. However, the ‘beautiful lady’ visual of Lady Onion did share a striking resemblance with the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","“Speaking of which, Lady Onion seems to have changed a lot in the future...”","Perhaps, when we meet again, she’ll reveal her innate skills and become a very dependable ally?","Song Shuhang’s gaze began to move away from the ‘Lady Onion’ screen, starting to search for information about his clone, Song Two—Lady Onion’s and the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s relationship was unexpectedly deep.","“`","But there were other matters that captured his attention.","How had clone Song Two ended up in the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s “Reincarnation Seal,” and how had he become a link in the Great Seal?","In the scene where the avatar of the Fifth Heavenly Dao transforms into the Reincarnation Seal, there was no trace of clone Song Two.","That is to say... did clone Song Two enter that “Great Seal” later on?","What had he experienced during that period?","Song Shuhang’s gaze searched swiftly.","During this search, his gaze once again swept over the images of the White Dragon and Su Clan’s Little Fairy—The White Dragon sister being able to become the guardian of Sixteen without any mutual rejection might be because the Spirit River Su Clan and the real dragon, White Dragon Clan, could trace their origins to a common source.","The White Dragon sister, Su Clan’s Sixteen, Lady Onion, they all had ties with the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","There wouldn’t happen to be yet another fairy by my side who is connected to the Fifth Heavenly Dao, would there?","While he was pondering, the screen that belonged to clone Song Two finally appeared before his eyes.","To be precise, it was the screen about this segment of memory that actively surfaced in front of Song Shuhang—it had a built-in search function.","The starting point of clone Song Two’s memory was when he split from Song Shuhang and was engulfed alongside Lady Onion and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber into the dimensional vortex.","This was also the point where their memories diverged.","On the screen of memories, Lady Onion is sucked into the dimensional black hole caused by the explosion of the Void Sun, screaming in a high-pitched voice.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber automatically unsheathed to protect her master.","Clone Song Two, grabbing the Scarlet Heaven Sword of the Inner Demon, also entered the black hole vortex, trying to fish out Lady Onion.","However, just as they were clutching Lady Onion and attempting to pull her out, the dimensional black hole suddenly closed, severing their retreat.","The exit disappeared, and they were sucked into the dimensional black hole, drawn by the swallowing power, sinking deeper into the abyss.","Clone Song Two held tightly onto Lady Onion the entire time.","“Boss Song, don’t let go... never let go,” Lady Onion cried out in panic.","“I... I’ll try my best,” clone Song Two gritted his teeth, dragging Lady Onion along.","A man, a green onion, a saber, and a sword struggled desperately in the dimensional black hole.","No one knew how much time had passed.","In the vortex of the black hole, another anomaly occurred—some mechanism within Lady Onion was activated.","Clone Song Two felt a force pulling at Lady Onion, wanting to drag her away, to swallow her.","His instincts told him that if Lady Onion was dragged away... she would likely disappear without a trace.","“I am in clone form; even if I vanish, my main body can use secret techniques to summon me again. But Lady Onion doesn’t have this capability.” Thinking this, clone Song Two made his final decision.","He forcefully pulled Lady Onion away and tossed her aside.","Then, embracing the thought of self-sacrifice, he hurled himself at that “swallowing power.”","If something must be swallowed, let it be me, release my hardworking Lady Onion!","Like the virtuous lamia, being a clone that could be infinitely resurrected through the main body, Song Two faced self-sacrifice without changing his expression.","And then... he lost consciousness.","By the time he awoke, he was already within the “Giant Seal.”","He had not died nor vanished.","It was merely a form of “return.”","Taking with him “the experiences and insights of a lifetime,” he returned to this Reincarnation Seal to perfect the cycle of reincarnation.","In the process of perfecting it.","The names such as Song, “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique,” “Saber-Nurturing Technique,” and so on, were all recorded within the “Reincarnation Seal.”","From the Reincarnation Seal, “immortal information” reciprocated, nourishing clone Song Two’s body.","This process lasted a very long time... it felt as long as two or three hundred years!","Two to three hundred years was about the time when Lady Onion came into existence."]},{"number":3095,"title":"Chapter 3095 - 3093: Agreements and Commitments","paragraphs":["Chapter 3095: Chapter 3093: Agreements and Commitments","“So that’s how it is, the one who should have ‘returned’ to the Reincarnation Seal was supposed to be Lady Onion. When the time was ripe—after Lady Onion’s cycle of reincarnation ended, she would return to the Reincarnation Seal, feed back her life’s experiences to it, becoming a part of the ‘Reincarnation System’ completion.”","“Moreover, Lady Onion was the final stop for the completion of the ‘Reincarnation System’... which means, after her return, the Fifth Heavenly Dao would no longer continue with the reincarnation and transmigration project.”","“Because the entire Reincarnation System was nearing perfection. Unless something unexpected occurred, the system could meet the needs of the myriad practitioners in the universe. Therefore, after Lady Onion’s return, the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s Reincarnation Cycle would be sealed, forming a perfect loop, with beginning and end interlocking like an Ouroboros, transforming into a circle.”","“And this was why the clone Song Two had an intuitive hunch, feeling that once Lady Onion returned, she would completely disappear. Because once Lady Onion returned, it marked the end of the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s cycle of reincarnation. So, it gave Song Two’s clone a kind of illusion.”","“In fact, under normal circumstances, after Lady Onion’s cycle of reincarnation ended, she, like previous avatars of the Fifth Heavenly Dao, would return to the Reincarnation Seal, guarding the Six Paths of Reincarnation, becoming part of the Reincarnation System which is an aspect of the Fifth Heavenly Dao. Essentially, it’s almost like returning home to inherit the throne.”","“But because of the misunderstanding caused by this intuition, as Lady Onion was about to be consumed, Song Two’s clone forcefully pushed her away, taking her place in returning to the Reincarnation Seal...”","“The life experiences of Song Two’s clone merged into the ‘Reincarnation,’ becoming a part of completing the Reincarnation System... However, he was not Lady Onion, not an incarnation of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation. So, he couldn’t become the last part of the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s Reincarnation Cycle, the final bite of the Ouroboros didn’t quite latch on.”","“Fortunately... from what we see now, the Reincarnation Seal is very satisfied with the life experiences of Song Two’s clone. So instead of directly grinding him into dust, it took him in, allowing him to stay within the Reincarnation Seal and even giving him the chance to be nourished by the immortal information.”","When it came to ‘life experiences’ and ‘understandings of death,’ Song Shuhang had confidence in himself.","He didn’t dare say he was the one who died the most throughout history, but over the past year, his number of deaths definitely topped the charts in the myriad realms.","These painful past experiences are an additional harvest for the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s perfection of the ‘Reincarnation System.’ So, even though the last bite of the Ouroboros wasn’t securely fastened, the Reincarnation Seal still treated Song Two’s clone kindly.","“Although the Reincarnation Seal is very satisfied with the life experiences of Song Two’s clone, Lady Onion still needs to be found,” Song Shuhang gently pressed on the ‘Reincarnation Seal’ and nodded his head.","No one can replace the significance of Lady Onion’s existence.","Now that Lady Onion has disappeared... she might have reached the ‘distant future,’ perhaps appearing at some node there.","“I will find a way to bring her back,” Song Shuhang promised to the Reincarnation Seal.","Bringing back Lady Onion isn’t about having her immediately end her ‘reincarnation’ and return to the Reincarnation Seal.","There are two conditions for returning to the Reincarnation Seal.","One is the natural end of Lady Onion’s life cycle, the completion of her onion life.","The other is for Lady Onion to step onto the immortal path, to prove her Dao and become an immortal onion.","After proving her Dao and attaining immortality, there would be more choices available. Lady Onion could choose to return in her onion form, or ‘cut’ out the Fifth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation Light, letting that Reincarnation Light carry the mark of her life cycle back to the Reincarnation Seal.","Song Shuhang hoped to have Lady Onion return to the Reincarnation Seal through the second method—so, if he found Lady Onion, he would use all his efforts, resources, and connections to develop her. He was determined to make her prove her Dao and achieve immortality in the shortest possible time!","After receiving Tyrannical Song’s promise, the energy inside the Reincarnation Seal churned joyfully. She had a good impression of Tyrannical Song and was willing to believe his promise at this moment.","The task of finding Lady Onion, she gladly entrusted to Tyrannical Song.","To facilitate future contact, the Reincarnation Seal left a ‘mark’ on Tyrannical Song’s arm.","Then, Song Shuhang’s consciousness returned.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy gently led him, as his consciousness left the Reincarnation Seal and returned to the Reincarnation Hall on Ancestor Star.","...","...","In the Su Clan’s Ancestral Star, within the Reincarnation Hall.","Song Shuhang’s entire body once again entered the pure lustrous body state, in which all his immortal yuan was transformed into a ‘Sub-immortal’ state within his glass-like body.","The Sub-immortal energy incessantly circulated within his lustrous body, as beautiful as a work of art.","“It’s a success,” The White Dragon murmured softly.","She knew that with Tyrannical Song taking action, he would never return empty-handed.","To this point, Song Shuhang had assembled the immortal information from the 2nd to the 8th Heavenly Dao... Soon after, he would gain an additional cheat from the 8.5th Heavenly Daozi.","“Yes, it was a success,” Song Shuhang opened his eyes, the flawless state of his glass-like body slowly fading away.","“Can you now explain what’s going on? Why was your clone in the Reincarnation Seal?” the voice of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy resonated from his hand.","“Fairy, please be patient,” Song Shuhang released his grip, letting go of the blade.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy transformed into her human form, her dazzling red hair flying about.","“My ‘clone’ entering the Reincarnation Seal was actually due to a ‘misunderstanding’. It should have been my... dear friend Lady Onion who was supposed to return to the Reincarnation Seal, but since my clone did not understand the situation, thinking that Lady Onion might encounter an accident, he pushed her aside and took her place. Then, he was absorbed by the Reincarnation Seal,” Song Shuhang explained.","The White Dragon: “...”","Since when did Lady Onion become your dear friend?","And how could Lady Onion be related to the ‘Fifth Heavenly Dao’?","There’s so much information here.","“After being absorbed by the Reincarnation Seal, the ‘lifetime experiences’ of my clone were also absorbed, becoming material to perfect the Reincarnation. I believe, Fairy, your familiarity with me and the feeling toward my techniques all stem from this,” Song Shuhang added.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy tapped her chin thoughtfully, nodding slightly.","“Regarding Lady Onion, you can rest assured, Fairy. I will find a way to bring her back,” Song Shuhang continued.","He glossed over some content while explaining his clone.","The ‘Ouroboros’ Reincarnation of the Fifth Heavenly Dao might likely trigger a temporal loop.","The disappearance of clone Song Two in the main world was an event that happened this year, yet the time he spent inside the Reincarnation Seal was entirely unsynchronized with the main world. This was also why he reacted so emotionally upon meeting with his main body.","However, these aspects are something the Reincarnation Blade Fairy might understand even more about, and so Song Shuhang didn’t waste too many words on them.","“So, essentially, the ‘immortal information’ of the Fifth Heavenly Dao has belonged to you all along. Your coming here was just a formality,” The White Dragon said.","The clones of the Tyrannical Song family and those of Fellow Daoist White’s family shared a curious similarity. Both belonged to a very capable series, where the main body could just lie down and relax while the clone silently took care of everything, an enviable situation.","Song Shuhang gave a sheepish smile, then he turned his gaze toward Sixteen’s location.","“The evolution aspect for Sixteen, I can also lend her a helping hand,” Song Shuhang extended an arm, revealing the mark of the Reincarnation Seal."]},{"number":3096,"title":"Chapter 3096 - 3094: Seven Blade Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 3096: Chapter 3094: Seven Blade Tyrannical Song","After recalling his clone, Song Two, a vast array of memories returned to him, along with fragments of memories from the “Fifth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation”.","Therefore, Song Shuhang was well-versed in the “Transformation Process” that Su Clan’s Sixteen was currently undergoing—it was all thanks to Song Two.","The Spirit River Su Clan was the first stop in the reincarnation project initiated by the “Fifth Heavenly Dao” and held a particularly special strategic position.","As this was the first experiment, the Fifth Heavenly Dao made extensive preparations before reincarnation and endowed the initial reincarnated beings with a lot of innate powers. This also led to the descendants of the Spirit River Su Clan inheriting some special innate abilities.","Among them, the talent to transform into a saber, just like the “Dao Artifact·Reincarnation Blade”, was the strongest hidden innate skill of the Su Clan.","However, because the Fifth Heavenly Dao was a fairy herself, this talent was slightly biased towards females over males, with most of the awakeners of this hidden talent being the fairy maidens of the Su Clan.","The ability was inherently more suitable for those with a “Fairy Physique”.","The number of male immortals in the Su Clan who could awaken this talent was relatively small.","The mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan, Su Clan’s Knot, was one who awakened this talent, but he was a mutated version—a Swordsmen.","If nothing unexpected happened, with Sixteen’s character and innate skill, upon activating her talent, she could potentially transform into a godly weapon similar to the Reincarnation Blade.","Normally, if a Saber woman had a dao companion, the two could grow together and rely on each other. The level of emotional closeness between them could exceed that of ordinary dao companions by several times.","—Because, aside from the typical romantic relationship, a Saber woman and her dao companion could also attain a state of “human-saber fusion” both physically and mentally, something ordinary dao companions could not achieve.","Moreover, there were techniques like the “Saber-Nurturing Technique” that could increase their daily closeness.","Even for those sabersmen who are like “Lonely Swordsmen” and have only their saber in their heart, desiring nothing else, obtaining a Saber woman would allow them to reap the benefits of both career and love.","However... between Song Shuhang and Su Clan’s Sixteen, there wasn’t any more time for “growing together”.","Time, that stingy boss, was always reluctant to give him more time to grow slowly.","If Su Clan’s Sixteen were to transform into a proper Saber woman, she could only add in some adult fun for Song Shuhang, but wouldn’t be able to join in the grand scheme that Song Shuhang was about to face.","It was all the world’s fault!","But deep down, Song Shuhang still hoped that in the upcoming events, he and Su Clan’s Sixteen could face them together just like any ordinary dao companions of a Saber woman.","—Hand in hand, retreating or advancing together, is also a pleasure for mature dao companions.","“Sixteen.” Song Shuhang softly called out to Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was in the midst of her transformation.","“Hmm.” Su Clan’s Sixteen, in the middle of her transformation, softly responded.","In this call and response, they had already completed a mental exchange.","Understanding is also a form of pleasure.","Song Shuhang rolled up his sleeves, revealing his “Reincarnation Seal” mark that was sparkling.","He took the initiative to partake in Sixteen’s transformation process.","“What does he want to do?” The White Dragon, resting on the neck of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, habitually coiled around—it was primarily because the aura on the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was somewhat similar to Sixteen’s, provoking an instinctive reaction from the White Dragon.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy seems to enjoy it, gently rubbing against the white dragon around her neck, and replied, “He probably wants to push Sixteen’s transformation even further. With the mark of the Reincarnation Seal, it might actually be successful.”","“What will happen if it goes one step further?” the White Dragon asked.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy herself was not sure and answered, “Become a top-tier Saber woman?”","“That sounds pretty good... but unfortunately, even a top-tier Saber woman seems to be lacking a little,” the White Dragon whispered.","She was well aware that the situation Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song was about to face would require at least Immortal-level strength to participate, and not even average Immortals could get involved.","Therefore...","The White Dragon sighed, “It would be nice if she could become a primordial treasure.”","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “...”","You guys still dare to say you’re not after me?","Even a top-tier Saber woman isn’t good enough, are you planning to fight the will of the heavens?","Wait a minute.","Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song seemed to actually plan to go against the Will of the Heavens.","Moreover...","Reincarnation Blade Fairy glanced at Tyrannical Song—his whole body in a Sub-immortal Mode was akin to a minor Will of the Heavens walking the main world.","For Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, it seemed that even top saber women were somewhat lacking in interest.","Only weapons at the pinnacle of Immortal level or dao artifacts would suit his hand.","“Actually, if the fairy maidens from the Spirit River Su Clan evolved their ‘innate abilities’ to the limit and transformed into top saber women, they could borrow my power at critical moments,” revealed the Reincarnation Blade Fairy—she wouldn’t let anyone underestimate the function of a saber woman!","The disciples of the Spirit River Su Clan, once they awoke their hidden innate skill, it was just like ‘Ancestral Return’.","At critical moments, by transforming into blades and connecting with her power, they could bring her power into the main world, allowing the Su Clan’s saber women to transform into Reincarnation Blades.","Moreover, since both parties were originally ‘of the same origin,’ their powers did not repel each other. The Reincarnation Blades transformed by the Su Clan’s saber women in a short span of time were no different from the true Reincarnation Blades and were indeed at the ‘dao artifact’ rank.","“I see, in that case, Sixteen and Shuhang have the opportunity to join hands and advance or retreat together,” The White Dragon smiled in relief, her smile akin to that of an old mother.","“Speaking of which, what dao artifacts does Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song possess?” asked the Reincarnation Blade Fairy—if Sixteen evolved into a top saber woman, perhaps she would soon have the chance to meet the other two dao artifacts in Tyrannical Song’s possession. As dao artifacts themselves, it would be good to get to know some information in advance, so things wouldn’t be too awkward when they met.","“They should be those two dao artifacts, first is the ‘big-eyed planet’ from the Second Wielder of the Will, a strategic weapon. Second is the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ from the third Heavenly Dao, which has already completed the Ninth Revolution,” replied The White Dragon.","“He already has a saber? And also a dao artifact-grade one? Then why is he flirting with the Spirit River Su Clan’s fairy maidens? What a scoundrel among sabersmen,” said the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","After thinking for a moment, The White Dragon said, “Double saber attack?”","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “...”","“Actually, beside the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, Shuhang also has a special sword, the Scarlet Heaven Sword. Although it appears as a sword, it’s actually a saber at heart. So, Triple Sword Style?” pondered The White Dragon.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “...”","“Right, within the Combined Magical Treasure of the thirty-three animals, there’s also ‘The Tyrant Cuttlefish’s Twin Blades,’ which are dual sabers in one. Tyrannical Song has two sets, making it four blades. So... Seven Blade Style?” The White Dragon got more excited as she spoke.","One saber in each hand, another gripped in the mouth, two sabers on the left leg, and two on the right leg, with a full split.","Seven Blade Tyrannical Song, scary, isn’t it?","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy was at a loss for words.","Clang~","At that moment, from the location of Song Shuhang and Su Clan’s Sixteen, a sharp sound of a blade unsheathing rang out.","Sixteen stretched out her arms, and a phantom of a saber emerged from her chest.","However, before Sixteen could fully transform into a saber woman, Song Shuhang stepped forward, extending his palm towards the phantom of the saber.","The phantom of the Reincarnation Seal brightened upon his arm.","Human-saber fusion.","A dazzling light halo enveloped Song Shuhang and Sixteen.","After a few breaths...","A small ‘Great Seal’ appeared before The White Dragon and the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: “???”","The White Dragon: “???”","Where’s the saber woman? What happened to the promised top saber woman? Where did she go?","And what about Tyrannical Song?","Where did that big Tyrannical Song go?","“Fusion?” The White Dragon wondered aloud.","Was this ‘Great Seal’ the Combined Evolution of Sixteen plus Song Shuhang?"]},{"number":3097,"title":"Chapter 3097 - 3095: The Only Guess in All Realms","paragraphs":["Chapter 3097: Chapter 3095: The Only Guess in All Realms","Why would the Saber woman mode of Sixteen + Song Shuhang turn into a Great Seal?","What is the principle behind this?","I can understand even if you transform into a Mother and Child Saber, or even dual swords.","But turning from a saber into a Great Seal, isn’t that a bit of a stretch? What is the connection between the two?","“The only connection between the two... might just be the Reincarnation Seal,” said the Reincarnation Blade Fairy as she looked up at the sky, her mood complex. Apparently, she hadn’t anticipated this scene either.","The White Dragon sister looked puzzled: “???”","She hadn’t dived into consciousness with Song Shuhang, nor had she come into contact with the Fifth Heavenly Dao, so she was unaware of the ‘Reincarnation Seal.’","But hearing the name ‘Reincarnation Seal,’ it clearly seems to be something that complements the Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade or something from the same origin, right?","Could it be that the Fifth Heavenly Dao has two Dao artifacts?","“The Reincarnation Seal is the foundation of the reincarnation reforged by the main body of my Fifth Heavenly Dao, transformed from her Body of Eternity. I just took Tyrannical Song there,” explained the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","The White Dragon sister blinked her eyes.","She had still underestimated the ability of Tyrannical Song to stir things up.","Is it worthy of being ‘Song•Anything-Can-Rub•Shuhang’?","—A top-notch Saber woman? A Saber woman who can temporarily manifest as a Dao artifact?","For Song Shuhang... it’s not just that!","Anything he comes into contact with, he always manages to rub a little something from it.","So, after assisting Sixteen in becoming a top-notch Saber woman, Song Shuhang even threw himself into the mix, using the Reincarnation Seal’s power to further himself and Sixteen, achieving a Combined Evolution.","Then the ‘Reincarnation Seal’ was conjured forth.","Just like the projection of the ‘Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade,’ the Combined Evolution of Tyrannical Song + Su Clan’s Sixteen materialized as ‘Reincarnation Seal,’ with power almost equal to the Reincarnation Seal itself.","“It can probably attack 2-3 times,” said Song Shuhang’s voice from within the Reincarnation Seal.","“It’s because my power is still too low. If I were stronger, we could bring forth more power,” said Sixteen somewhat unsatisfied, feeling discontent with the speed of her advancement, although she was already advancing rapidly.","“No worries, about power... we have plenty of opportunities to enhance it. The main thing is not to leave behind any hidden dangers but to take it step by step, steadily and surely,” Song Shuhang consoled.","Moreover, being able to hit the Reincarnation Seal 2-3 times after one fusion, the effect was already awesome. At a critical moment, it might even turn the tables—especially since the Fifth Heavenly Dao always bears a grudge against the Fourth Heavenly Dao. Power against the Fourth Heavenly Dao might at least double!","The White Dragon sister rolled her eyes.","In all the myriad realms, only you, Tyrannical Song, are not in a position to say that.","“Shuhang, next time before we merge for an evolution, let me do an experiment first. I have a conjecture that might enhance the ‘Reincarnation Seal’s’ power,” pondered Sixteen.","“I also just had a bold idea,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Then the two simultaneously voiced in unison as if by tacit agreement, “Before merging for an evolution, first maximize the ‘Saber Transformation’ power, borrowing the power of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy to evolve temporarily into a Dao artifact. On this basis, perform a Combined Evolution.”","By doing so, they could possibly bring the Reincarnation Blade’s power to its limits.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy said discontentedly, “Do you guys see me as a tool person?”","“My condolences,” consoled the White Dragon sister.","Whether a tool person or not, it didn’t really matter to the White Dragon sister. She felt that as long as Tyrannical Song’s Saber-Nurturing Technique was up to the mark by then, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy would be very willing to lend Tyrannical Song and Sixteen a helping hand.","After all, Tyrannical Song’s “Saber-Nurturing Technique” is a demonic technique considered secret by the Heavenly Dao and many rulers of the Netherworld.","“That’s about it, let’s end this mode for now. Maintaining this mode puts a lot of pressure on your body, Sixteen,” said Song Shuhang aloud.","“Release!” Sixteen softly exclaimed as the two exited the “Reincarnation Seal Mode”.","In the halo of light, Sixteen’s figure also transformed back to her human form.","The White Dragon danced around, leaving the neck of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, and landed back on Sixteen.","The abandoned Reincarnation Blade Fairy touched her neck—strangely enough, she felt somewhat nostalgic about the White Dragon entangled around her neck.","The White Dragon scarf provided warm and intimate protection.","“Could it be because part of the White Dragon Branch from the Dragon Realm, also has the bloodline of the Fifth Heavenly Dao reincarnation in their main body? Is that why I feel this nostalgia? Should I consider going to the Dragon Realm to find a White Dragon to bring back?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy thought to herself.","The White Dragon, unaware of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s lingering attachment, returned to Sixteen’s neck, coiled around it, and asked, “After becoming Saber Woman, do you feel any different? Has your body undergone any changes?”","“Hmm, besides the ‘dantian’, it seems there’s also another type of energy core in my body. I share the power of this energy core with all the other Sixteens; it’s also the foundation of my ability to transform into a blade,” Sixteen replied.","Besides that, her strength had also slightly increased.","Moreover, this trend of increase was still gently rising and hadn’t stopped.","Could this be the reward for her decision to preserve all ‘Sixteen personalities’?","“No other changes?” the White Dragon asked—she seemed to be expecting more significant reactions.","Sixteen shook her head.","The White Dragon looked somewhat disappointed.","Then, she turned to Song Shuhang and asked, “What about you, Shuhang? When you transformed into the Reincarnation Seal, did you feel any changes in your body, or did you have any special sensations?”","“I was just aiding Sixteen in evolving, transforming into the ‘Reincarnation Seal’, I actually only borrowed the Sub-immortal attribute of mine... so, in fact, my body didn’t undergo any changes,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","And now, as his entire being had turned ‘Sub-immortal’, his body was already hard to alter—even heavenly punishment couldn’t faze him now!","When the opportunity arises, he could cooperate with Daozi to try out the top dog of heavenly tribulations—the heavenly punishment.","“As for special sensations, there might be some,” Song Shuhang said, stroking his chin and closing his eyes to recall the sensations he felt during their combined evolution with Sixteen.","The biggest sensation should have been the overwhelming feeling of being connected with hundreds of ‘Mini-Sixteens’ and Su Clan’s Sixteen.","After a while,","Song Shuhang tried to summarize, “Unique in all the Myriad Realms, a legend amongst myriad practitioners in the universe?”","This was an experience that even Daozi, who utilized a loophole to prove his Dao as the 8.5th Heavenly Dao, had never felt.","Heavenly Dao does not necessarily possess or understand the ‘principles of Time’.","But every Heavenly Dao might interfere with ‘Time’.","This interference might even go unnoticed by the ‘Heavenly Dao’ itself.","For instance... the ‘Time River Sea Urchin Spur’ that he saw back then. If it truly exists and isn’t just conjecture, every sea urchin spur on the river of time undergoes many different changes.","But perhaps all ‘Historical Heavenly Daos’ on each sea urchin spur are the same?","Of course, this was Song Shuhang’s speculation.","It’s not certain.","“Anyway, let’s go back to the ‘Ancient Nether World’ and continue planting columns,” Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","Historical ‘Prospective Heavenly Dao’ all went to the Ancient Nether to plant columns.","Senior White is still waiting there."]},{"number":3098,"title":"Chapter 3098 - 3096: The Stage Is Set, Just Waiting for the Actors to Take Their Places","paragraphs":["Chapter 3098: Chapter 3096: The Stage Is Set, Just Waiting for the Actors to Take Their Places","“You’re leaving so soon, don’t you want to stay a bit longer?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked.","In the past, when disciples from the Su Clan finished their evolution with her, they would try to stay longer.","If she was awake, she could take some time to give speeches and provide guidance to the disciples of the Su Clan.","If she was asleep, just observing the nature of the primordial treasure itself could bring endless enlightenment to the Su Clan’s disciples.","But now, after the evolution was complete, Tyrannical Song and Su Clan’s Sixteen seemed eager to leave, causing her to feel a touch of disappointment—a twinge in her heart. Even if you have two primordial treasures at home, making such treasures seem less precious, you could still show some respect and stay a bit longer, just for courtesy.","“There’s no need to be polite, Reincarnation Blade Senior, just leave us an access permission... We’ll come to visit whenever we can. We’re a bit busy today, we have to go to the Ancient Nether and plant some pillars,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","Well, when someone says ‘don’t stay any longer,’ it’s generally just being polite, so he figured the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was probably just being courteous with them as well.","“Fine, I’ll give you the permission to open the door. But every time you come over, give me a shout first. If I’m awake, then come over,” the Reincarnation Blade Senior declared.","“Then Senior, we’ll see you in a bit,” Song Shuhang waved his hand—he would definitely come over whenever he was free. Even if his main body was busy, he could use a clone to accompany Su Clan’s Sixteen and observe the form of the Reincarnation Blade’s primordial treasure, which would be beneficial for Sixteen’s cultivation.","“By the way, if you’re leaving, does Fellow Daoist White Dragon have any business here? If not, stay behind and chat with me for a bit?” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy added at the last moment, unable to help herself.","The White Dragon was clearly puzzled: “???”","Why did the Reincarnation Blade Fairy suddenly become so familiar with her? Were they even that compatible in conversation?","“No, I have some things to deal with as well. I feel I’m about ready to resurrect,” replied the White Dragon after some thought, tactfully refusing: “I’ll come and chat with you after my resurrection, Reincarnation Blade Daoist.”","Now, in her current state of being a body of virtue, being away from Sixteen for extended periods of time would eventually prove inconvenient... Once her real body was resurrected, she would come and keep the Reincarnation Blade Fairy company, to see if it was possible to take her out for a stroll.","“Then it’s settled,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said cheerfully.","The White Dragon nodded in response.","—By the way, am I really that charming?","The White Dragon became curious about herself.","...","...","After getting the access permission from the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, Song Shuhang took Sixteen and traversed through space to arrive outside the Reincarnation Hall—Su Clan’s Shield Maiden and Su Clan’s Knot were waiting for them outside.","“Has Sixteen completed her metamorphosis?” Su Clan’s Shield Maiden caught a glimpse of Sixteen and affirmed instantly.","“Yes, thanks to the blessings of the Fairy and the Ancestor,” Sixteen responded with a bow toward her two ancestors.","“What are your plans next?” asked Su Clan’s Knot Ancestor.","“First, we need to take a trip to the Ancient Nether to establish a root pillar...” Song Shuhang replied softly.","After that, their time was limited.","Daoist Senior was already preparing his plans for abdication.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you’re always so busy... I envy you young folks, always brimming with endless tasks and seemingly inexhaustible vigor,” mused Su Clan’s Knot Ancestor.","He hadn’t known Tyrannical Song for very long, but from their interactions, he always got the impression that Tyrannical Song was perpetually ‘running.’","Rushing forward without ever stopping.","It was only during the Su Clan’s annual gatherings, when members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group took the time to rest together, that he saw Tyrannical Song’s ‘overbearing run’ come to a brief pause—that group was the haven for Tyrannical Song’s soul.","This relentless version of Tyrannical Song reminded the Knot Ancestor of himself from a very long time ago, when he was also young and full of vigor.","“Actually, I’m not as great as you make it sound,” Song Shuhang said modestly.","“A motivated salted fish.” the White Dragon said slowly.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“When you’re done with your busy schedule, if you have time, come find us at Su Clan.” Su Clan’s Knot said. “After that, let’s form a group and go check out the ‘Gem Domain’ together.”","“Gem Domain? Is that Spirit River Su Clan’s territory?” Song Shuhang asked.","Su Clan’s Knot was taken aback and asked in confusion, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you don’t know?”","Song Shuhang: “???”","“In the Gem Domain, there are ‘Tombs of Immortality’ of both the Second Wielder of the Will and the Third Wielder of the Will showing their divinity at the same time. This news has already spread throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe... Right now, many Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders must have gone to the Gem Domain. After all, they are relics of two Wielders of the Will.” Su Clan’s Knot replied.","Song Shuhang stroked his chin, contemplating.","The ‘Tombs of Immortality’ of Senior Three Eyes and Heavenly Dao Father Goudan?","And they both appeared in the same place?","This must be a trap!","Because, if Senior Three Eyes’ Tomb of Immortality was in the ‘Gem Domain’, the first thing Heavenly Dao Father Goudan would do is definitely to dig up Senior Three Eyes’ ancient tomb and scatter the ashes. Then he would transform Senior Three Eyes’ tomb into his own and install himself inside.","There can be no second possibility. Heavenly Dao Father Goudan would certainly do something like that.","So, the simultaneous appearance of two tombs is absolutely impossible!","At this thought, Song Shuhang’s mind stirred, and he remembered the words of ‘Daozi’ Senior—Daozi Senior was secretly scheming a ‘premature retirement’ plan. Moreover, he was secretly trying to gather all the ‘Immortals’ from the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Now it seemed that this might be the trap that Daozi Senior, Heavenly Dao Father Goudan, and Senior Three Eyes had set up together.","“I’ll go. If I return early, I’ll make arrangements with the Seniors and head there together,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Once the ‘Immortals’ of the heaven and earth gathered enough, according to Daozi Senior’s script, it would be his or Senior White’s turn to make an entrance and accept challenges from the big shots of the myriad practitioners in the universe, right?","The stage was already set.","Just waiting for the actors to take their places.","...","...","Black Dragon World • Ancient Nether","The self-corpse maintained a power-output posture, sustaining a pillar that resembled an ‘Overlord God Pillar’ with energy.","Senior White squatted on the ground, drawing a circle with a branch.","Inside the circle, some of the ‘Ancient Nether’ special creatures were hopping around—it was something like a small crayfish, milky white in color, and possessing great jumping strength.","Senior White confined them within the circle, and any creature that jumped out was promptly flicked back into the circle with the branch.","Chu Pavilion Master’s Dumb Hair was stuck to Senior White’s head, constantly swaying, its tip penetrating the vacuum and occasionally capturing new ‘small crayfish’ to bring over for Senior White to play with.","“They look quite tasty.” Scarlet Heaven Sword returned to its sword form, floating in the vacuum.","Meteor Sword followed behind it, seeming envious of Scarlet Heaven Sword.","At that moment, a space gate opened.","“I’m back.” Song Shuhang stepped through the space gate and said, “Senior White, I have some new insights regarding the ‘Sole Dominator of Myriad Realms’ concept. It might relate to the Ancient Nether’s pillar insertion. I’ll transmit these insights to you, please receive them!”","“Sole Dominator of Myriad Realms? Are you going to kill all the other Song Shuhangs?” Senior White looked up, his face full of confusion."]},{"number":3099,"title":"Chapter 3099 - 3097: Sorry, Please Forgive Me... For Giving You All the Pressure and Burden","paragraphs":["Chapter 3099: Chapter 3097: Sorry, Please Forgive Me... For Giving You All the Pressure and Burden","“How could that be possible... Moreover, I don’t have the ability to do that,” Song Shuhang waved his hand and said.","Previously, with the help of the seniors’ power, he could briefly see the other ‘Song Shuhangs’ on the ‘time river sea urchin spines’.","But that kind of seeing was just like sitting in front of a screen watching a ‘movie.’ It was impossible to interfere with the world inside the movie.","Let alone kill off all the ‘Shuhangs.’","There are dimensions of distance involved.","Besides, it was not in his nature to do such a thing.","It’s said that men should be a little cruel to themselves.","But cruelty should have purpose and direction.","Not senseless, constant cruelty to oneself... that would be masochistic.","“I’ll transmit my new insights about ‘The Only One in Myriad Realms’ to you, Senior White,” Song Shuhang said, activating the data transfer mode between himself and Senior White.","Their data transfer didn’t need to go through the ‘Cultivator Chat System.’","With the mutual assimilation of ‘Confucian Saint Talent,’ they developed a unique ‘direct connection’ mode of communication. Data transfer was faster, almost to the level of synchronization between a clone and the main body.","“I see,” Senior White nodded after receiving the data.","This portion of insight was summarized by Song Shuhang after his encounter with the ‘time river’ plus ‘Su Clan’s Reincarnation Seal.’","There was a process to becoming ‘The Only One in Myriad Realms,’ extending from the Netherworld Realm to the heavens.","Song Shuhang speculated that from ancient times to the present, all ‘Heavenly Dao Candidates’ came to the Ancient Nether world to insert pillars, which likely related to the process of ‘descending to the Netherworld.’","Thus, at this moment, Song Shuhang had an idea—could he transmit the seed to all the ‘Song Shuhangs’ by inserting pillars in the ‘Ancient Nether World’?","By utilizing the power of the ‘seed,’ could he achieve a singular ending without changing all the ‘Shuhangs’?","“Maybe it could work, projecting your seed into the time river,” Senior White felt the proposal was feasible.","“Shuhang’s... seed?” Sixteen’s cheeks flushed.","The White Dragon also circled around Sixteen’s neck somewhat awkwardly.","“If we’re going to do this, the form this ‘pillar’ takes will have to change,” Senior White said as he dropped a branch and looked at the ‘pillar’ maintained by his self-corpse.","The pillar erected by the self-corpse, like those placed by ‘Heavenly Dao candidates’ of previous generations, was there to leave one’s information at the world’s node, leaving a footprint.","“How should it change?” Song Shuhang asked.","He was just putting forward suggestions and ideas, as for how to actually operate, he was powerless.","“If it were before, sealing you within the pillar and leaving behind a ‘Tyrannical Song’s Body’ would have been the most convenient operation. But now, that can no longer be done,” Senior White said regretfully.","Song Shuhang, now with a full body semi-immortal, no longer had the option to leave behind a body.","“Then, shall I send my clone in my stead?” Song Shuhang suggested.","“No need, I’ll carve a few spots on this pillar, and you just need to stamp your ‘Sage Seals’ inside. The effect might be a bit less, but it should be sufficient,” Senior White waved his hand and replied.","Sage Seal of Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar Demon Seal, Tyrannical Dragon Ancient Seal, Tyrannical Demon Sage Seal, Dao Seal of Tyranny, Tyrannical You Tai Seal, Tyrannical Saber’s Seal, Seal of the Overlord World, and Ba Mei’s Sage Seal.","Song Shuhang in one breath brought out the Nine Great Sage Seals, following Senior White’s instruction, stamped his own Sage Seals at various positions on the ‘pillar.’","Finally, Song Shuhang asked, “Senior White, do you need to stamp a Sage Seal as well?”","“I don’t need to,” Senior White shook his head: “Moreover, I have already participated in the erecting of the pillar, that is enough.”","He had no need for the option of ‘The Only One in Myriad Realms.’","Song Shuhang nodded thoughtfully.","“Let’s go, to the next node.” After the pillar was established, Senior White beckoned.","As with the pioneers of the past, the nodes that needed to have pillars inserted were more than just one.","Senior White and his self-corpse worked together to forge the pillar, and it was Song Shuhang’s main body’s responsibility to go up and stamp the nine seals in quick succession.","After a day and a night...","All nodes, and the erection of the pillars, were completed.","Song Shuhang reached out and branded a Sage Seal on the last ‘pillar’: “It’s over.”","“It’s just begun,” Senior White reminded him.","After the pillars were erected, the plan Song Shuhang wanted – to project the seeds into the river of time – could begin.","Song Shuhang put away the Nine Great Sage Seals and then closed his eyes, gathering his focus to brace for any possible changes.","After a long while...","“Do you feel anything?” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair asked.","Song Shuhang shook his head.","This time, he hadn’t sensed the ‘river of time’; he couldn’t see parallel versions of himself on the sea urchin spines.","“Did it fail?” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword asked.","“I’m not sure,” Song Shuhang looked towards Senior White.","“It’s already a success,” Senior White spoke softly.","In those brief moments, Senior White had seen many scenes.","Each one was related to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang while eating.","Song Shuhang while asleep.","There was Song Shuhang doing homework.","And Song Shuhang taking a bath.","There was Tyrannical Song who couldn’t be reflected in mirrors.","There was Tyrannical Song sitting face-to-face with Fairy Soft Feather, talking.","Some were smiling joyfully, others were crying out loud.","A myriad of life vignettes composed the kaleidoscopic Song Shuhang.","And at this moment, every Song Shuhang was paired with a seed.","Each seed contained Song Shuhang’s intentions.","...","...","In a world of grey hues.","Lady Onion, with short hair and clad in white skinny jeans and high heels, jumped from the air with style, striding forward with elegant catlike steps into the depths of the world.","Behind her rode Soft Feather on a multicolored butterfly.","Her long hair covered half of her face, giving her an appearance of being still half asleep.","“Soft Feather, did you use the power of time again?” Lady Onion, at the front, turned her head, her short hair swishing as she asked.","“Sorry, but this is the last time,” Soft Feather looked up, responding.","After this, she no longer had the chance to visit that peaceful world of Senior Song again.","Lady Onion sighed.","She had wanted to scold Soft Feather a bit, but seeing her worn-out appearance, suppressed the words that had almost reached her lips.","“Forget it, let’s go... Let’s check on Boss Song and see if his retreat has ended yet. He owes me wages, and it’s time he paid up.” Lady Onion handsomely tucked her hands into her pockets and continued forward with long strides.","‘Creak~’","Ahead, the heavy sound of a stone gate opening resonated.","Then, a warm-smiling Song Shuhang who looked slightly aged emerged from behind the gate.","Lady Onion, who had been moving forward with her stylish catwalk, was suddenly suspended mid-step and didn’t land for several moments.","“Sorry for worrying you all,” Shuhang said in a gentle and dependable voice.","In his hand, a bright seed flickered faintly.","“I’m sorry, please forgive me for passing all the pressure and burdens onto you...” he said softly with palms pressed together.","Everything was about to start... and then, it was also about to end!"]},{"number":3100,"title":"Chapter 3100 - 3098: The War Begins!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3100: Chapter 3098: The War Begins!","“It took a whole day and night, the time it took to plant the column was longer than I expected,” Senior White rubbed his eyes.","Then, Senior White transmitted the information about the ‘Kaleidoscope Tyrannical Song Life’ he had just witnessed back to Song Shuhang, so he knew the seed had reached the end of the river of time.","[Fortunately, Senior White was here, as he could see the ‘seed’ projected onto the river of time.]","Song Shuhang closed his eyes and began to search within the ‘Kaleidoscope Tyrannical Song Life’... Soon, he found an older version of himself that resembled Tyrannical Song.","“So, it has been conveyed!” Song Shuhang murmured, a smile appearing at the corner of his mouth.","This older Tyrannical Song should be himself from the world where ‘Future Child’ is, right?","The Future Child could no longer come over due to the restrictions of the ‘space spell’... So now, let me convey my ‘intent’ and ‘response’ over there!","Distant Future Child, on my end, war... is about to begin!","Did you receive the message?","“What has been conveyed?” Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair bent down, its tip asking the question.","“Belief, or rather, my decision,” Song Shuhang laughed and then said, “Next, the following step... are we going to the Gem Domain?”","At the location of the Gem Domain, Daoist Senior and Father Goudan, along with Senior Three-Eyes, had set up a plan, drawing all immortals and top Tribulation Transcenders from myriad practitioners in the universe to give Song Shuhang a chance for a swift resolution.","If they were to go to the Gem Domain, he was also preparing to take Sixteen back to Su Clan’s Ancestor Star to meet up with Su Clan’s Sixteen and the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan.","“Don’t rush, first check if the ‘Domination Secret Method•Reverse’ is ready,” Senior White reminded.","Their advantage lay in having mastered the information and actions of the ‘Dark Sun’ and the hidden Fourth Heavenly Dao ‘Dark Giant’, even conducting targeted research on the ‘Domination Secret Method’.","Intelligence is the utmost importance in modern warfare.","Know yourself and know your enemy, and you are halfway to winning the war.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and opened the ‘Confucian Sage Eye Research Group’ with a point in the vacuum.","“@White from the Netherworld, @My Family Has a Twin Eggs, Father Goudan, Senior White, regarding the research on the ‘Domination Secret Method,’ do we have any results yet?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Mister Song, did you and Fellow Daoist White finish planting the column?” Heavenly Daizi responded with a question.","“All set, and now getting ready for the next step,” Song Shuhang replied.","Senior White two: “The Domination Secret Method deconstruction is complete, Domination Secret Method•Reverse has been structured successfully, you can come back and try the effect of the secret technique.”","All the seniors, being in the ‘Heavenly Dao Time Secret Realm,’ multiple times the duration of a day and night in the main world had already passed in the secret realm. With the support of the ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation Ability’ backed by Daoist Senior, the research to break the Domination Secret Method was going smoothly.","Now, it was just a matter of putting it into practice.","“If that’s the case... the war has begun!” Senior Three-Eyes stated gravely.","Next, it’s Tyrannical Song’s war.","“We have already directed most of the immortals in the ‘Gem Domain’ from the myriad realms. A portion of them were politely invited by your ‘fat ball’ and have been engaging in discourse with your manifestation. Now, returning and mastering both the ‘Domination Secret Method’ and the ‘Domination Secret Method•Reverse’... the next step, we head to the Gem Domain,” Daoist Senior spoke.","He was already prepared and standing by, waiting to step down.","“I’ll learn the secret technique myself, and once I have, I will simplify it,” Senior White said at that moment.","There was no time for Song Shuhang to personally learn the intricate process of the secret techniques... He would simplify the secret techniques down to two formation symbols, then teach them through transferral.","“Tyrannical Song has become spoiled because of you, Fellow Daoist White,” Pavilion Master Chu commented.","“It’s okay, if I don’t have enough basic knowledge, I’ll catch up after achieving immortality. It’s a crisis right now, and we need extraordinary measures!” Song Shuhang made a quick decision.","“Alright, then I’ll set my retirement for tomorrow. Today, you return to the secret realm and nurture all of the ‘Combined Magical Treasure’ along with Fellow Daoist White’s Meteor Sword into human forms,” Daoist Senior decided.","One day in the external world is enough time in the time-distorted secret realm for Song Shuhang to nurture all of the magical treasures to their ultimate potential!","...","...","The day had passed in the main world,","It was February 4th, 2020, the beginning of spring in China.","Tyrannical Song sprang up with a carp’s flip, leaping to his feet.","Behind him, exactly three sets of ‘Combined Magical Treasure of Thirty-Three Beasts’ transformed into tiny metal figures the size of thumbs, circling around him and emitting a series of tinkling laughter.","They were like mythological flower elves.","In Song Shuhang’s hands, a light blade conjured a light wheel, coalescing into the form of Su Clan’s Sixteen.","“You young people really know how to have fun,” Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair slowly said.","Using the state of ‘human-saber fusion’ to cultivate human emotions was something unheard of.","“Have you mastered the secret formation techniques that White taught you?” The White Dragon lazily asked, draped around Song Shuhang’s neck.","“Mastered.” Song Shuhang confidently replied.","His talent for saber techniques was strong, his innate skill in fist techniques was not bad, and his talent for learning Senior White’s simplified formation techniques fell somewhere in between his saber and fist talents, also fairly strong.","“Then, go meet up with White and set off,” the White Dragon said. “It’s about time.”","“Mhm.” Song Shuhang nodded in agreement.","He beckoned with his hand, and two sets of the Combined Magical Treasure landed on him; 32 of the items entered his dantian, while the Defiant Whale Glove artifact spirit fairy armed his right hand.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword all hung at his waist.","“Main body!” Song the fat ball bounced over from afar.","Song Shuhang beckoned, and Song the fat ball transformed into a cloak that draped over him.","The fat ball cloak fluttered majestically.","Accompanying Song the fat ball were Senior White and Senior White Two, walking side by side.","When the two Senior Whites walked together, the rest of the world paled in comparison.","The fully evolved Meteor Sword, carrying a set of the Combined Magical Treasure, returned to Senior White’s side, dancing joyfully.","Senior White affectionately patted Meteor Sword.","“Time flies.” Senior White looked at Song Shuhang and Sixteen, his eyes drifting slightly.","In a trance, he seemed to return to the time when he had just come out of secluded meditation and was picked up by Song Shuhang.","Back then, Song Shuhang barely knew anything and had just started on his path of cultivation, extremely interesting.","The Song Shuhang of today was still interesting, yet without realizing it, had grown so much.","The still innocently smiling Song Shuhang before him had quietly become a reliable fellow daoist.","“You’ve grown up, Shuhang,” Senior White suddenly said happily.","“Yes, Senior White,” Song Shuhang said with a smile, showing six teeth.","Memories, as if returning to last year.","Senior White had just exploded out of his statue form.","“Hello, Fellow Daoist Shuhang.” At that time, the indescribably handsome Senior White greeted him with a daoist handprint.","“Hello, True Monarch White Senior.” Back then, junior cultivator Song Shuhang imitated Senior White’s gesture and returned the courtesy."]}]);
